{"sha":"9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","node_id":"C_kwDOS6pZOtoAKDlmNGI3NDIzNmY5N2IwYjlkYzcyMzg4YjZlMDhkMzEwZDJmMjZmNjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com","date":"2026-10-31T17:58:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com","date":"2026-10-31T17:58:27Z"},"message":"docs(native): record I02 CI acceptance and C331 source audits\n\nRecord exact-34e CI success and the Windows checkout correction while retaining d07's failed run. Preserve the private C9d/C9e source snapshots, regression results, 41-row source concordance and independent BLOCK reviews with their original evidence.\n\nThe current progress text separates five bounded C9e repairs from 17 mandatory source finding groups, the chain-birth P1 and the unproved provider/continuation work. This documentation commit does not import C331 production code or change the runtime defaults, rules, archive, ABI or protocol versions.\n\nValidation: 9,905 enumerated paths / 257,498,242 bytes; every staged blob and mode matches the reviewed candidate tree. Eight narrative documents have 861 valid local links; 1,065 line references have no out-of-range targets (six existing example-path categories remain unresolved); source-line gate and its two unit tests pass. Independent documentation review found no issues. Runtime acceptance remains bounded by each archived source version.","tree":{"sha":"88dfb549ab937d23b3632371eb77f387a566cb7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/git/trees/88dfb549ab937d23b3632371eb77f387a566cb7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/git/commits/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/commits/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","html_url":"https://