实际12；初始index至门禁33项仅ctime变化由父独立解析确认，来源未知；第一次whole-session raw相等断言失败及误捕获原命令P2保留，追加真正tool命令／结果后P2独立复审关闭，不重跑产品。14:03:47明确解除冻结；14:07接入的CI单文件不冒作原preflight输入。见[Main证据、勘误和边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-main-typed-wire/README.md)。九生产constructor仍None，注入fixture只证consumer、不证Rust producer／真实音频；完整I02和新版本未验收。C29真实激活／provider及R05受控原字节factory按批准顺序仍是依赖；[共享DeathFlow方案](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/README.md)已复核在裁决29内，实施待Damage修复复审。全37、234动态／2487缺backing／18其他资源及作者生命周期保留范围。\n \n \n **NC27已接纳并发布（2026-10-31；5fc0f774，330/105/758/WS6）**：Own可选source_skill及跨端兼容、legacy单字段剥离已按裁决27实施；两独立源码／legacy复审完成，诊断P2经同一445输入18→0差异闭合。父fresh核V2全部43867源码／43836旧Git blob、31增量、58命令与95产物，再核四文件V3增量和Main功能证据。Main原生1715/0/75、前端179／type／外部构建通过；V3最终实际workspace6917/0/77、当前两WASM、native来源／Other隐藏与legacy120步33choices、Worker82／conformance19／轨迹通过，最终完整preflight21／行数自测2／source9003／strict1065零越界全部exit0，父fresh核95证据、当前源码／产品／1927文档和原日志计数通过，组合复审No issues／OK with notes；仅本批source字段限定接纳，已按裁决18入库5fc0f774并按25正常发布；exact-head [CI41183155464](https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/actions/runs/41183155464) attempt1真实10/10，130steps=128success/2skip/0null。父fresh92条SHA/CRC／十完整gzip／API与5次独立live读、独立登记复审均通过，见[本次发布与CI](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/publication-ci/README.md)；旧4dd ten-green不挪作本次。当前仅授权18生成模块更新（未跟踪／ignored构建产品，保留工作树，不强入Git），37默认dist保持；规则330／NGSA105／ABI758／WS6／桌面transport默认WASM不变。私有资源原exit1保留，真实inode差异经既有resources-only修复后两verify新exit0且manifest／catalog／source字节不变。见[字段合同、完整证据及边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/README.md)。一小时任务TIMEOUT及已存在20分钟检查点分开登记，不冒充测试失败或整体验收；原19 NoCert和NC10 runtime仍BLOCK。\n@@ -22,7 +24,7 @@\n \n **R05具体合同已获裁决28（2026-10-31）**：v3＋原文／完整锁恢复v4＋删除裸packs输入v5已独立审为No issues／OK with notes，用户明确批准三技能、191处异步Draw／gain调用、固定compound／四角色、精确生命周期及全部保存／恢复信封与显式请求、缺原上下文的旧扩展档保留原件受控拒绝。实际C331→改命332验收后规则333／ABI759／WS7不变，NGSA已由裁决29明确从106调整为107，见顶部及[29审批合同](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-runtime-contract/README.md)；不提前切换Main。原始包／资产字节验证后直接构实际Catalog，无第二R05指纹／包仓库；旧协议、投影、续行门禁不因设计通过视作已实现。见[裁决28及最终合同](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-r05-runtime-contract/README.md)。Main仍330／105／758／WS6；R05全部场景及三noop仍待实施。\n \n-**C331剩28与NC10前缀源码反例（2026-10-31）**：16项译名在配置／缓存／异步加载上下文未绑定时仍unknown，6静态解析失败保留；另12项producer／grant／窗差异已定向定位，父fresh核32份实际source body／文件SHA，新增证明0，262/290保持。玄影parent未grant damage子技却原生自动触发，已交唯一C私有writer检查现有grant/filter修复；四chooseToUse救援、两expiry不能用tuple伪替。见[完整静态followup](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-source-followups/README.md)。独立源码分析构造旧park Q可在Yiji Draw child结束后先于P运行的候选，因此exact初始source不是不中断Confirm前缀证书；未生成／执行新档，裁决27字段不受影响且不放任何门禁，见[反例候选及边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/README.md)。05:20Z后readiness Android授权仍0，Apple CLI18s超时无JSON，当前iPhone状态unknown，不能从空stdout推可用。\n+**C331剩28与NC10前缀源码反例（2026-10-31）**：16项译名在配置／缓存／异步加载上下文未绑定时仍unknown，6静态解析失败保留；另12项producer／grant／窗差异已定向定位，父fresh核32份实际source body／文件SHA，新增证明0，262/290保持。玄影parent未grant damage子技却原生自动触发，已交唯一C私有writer检查现有grant/filter修复；四chooseToUse救援、两expiry不能用tuple伪替。见[完整静态followup](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-source-followups/README.md)。独立源码分析构造旧park Q可在Yiji Draw child结束后先于P运行的候选，因此exact初始source不是不中断Confirm前缀证书；未生成／执行新档，裁决27字段不受影响且不放任何门禁，见[反例候选及边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/README.md)。15:31:55Z只读readiness Android授权0，Apple有效JSON发现1台物理iPhone但可用0；实际deviceprep错误-27指向Developer Mode要求。无配对／安装／权限／窗口改变，不能作为真机整局／听感或30分钟功耗验收。\n \n **4dd发布及新CI独立登记（2026-10-31登记；实跑2026-10-30）**：PA09 JS总量8和provenance精确路径属性修正已本地验收、提交并正常发布`4dd0b286b995fe414128b6c52eb83a4d0d85f6cd`。真实run41125396035 attempt1精确绑定该提交，十job全成功；130step为128成功／2跳过／0失败／0null，Windows资源准备／安装器／上传实际成功，三平台artifact元数据齐备。原777 run9/1、a1f／da7e十绿与最早五红各保留原结论。父fresh核95清单项及十完整gzip／SHA／CRC／CRLF，独立登记No issues／OK with notes；96primary已归档。workspace6894/0/77、native1815/0/75、三OS库各838/0/0、Worker82／前端175／资源17范围重叠；hosted legacy预算通过不作native收益。见[完整CI登记](../operations/evidence/2026-10-30-pa09-js-admission/publication-ci/README.md)。规则330／NGSA105／ABI758／WS6／WASM默认保持；新CI不关闭实体安装／签名／真机或PA09六条件。\n "},{"sha":"2abf1f11b0c4d082952ce70622fdc1cf078acbea","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/README.md","status":"added","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changes":11,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2FREADME.md?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+# C29 genuine ChangeHp：方案v2已审，代码尚未实施\n+\n+核验2026-10-31；固定Core1a548c95…／Liuli8485dbb…和C9c冻结214组合0ab2b44e…为读者，未读活跃C9d/C9e工作树。原[完整方案v1](guide-v1.raw.txt)及[源码清单](source-inventory-v1.json)保留；其notrigger解释被[独立P1复审](review-v1-BLOCK.raw.txt)否决，不重写旧报告。方案以真实普通ChangeHp child替换HP提交后的inline回调，复用既有栈／队列，持久receipt／progress／cause，覆盖Recover有限续行、LoseHp后Dying及真实qualified helper／named disable reason。\n+\n+[追加v2](guide-v2.raw.txt)及[补充清单](supplement-v2.json)明确更正：正量damage.notrigger仍执行HP body里的普通changeHp触发和合法callback，即使armor全吸收令HP num0；只抑制源指定generic lifecycle及damage窗口。Core content.ts12118给child._triggered=null，GameEvent.loop仍进body，而12370显式trigger('changeHp')没有被该值禁用。不能传播一个祖先notrigger作为所有子事件禁令，也不新增ordinaryChangeHpDisabled。\n+\n+父[fresh源核验](parent-source-audit-v2.json)核旧报告／清单／BLOCK审查不变、五源码SHA及完整214 manifest／源相符；[v2独立复审](review-v2-closure.raw.txt)No issues／OK with notes，仅关闭方案P1。未来须真实Shangshix手1→draw3、notrigger正损伤、armor1吸收令num0、zero／prevented对照及time-slice／byte恢复和错误输入原子性；这里只是测试规范，尚未执行或实现。\n+\n+八boss helper必须用真实group／provider，仅解除对应disable blocker；HLSS First／priority−100／forceDie直接赋HP，不递归伪造Recover；Shangshix loseEnd与changeHp分别保留。31个Recover caller文件要真正await／有限续行，不能只push child后继续draw／ask。maxHP／reset／direct die和真正HP操作分别按源处理，不把一切赋值当changeHp。\n+\n+实施顺序为C9d seal/review→修复复审Ciqiu窗口／元素杀及Chilongya notLink、Zuijiu直接Sha父上下文、Hutian signed量→真实ChangeHp→已审共享DeathFlow；均在裁决29既有范围，不重请用户授权。保持private331/106/758/WS6及332/106→R05-333/107，不预约新tag／公开SDK／WS／ABI。bdaf只作撤回的历史读身份，当前Main34e与5fc内核／内容未变；无Main C代码合入或I02／37来源完成结论。当前状态见[进度主稿](../../../architecture/native-progress.md)。"},{"sha":"a6e762ac3dc3ca6772a950febb08b095535fa2ab","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/guide-v1.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":36,"deletions":0,"changes":36,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v1.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v1.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v1.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\n+# C29 next Core slice: genuine shared ChangeHp, before the reviewed DeathFlow\n+- **Decision:** finish/seal the current C9d real Damage-window repair first; then implement this genuine HP callback slice under existing Decision29, then the independently8791-reviewed shared DeathFlow. No new user approval, DamageEnd alias, SDK feature or formal version allocation. This document is an implementation guide, not implementation or acceptance.\n+- **Read authority:** Main `bdaf9868ef49de08dc66127eb82b05d922cc9eba`; supplied immutable214-file C9c overlay `/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9c-final-ld22eim7/snapshot`, source-manifest identity `0ab2b44eac80e7c1d591ebe560e8be69ab4ff72a4ac35b7db92edc5c4f4925ae` confirmed in parent audit; unchanged kernel/content fallback Main/5fc. Verified214 paths and pinned upstream HEADs, not the unavailable original manifest bytes. No live C9d tree read. [Machine source inventory, hashes and exact caller families](/tmp/c29-change-hp-4f27f4d2/source-inventory.json).\n+- **Existing approval is explicit:** approved C29 v2 §1 TargetDamage says “After HP/changeHp children finish, open actual target damage”; the same section requires affected inline callbacks to become qualified declarations/resumable intrinsic transitions. Decision29 covers formal HP/provider/callback machinery; Decision30 audio exclusion does not revoke it. Current private331/106/758/WS6 can contain this whole accepted structure; preserve332/106→R05-333/107, and accepted future baselines, without borrowing allocations.\n+- **Current counterexample:** C9c `kernel/damage.rs:81/101–102` mutates HP then directly calls `hlss_light_refill` and `damage_change_hp::commit_damage_change_hp`; the latter hardcodes eight parent-enabled flips and Shangshix draw. `event.rs` has no ChangeHp. Actual root `DamageFlow` exists (:53–79); NativeDamageSkill tag85 exists. C9d's Huoshen First num1→0/current HP3 versus expected HP2 red concerns **pre-HP damage prevention/priority**, which must remain its own fixture; a post-commit ChangeHp consumer cannot repair or cancel that HP submission.\n+- **Pinned ordinary event:** Core `1a548c95…` player.js9188–9197 creates changeHp with num/player/originalHp; content.ts12322–12370 records history, absorbs armor only for an immediate damage parent, mutates/clamps HP, finishes applicable positive-HP dying/save state, then awaits trigger('changeHp'). Liuli `8485dbb…` game/game.js26494/20979–21009 agrees on mutation→ordinary trigger but lacks Core originalHp/changedHp metadata. Core getHp() is max(0,hp) (player.js3271); changedHp is max(0,afterHp)−max(0,originalHp), **not** raw signed delta or damage.num.\n+- **Order/roles:** Core damage12115–12161 awaits ChangeHp subtree before target damage and Dying, then source12223 and End/After/chain. Recover12229–12255 caps positive recovery and awaits ChangeHp before its completion; LoseHp12258–12281 awaits ChangeHp before Dying. ChangeHp player is the actual HP recipient, not handler owner/current actor/damage source. Its immediate parent/cause preserves damage root or recover/loseHp identity; original source/card are cause data, not a guessed ChangeHp source role. Ordinary ChangeHp cannot roll back already committed HP.\n+\n+| Effective caller family (overlay wins) | Present behavior / required migration |\n+| --- | --- |\n+| Damage: C9c kernel/damage.rs4–102; damage_flow.rs53–79 | Already atomic canonical submission/armor/receipt, then inline refill/eight switches/draw. Replace those callbacks with one awaited real ChangeHp subtree before Target; retain committed damage.num distinct from HP loss. |\n+| LoseHp: damage.rs522–558; standard/skills/ku_rou.rs62, kuang_fu.rs56; host/step/wudian_cards.rs279 | First has refill, then Dying before Shangshix; other three write raw loss and bypass shared callbacks. Route actual source loseHp through shared loss commit→ChangeHp→rechecked Dying→completion; persist following Draw/Ask stage before yielding. |\n+| Recover: C9c machine.rs672–697; VM rvm_ops.rs276 and31 base caller files listed in inventory | HP is already changed by helper before emitting Recover; no ChangeHp. machine.change_hujia642 also converts Haidao gain into recover. Keep public helper return semantics; insert genuine child at the recover body position and await it before recover-completion effects. events.rs844's Shangshix sits behind Jicai's early return823: remove this misplaced HP-half call, not the real loss-half628. |\n+| MaxHP: machine.rs654–669; VM rvm_ops.rs319–324; host recovery/maxHP bodies in inventory | Clamp/fill writes are not automatically ordinary ChangeHp. Core loseMaxHp12289/gainMaxHp12312 are distinct bodies; HLSS explicitly subscribes to those names too. Preserve their real callback points and classify source update-time clamping; do not emit an invented ChangeHp for every hp assignment. |\n+| Direct mutations: phase/judge.rs292–293 Lunhui exchange; events.rs705; host/boss.rs312/323/337/339/368/375–377; host recovery/reset bodies | Inventory distinguishes source Recover/LoseHp from raw assignment, exchange, maxHP clamp, resurrection/reset; replace genuine operations with shared calls plus finite continuation, but retain genuine direct assignments. Source-classify each named branch before migrating; lexical mutation inventory is not completed equivalence. |\n+| VM EnterDying649/KillPlayer662; native death.rs116/132; general_assembly.rs21; host/boss.rs155/451+ | EnterDying clamp, premature VM death, committed die normalization, substitute/reinit and fellow removal are distinct. Do not add damage/rescue/death cues. Future DeathFlow alone requests source forceDie ChangeHp(-hp) **after its genuine commit** (Core content12531); positive-HP direct die still skips ordinary rescue. |\n+\n+- **Eight real helper declarations:** Core mode/boss.js4537 echou,4616 xushi,4735 yanyu,4821 sipu,5232 yinzei,5260 jicai,5288 luanchang,5316 yandu: each `boss_*_switch` owns grouped `_on`/`_off`; `_on` listens to **player changeHp**, forced, normal timing/default priority0. Filter hp≤maxHp/2 && changedHp!==0, with **no hp>0 gate**. Body removes only `boss_*_awake` disable reason via enableSkill, then removes that switch provider/group. `_off` remains actual gameStart initialization, not a new HP trigger. Liuli corresponding lines3971/4041/4154/4237/4636/4663/4690/4717 omit changedHp gate: bind by genuine source, never unify the sources by guessing.\n+- Install/resolve actual qualified helper definitions and C29 Group providers; a disabled parent effect is not admission authority. Removing the switch closes only its provider edges; overlapping providers/storage/counters survive. Enable only the named blocker, not every disabled reason or a blanket enabled=true. Chinese names, runtime indices, sourceSkill provenance and parent ownership are insufficient qualification. C9d's sealed genuine-helper work may supply reusable declarations; inspect that **sealed** result before duplicating them.\n+- **Shangshix:** genuine key is `shangshix`, not guessed `boss_shangshix`: Core mode/boss.js9589–9600 and Liuli8687; player loseEnd/changeHp, forced/default normal priority0, hand<4→draw(4−hand), grouped shangshix2 kept distinct. Run the real draw child at this window, before DamageTarget/Dying; current hand/deck/card-loss children affect it. Do not retain the inline damage/LoseHp/Recover HP-half as a second firing; preserve genuine loseEnd behavior separately.\n+- **HLSS:** genuine Liuli character/extra.js296/320/418–450 child `hlss_xiangxing_hp`, player changeHp/loseMaxHp/gainMaxHp, filter getHp()<maxHp, **First, priority−100, forced/silent/charlotte/forceDie**. Body directly assigns hp=maxHp and updates: no recursive ChangeHp or Recover. Source main star-count body is damageEnd/loseHpEnd and awakens at zero (:321/:345/:402–406); parent.enabled alone does not prove child ownership/disable propagation. Use actual qualified child/group and C29 disable/forceDie rules, not a new star>0 name heuristic or ordinary alive-only guard.\n+- **Implement first: committed receipt + one ordinary frame.** Add finite internal EventKind::ChangeHp and EventData::ChangeHp containing recipient, raw original/committed HP, submitted/applied signed num, and typed cause/checked parent identity. Derive Core changedHp from frozen receipt, not from current HP after nested children; preserve raw applied num for source consumers. Cause is a finite Damage(root)/Recover(parent,by_card)/LoseHp(parent)/genuine direct change binding, not arbitrary callback strings or an extra history registry. Keep source-specific missing metadata meaningful for Liuli.\n+- **Smallest continuation:** retain the existing atomic HP/armor/body commit, atomically persist its receipt and caller progress, then emit the ordinary ChangeHp frame whose own commit is a no-op; C7 Frame.queue handles its genuine window. For Damage persist HpCommitted and append this child before returning Yield; resumption goes to Target without subtracting again. Do not create a second commit-bearing “HP request” frame alongside the committed receipt or overload DamageWindow ancestry/payload resolution for this different event.\n+- **Recover placement/callers:** preserve Recover as actual causal parent and run ChangeHp before its completion callbacks; helper emits/binds the required parent+child in correct LIFO order. Audit all31 lexical caller files, including Tao/dying, VM recover, standard skills and host support. A caller doing recover→draw/ask/second HP operation must save its next finite stage/actual gained result **before** the call and yield; merely pushing ChangeHp then continuing synchronous code can put draw/asks above it or mutate state too early. Keep source non-await versus await/step boundaries distinct; do not claim helper-only insertion fixes every caller.\n+- **LoseHp placement:** move Dying into a finite existing-stack intrinsic continuation after ChangeHp; update resolution.next_stage/intrinsic factory so loseHp completion handlers cannot run before that subtree. Apply equivalent explicit recover-body/completion routing where needed; current generic Commit→AfterTriggers is not automatically source recoverEnd/After. One bounded intrinsic per actual root, no separate scheduler; reuse existing admitted Host/RVM continuation and park slots. Capture capacity/checked arithmetic/child admission before mutating, preserving existing decode/fuel/choice limits; no arbitrary new cap or new counter.\n+- **Zero/prevention/armor/infinity:** cancelled/nonpositive Damage never submits HP or ChangeHp; Jueqing replacement submits its own real LoseHp only. A positive damage whose armor absorbs all still creates ordinary ChangeHp(num0), so Core switches skip via changedHp0, but Shangshix may legitimately draw. notrigger suppresses its actual ChangeHp triggers too (Core12118); do not expose callback work through another alias. Full/nonpositive capped Recover creates no ordinary HP child. Infinite HP retains real parent submission and source event semantics without unsafe Infinity→i32 arithmetic; raw HP unchanged is not a universal reason to suppress the ordinary event/consumers. Bound/check u32→signed amounts and subtraction before commit, not wrapping casts.\n+- **Stop/nesting:** ordinary candidates are selected/ordered in C7's existing first→normal owner/priority group→last queue; recheck current source filter/ownership before admission, and refresh real group membership as C7 prescribes. Once admitted, persist the selected def/owner/result and obey C29 actual Async/step boundaries—never requery parent activation after every child park. First HLSS can change current HP before later switch filters; a later child may kill/remove/out the recipient. Subsequent eligibility and Dying read real current liveness/HP; the frozen original receipt is not rewritten. A genuine nested Recover/LoseHp gets its own existing EventId/receipt and completes before parent progress; direct HLSS assignment does not recurse.\n+- **Exact touched seams:** kernel event.rs/new focused HP event module; machine.rs recover/maxHP helpers; kernel.rs routing; kernel/intrinsic.rs; damage.rs/damage_change_hp.rs/damage_flow.rs; finite loss continuation; native content standard/boss_skills.rs and qualified helper/group bootstrap; host metadata/HLSS body; affected31 recover-caller files/raw-loss exceptions above; events.rs recover callback removal. C7 resolution.rs/trigger_order.rs need real event kind/payload/filter/order/optional/admitted handling and restored-order validation, not backend-specific bypass. Do not attach ChangeHp consumers to DamageEnd to avoid these connections.\n+- **Persistence together:** event codecs archive/events.rs; actual frame/state hashing engine/hash.rs and machine hash/machine.rs; event/damage progress encoding archive/damage.rs; snap.rs, snap/validation.rs, machine_validation.rs, damage_validation.rs, restore.rs; native consumer's selected qualified def/stage and actual ask/child/result. Reuse an existing HostMachine if its real finite body fits; only add a new native machine snapshot if resumability actually requires it. Original105 and accepted locks/readers remain untouched, no migration or golden promotion.\n+- **Internal tag recommendation only:** immutable C9c uses EventData21 DamageWindow,22 movement; Machine84 DamageFlow,85 NativeDamageSkill. Probe found no EventData23 or Machine86/87 cases; these are possible append-only encodings for ChangeHp/needed finite continuation, **not reservations or allocations**. Recheck the final sealed C9d and all relevant encoder/decoder/hash discriminant tables before selecting; event-hash discriminants are a separate domain (DamageWindow hash23 already exists). No new WS/ABI/schema number and no tag reuse.\n+- **Restore validity matrix:** legal committed root+unplanned ChangeHp; planned live queue; optional/order ask; admitted child parked after body; nested HP change; post-window parent awaiting Target/Dying; valid dead forceDie child. Reject wrong/oob/cyclic/nonancestor parent, damage-cause bound to Recover, duplicate sibling receipt for one submission, pre-HP progress with committed child, mismatched submitted/applied/armor arithmetic, invalid def/window/provider result or spoofed ask, stale cursor/child slot and tag. Do not require current HP equal old committed HP after genuine nested children, or reject admitted continuation solely because its provider disappeared. Restore must not reevaluate activation or replay HP/armor/draw.\n+- **Tests before code (future execution):** source-bounded primitive fixtures for each eight helper, duplicate provider/other disable reason, exact half and HP0 boundary, positive/negative raw delta and crossing0 with Core changedHp0 versus Liuli omission, disabled parent+owned helper and absent helper+parent ownership negative controls. Real Huoshen First prevention remains C9d pre-HP negative control: zero/prevented submission has no new frame. Armor-all plus hand<4 proves real zero ChangeHp; notrigger/full recover/infinity/overflow/capacity get separate assertions.\n+- **Ordering/continuation fixtures:** HLSS First−100 versus real competing priority; Shangshix draw children before Target then Dying/source/End/After/chain; damage-stat/source quantity versus applied HP; LoseHp versus damage armor/source; Recover/Tao correction of actual dying state; nested recovery then nested death/out/removal; recover→draw/ask callers and VM subsequent effects. Assert state, actual full events, card zones/IDs/order, provider/counters/storage, RNG and root/cause—not DTO or count parity. Preserve primitive source behavior for dead forceDie and genuine raw assignments.\n+- **Save/fault matrix:** time_slice1 save/byte restore before atomic submission, after receipt before planning, each order/optional ask, after selected body/draw/nested HP child and before parent continuation. Compare continuous/live/byte-restored full state/events/RNG; exactly one HP/armor application, switch revoke/enable, draw/onremove and parent Target/Dying. VM fault rolls back HP+receipt+log+children as one checkpoint, with malformed archive cases above. First divergence requires source trace, not re-recording expected hashes.\n+- **API/SDK boundary:** add only real native/internal consumers now; no DSL changeHp syntax, opcode/query/context slot, WASM export, S→C event, synthetic metadata or audio producer. Keep existing VM Recover/KillPlayer operands and meaning; audit exhaustive Rust bridge/match consumers with explicit internal handling, not a fabricated VM damage context. If a future author-facing ChangeHp operand/irreversible policy requires new public meaning, report that exact missing boundary separately; no blanket approval question for this already authorized slice.\n+- **Acceptance/remaining work:** after the future patch, targeted primitive/provider/C7/native regression plus required full native/workspace and matched platform/save evidence; remain within source/effective-line gates. C9c12 dispositions are11 observed business-equal cases and one real chain log-order difference, not full acceptance; outcome_raw future parsing is not Internal/Fuel parity. Source-specific maxHP/reset/mode/zone/onremove branches and all37 equivalence remain open; this plan does not preempt DeathFlow or complete I02. Skipped all implementation/tests/builds/scripts/network/live-writer access; risk is formal ordering/provider/liveness behavior until independently reviewed and executed."},{"sha":"e02ecab63a05a7291e5169ea460b3ff2b1c967b8","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/guide-v2.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changes":21,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v2.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v2.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fguide-v2.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+# C29 ChangeHp guide v2 — additive P1 correction\n+This supplement overrides the `notrigger` sentence in [original guide line26](/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/4f27f4d2-25b9-4460-80f5-4f13ade2c32e/proposals/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan.md:26) and the original inventory's “notrigger suppresses child trigger” shorthand. Both originals remain immutable. The [independent BLOCK1P1 review](/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/a1569ea2-d445-43ad-9f9e-1333b00db854/reviews/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan.md) is correct; independent closure of this correction is still required.\n+\n+The corrected contract is: **positive submitted `damage.notrigger` still runs the ordinary ChangeHp body trigger and its eligible callbacks, including when full armor makes applied HP num0.** Suppress only the automatic lifecycle and damage windows prescribed by the source. Do not propagate an ancestor's `notrigger` as a general ban on child events or ordinary callbacks.\n+At pinned Core `1a548c95acdf8ac1ef44d74473403eda2ac86cf0`, content.ts12118 sets `player.changeHp(-num, false)._triggered = null`. GameEvent.loop247–289 uses strict `_triggered===0/1` for automatic Before/Begin and1/2/3 for terminal lifecycle branches; null still takes the content branch. The ChangeHp body unconditionally reaches `await event.trigger(\"changeHp\")` at content.ts12370. The ordinary trigger(name) implementation (gameEvent.ts462–648) has no `_triggered` gate; its real hook, filterStop, player and admission guards still apply.\n+Parent damage setup sets `_triggered=null` for `notrigger` (player.js8912–8922/8940–8942), while content.ts12146/12224 explicitly guard actual damage/damageSource windows. This separates parent damage suppression, the HP child's automatic lifecycle policy and the HP body's ordinary trigger. Source-specific exceptions remain source-specific; the focused fixture below uses normal, real damage, without poison/unreal overrides.\n+\n+Use the original committed HP receipt and existing stack/frame queue. Persist the actual causal parent, raw original/committed HP, signed submitted/applied num and source-specific lifecycle policy before yielding. If generic lifecycle policy needs a finite internal field, distinguish source-normal from suppressed there; **do not introduce or inherit an `ordinaryChangeHpDisabled` flag**. The ordinary ChangeHp frame represents the genuine body trigger; its no-op HP commit and existing planned queue/cursor ensure one dispatch after the already committed HP operation.\n+Resume the parent only after the ordinary queue and admitted callback children finish. C7 uses the actual recipient and qualified declaration/provider, rechecks eligibility before admission, then preserves the admitted invocation's source continuation across parks. Neither restore nor a child await may rerun HP subtraction, armor, an already admitted callback selection or the completed draw. This requires no second queue, registry, counter, fake DamageEnd alias or new SDK event.\n+At the archive/restore boundary, validate cause/ancestor, committed parent progress, receipt arithmetic and the child lifecycle policy against the genuine parent; reject contradictory suppression/progress or duplicate receipts. An archive cannot use parent damage suppression to erase the ordinary HP window, or use an invented flag to enable unrelated windows. Preserve real nested HP changes and existing admitted continuations; current HP need not equal a historical receipt after children.\n+\n+Future focused fixtures, **specified here and not executed**:\n+- Grant genuine source-qualified `shangshix` to the HP recipient, hand1 and sufficient HP; submit normal positive damage1 with notrigger. Its real hand<4 filter/draw (Core mode/boss.js9589–9598) must draw3 through the actual child operation before parent progress. Parent damage windows and the HP child's suppressed automatic lifecycle windows remain absent; ordinary ChangeHp and its draw remain present.\n+- Repeat with armor1 absorbing that positive damage1: HP stays unchanged and ordinary ChangeHp has num0, but Shangshix still draws3. Core changedHp0 prevents switch activation through its actual filter. Armor commits once. Keep this distinct from zero/prevented Damage, which does not submit that HP child; preserve any genuine zero/cancel notification separately.\n+- Save/byte-restore before HP submission, after receipt/before ordinary planning, during order/admission, during the real draw child and before parent continuation. Continuous/resumed full state, events, card identities/order, providers and RNG must agree; one HP/armor application, one ordinary dispatch and one draw, with no suppression leak or mid-admitted-child activation requery. Include malformed lifecycle-policy/cause/progress controls and fault/checkpoint atomicity.\n+\n+All remaining correct v1 work continues: Core changedHp uses max(0,newHP)−max(0,originalHP), not raw damage or HP loss; HLSS is genuine First/−100/forceDie with direct assignment; helper ownership is qualified/provider-based; enable only the named blocker; retain Shangshix's separate loseEnd subscription; all31 lexical Recover-caller files still need actual await/finite-continuation audit. This supplement does not claim those migrations or tests complete.\n+The required sequence is **C9d seal/review → repair and review Chilongya notLink, Zuijiu genuine immediate-Sha ancestry/QueryCtx gap, and signed Hutian versus max0 → genuine ChangeHp → shared DeathFlow**. Those three are actual open rule defects, not accepted variants or exclusions; ChangeHp cannot repair their pre-HP behavior. Existing Decision29 already covers this work; no new user approval or WS/ABI/schema/internal-tag reservation follows.\n+Read identity correction: bdaf is a historical read identity **withdrawn before push**, not accepted Main. Observed accepted Main is `34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8`, tree `22e6eab72d104baf7a658d5ff2d832128ac32e4a`; its kernel/content diff from5fc is empty. Reused only the immutable214-path C9c overlay, manifest identity `0ab2b44eac80e7c1d591ebe560e8be69ab4ff72a4ac35b7db92edc5c4f4925ae`; original manifest bytes were not rehashed. No pending C9d/live writer source was read.\n+[New supplement inventory](/tmp/c29-change-hp-v2-06933b8b/supplement.json) records observed source/original/review hashes, exact quotations and the small repair diff. Keep private331/106/758/WS6 and approved332/106→R05-333/107 unchanged. Next action is independent review of this concrete v2 correction; the original BLOCK remains historical, and no code, rule, all37 or I02 acceptance is claimed.\n+Skipped implementation, tests, builds, scripts, network and live-C access. Residual risk: callback ordering and caller migration require future implementation and executed evidence."},{"sha":"e1f73eecbb890e878a4e11517d204870425459b2","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/parent-source-audit-v2.json","status":"added","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changes":11,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fparent-source-audit-v2.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fparent-source-audit-v2.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fparent-source-audit-v2.json?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-31T15:21:23.832977+00:00\",\n+  \"status\": \"PASS_V2_SOURCE_IDENTITY_AND_NOTRIGGER_TEXT_CORRECTION\",\n+  \"supplementSha256\": \"27d4f070b70761a8cf1a25ffc00ffb5c5554c184e35b6027a6ded5fd18c78465\",\n+  \"reportSha256\": \"f71ce1723f0eba9481d748915c23ca082bddfa0e2b4fd412707a85e8d0a22d21\",\n+  \"originalGuideInventoryReviewUnchanged\": true,\n+  \"fiveSourceHashesExact\": true,\n+  \"frozen214ManifestAndSourcesExact\": true,\n+  \"notriggerChildNullVersusExplicitOrdinaryTriggerObserved\": true,\n+  \"qualification\": \"Read source only; no JavaScript/runtime/implementation/tests/network/Main/liveCwrites. Supports v2 plan correction; independentclosure pending and futurecode stillrequired.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"74c117d7a26ccc911cc5fa547f783fa0ab60d5da","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/review-v1-BLOCK.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":18,"deletions":0,"changes":18,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v1-BLOCK.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v1-BLOCK.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v1-BLOCK.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@\n+## Review\n+\n+**Merge verdict: BLOCK pending one bounded source-semantic correction.** The remaining guide is suitable for the next C29 slice; this is neither code acceptance nor a new authorization request.\n+\n+- **Correct:** Frozen C9c [damage submission:81–102](/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9c-final-ld22eim7/snapshot/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/kernel/damage.rs:81) directly invokes refill/switch/draw callbacks after HP mutation. Replacing these with one awaited ordinary ChangeHp frame, durable receipt/progress and the existing queue addresses the actual seam. The guide correctly distinguishes canonical damage, applied HP delta and Core `changedHp`.\n+- **Correct:** The source-qualified eight switch helpers, HLSS First/−100/forceDie direct assignment, and separate Shangshix loseEnd subscription are appropriate. Provider ownership and named disable reasons must replace parent-enabled heuristics.\n+- **Correct:** The guide explicitly requires finite continuations across Recover callers and LoseHp→ChangeHp→Dying, rather than merely pushing a child while synchronous draw/ask code continues. Its restore matrix preserves admitted continuations without replaying HP or callbacks.\n+\n+**Finding — P1: `damage.notrigger` does not suppress the ordinary ChangeHp trigger in the adopted Core source.**  \n+[Guide line26](/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/4f27f4d2-25b9-4460-80f5-4f13ade2c32e/proposals/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan.md:26) says “notrigger suppresses its actual ChangeHp triggers too.” Actual [content.ts:12118](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/archive/upstream/noname/apps/core/noname/library/element/content.ts:12118) sets the ChangeHp child’s `_triggered=null`, suppressing its generic lifecycle windows. Its body still unconditionally calls [event.trigger(\"changeHp\"):12370](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/archive/upstream/noname/apps/core/noname/library/element/content.ts:12370). [GameEvent.loop:247](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/archive/upstream/noname/apps/core/noname/library/element/gameEvent.ts:247) still executes that body, and `trigger(name)` does not use `_triggered` as an ordinary-trigger gate.\n+\n+**Smallest correction:** Preserve the ordinary ChangeHp event and eligible consumers for positive notrigger damage, including full-armor num0; suppress only the source-prescribed generic lifecycle and damage windows. Add a focused source-trace case with eligible Shangshix, asserting its ordinary ChangeHp draw completes before parent progression while suppressed damage windows remain absent. This is a correctness correction within C29, not a new opcode/context or permission boundary.\n+\n+The required sequence is **C9d seal/review → repair/review the still-open Chilongya notLink, Zuijiu immediate-Sha ancestry and signed Hutian defects → genuine ChangeHp → shared DeathFlow**. Those three defects must remain explicit prerequisites; this consumer cannot repair pre-HP rules.\n+\n+Decision29 already authorizes the genuine HP-child machinery. Keep private331/106/758/WS6 and the approved 332/106→R05-333/107 sequence unchanged. Treat bdaf solely as a historical read identity, not published/accepted Main; frozen C9c remains the overlay authority. Full C/all37/I02 acceptance remains open.\n+\n+Skipped implementation, tests, builds, network, JavaScript execution and live C reads; no writes were made. Hashes were not independently recomputed. Risk remains in callback ordering and caller migration until the corrected guide is implemented and verified.\n\\ No newline at end of file"},{"sha":"532eeb9527dfa9f4956f1d36cdcae5a854a775af","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/review-v2-closure.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changes":14,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v2-closure.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v2-closure.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Freview-v2-closure.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+## Review\n+\n+No issues found.\n+\n+**Fixed — The notrigger P1 is closed at plan level.** [V2](/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/06933b8b-0d67-4c35-ba93-36d22bdb2b34/proposals/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan-v2.md:4) explicitly preserves ordinary ChangeHp and eligible callbacks for positive submitted `damage.notrigger`, including full-armor num0. It limits suppression to the source-prescribed automatic lifecycle and damage windows, matching the previously inspected `_triggered=null` versus explicit `trigger(\"changeHp\")` distinction.\n+\n+- **Correct:** Receipt, parent progress, lifecycle policy and restore checks cannot suppress the ordinary window or duplicate HP/armor/callback effects. Already-admitted children retain their continuation semantics.\n+- **Correct:** The future Shangshix hand1→draw3 fixtures distinguish positive damage, full absorption and zero/prevented roots. They require real child ordering and byte-restore/fault checks without claiming execution.\n+- **Correct:** The original guide, inventory and BLOCK review remain immutable. The supplement expressly supersedes both erroneous notrigger statements and qualifies bdaf as withdrawn historical identity.\n+- **Correct:** The sequence retains C9d seal/review, then repair/review of Chilongya notLink, Zuijiu immediate-Sha ancestry and signed Hutian, before ChangeHp and DeathFlow. Existing Recover-caller, HLSS, provider and named-disable requirements remain in force.\n+\n+**Merge verdict: OK with notes — the corrected guide is ready for future implementation under Decision29.** No additional permission or version/tag reservation follows. This closes the plan finding only; it accepts no code, full C331, I02 or all37-source equivalence.\n+\n+I read the supplement and parent audit; their reported hash verification was not independently recomputed here. No tests, builds, network, JavaScript execution, live-C access or writes occurred. Residual risk remains in the unimplemented callback ordering and production caller migration.\n\\ No newline at end of file"},{"sha":"6c2726986991be82d5cd7f9ee24ca2cfd134116e","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/source-inventory-v1.json","status":"added","additions":74,"deletions":0,"changes":74,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsource-inventory-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsource-inventory-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsource-inventory-v1.json?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,74 @@\n+{\n+  \"kind\": \"read-only-next-Core-source-inventory\",\n+  \"main\": \"bdaf9868ef49de08dc66127eb82b05d922cc9eba\",\n+  \"fallback_rule\": \"Use frozen214 overlay first; unchanged kernel/content files are supplied Main/5fc byte-equal. No live C tree inspected.\",\n+  \"snapshot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9c-final-ld22eim7/snapshot\",\n+  \"snapshot_files_observed\": 214,\n+  \"source_manifest_sha256_supplied_and_confirmed_in_parent_audit\": \"0ab2b44eac80e7c1d591ebe560e8be69ab4ff72a4ac35b7db92edc5c4f4925ae\",\n+  \"manifest_qualification\": \"Parent immutable audit /tmp/noname-parent-c9c-final-audit.json records manifest identity; original manifest bytes were not separately available in the supplied snapshot directory, so this run did not recompute its digest.\",\n+  \"upstream_heads_observed\": {\n+    \"noname\": \"1a548c95acdf8ac1ef44d74473403eda2ac86cf0\",\n+    \"noname-liuli\": \"8485dbb29ff16f9b258a766b1a17ef75f883aade\"\n+  },\n+  \"sha256_observed\": {\n+    \"C9c/kernel/damage_change_hp.rs\": \"be74e1708d5c52831a2915bd648e0ae2148e84d4f4372b1b1fa902a006ab2d25\",\n+    \"C9c/kernel/damage.rs\": \"ecc14df301b33da1a7852309d4ad70dbd7ff31dcf8e08baa1ae4bbc7b8d4f2f4\",\n+    \"C9c/kernel/damage_flow.rs\": \"0ea44f598613d20d1eaa6224c358f9a0f86cf76207fe850c9c42663faad057d4\",\n+    \"C9c/machine.rs\": \"cd7a54a0c778b9031ff0e7f1e28d1b9a56d504b11ef4674ced2a22fa6bfa7b2c\",\n+    \"Core/mode/boss.js\": \"d92b9b66f158b2877a2d403a70048b803af649696f5be2ba41bef6dc1e3f7865\",\n+    \"Liuli/character/extra.js\": \"888e041f8a2d7eec97ab91edd62d5a78a6f4dd94ba4a8a3a2d55ab0bc3d8091a\"\n+  },\n+  \"ordinary_change_hp_source\": {\n+    \"Core\": \"player.js9188-9197 captures originalHp; content.ts12322-12370 mutates then triggers; player.js3271 returns raw?hp:max(0,hp)\",\n+    \"Liuli\": \"game/game.js26494 creates event;20979-21009 mutates then triggers; lacks Core changedHp field/gate\",\n+    \"Damage\": \"Core content.ts12115-12161,12223-12225: changeHp children, actual target damage, Dying, source; notrigger suppresses child trigger\",\n+    \"Recover\": \"Core content.ts12229-12255: cap positive recover, await changeHp; no child for nonpositive capped recovery\",\n+    \"LoseHp\": \"Core content.ts12258-12281: await changeHp, then Dying\",\n+    \"MaxHp\": \"Core content.ts12289-12320: separate loseMaxHp/gainMaxHp bodies and update; not ordinary changeHp by name\",\n+    \"Die\": \"Core content.ts12531: committed die body invokes changeHp(-hp,false).forceDie; future DeathFlow integration only\"\n+  },\n+  \"boss_switch_helper_definitions\": [\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js4537 boss_echou_switch -> boss_echou_switch_on, changedHp gate4553\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js4616 boss_xushi_switch -> boss_xushi_switch_on, changedHp gate4632\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js4735 boss_yanyu_switch -> boss_yanyu_switch_on, changedHp gate4751\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js4821 boss_sipu_switch -> boss_sipu_switch_on, changedHp gate4837\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js5232 boss_yinzei_switch -> boss_yinzei_switch_on, changedHp gate5248\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js5260 boss_jicai_switch -> boss_jicai_switch_on, changedHp gate5276\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js5288 boss_luanchang_switch -> boss_luanchang_switch_on, changedHp gate5304\",\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js5316 boss_yandu_switch -> boss_yandu_switch_on, changedHp gate5332\",\n+    \"Liuli mode/boss.js3971/4041/4154/4237/4636/4663/4690/4717 corresponding switches: no changedHp gate\"\n+  ],\n+  \"other_genuine_consumers\": [\n+    \"Core mode/boss.js9589 shangshix, player loseEnd/changeHp, hand<4 draw4-hand; Liuli mode/boss.js8687 same\",\n+    \"Liuli character/extra.js296 hlss_xiangxing group hlss_xiangxing_hp;418-450 player changeHp/loseMaxHp/gainMaxHp, getHp<maxHp, First priority-100 forced silent charlotte forceDie, direct hp=maxHp assignment (no nested ordinary changeHp)\"\n+  ],\n+  \"effective_raw_hp_writes_by_operation\": {\n+    \"Damage\": [\"C9c kernel/damage.rs81 checked subtraction;101 refill;102 switch/draw callback\"],\n+    \"LoseHp\": [\"C9c kernel/damage.rs544 subtract;546 refill;548 Dying before558 Shangshix\", \"standard/skills/ku_rou.rs62\", \"standard/skills/kuang_fu.rs56\", \"C9c host/step/wudian_cards.rs279\"],\n+    \"Recover\": [\"C9c machine.rs680 cap/saturating add;687 already-committed Recover frame; no ChangeHp\", \"kernel/events.rs844 Shangshix misplaced at recovery callback behind Jicai lookup return823\"],\n+    \"Direct_assignment_requires_source_classification_not_automatic_event\": [\"kernel/phase/judge.rs292-293 Lunhui exchange\", \"kernel/events.rs705 gain HP\", \"C9c host/boss.rs312/323/337/339/368/375/377 wing recovery/loss/revive/clamp\", \"C9c host/step/skills_damage.rs114/168 HLSS source assignment\", \"C9c host/step/xianjian_recovery.rs452 clamp after maxHP loss\", \"C9c host/step/gwent.rs95 maxHP/recovery body\", \"C9c host/step/skills_recovery.rs109 maxHP/reset\", \"C9c host/step/swd_response_cards.rs70 reset\", \"C9c host/step/xianjian_status.rs279 Shiying reset\", \"C9c host/step/swd_equipment.rs330 Kongdongyin reset\", \"standard/skills/buchun.rs114 revive reset\"],\n+    \"MaxHp\": [\"C9c machine.rs664 cap after lose_max_hp\", \"C9c rvm_ops.rs320/324 clamp/fill after maxHP modify\"],\n+    \"Dying_Death_not_damage_or_rescue\": [\"C9c rvm_ops.rs649 EnterDying clamp\", \"C9c rvm_ops.rs662 premature KillPlayer zero (later DeathFlow repair)\", \"kernel/death.rs116 substitute assembly;132 committed death zero\"],\n+    \"Assembly_mode_removal_not_ordinary_changeHp\": [\"state/general_assembly.rs21\", \"C9c host/boss.rs155 Mengpo removal\", \"C9c host/boss.rs451/453/473/518/531/561 mode/fellow assembly/reinit\"]\n+  },\n+  \"recover_helper_call_files_base_lexical_inventory_not_semantic_completion\": [\n+    \"kernel/damage.rs\", \"kernel/monkey.rs\", \"kernel/tricks.rs\", \"kernel/dying.rs\", \"kernel/events.rs\", \"kernel/phase/judge.rs\", \"machine.rs\", \"rvm_ops.rs\",\n+    \"standard/skills/jie_yin.rs\", \"standard/skills/shen_zhi.rs\", \"standard/skills/yao_wu.rs\", \"standard/skills/futai.rs\", \"standard/skills/buchun.rs\", \"standard/skills/rende.rs\", \"standard/skills/qing_nang.rs\",\n+    \"host/support.rs\", \"host/step/hearth.rs\", \"host/step/swd_card_effects.rs\", \"host/step/swd_damage_multi.rs\", \"host/step/swd_equipment_skills.rs\", \"host/step/swd_damage_targets.rs\", \"host/step/swd_equipment.rs\", \"host/step/swd_damage_combos.rs\", \"host/step/wudian_recovery.rs\", \"host/step/xianjian_recovery.rs\", \"host/step/skills_recovery.rs\", \"host/step/gujian.rs\", \"host/step/jiguan.rs\", \"host/step/swd_recovery.rs\", \"host/step/yunchou.rs\", \"host/step/mtg.rs\"\n+  ],\n+  \"native_consumers_current\": [\n+    \"C9c kernel/damage_change_hp.rs eight parent-enabled mutations + shangshix_draw171\",\n+    \"C9c kernel/damage.rs474 hlss_light_refill checks alive and parent enabled only\",\n+    \"kernel/events.rs628 shangshix genuine loss-half call;844 misplaced HP-half recovery call\"\n+  ],\n+  \"integration_seams\": [\n+    \"event.rs + event/damage.rs progress; kernel.rs; kernel/intrinsic.rs; kernel/damage_flow.rs; kernel/damage.rs; machine.rs; rvm_ops.rs; rvm_bridge/machine.rs\",\n+    \"resolution.rs and resolution/trigger_order.rs existing C7 Frame.queue/order/admission/restore; catalog SkillDef/TriggerMeta; native content declarations and group/provider bootstrap\",\n+    \"snap.rs + snap/machine_validation.rs + snap/validation.rs + snap/damage_validation.rs + snap/restore.rs; archive/events.rs + archive/damage.rs + archive/machine_encode.rs + machine_decode.rs; engine/hash.rs and engine/hash/machine.rs\"\n+  ],\n+  \"internal_tag_probe\": {\n+    \"occupied\": \"EventData21 DamageWindow,22 movement; Machine84 DamageFlow,85 NativeDamageSkill\",\n+    \"only_candidates_not_allocations\": \"EventData23; Machine86/87 if finite LoseHp continuation/new atomic native consumer actually needs tags. No matches for these in supplied encoder/decoder; recheck C9d sealed manifests before choosing. No public ABI/WS/schema allocation.\"\n+  },\n+  \"evidence_qualification\": \"Read-only source/contract/hash inspection; no tests, builds, scripts, JS, network or live-writer tree access. C9c12 dispositions contain11 observed business-equal scenarios and one chain log order difference; outcome_raw future parser is not Internal/Fuel parity. All37 equivalence unproven.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"fc023efa6d54e5b6999b6ea55e9a9e0a3b6aa590","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/supplement-v2.json","status":"added","additions":94,"deletions":0,"changes":94,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsupplement-v2.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsupplement-v2.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan%2Fsupplement-v2.json?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@\n+{\n+  \"artifact_kind\": \"additive-plan-P1-correction-not-implementation\",\n+  \"originals_preserved\": {\n+    \"guide\": \"/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/4f27f4d2-25b9-4460-80f5-4f13ade2c32e/proposals/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan.md\",\n+    \"guide_sha256\": \"18011b3559deb93791e6802166c3fed72694a27783ebf00430e6b1c54ee7d03d\",\n+    \"inventory\": \"/tmp/c29-change-hp-4f27f4d2/source-inventory.json\",\n+    \"inventory_sha256\": \"ce657b4ed13ef3e08c77dbaa5ab79c5ea190cec9190698c3150720a14211bc2b\",\n+    \"review\": \"/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/a1569ea2-d445-43ad-9f9e-1333b00db854/reviews/c29-change-hp-shared-consumer-plan.md\",\n+    \"review_sha256\": \"dcafabaf5306db7208962bc8c8339946050c18c91dd262a100557d034972b6b2\",\n+    \"historical_review_disposition\": \"BLOCK1P1, retained; no independent closure claimed\"\n+  },\n+  \"corrected_read_identity\": {\n+    \"main_head_observed\": \"34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8\",\n+    \"main_tree_observed\": \"22e6eab72d104baf7a658d5ff2d832128ac32e4a\",\n+    \"bdaf_status\": \"Historical read identity only, withdrawn pre-push due parent test-profile archive; not accepted/published Main.\",\n+    \"kernel_content_diff_5fc_to_34e83\": \"empty\",\n+    \"overlay\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9c-final-ld22eim7/snapshot\",\n+    \"overlay_files_observed\": 214,\n+    \"overlay_manifest_identity_inherited\": \"0ab2b44eac80e7c1d591ebe560e8be69ab4ff72a4ac35b7db92edc5c4f4925ae\",\n+    \"manifest_qualification\": \"Supplied identity and prior parent-audit confirmation; original manifest bytes not rehashed.\",\n+    \"live_C9d_read\": false\n+  },\n+  \"pinned_sources\": {\n+    \"noname_head_observed\": \"1a548c95acdf8ac1ef44d74473403eda2ac86cf0\",\n+    \"liuli_pin_inherited_unchanged\": \"8485dbb29ff16f9b258a766b1a17ef75f883aade\",\n+    \"sha256_observed\": {\n+      \"Core/noname/library/element/content.ts\": \"09951b61fe8d9199ed1eb8b373faaf206d683e24b2a93a75ffc2259330891e6c\",\n+      \"Core/noname/library/element/gameEvent.ts\": \"9a777f0f88f46d706bb6539c8ea2ae09c87d90e5ffad43c289e1a8423a2be4b8\",\n+      \"Core/noname/library/element/player.js\": \"fc34249bcfeb48e676ecff6c973892e5d9affe039201d537237c08a294546bcd\",\n+      \"C9c/kernel/damage.rs\": \"ecc14df301b33da1a7852309d4ad70dbd7ff31dcf8e08baa1ae4bbc7b8d4f2f4\",\n+      \"C9c/kernel/damage_flow.rs\": \"0ea44f598613d20d1eaa6224c358f9a0f86cf76207fe850c9c42663faad057d4\"\n+    },\n+    \"exact_quotes\": [\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"original guide line26\",\n+        \"quote\": \"notrigger suppresses its actual ChangeHp triggers too (Core12118); do not expose callback work through another alias.\",\n+        \"disposition\": \"Incorrect; explicitly superseded by v2.\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"Core content.ts12118\",\n+        \"quote\": \"player.changeHp(-num, false)._triggered = null;\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"Core content.ts12370\",\n+        \"quote\": \"await event.trigger(\\\"changeHp\\\");\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"Core gameEvent.ts261-267\",\n+        \"quote\": \"if (this._triggered === 0) { await trigger(\\\"Before\\\", 1); } else if (this._triggered === 1) { await trigger(\\\"Begin\\\", 2); } else { this.#inContent = true; let next = this.content(this).catch(error => {\",\n+        \"qualification\": \"Whitespace normalized; numbered source read confirms null takes content branch.\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"Core gameEvent.ts462-648\",\n+        \"quote\": \"trigger(name: string): GameEvent {\",\n+        \"finding\": \"Full method contains ordinary hook/filter/player/eligibility dispatch and no _triggered gate. Existing video/filterStop/no-subscriber guards still apply.\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"location\": \"Core mode/boss.js9589-9598\",\n+        \"quote\": \"trigger: { player: [\\\"loseEnd\\\", \\\"changeHp\\\"] },\",\n+        \"finding\": \"Real shangshix hand<4 filter and player.draw(4-player.countCards('h')) supply future fixture; source inspected, not executed.\"\n+      }\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"small_repair_diff\": [\n+    {\n+      \"location\": \"v1 inventory ordinary_change_hp_source.Damage\",\n+      \"old\": \"notrigger suppresses child trigger\",\n+      \"new\": \"notrigger suppresses the child automatic lifecycle only; its ordinary changeHp body trigger remains eligible.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"location\": \"v1 line26 notrigger sentence only\",\n+      \"old\": \"notrigger suppresses its actual ChangeHp triggers too (Core12118); do not expose callback work through another alias.\",\n+      \"new\": \"For positive submitted damage.notrigger, suppress only source-prescribed automatic lifecycle and damage windows. Run the ordinary ChangeHp body trigger and eligible consumers, including full-armor num0, before parent progression.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"location\": \"v1 historical read identity\",\n+      \"old\": \"bdaf as Main read authority without withdrawal qualifier\",\n+      \"new\": \"bdaf is withdrawn historical read identity; accepted Main34e83/tree22e6, immutable214 overlay retained.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"location\": \"v1 sequencing\",\n+      \"old\": \"C9d seal/review -> ChangeHp -> DeathFlow\",\n+      \"new\": \"C9d seal/review -> repair/review Chilongya notLink, Zuijiu immediate-Sha parent ancestry, signed Hutian vs max0 -> ChangeHp -> DeathFlow\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"future_test_contract\": {\n+    \"positive_normal_notrigger_damage\": \"Source-qualified shangshix owner, hand1, positive damage1, sufficient HP; real draw3 child before parent progress, no suppressed damage or HP-generic lifecycle windows.\",\n+    \"full_armor_variant\": \"Same positive submission with armor1 absorbs all; rawHP unchanged, ordinary ChangeHp num0 still draws3, Core changedHp0 switch filter skips, armor applied once.\",\n+    \"zero_prevented_control\": \"No submitted HP/ChangeHp from damage; do not conflate a positive submission with zero HP loss and a zero/prevented root. Preserve actual zero/cancel notifications separately.\",\n+    \"restore\": \"Receipt/ordinary frame/order admission/draw child/parent progress time-slice and byte-restore matrix; one HP/armor application, one ordinary dispatch and draw, no activation requery of admitted child; wrong inherited suppression flags rejected at restore trust boundary.\",\n+    \"execution_status\": \"Not run; specification only.\"\n+  },\n+  \"scope\": \"Existing Decision29; private331/106/758/WS6 and332/106->R05-333/107 unchanged. No user approval, public ABI/WS/schema number or internal tag reserved.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"a156f75cd1686af215b4d4adf3b3b1343d762850","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/README.md","status":"added","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changes":13,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2FREADME.md?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@\n+# C9d：既有Damage窗口队列迁移，仍 BLOCK 两新P1和三规则缺陷\n+\n+核验2026-10-31；私有331／NGSA106／ABI758／WS6，Main无C生产合入。完整217 manifest0d4583771720f7eeb3bf87a84dc3fc52fc7d471105830d99e894b81446214053，18增量487bb40008d8a9be8aff5bce97df8e3fbbb63b63cad7751cdb703db5aa1564b9。见[实现原文](implementation.raw.txt)、[完整原索引](artifact-index.json)、[父fresh核验](noname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json)及[独立复审](review-two-P1.raw.txt)。\n+\n+41个有限源效果经原Frame.queue／TriggerOrder／C7 admission执行；15个真实helper定义追加在原215 builtins之后，以状态／装备／deposit识别实际recipient／holder，不伪造parent skill所有权。窗口Commit不再直接运行这些skill效果，Huoshen First把num1归零先于恢复的真实反例已绿。helper移除／续期、Order选择、七个非法byte输入和Recover子树恢复恰一次回归通过；这仍是既有状态到队列的限定适配，不等于完整provider／lifetime契约完成。\n+\n+最终native1802/1/75、exit101，仅golden组失败；独立Gate1b0、source9033／unit2／layering0。父独立核2319产物、217／18源与tar、最终六命令，并确认tracked diff无217以外路径。误触发的整仓cargo fmt结果与按C9c＋5fc原字节恢复记录保留在original/accidental-format-original及相关日志；最终仅18 intended增量，不把恢复当丢弃他人工作。\n+\n+独立复审仍BLOCK两个具体P1：Ciqiu错在Begin声明／分派，实际源为Begin1；Ciqiu／Xixue准入允许元素杀而body只认普通Sha，导致被准入却无效果。需真实First Begin1反例及FireSha／LeiSha正控／恢复，不能用缩窄准入掩盖。另三必修缺陷是Chilongya notLink、Zuijiu真实直接Sha父上下文及Hutian signed量；原语／live／restore消费者需共同修复，均不是已接纳变体或可选差异。\n+\n+12场362对最终capture相对精确C8 baseline：11场仅在已观察业务面相同，chain事件顺序有已审源支持。父独立核完整六业务字段与原始返回：187无返回、139 Accepted哈希单列、32 Pending完整载荷、4 Rejected完整原因一致；不规范化未知字段，不从相同错误推隐私。golden expected未改、baseline原14场绿复用无重跑，原红完整保留。见original/golden-business-and-outcome-dispositions.json。\n+\n+真实ChangeHp尚不存在，HLSS／八boss激活／Shangshix／DVa仍直接消费者；[已审ChangeHp v2方案](../2026-10-31-c331-change-hp-plan/README.md)只关闭方案P1。顺序仍是本批复审→五项规则／资格修复并复审→真实ChangeHp→共享DeathFlow，当前全Damage／C331／37来源／Main merge均未验收。最新状态见[进度主稿](../../../architecture/native-progress.md)。"},{"sha":"572e673f7ce3151264c6b62106b63e9d266ef693","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/artifact-index.json","status":"added","additions":11615,"deletions":0,"changes":11615,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fartifact-index.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fartifact-index.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fartifact-index.json?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64"},{"sha":"f87715f044c43812a928f299fcd29e566f815c42","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/implementation.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":56,"deletions":0,"changes":56,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fimplementation.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fimplementation.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fimplementation.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@\n+2026-10-31 C331 phase9d — bounded existing-window damage priority migration; independent review required.\n+Whole Damage/C331/Main merge remains BLOCK: source262/290, remaining28, +0. No golden rerecord or SDK/source parity acceptance.\n+Private writer remains based on 5fc; C9c214/21 and all 5215 indexed artifacts were independently rehashed without changes.\n+Evidence root: `/private/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-c331-phase7-ktqqj1fb/evidence/phase9d`.\n+Machine inventory: `source-inventory-and-remaining-boundaries.json` pins 41 units, actual source paths/hashes/keys, roles, tuples, qualifications, producer/cleanup consumers and mandatory defects.\n+All formerly inline Before/Begin/Begin1/Begin4/End/After callbacks now run as individually admitted native units through the existing Frame.queue/TriggerOrder; window Commit performs no skill effects.\n+Begin2/Target/Source contain no former inline source unit; Begin3 XiangDe already uses the ordinary queue. Original Zhaohuo Begin1 source conversion is preserved.\n+Fifteen genuine source/card helper definitions were appended after the original 215 builtins; status/equip/deposit qualification identifies recipient/holder without fabricating parent-skill ownership.\n+Owned definitions retain real enabled instances. Helper renewals enter the existing register_added consumer; stopped, zero or cancelled roots exclude downstream units through shared eligibility.\n+Existing tag85 carries owner/def/window; codec/hash/archive/inventory remain synchronized. Restore checks actual qualified identity, admission, root window, slot/stage/depth and nested-machine rejection.\n+An atomic native body returns Done before its emitted children finish; no provider is rechecked midway through a completed body's child. NonDamage construction remains unchanged.\n+Actual Huoshen RED: First Begin1 num1→0 expected HP2, got HP3. Final GREEN: First stops recovery; real Boss Zhouyu positive independently recovers HP4→5.\n+Six added regressions cover that counterexample, real Boss identity, applied-recipient removal/renewal, helper Order choice, seven byte-restore forgeries/atomic rejection, Mailun First zero, and actual Recover-child restore exactly once.\n+Final full native: **1802 passed / 1 failed / 75 ignored**, exit101; sole failure is replay_scenarios_match_golden. The focused final file contributes 20 passing tests in that run.\n+Independent Gate1b (`RUSTFLAGS=-Dwarnings cargo check --offline -p engine-native --all-targets`) passed; cap unit2, source9033 and layering0 passed.\n+Commands, log hashes, exact tested-source identity and targets: `command-source-bindings.json`; raw final logs/results: `checks-final/`; aggregate: `full-native-summary.json`.\n+Twelve original expected goldens remain unchanged. Accepted C8 producer PASS14 was reused; no baseline producer rebuild or rerun.\n+Refreshed comparison: `golden-business-and-outcome-dispositions.json`; complete current snapshots/archives/resolution/core/log/RNG/views/choices remain in `checks-final/current-*-traces-v3`.\n+\n+| Scenario | Seed | Paired captures | Observed six-field business disposition |\n+|---|---:|---:|---|\n+| sha_dodge_then_damage | 11 | 21 | Equal |\n+| death_terminal_single | 71 | 19 | Equal |\n+| sancai_nested_chain | 23 | 25 | Equal |\n+| yishang_redirect | 31 | 23 | Equal |\n+| suidun_window_matrix | 53 | 69 | Equal |\n+| shouyi_dynamic_skill | 61 | 67 | Equal |\n+| rollback_invariants | 81 | 25 | Equal |\n+| equip_distance_matrix | 101 | 63 | Equal |\n+| chain_fire_propagation | 113 | 11 | Source-supported unlink/log order |\n+| aoe_response_queue | 131 | 15 | Equal |\n+| duel_alternating_response | 141 | 11 | Equal |\n+| nullify_chain_on_savage | 153 | 13 | Equal |\n+\n+Across362 pairs, outcome discriminants agree; 32 Pending payloads and4 complete Rejected reasons agree. All139 Accepted hashes remain raw and separately recorded; 187 boundaries have no command outcome.\n+Chain first difference remains 0007-after: actor0/revision3/dedup163/card95→[1]; old event11 unlinks player2 prematurely, current records DamageDealt(target2,1) before its own unlink.\n+No unknown fields were normalized. This does not prove arbitrary internal/fuel equivalence, scheduling/archive equality, privacy from matching rejections, or global source parity.\n+**Unfixed concrete rule defect:** Chilongya admits chain damage despite source notLink; amount1 becomes2 rather than1, changing canonical quantity/HP/log and descendants.\n+**Unfixed concrete qualification defect:** Zuijiu checks damage.card without proving genuine immediate Sha parent; chain/non-Sha-parent damage can receive an invalid increment. QueryCtx ancestry and live/restore admission need the same real parent fact.\n+**Unfixed concrete rule defect:** Hutian clamps hp−deposit to0; HP2/deposit3 should preserve canonical−1. Later window handlers, signed host amount, persistence and zero progression need exact regression coverage.\n+Those three are mandatory repairs, not accepted variants or optional gaps. Exact affected live/restore/provider consumers and minimal tests are in the machine inventory; supervisor directed preserving this frozen priority delta for review.\n+**Remaining mechanism:** genuine ChangeHp queue is absent. HLSS refill, eight boss activation gates, Shangshix and DVa HP interception remain direct source consumers; they were not relabelled as DamageEnd/After.\n+Next approved work after independent review: repair these predicates/parent qualification, then genuine ChangeHp consumer; DeathFlow/provider/LossEnd/wholeSDK remain later work. Plan8791 ordering unchanged.\n+Clock: start14:36:47Z; checkpoint14:54:52Z,22 files, reverse-checkPASS. Checkpoint manifest0183cb2ddf377096e7a3f60fba9c802a62b28020666b6db534634d67c62e49e2.\n+Final producers completed before15:09Z, source/protection seal15:14:15Z; no new heavy after15:16:47Z and no queued/active owned producer remains.\n+Setup/compiler/parser/zero-test attempts, initial full-suite failures and positive-body migration error remain raw evidence; only final source-bound results above establish current status.\n+Accidental cargo fmt changes outside scope were restored from C9c214+5fc bytes; formatted bytes and restoration records remain under accidental-format-original/. Final increment has only18 intended files.\n+Main was read-only: exact Own6/I02_30/CI/generated/schema exceptions were checked separately from original31867; defaultdist37, originalC6_140, hooks, private generated12 and old330 reader pins were preserved.\n+Observed Main HEADbdaf is receipt-bound but supervisor explicitly marks that commit withdrawn/not pushed, correction local stage; this report supplies no Main publication or QA acceptance claim.\n+Private331/NGSA106/ABI758/WS6, public format/API1 and future332/106→R05333/107 remain unchanged; private staging is empty, no commit/push.\n+Increment18 manifest: `487bb40008d8a9be8aff5bce97df8e3fbbb63b63cad7751cdb703db5aa1564b9`.\n+Increment tar: `47d000a8caaa960c78bd3116b0a780c9541098116ba09db4dac3453587fd2a65`; patch: `43bce71e225b160c6376989b229bbf13a83751a04aafd13cd96afeb7b3eec1ea`.\n+Composed217 manifest: `0d4583771720f7eeb3bf87a84dc3fc52fc7d471105830d99e894b81446214053`.\n+Composed tar: `761350fdc78a28418e34af4b0caee5c0bb1c33c7d3207a92e9291564b1e18e8f`; patch: `0576b3132e49e56730a8712e3215b3b40400b9d9413622529d2ac37e6ed9f04f`.\n+Both patches reverse-check; immutable materialized source trees are final-freeze/source/ and full-source/source/. Hashes/status: results-bound.json; protection: protected-after.json; all phase9d artifacts: artifact-index.json and artifact-index.sha256.\n+Skipped broad WASM/UI/workspace campaigns and golden rerecording. Mandatory rule/qualification defects, actual ChangeHp ordering and the red golden gate remain risks; no full Damage/C331 acceptance follows."},{"sha":"ee3e2e4d53931508b65705045fe092a465ae190e","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/noname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json","status":"added","additions":95,"deletions":0,"changes":95,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-31T15:25:01.731453+00:00\",\n+  \"status\": \"PASS_INTEGRITY_BOUNDED_MIGRATION_REVIEW_PENDING_WHOLE_DAMAGE_BLOCK\",\n+  \"root\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9d-final-nzl_pk88\",\n+  \"snapshot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9d-final-nzl_pk88/snapshot\",\n+  \"evidenceRoot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-c331-phase7-ktqqj1fb/evidence/phase9d\",\n+  \"artifactFiles\": 2319,\n+  \"fullFiles\": 217,\n+  \"incrementFiles\": 18,\n+  \"sourceManifest\": \"0d4583771720f7eeb3bf87a84dc3fc52fc7d471105830d99e894b81446214053\",\n+  \"incrementManifest\": \"487bb40008d8a9be8aff5bce97df8e3fbbb63b63cad7751cdb703db5aa1564b9\",\n+  \"trackedDiffOutside217\": [],\n+  \"commands\": [\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"full-native\",\n+      \"exit\": 101,\n+      \"counts\": [\n+        1802,\n+        1,\n+        75\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"gate1b\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"golden-traces\",\n+      \"exit\": 101,\n+      \"counts\": [\n+        0,\n+        1,\n+        0\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"source-cap-unit\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"source-caps\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"layering\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"pairedCaptures\": 362,\n+  \"actualOutcomeCounts\": {\n+    \"NoCommandOutcome\": 187,\n+    \"Accepted\": 139,\n+    \"Pending\": 32,\n+    \"Rejected\": 4\n+  },\n+  \"nonAcceptedEntirePayloadEqual\": true,\n+  \"AcceptedExact32ByteHashRetainedNotCompared\": true,\n+  \"observedEqualScenarios\": 11,\n+  \"observedBusinessDifferences\": [\n+    {\n+      \"scenario\": \"chain_fire_propagation\",\n+      \"differences\": [\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0007-after\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0008-before\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0009-after\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0010-final\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        }\n+      ]\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"qualification\": \"No product/golden/C331/Main acceptance. Needs connected-source review of41units/15helpers/admission/lifetimes/restore. Three concrete source defects Chilongya notLink,Zuijiu immediateSha ancestry,Hutian signed remainmandatoryrepairs; genuineChangeHp andDeathFlow stillabsent. No golden expected changed.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"d6ce053979753b5e389f038aac44a384dea8011f","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/noname-parent-c9d-final-audit.py","status":"added","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changes":43,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.py","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.py","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.py?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@\n+from pathlib import Path\n+import json,hashlib,tarfile,tempfile,re,datetime,subprocess,collections\n+E=Path('/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-c331-phase7-ktqqj1fb/evidence/phase9d');W=E.parent.parent/'worktree';h=lambda b:hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest();j=lambda p:json.loads(p.read_bytes());r=j(E/'results-bound.json');idx=j(E/'artifact-index.json');root=Path(tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='noname-parent-c9d-final-'));S=root/'snapshot';S.mkdir()\n+for x in idx['files']:b=(E/x['path']).read_bytes();assert h(b)==x['sha256'] and len(b)==x['bytes'],x['path']\n+for folder,mkey,tarname,tkey,patchname,pkey,count in [('full-source','composed_manifest_sha256','composed-source.tar.gz','composed_tar_sha256','vs-main5fc.patch','composed_patch_sha256',217),('final-freeze','increment_manifest_sha256','changed-source.tar.gz','increment_tar_sha256','vs-c9c.patch','increment_patch_sha256',18)]:\n+ d=E/folder;m=j(d/'source-manifest.json');assert len(m['files'])==count and h((d/'source-manifest.json').read_bytes())==r[mkey] and h((d/tarname).read_bytes())==r[tkey] and h((d/patchname).read_bytes())==r[pkey];expected={x['path']:x['sha256'] for x in m['files']}\n+ with tarfile.open(d/tarname,'r:gz') as t:\n+  files={x.name:x for x in t.getmembers() if x.isfile()};assert set(files)==set(expected)\n+  for name,sha in expected.items():\n+   p=Path(name);assert not p.is_absolute() and '..' not in p.parts;data=t.extractfile(files[name]).read();assert h(data)==sha and h((d/'source'/name).read_bytes())==sha and h((W/name).read_bytes())==sha\n+   if folder=='full-source':out=S/name;out.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);out.write_bytes(data)\n+   else:assert h((S/name).read_bytes())==sha\n+full={x['path'] for x in j(E/'full-source/source-manifest.json')['files']};changed=set(subprocess.check_output(['git','--no-optional-locks','-C',str(W),'diff','--name-only']).decode().splitlines());assert changed<=full,sorted(changed-full)\n+b=j(E/'command-source-bindings.json');assert h(Path(b['source_manifest']).read_bytes())==b['source_manifest_sha256']==r['increment_manifest_sha256'];parsed=[]\n+for c in b['commands']:\n+ p=E/'checks-final'/(c['name']+'.log');assert h(p.read_bytes())==c['log_sha256'] and c['source_manifest_sha256']==b['source_manifest_sha256'];rows=re.findall(r'test result: (?:ok|FAILED)\\. (\\d+) passed; (\\d+) failed; (\\d+) ignored;',p.read_text(errors='replace'));counts=[sum(int(x[i]) for x in rows) for i in range(3)] if rows else None\n+ if c['name']=='full-native':assert counts==[1802,1,75] and c['exit']==101\n+ if c['name']=='gate1b':assert c['exit']==0 and c['RUSTFLAGS']=='-Dwarnings'\n+ parsed.append({'name':c['name'],'exit':c['exit'],'counts':counts})\n+g=j(E/'golden-business-and-outcome-dispositions.json');assert len(g['rows'])==12 and not g['normalization'] and not g['golden_expectations_changed'];pairs=0;outcomes=collections.Counter();diffs=[]\n+def classify(raw):\n+ if raw=='':return 'NoCommandOutcome'\n+ if re.fullmatch(r'Accepted \\{ state_hash: \\[(?:\\d+(?:, )?){32}\\] \\}',raw):\n+  values=json.loads(raw[len('Accepted { state_hash: '):-2]);assert len(values)==32 and all(0<=x<=255 for x in values);return 'Accepted'\n+ for kind in ['Pending','Rejected']:\n+  if raw.startswith(kind+' {') or raw.startswith(kind+'('):return kind\n+ raise AssertionError(('unsupported full outcome format',raw[:120]))\n+for row in g['rows']:\n+ assert row['paired_inputs_and_phase_identical'] and row['source_versions']['C8_overlay_manifest']==g['baseline_manifest_sha256'];observed=[];assert len(row['captures'])==len(row['outcomes'])\n+ for cap,outcome in zip(row['captures'],row['outcomes']):\n+  assert cap['step']==outcome['step'];data={}\n+  for side in ['old','new']:\n+   p=Path(cap[side+'_path']);assert h(p.read_bytes())==cap[side+'_sha256'];data[side]=j(p)\n+   for suffix,ending in [('_snapshot_sha256','.snapshot.txt'),('_archive_sha256','.archive.ngsa')]:assert h(p.with_suffix(ending).read_bytes())==cap[side+suffix]\n+  a=data['old'];z=data['new'];assert a['command']==z['command'] and a['phase']==z['phase'] and a['ruleset_version']==z['ruleset_version'];fields=[key for key in ['core','events','rng','views','choices','referee'] if a[key]!=z[key]]\n+  if fields:observed.append({'step':cap['step'],'fields':fields})\n+  old=a['outcome_raw'];new=z['outcome_raw'];kind=classify(old);assert kind==classify(new)==outcome['discriminant'];assert old==outcome['old_raw'] and new==outcome['new_raw']\n+  if kind!='Accepted':assert old==new\n+  outcomes[kind]+=1;pairs+=1\n+ if observed:diffs.append({'scenario':row['scenario'],'differences':observed});assert row['first_business_difference'] is not None\n+ else:assert row['first_business_difference'] is None\n+assert pairs==362 and outcomes=={'Accepted':139,'Pending':32,'Rejected':4,'NoCommandOutcome':187} and [x['scenario'] for x in diffs]==['chain_fire_propagation']\n+v={'utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'status':'PASS_INTEGRITY_BOUNDED_MIGRATION_REVIEW_PENDING_WHOLE_DAMAGE_BLOCK','root':str(root),'snapshot':str(S),'evidenceRoot':str(E),'artifactFiles':len(idx['files']),'fullFiles':217,'incrementFiles':18,'sourceManifest':r['composed_manifest_sha256'],'incrementManifest':r['increment_manifest_sha256'],'trackedDiffOutside217':[],'commands':parsed,'pairedCaptures':pairs,'actualOutcomeCounts':dict(outcomes),'nonAcceptedEntirePayloadEqual':True,'AcceptedExact32ByteHashRetainedNotCompared':True,'observedEqualScenarios':11,'observedBusinessDifferences':diffs,'qualification':'No product/golden/C331/Main acceptance. Needs connected-source review of41units/15helpers/admission/lifetimes/restore. Three concrete source defects Chilongya notLink,Zuijiu immediateSha ancestry,Hutian signed remainmandatoryrepairs; genuineChangeHp andDeathFlow stillabsent. No golden expected changed.'};Path('/tmp/noname-parent-c9d-final-audit.json').write_text(json.dumps(v,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\n');print(json.dumps(v,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))"},{"sha":"ee3e2e4d53931508b65705045fe092a465ae190e","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/noname-parent-c9d-final-audit.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":95,"deletions":0,"changes":95,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Fnoname-parent-c9d-final-audit.raw.txt?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-31T15:25:01.731453+00:00\",\n+  \"status\": \"PASS_INTEGRITY_BOUNDED_MIGRATION_REVIEW_PENDING_WHOLE_DAMAGE_BLOCK\",\n+  \"root\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9d-final-nzl_pk88\",\n+  \"snapshot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9d-final-nzl_pk88/snapshot\",\n+  \"evidenceRoot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-c331-phase7-ktqqj1fb/evidence/phase9d\",\n+  \"artifactFiles\": 2319,\n+  \"fullFiles\": 217,\n+  \"incrementFiles\": 18,\n+  \"sourceManifest\": \"0d4583771720f7eeb3bf87a84dc3fc52fc7d471105830d99e894b81446214053\",\n+  \"incrementManifest\": \"487bb40008d8a9be8aff5bce97df8e3fbbb63b63cad7751cdb703db5aa1564b9\",\n+  \"trackedDiffOutside217\": [],\n+  \"commands\": [\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"full-native\",\n+      \"exit\": 101,\n+      \"counts\": [\n+        1802,\n+        1,\n+        75\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"gate1b\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"golden-traces\",\n+      \"exit\": 101,\n+      \"counts\": [\n+        0,\n+        1,\n+        0\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"source-cap-unit\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"source-caps\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"layering\",\n+      \"exit\": 0,\n+      \"counts\": null\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"pairedCaptures\": 362,\n+  \"actualOutcomeCounts\": {\n+    \"NoCommandOutcome\": 187,\n+    \"Accepted\": 139,\n+    \"Pending\": 32,\n+    \"Rejected\": 4\n+  },\n+  \"nonAcceptedEntirePayloadEqual\": true,\n+  \"AcceptedExact32ByteHashRetainedNotCompared\": true,\n+  \"observedEqualScenarios\": 11,\n+  \"observedBusinessDifferences\": [\n+    {\n+      \"scenario\": \"chain_fire_propagation\",\n+      \"differences\": [\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0007-after\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0008-before\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0009-after\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"step\": \"0010-final\",\n+          \"fields\": [\n+            \"events\"\n+          ]\n+        }\n+      ]\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"qualification\": \"No product/golden/C331/Main acceptance. Needs connected-source review of41units/15helpers/admission/lifetimes/restore. Three concrete source defects Chilongya notLink,Zuijiu immediateSha ancestry,Hutian signed remainmandatoryrepairs; genuineChangeHp andDeathFlow stillabsent. No golden expected changed.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"8a26cd39043a46dea54f9f516c48b66d7e200fd4","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/benchmark-runner/src/main.rs","status":"added","additions":714,"deletions":0,"changes":714,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fbenchmark-runner%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fbenchmark-runner%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fbenchmark-runner%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,714 @@\n+//! Reproducible benchmark runner (architecture plan §38).\n+//!\n+//! Runs the fixed scenarios from §38.2 and reports the metrics from §38.3.\n+//! Results are printed as stable key=value pairs for CI parsing. Per §38.5,\n+//! each run records CPU/build context so regressions are attributable.\n+//!\n+//! Usage:\n+//!   benchmark-runner                    # run all scenarios\n+//!   benchmark-runner start-hash         # single scenario\n+//!   benchmark-runner identity-match     # single scenario\n+//!   benchmark-runner trigger-dispatch   # 100k trigger fan-outs\n+//!   benchmark-runner distance-query     # 100k distance queries\n+//!   benchmark-runner tier-report [tier] # §38.1 device tier budget report\n+\n+mod device_tiers;\n+\n+use device_tiers::{render_tier_report, BudgetCheck, DeviceTier, TierBudget, TierReport};\n+use engine_api::{\n+    Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, ObserverKind, PlayerId,\n+};\n+use engine_core::{project_observer, query, run_identity_match, Engine, MatchConfig, QueryContext};\n+use rule_api::QueryRequest;\n+use serde::Serialize;\n+use std::alloc::{GlobalAlloc, Layout, System};\n+use std::env;\n+use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicU64, Ordering};\n+use std::time::Instant;\n+\n+/// O3：计数分配器——统计分配次数与字节数（仅 benchmark 进程内）。\n+struct CountingAlloc;\n+\n+static ALLOC_OPS: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(0);\n+static ALLOC_BYTES: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(0);\n+\n+unsafe impl GlobalAlloc for CountingAlloc {\n+    unsafe fn alloc(&self, layout: Layout) -> *mut u8 {\n+        ALLOC_OPS.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+        ALLOC_BYTES.fetch_add(layout.size() as u64, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+        System.alloc(layout)\n+    }\n+    unsafe fn dealloc(&self, ptr: *mut u8, layout: Layout) {\n+        System.dealloc(ptr, layout)\n+    }\n+    unsafe fn realloc(&self, ptr: *mut u8, layout: Layout, new_size: usize) -> *mut u8 {\n+        ALLOC_OPS.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+        ALLOC_BYTES.fetch_add(new_size as u64, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+        System.realloc(ptr, layout, new_size)\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[global_allocator]\n+static GLOBAL: CountingAlloc = CountingAlloc;\n+\n+/// 分配快照（op, bytes）。\n+fn alloc_snapshot() -> (u64, u64) {\n+    (\n+        ALLOC_OPS.load(Ordering::Relaxed),\n+        ALLOC_BYTES.load(Ordering::Relaxed),\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Serialize)]\n+struct BenchReport {\n+    scenario: &'static str,\n+    samples: u64,\n+    total_us: u64,\n+    p50_ns: u64,\n+    p99_ns: u64,\n+    cpu: String,\n+    build: String,\n+}\n+\n+/// 已排序样本的分位数（q ∈ (0,1]，最近邻取值）。\n+fn percentile(sorted: &[u64], q: f64) -> u64 {\n+    if sorted.is_empty() {\n+        return 0;\n+    }\n+    let idx = (((sorted.len() as f64) * q) as usize).min(sorted.len() - 1);\n+    sorted[idx]\n+}\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let mut args = env::args().skip(1);\n+    let scenario = args.next().unwrap_or_else(|| \"all\".into());\n+    match scenario.as_str() {\n+        \"all\" => {\n+            bench_start_hash(4, 42, 50);\n+            bench_start_hash(8, 99, 50);\n+            bench_identity_match(4, 42, 2000);\n+            bench_trigger_dispatch(50_000);\n+            bench_distance_query(50_000);\n+            bench_query_cache(100_000);\n+            bench_snapshot_restore(100);\n+            bench_observer_projection(10_000);\n+            bench_ai_nodes(2_000);\n+        }\n+        \"start-hash\" => bench_start_hash(4, 42, 200),\n+        \"identity-match\" => bench_identity_match(4, 42, 5000),\n+        \"trigger-dispatch\" => bench_trigger_dispatch(100_000),\n+        \"distance-query\" => bench_distance_query(100_000),\n+        \"snapshot\" => bench_snapshot_restore(500),\n+        \"query-cache\" => bench_query_cache(100_000),\n+        \"ai-nodes\" => bench_ai_nodes(5_000),\n+        \"frame-latency\" => bench_frame_latency(20, 4),\n+        \"frame-latency-heavy\" => bench_frame_latency(8, 8),\n+        \"projection\" => bench_observer_projection(50_000),\n+        \"tier-report\" => {\n+            let tier_label = args.next().unwrap_or_else(|| \"desktop-native\".into());\n+            let tier = DeviceTier::from_label(&tier_label).unwrap_or_else(|| {\n+                eprintln!(\"unknown tier: {tier_label}\");\n+                eprintln!(\"tiers: android-low-webview | android-mainstream | iphone-ipad | desktop-browser | desktop-native | server-baseline\");\n+                std::process::exit(1);\n+            });\n+            run_tier_report(tier);\n+        }\n+        \"tiers\" => {\n+            // List all tiers.\n+            println!(\"=== §38.1 Device Tiers ===\");\n+            for t in DeviceTier::all() {\n+                let b = TierBudget::for_tier(*t);\n+                println!(\"{}: {}\", t.label(), t.display_name());\n+                println!(\"  start_hash_p50={}us  command_p95={}us  distance_q_p95={}us  frame={}ms  mem={}MB\",\n+                    b.start_hash_p50_us, b.command_p95_us, b.distance_query_p95_us, b.frame_budget_ms, b.memory_budget_mb);\n+            }\n+        }\n+        other => {\n+            eprintln!(\"unknown scenario: {other}\");\n+            eprintln!(\"scenarios: all | start-hash | identity-match | trigger-dispatch | distance-query | query-cache | snapshot | projection | ai-nodes | frame-latency | frame-latency-heavy | tier-report [tier] | tiers\");\n+            std::process::exit(1);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Run benchmarks and check results against a tier's budget (§38.1).\n+fn run_tier_report(tier: DeviceTier) {\n+    let budget = TierBudget::for_tier(tier);\n+    let mut checks = Vec::new();\n+\n+    // StartGame P50.\n+    let mut times_ns: Vec<u64> = Vec::with_capacity(50);\n+    for _ in 0..50 {\n+        let mut e = Engine::new();\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        e.submit(start_cmd(42, 4));\n+        times_ns.push(s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64);\n+    }\n+    times_ns.sort_unstable();\n+    let p50_us = times_ns[times_ns.len() / 2] / 1000;\n+    checks.push(BudgetCheck::check(\n+        \"start-hash-p50\",\n+        p50_us,\n+        budget.start_hash_p50_us,\n+        \"us\",\n+    ));\n+\n+    // Distance query P95.\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 8));\n+    let p1 = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    let p2 = PlayerId::new(2);\n+    let mut ctx = QueryContext::new();\n+    for _ in 0..100 {\n+        let _ = query(\n+            eng.state(),\n+            &QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 },\n+            &mut ctx,\n+        );\n+    }\n+    let mut q_times: Vec<u64> = Vec::with_capacity(10_000);\n+    for _ in 0..10_000 {\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        let _ = query(\n+            eng.state(),\n+            &QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 },\n+            &mut ctx,\n+        );\n+        q_times.push(s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64);\n+    }\n+    q_times.sort_unstable();\n+    let p95_idx = (q_times.len() as f64 * 0.95) as usize;\n+    let q_p95_us = q_times[p95_idx] / 1000;\n+    checks.push(BudgetCheck::check(\n+        \"distance-query-p95\",\n+        q_p95_us,\n+        budget.distance_query_p95_us,\n+        \"us\",\n+    ));\n+\n+    // Snapshot restore.\n+    let snap = eng.snapshot();\n+    let mut snap_times: Vec<u64> = Vec::with_capacity(100);\n+    for _ in 0..100 {\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        let mut r = Engine::new();\n+        r.restore_snapshot(&snap).unwrap();\n+        snap_times.push(s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64);\n+    }\n+    snap_times.sort_unstable();\n+    let snap_us = snap_times[snap_times.len() / 2] / 1000;\n+    checks.push(BudgetCheck::check(\n+        \"snapshot-restore\",\n+        snap_us,\n+        budget.snapshot_restore_us,\n+        \"us\",\n+    ));\n+\n+    // Observer projection.\n+    let mut proj_times: Vec<u64> = Vec::with_capacity(10_000);\n+    for _ in 0..10_000 {\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        let _ = project_observer(eng.state(), ObserverKind::Player(p1));\n+        proj_times.push(s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64);\n+    }\n+    proj_times.sort_unstable();\n+    let proj_us = proj_times[proj_times.len() / 2] / 1000;\n+    checks.push(BudgetCheck::check(\n+        \"observer-projection\",\n+        proj_us,\n+        budget.observer_projection_us,\n+        \"us\",\n+    ));\n+\n+    let all_passed = checks.iter().all(|c| c.passed);\n+    let report = TierReport {\n+        tier: tier.label().into(),\n+        display_name: tier.display_name().into(),\n+        checks,\n+        all_passed,\n+    };\n+    print!(\"{}\", render_tier_report(&report));\n+    if !all_passed {\n+        std::process::exit(1);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn start_cmd(seed: u64, n: u8) -> Command {\n+    Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: n,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: StartGame latency (Core metric: Resolution P50/P95).\n+fn bench_start_hash(players: u8, seed: u64, samples: u64) {\n+    let mut times_ns: Vec<u64> = Vec::with_capacity(samples as usize);\n+    // Warmup\n+    for _ in 0..3 {\n+        let mut e = Engine::new();\n+        e.submit(start_cmd(seed, players));\n+    }\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..samples {\n+        let mut e = Engine::new();\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        e.submit(start_cmd(seed, players));\n+        times_ns.push(s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64);\n+    }\n+    let total = t0.elapsed().as_micros() as u64;\n+    times_ns.sort_unstable();\n+    let p50 = times_ns[times_ns.len() / 2];\n+    let p99 = percentile(&times_ns, 0.99);\n+    emit(BenchReport {\n+        scenario: \"start-hash\",\n+        samples,\n+        total_us: total,\n+        p50_ns: p50,\n+        p99_ns: p99,\n+        cpu: cpu_info(),\n+        build: engine_api::ENGINE_BUILD_ID.into(),\n+    });\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=start-hash players={players} seed={seed} samples={samples} \\\n+         p50_ns={p50} p99_ns={p99} total_us={total}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: Identity match end-to-end (Core + Server metrics).\n+fn bench_identity_match(players: u8, seed: u64, max_steps: u32) {\n+    let samples = 10u64;\n+    let mut times_ms: Vec<u128> = Vec::new();\n+    for _ in 0..samples {\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        let report = run_identity_match(MatchConfig {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            max_steps,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        })\n+        .expect(\"match must complete\");\n+        let elapsed = s.elapsed().as_millis();\n+        times_ms.push(elapsed);\n+        assert!(!report.capped, \"match must not be capped\");\n+    }\n+    times_ms.sort_unstable();\n+    let p50 = times_ms[times_ms.len() / 2];\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=identity-match players={players} seed={seed} max_steps={max_steps} samples={samples} p50_ms={p50}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: Trigger dispatch throughput (10万次 trigger fan-out in plan).\n+/// Approximated by running EndPhase (which fans through trigger windows).\n+///\n+/// 验收口径修正（ADR 0703 \"先修正验收口径\"）：旧实现以固定\n+/// `ExpectedRevision(0)`/`IdempotencyKey(0)` 重复提交并**忽略 submit 结果**，\n+/// revision 前进后几乎全部落入 `StaleRevision` 拒绝路径，却被照常计入\n+/// \"触发吞吐\"。实测第二层拒绝源是选择屏障（`illegal_action:choice pending`）。\n+/// 现改为：跟踪 revision 与幂等键、actor 取当前回合玩家/选择观察者，\n+/// 遇挂起选择以确定性中性策略自动应答（取前 min_count 个选项 token），\n+/// 使 EndPhase 真正扇出到触发窗口；吞吐只统计**实际接受**的命令\n+/// （分 EndPhase / ResolveChoice 两类，P50/P95 覆盖全部接受命令），\n+/// 拒绝单独按原因计数并记录事件数；接受数为 0 时场景无效、非零码退出。\n+fn bench_trigger_dispatch(iterations: u64) {\n+    use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n+\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 8));\n+    let mut revision = eng.state().revision;\n+    let mut idempotency: u64 = 0;\n+    let mut accepted_end_phase: u64 = 0;\n+    let mut accepted_choice: u64 = 0;\n+    let mut rejected: u64 = 0;\n+    let mut events_total: u64 = 0;\n+    let mut rejected_by: BTreeMap<String, u64> = BTreeMap::new();\n+    let mut accepted_ns: Vec<u64> = Vec::new();\n+    let (a0, b0) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        if eng.state().outcome.is_finished() {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        let (kind, actor) = match eng.last_choice() {\n+            Some(choice) => {\n+                let a = choice.observer;\n+                (auto_answer(choice), a)\n+            }\n+            None => {\n+                let a = eng.state().turn.current;\n+                if a == PlayerId::NONE {\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+                (CommandKind::EndPhase, a)\n+            }\n+        };\n+        idempotency += 1;\n+        let is_end_phase = matches!(kind, CommandKind::EndPhase);\n+        let s = Instant::now();\n+        let result = eng.submit(Command {\n+            actor,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(revision),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(idempotency),\n+            kind,\n+        });\n+        let dt = s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64;\n+        match result {\n+            CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } => {\n+                if is_end_phase {\n+                    accepted_end_phase += 1;\n+                } else {\n+                    accepted_choice += 1;\n+                }\n+                revision = new_revision;\n+                events_total += eng.last_events().len() as u64;\n+                accepted_ns.push(dt);\n+            }\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+                rejected += 1;\n+                *rejected_by.entry(reject_key(&reason)).or_insert(0) += 1;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    let accepted = accepted_end_phase + accepted_choice;\n+    if accepted == 0 {\n+        eprintln!(\n+            \"scenario=trigger-dispatch INVALID: accepted=0 rejected={rejected} \\\n+             rejected_by={rejected_by:?} — throughput not measurable\"\n+        );\n+        std::process::exit(1);\n+    }\n+    accepted_ns.sort_unstable();\n+    let p50 = percentile(&accepted_ns, 0.50);\n+    let p95 = percentile(&accepted_ns, 0.95);\n+    let p99 = percentile(&accepted_ns, 0.99);\n+    let per_op_ns = elapsed.as_nanos() / (accepted + rejected).max(1) as u128;\n+    let (a1, b1) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let a_ops = (a1 - a0) / (accepted + rejected).max(1);\n+    let a_bytes = (b1 - b0) / (accepted + rejected).max(1);\n+    // 终局条件：驱动结束时对局是否终局、结果与回合数（§3 验收口径）。\n+    let outcome = eng.state().outcome.clone();\n+    let finished = outcome.is_finished();\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=trigger-dispatch iterations={iterations} accepted={accepted} \\\n+         accepted_end_phase={accepted_end_phase} accepted_choice={accepted_choice} \\\n+         rejected={rejected} events={events_total} p50_ns={p50} p95_ns={p95} p99_ns={p99} \\\n+         per_op_ns={per_op_ns} total_ms={} finished={finished} outcome={outcome:?} \\\n+         rounds={} rejected_by={rejected_by:?} allocs_delta={} bytes_delta={} allocs_per_op={} bytes_per_op={}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        eng.state().turn.round,\n+        a1 - a0,\n+        b1 - b0,\n+        a_ops,\n+        a_bytes\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 确定性中性自动应答：取前 min_count 个选项 token；无选项时按\n+/// allow_cancel 取消或提交空选择（constraint-only）。\n+fn auto_answer(choice: &engine_api::ChoiceRequest) -> CommandKind {\n+    if choice.options.is_empty() {\n+        return CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+            choice_id: choice.choice_id,\n+            selections: vec![],\n+            cancelled: choice.allow_cancel,\n+        };\n+    }\n+    let n = choice.min_count.max(1) as usize;\n+    let selections = choice.options.iter().take(n).map(|o| o.token).collect();\n+    CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+        choice_id: choice.choice_id,\n+        selections,\n+        cancelled: false,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Short stable key for reject-reason histogram (never leaks payloads).\n+fn reject_key(reason: &engine_api::RejectReason) -> String {\n+    use engine_api::RejectReason as R;\n+    match reason {\n+        R::InvalidActor => \"invalid_actor\".into(),\n+        R::StaleRevision { .. } => \"stale_revision\".into(),\n+        R::DuplicateIdempotency => \"duplicate_idempotency\".into(),\n+        R::IllegalAction { code } => format!(\"illegal_action:{code}\"),\n+        R::InvalidChoice => \"invalid_choice\".into(),\n+        R::MatchOver => \"match_over\".into(),\n+        R::NotStarted => \"not_started\".into(),\n+        R::Fault { kind, .. } => format!(\"fault:{kind:?}\"),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: Distance query throughput (10万次 distance Query).\n+fn bench_distance_query(iterations: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 8));\n+    let p1 = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    let p2 = PlayerId::new(2);\n+    let mut ctx = QueryContext::new();\n+    // Warmup\n+    for _ in 0..100 {\n+        let _ = query(\n+            eng.state(),\n+            &QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 },\n+            &mut ctx,\n+        );\n+    }\n+    let (a0, b0) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        let _ = query(\n+            eng.state(),\n+            &QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 },\n+            &mut ctx,\n+        );\n+    }\n+    let (a1, b1) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let a_ops = (a1 - a0) / iterations;\n+    let a_bytes = (b1 - b0) / iterations;\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    let per_q_ns = elapsed.as_nanos() / iterations as u128;\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=distance-query iterations={iterations} per_query_ns={per_q_ns} total_ms={} allocs_delta={} bytes_delta={} allocs_per_op={} bytes_per_op={}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        a1 - a0,\n+        b1 - b0,\n+        a_ops,\n+        a_bytes\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// O3：query 缓存命中率（同键重复查询——无提交边界时键不失效）。\n+fn bench_query_cache(iterations: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 8));\n+    let p1 = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    let p2 = PlayerId::new(2);\n+    let req = QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 };\n+    let mut ctx = QueryContext::with_cache(true);\n+    // 冷段：首查写缓存\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..100 {\n+        let _ = query(eng.state(), &req, &mut ctx);\n+    }\n+    let cold_ns = t0.elapsed().as_nanos() / 100;\n+    let hits_before = ctx.cache_hits();\n+    // 热段：同键查询应全部命中\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        let _ = query(eng.state(), &req, &mut ctx);\n+    }\n+    let warm_ns = t0.elapsed().as_nanos() / iterations as u128;\n+    let hits = ctx.cache_hits() - hits_before;\n+    let misses = iterations.saturating_sub(hits);\n+    let rate_pct = hits * 100 / iterations.max(1);\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=query-cache iterations={iterations} cold_ns={cold_ns} warm_ns={warm_ns} hits={hits} misses={misses} hit_rate_pct={rate_pct}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// O3：AI 节点成本（旧线 engine-ai 束搜索——nodes_used 与 ns/node）。\n+fn bench_ai_nodes(iterations: u64) {\n+    use engine_ai::{BeamSearch, SearchBudget, SearchPolicy, StateFork};\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 5));\n+    let actor = eng.state().turn.current;\n+    let mut search = BeamSearch::default();\n+    let budget = SearchBudget {\n+        max_nodes: 10_000,\n+        max_depth: 8,\n+    };\n+    let mut total_nodes = 0u64;\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        let mut fork = StateFork::from_authority(&eng, 99);\n+        let r = search.select(&mut fork, actor, budget);\n+        total_nodes += r.nodes_used;\n+    }\n+    let ns = t0.elapsed().as_nanos();\n+    let ns_per_node = if total_nodes > 0 {\n+        ns / total_nodes as u128\n+    } else {\n+        0\n+    };\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=ai-nodes iterations={iterations} nodes_total={total_nodes} ns_per_node={ns_per_node} total_ms={}\",\n+        ns / 1_000_000\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: Snapshot capture + restore latency (Replay metric).\n+fn bench_snapshot_restore(iterations: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 4));\n+    // 预热对局：同样跟踪 revision/幂等键/actor，保证 5 条 EndPhase 真正被接受。\n+    let mut revision = eng.state().revision;\n+    let mut idempotency: u64 = 0;\n+    for _ in 0..5 {\n+        let actor = eng.state().turn.current;\n+        if actor == PlayerId::NONE || eng.state().outcome.is_finished() {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        idempotency += 1;\n+        if let CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } = eng.submit(Command {\n+            actor,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(revision),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(idempotency),\n+            kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+        }) {\n+            revision = new_revision;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        let snap = eng.snapshot();\n+        let mut restored = Engine::new();\n+        restored.restore_snapshot(&snap).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    let per_op_ns = elapsed.as_nanos() / iterations as u128;\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=snapshot-restore iterations={iterations} per_op_ns={per_op_ns} total_ms={}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis()\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// §38.2: Observer projection throughput (Client metric: ObserverDelta size).\n+fn bench_observer_projection(iterations: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(start_cmd(42, 8));\n+    let p1 = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    // 扇出：单次投影产出的座位+已知牌条目数（O3 project_observer 扇出面）。\n+    let sample = project_observer(eng.state(), ObserverKind::Player(p1));\n+    let fanout = sample.seats.len() + sample.known_cards.len();\n+    let (a0, b0) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..iterations {\n+        let _ = project_observer(eng.state(), ObserverKind::Player(p1));\n+    }\n+    let (a1, b1) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let a_ops = (a1 - a0) / iterations;\n+    let a_bytes = (b1 - b0) / iterations;\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    let per_op_ns = elapsed.as_nanos() / iterations as u128;\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=observer-projection iterations={iterations} per_op_ns={per_op_ns} total_ms={} fanout_targets={fanout} allocs_delta={} bytes_delta={} allocs_per_op={} bytes_per_op={}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        a1 - a0,\n+        b1 - b0,\n+        a_ops,\n+        a_bytes\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+fn emit(report: BenchReport) {\n+    // Stable JSON for CI artifact ingestion.\n+    if let Ok(json) = serde_json::to_string(&report) {\n+        eprintln!(\"{json}\");\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn cpu_info() -> String {\n+    // Best-effort; not security-sensitive.\n+    std::env::consts::ARCH.to_string()\n+}\n+\n+/// T13 帧率/延迟实测：完整对局驱动的**逐步延迟分布**——每步（命令提交+\n+/// 触发扇出+选择挂起解析）的提交延迟即客户端帧内的权威步延迟上界。\n+/// 对照 §38.1 档位 `command_p95` 预算出账（desktop-native / server-baseline）。\n+/// 分配剖面（allocs/bytes per step）随 O3 计数分配器输出。\n+fn bench_frame_latency(games: u64, players: u8) {\n+    let mut step_ns: Vec<u64> = Vec::new();\n+    let mut games_finished = 0u64;\n+    let mut total_steps = 0u64;\n+    let (a0, b0) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    for g in 0..games {\n+        let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+        eng.submit(start_cmd(42 + g, players));\n+        let mut revision = eng.state().revision;\n+        let mut idempotency: u64 = 0;\n+        let mut steps_this_game = 0u64;\n+        while !eng.state().outcome.is_finished() && steps_this_game < 4000 {\n+            let (kind, actor) = match eng.last_choice() {\n+                Some(choice) => {\n+                    let a = choice.observer;\n+                    (auto_answer(choice), a)\n+                }\n+                None => {\n+                    let a = eng.state().turn.current;\n+                    if a == PlayerId::NONE {\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                    (CommandKind::EndPhase, a)\n+                }\n+            };\n+            idempotency += 1;\n+            let s = Instant::now();\n+            let result = eng.submit(Command {\n+                actor,\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(revision),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(idempotency),\n+                kind,\n+            });\n+            let dt = s.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64;\n+            match result {\n+                CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } => {\n+                    revision = new_revision;\n+                    step_ns.push(dt);\n+                    steps_this_game += 1;\n+                }\n+                CommandResult::Rejected { .. } => {}\n+            }\n+        }\n+        total_steps += steps_this_game;\n+        if eng.state().outcome.is_finished() {\n+            games_finished += 1;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let (a1, b1) = alloc_snapshot();\n+    let wall_ms = t0.elapsed().as_millis();\n+    step_ns.sort_unstable();\n+    let n = step_ns.len();\n+    let pct = |q: f64| -> u64 {\n+        if n == 0 {\n+            0\n+        } else {\n+            step_ns[(((n as f64) * q) as usize).min(n - 1)]\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let p50 = pct(0.50);\n+    let p95 = pct(0.95);\n+    let p99 = pct(0.99);\n+    let max = step_ns.last().copied().unwrap_or(0);\n+    let allocs_step = if total_steps > 0 {\n+        (a1 - a0) / total_steps\n+    } else {\n+        0\n+    };\n+    let bytes_step = if total_steps > 0 {\n+        (b1 - b0) / total_steps\n+    } else {\n+        0\n+    };\n+    // 档位预算出账（us）\n+    let checks = [(\"desktop-native\", 3_000u64), (\"server-baseline\", 20_000u64)];\n+    for (tier, budget_us) in checks {\n+        let ok = p95 <= budget_us * 1_000;\n+        println!(\n+            \"frame-latency tier={tier} budget_command_p95_us={budget_us} p95={}us pass={}\",\n+            p95 / 1_000,\n+            if ok { \"yes\" } else { \"no\" }\n+        );\n+    }\n+    println!(\n+        \"scenario=frame-latency games={games} players={players} steps_total={total_steps} \\\n+games_finished={games_finished} p50_ns={p50} p95_ns={p95} p99_ns={p99} max_ns={max} \\\n+allocs_per_step={allocs_step} bytes_per_step={bytes_step} wall_ms={wall_ms}\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"2a21170015a5c2465d4a8816fb7dc187915e5ab7","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/content-cli/examples/add_package_deps.rs","status":"added","additions":63,"deletions":0,"changes":63,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fcontent-cli%2Fexamples%2Fadd_package_deps.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fcontent-cli%2Fexamples%2Fadd_package_deps.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fcontent-cli%2Fexamples%2Fadd_package_deps.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@\n+//! 内容债② 修复辅助（2026-10-14 O4 冒烟发现）：向 ported 包 npack 的\n+//! manifest 追加缺失的跨包依赖声明并重算 logic_hash——**不触碰\n+//! skill_index/character_index/modules**（roster def_ids 与现存编译产物\n+//! 绑定，重编译会全面失配）。\n+//!\n+//! 运行：cargo run --offline -p content-cli --example add_package_deps -- \\\n+//!         <npack.json> <package_id>...   （追加的依赖包 id 列表）\n+\n+use content_schema::ContentPackage;\n+\n+fn hex32(bytes: &[u8; 32]) -> String {\n+    bytes.iter().map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\")).collect()\n+}\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let args: Vec<String> = std::env::args().collect();\n+    let npack_path = args\n+        .get(1)\n+        .expect(\"usage: add_package_deps <npack.json> <dep_pkg>...\");\n+    let add = &args[2..];\n+    assert!(!add.is_empty(), \"no dependency package ids given\");\n+\n+    let raw = std::fs::read(npack_path).expect(\"read npack\");\n+    let mut pkg: ContentPackage = serde_json::from_slice(&raw).expect(\"parse npack\");\n+    let old_hash = hex32(&pkg.manifest.logic_hash);\n+\n+    let existing: Vec<String> = pkg\n+        .manifest\n+        .dependencies\n+        .iter()\n+        .map(|d| d.package_id.clone())\n+        .collect();\n+    for dep_id in add {\n+        assert!(\n+            !existing.iter().any(|e| e == dep_id),\n+            \"{dep_id} already declared in {}\",\n+            pkg.manifest.package_id\n+        );\n+        pkg.manifest\n+            .dependencies\n+            .push(content_schema::PackageDependency {\n+                namespace: \"official\".into(),\n+                package_id: dep_id.clone(),\n+                version: \"0.1.0\".into(),\n+                logic_hash: [0u8; 32],\n+            });\n+    }\n+    pkg.manifest.logic_hash = pkg.compute_logic_hash();\n+\n+    let out = serde_json::to_string(&pkg).expect(\"serialize\");\n+    std::fs::write(npack_path, out).expect(\"write npack\");\n+    println!(\n+        \"{}: deps={:?} logic_hash {} → {}\",\n+        pkg.manifest.package_id,\n+        pkg.manifest\n+            .dependencies\n+            .iter()\n+            .map(|d| d.package_id.clone())\n+            .collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+        old_hash,\n+        hex32(&pkg.manifest.logic_hash)\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"0231a6a0e9110091087457045284ac4133f8c423","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/desktop-client/src/native_envelope.rs","status":"added","additions":184,"deletions":0,"changes":184,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fdesktop-client%2Fsrc%2Fnative_envelope.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fdesktop-client%2Fsrc%2Fnative_envelope.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fdesktop-client%2Fsrc%2Fnative_envelope.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,184 @@\n+//! Existing Worker envelope projection from the shared, observer-filtered session API.\n+use engine_native_wasm::NativeSession;\n+use serde_json::{json, Value};\n+\n+fn parse(raw: String) -> Result<Value, String> {\n+    serde_json::from_str(&raw).map_err(|error| error.to_string())\n+}\n+\n+fn card(view: &Value, id: &Value, owner: Value, zone: &str) -> Value {\n+    let face = &view[\"cards\"][id.to_string()];\n+    json!({\"id\": id, \"def\": face[\"def\"], \"suit\": face[\"suit\"], \"rank\": face[\"rank\"],\n+        \"owner\": owner, \"zone\": zone, \"kind\": face[\"kind\"].as_str().unwrap_or(\"Other\")})\n+}\n+\n+fn snapshot(view: &Value, revision: u64) -> Result<Value, String> {\n+    let mut cards = Vec::new();\n+    let mut seats = Vec::new();\n+    for player in view[\"players\"].as_array().into_iter().flatten() {\n+        for (key, zone) in [(\"equips\", \"Equip\"), (\"judge\", \"Judge\")] {\n+            for id in player[key].as_array().into_iter().flatten() {\n+                cards.push(card(view, id, player[\"seat\"].clone(), zone));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        let generals: [Option<engine_api::GeneralSlotView>; 2] = player\n+            .get(\"generals\")\n+            .map(|value| serde_json::from_value(value.clone()))\n+            .transpose()\n+            .map_err(|error| format!(\"generals: {error}\"))?\n+            .unwrap_or_default();\n+        seats.push(json!({\n+            \"player\": player[\"seat\"], \"character_def\": player[\"characterDef\"].as_u64().unwrap_or(0),\n+            \"generals\": generals,\n+            \"seat\": player[\"seat\"], \"hp\": player[\"hp\"], \"max_hp\": player[\"maxHp\"],\n+            \"alive\": player[\"alive\"], \"turned_over\": player[\"turnedOver\"],\n+            \"hand_count\": player[\"handCount\"], \"identity\": player[\"identity\"],\n+            \"skills\": player[\"skills\"].as_array().into_iter().flatten().map(|name| json!({\n+                \"id\": 0, \"def\": 0, \"enabled\": true, \"use_count\": 0, \"active\": false,\n+                \"view_as\": false, \"locked\": false, \"name\": name,\n+            })).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+        }));\n+    }\n+    let mut own = Vec::new();\n+    if let Some(player) = view[\"players\"]\n+        .as_array()\n+        .and_then(|players| players.iter().find(|p| p[\"seat\"] == view[\"seat\"]))\n+    {\n+        for id in player[\"hand\"][\"own\"].as_array().into_iter().flatten() {\n+            own.push(card(view, id, view[\"seat\"].clone(), \"Hand\"));\n+        }\n+    }\n+    own.extend(cards);\n+    for (key, zone) in [(\"discard\", \"DiscardPile\"), (\"table\", \"Processing\")] {\n+        for id in view[key].as_array().into_iter().flatten() {\n+            own.push(card(view, id, Value::Null, zone));\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let phase = match view[\"phase\"].as_str() {\n+        Some(\"judge\") => \"Judge\",\n+        Some(\"draw\") => \"Draw\",\n+        Some(\"play\") => \"Play\",\n+        Some(\"discard\") => \"Discard\",\n+        Some(\"end\") => \"End\",\n+        _ => \"Idle\",\n+    };\n+    Ok(\n+        json!({\"revision\": revision, \"state_hash\": \"\", \"observer\": view[\"seat\"],\n+        \"round\": view[\"round\"], \"current_player\": view[\"turn\"], \"phase\": phase,\n+        \"seats\": seats, \"known_cards\": own, \"outcome\": view[\"outcome\"]}),\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+fn option_label(option: &Value) -> String {\n+    if let Some(text) = option.as_str() {\n+        return text.into();\n+    }\n+    if option.is_number() {\n+        return option.to_string();\n+    }\n+    if let Some(skill) = option[\"skill\"].as_str() {\n+        return format!(\"skill:{skill}\");\n+    }\n+    for key in [\"card\", \"player\", \"tag\", \"kind\"] {\n+        if !option[key].is_null() {\n+            return format!(\"{key}:{}\", option[key]);\n+        }\n+    }\n+    \"unknown\".into()\n+}\n+\n+fn choice(session: &NativeSession, observer: u8) -> Result<Value, String> {\n+    let raw = parse(session.open_choice_json(observer)?)?;\n+    if raw.is_null() || raw[\"hidden\"] == true {\n+        return Ok(Value::Null);\n+    }\n+    let native_kind = raw\n+        .get(\"native_kind\")\n+        .filter(|value| !value.is_null())\n+        .map(|value| {\n+            value\n+                .as_str()\n+                .and_then(engine_api::choice_kind_from_native)\n+                .ok_or(\"invalid native_kind\")\n+        })\n+        .transpose()?;\n+    let kind = if raw[\"prompt\"] == \"trigger_order\" && raw[\"native_kind\"] == \"pick_tag\" {\n+        json!(engine_api::ChoiceKind::OrderTriggers)\n+    } else {\n+        native_kind\n+            .map(|kind| json!(kind))\n+            .unwrap_or_else(|| json!(raw[\"kind\"].as_str().unwrap_or(\"Custom\")))\n+    };\n+    if raw\n+        .get(\"prompt\")\n+        .is_some_and(|value| !value.is_null() && !value.is_string())\n+    {\n+        return Err(\"invalid prompt\".into());\n+    }\n+    if raw\n+        .get(\"source_skill\")\n+        .is_some_and(|value| !value.is_null() && value.as_str().is_none_or(str::is_empty))\n+    {\n+        return Err(\"invalid source_skill\".into());\n+    }\n+    let mut result = json!({\"choice_id\": raw[\"id\"], \"revision\": session.revision(), \"observer\": observer, \"kind\": kind,\n+        \"options\": raw[\"options\"].as_array().into_iter().flatten().enumerate().map(|(index, option)| {\n+            json!({\"token\": index, \"label_key\": option_label(option)})\n+        }).collect::<Vec<_>>()});\n+    for (source, target) in [\n+        (\"prompt\", \"prompt\"),\n+        (\"native_kind\", \"native_kind\"),\n+        (\"source_skill\", \"source_skill\"),\n+        (\"min\", \"min_count\"),\n+        (\"max\", \"max_count\"),\n+        (\"allowCancel\", \"allow_cancel\"),\n+    ] {\n+        if let Some(value) = raw.get(source) {\n+            result[target] = value.clone();\n+        }\n+    }\n+    Ok(result)\n+}\n+\n+fn public_event(code: &Value) -> Value {\n+    let label = match code.as_u64() {\n+        Some(1) => \"对局开始\",\n+        Some(2) => \"摸牌\",\n+        Some(3) => \"使用或响应牌\",\n+        Some(4) => \"伤害结算\",\n+        Some(5) => \"回复体力\",\n+        Some(6) => \"濒死状态变化\",\n+        Some(7) => \"玩家阵亡\",\n+        Some(8) => \"阶段或回合推进\",\n+        Some(9) => \"对局结束\",\n+        Some(10) => \"选择状态变化\",\n+        _ => return json!({\"PublicEvent\": {\"code\": code, \"label\": format!(\"事件 {code}\")}}),\n+    };\n+    json!({\"PublicEvent\": {\"code\": code, \"label\": label}})\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn envelope(\n+    session: &NativeSession,\n+    observer: u8,\n+    cursor: &mut u32,\n+    result: Value,\n+) -> Result<Value, String> {\n+    let view = parse(session.view_json(observer)?)?;\n+    let legal = parse(session.legal_actions_json(observer)?)?;\n+    let choice = choice(session, observer)?;\n+    let mut events = Vec::new();\n+    if !result.is_null() {\n+        let end = session.log_len();\n+        let codes = parse(session.public_event_codes_json((*cursor).min(end)))?;\n+        events = codes\n+            .as_array()\n+            .into_iter()\n+            .flatten()\n+            .map(public_event)\n+            .collect();\n+        *cursor = end;\n+    }\n+    Ok(json!({\"result\": result, \"events\": events, \"choice\": choice,\n+        \"view\": snapshot(&view, session.revision())?, \"legal_actions\": legal[\"actions\"],\n+        \"hash_hex\": session.state_hash_hex(), \"revision\": session.revision(), \"finished\": session.is_finished()}))\n+}"},{"sha":"345f42d73d5189dee5e6760d40d15ce19b1e276c","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/engine-cli/src/main.rs","status":"added","additions":886,"deletions":0,"changes":886,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fengine-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fengine-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fengine-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,886 @@\n+//! Headless CLI for engine debug and golden hash dumps.\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+use engine_core::Engine;\n+use std::env;\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let mut args = env::args().skip(1);\n+    let cmd = args.next().unwrap_or_else(|| \"help\".into());\n+    match cmd.as_str() {\n+        \"help\" | \"-h\" | \"--help\" => print_help(),\n+        \"start\" => {\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            run_start(players, seed);\n+        }\n+        \"demo\" => run_demo(),\n+        \"play\" => run_play_demo(),\n+        \"match\" => {\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            let max_steps: u32 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(2000);\n+            // Optional trailing `--ruleset <name>` selects the mode (identity-standard,\n+            // guozhan, single). M4: 单挑 mode is playable through this entry.\n+            let mut ruleset = \"identity-standard\".to_string();\n+            if args.next().as_deref() == Some(\"--ruleset\") {\n+                if let Some(name) = args.next() {\n+                    ruleset = name;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            run_match(players, seed, max_steps, &ruleset);\n+        }\n+        \"full-demo\" => {\n+            // End-to-end match demo with turn-by-turn output.\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            let max_steps: u32 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(3000);\n+            run_full_demo(players, seed, max_steps);\n+        }\n+        \"hash\" => {\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            print_hash(players, seed);\n+        }\n+        \"manifest\" => {\n+            // Phase 14: pin MatchManifest at StartGame and print hash + chain status.\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            print_manifest(players, seed);\n+        }\n+        \"replay-export\" => {\n+            // Phase 16: export replay file, re-import, verify manifest + chain.\n+            // Optional output path: replay-export [players] [seed] [out.json]\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            let out_path = args.next();\n+            run_replay_export(players, seed, out_path.as_deref());\n+        }\n+        \"replay-import\" => {\n+            // Import a replay JSON file, reconstruct engine, verify chain.\n+            let path = args.next().unwrap_or_else(|| {\n+                eprintln!(\"usage: engine-cli replay-import <file.json>\");\n+                std::process::exit(1);\n+            });\n+            run_replay_import(&path);\n+        }\n+        \"skill-vm\" => {\n+            // Load official jianxiong.skill (or path), start, grant, damage → draw via VM\n+            let path = args\n+                .next()\n+                .unwrap_or_else(|| \"content/standard/jianxiong.skill\".into());\n+            run_skill_vm(&path);\n+        }\n+        \"load-hash\" => {\n+            // Start with optional package JSON → print content lock + start hash\n+            let pkg_path = args.next();\n+            let players: u8 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(4);\n+            let seed: u64 = args.next().and_then(|s| s.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(42);\n+            run_load_hash(pkg_path.as_deref(), players, seed);\n+        }\n+        \"mod-demo\" => {\n+            // Load mashu+qicao package, grant, print distance/range queries\n+            run_mod_demo();\n+        }\n+        other => {\n+            eprintln!(\"unknown command: {other}\");\n+            print_help();\n+            std::process::exit(1);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn print_help() {\n+    println!(\n+        \"engine-cli — noname-next headless core\\n\\n\\\n+         Usage:\\n\\\n+           engine-cli start [players] [seed]   Start match and print state summary\\n\\\n+           engine-cli hash [players] [seed]    Print canonical state hash only\\n\\\n+           engine-cli manifest [players] [seed]\\n\\\n+                                               Pin MatchManifest and print its hash + chain status\\n\\\n+           engine-cli replay-export [players] [seed]\\n\\\n+                                               Export replay file, verify manifest + chain\\n\\\n+           engine-cli replay-import <file.json>\\n\\\n+                                               Import replay JSON, reconstruct engine, verify chain\\n\\\n+           engine-cli demo                     Start + end phases, print revisions\\n\\\n+           engine-cli play                     Start, enter play phase, try first hand card\\n\\\n+           engine-cli match [players] [seed] [max_steps]\\n\\\n+                                               Run full identity match with auto-players\\n\\\n+           engine-cli full-demo [players] [seed] [max_steps]\\n\\\n+                                               End-to-end match demo with outcome summary\\n\\\n+           engine-cli skill-vm [skill.dsl]     Load DSL package, damage → VM draw demo\\n\\\n+           engine-cli mod-demo                 Load mashu+qicao, print query results\\n\\\n+           engine-cli load-hash [pkg.json] [players] [seed]\\n\\\n+                                               Optional package load then start hash\\n\\\n+           engine-cli help\\n\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+fn run_mod_demo() {\n+    use engine_api::SkillDefId;\n+    use engine_core::effect::run_effects;\n+    use engine_core::query::{query, QueryContext};\n+    use engine_core::transaction::Transaction;\n+    use engine_core::{BOOTSTRAP_MASHU, BOOTSTRAP_QICAO};\n+    use rule_api::{EffectRequest, QueryRequest, QueryResponse};\n+\n+    let mut src = String::new();\n+    src.push_str(\n+        &std::fs::read_to_string(\"content/standard/mashu.skill\").unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"read mashu: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }),\n+    );\n+    src.push('\\n');\n+    src.push_str(\n+        &std::fs::read_to_string(\"content/standard/qicao.skill\").unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"read qicao: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }),\n+    );\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source(&src).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"compile: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.load_package(&pkg).unwrap();\n+    eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 4,\n+            rng_seed: 11,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    let p1 = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    let p2 = PlayerId::new(2);\n+    let mut tx = Transaction::begin(eng.state().clone());\n+    run_effects(\n+        &mut tx,\n+        vec![\n+            EffectRequest::AddSkill {\n+                player: p1,\n+                skill_def: SkillDefId::new(BOOTSTRAP_MASHU),\n+            },\n+            EffectRequest::AddSkill {\n+                player: p1,\n+                skill_def: SkillDefId::new(BOOTSTRAP_QICAO),\n+            },\n+        ],\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let mut ctx = QueryContext::new();\n+    let dist = query(\n+        tx.state(),\n+        &QueryRequest::Distance { from: p1, to: p2 },\n+        &mut ctx,\n+    );\n+    let range = query(\n+        tx.state(),\n+        &QueryRequest::AttackRange { player: p1 },\n+        &mut ctx,\n+    );\n+    println!(\"packages={}\", eng.content().package_count());\n+    println!(\"distance_1_to_2={dist:?}\");\n+    println!(\"attack_range_1={range:?}\");\n+    match (dist, range) {\n+        (QueryResponse::Int(d), QueryResponse::Int(r)) if r >= 2 && d <= 1 => {\n+            println!(\"ok=true\");\n+        }\n+        _ => {\n+            println!(\"ok=false\");\n+            std::process::exit(3);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_skill_vm(path: &str) {\n+    // Skill-VM smoke: compile the DSL package, drive one card-backed damage into the owning\n+    // player, and verify the skill's authoritative contract. The standard 奸雄 (jianxiong)\n+    // contract is \"after taking card-backed damage, optionally gain that physical carrier\"\n+    // (upstream standard/skill.js `damageEnd` + `gain(trigger.cards)`). A cardless DealDamage\n+    // intentionally opens no choice — see original_standard_jianxiong.rs for the full golden.\n+    use engine_api::{CardDefId, CardId, ChoiceId, SkillDefId, Suit};\n+    use engine_core::command::apply_command;\n+    use engine_core::effect::{run_effects, EffectError};\n+    use engine_core::state::{Card, CardKind, ZoneKind};\n+    use engine_core::transaction::Transaction;\n+    use rule_api::EffectRequest;\n+\n+    let source = std::fs::read_to_string(path).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"read {path}: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source(&source).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"compile: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.load_package(&pkg).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"load: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 2,\n+            rng_seed: 7,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    let owner = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    let opponent = PlayerId::new(2);\n+    let mut tx = Transaction::begin(eng.state().clone());\n+    for player in [owner, opponent] {\n+        for skill in tx.state().players.get(player).unwrap().skills.clone() {\n+            run_effects(&mut tx, vec![EffectRequest::RemoveSkill { skill }]).unwrap();\n+        }\n+    }\n+    run_effects(\n+        &mut tx,\n+        vec![EffectRequest::AddSkill {\n+            player: owner,\n+            skill_def: SkillDefId::new(1),\n+        }],\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+\n+    // Place the damage carrier (a Sha) in the processing zone, then deal card-backed damage.\n+    // jianxiong fires only when a physical carrier is in processing at damageEnd.\n+    let processing = tx\n+        .state()\n+        .zones\n+        .find(ZoneKind::Processing, PlayerId::NONE)\n+        .expect(\"processing zone exists\");\n+    let card = tx.state_mut().cards.alloc(Card {\n+        id: CardId::NONE,\n+        def: CardDefId::new(170_001),\n+        kind: CardKind::Sha,\n+        suit: Suit::Spade,\n+        rank: 7,\n+        weapon_range: 0,\n+        zone: processing,\n+        owner: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        face_up: true,\n+    });\n+    tx.state_mut()\n+        .zones\n+        .get_mut(processing)\n+        .expect(\"processing zone exists\")\n+        .cards\n+        .push(card);\n+\n+    let before = tx.state().hand_count(owner);\n+    let damage = run_effects(\n+        &mut tx,\n+        vec![EffectRequest::DealCardDamage {\n+            source: opponent,\n+            target: owner,\n+            amount: 1,\n+            is_lose_hp: false,\n+            nature: rule_api::damage_nature::NORMAL,\n+            card,\n+            card_kind: CardKind::Sha.tag(),\n+            card_flags: 0,\n+        }],\n+    );\n+    let pending = tx.state().has_pending_choice();\n+    let state = tx.commit().state;\n+\n+    println!(\"package={}\", path);\n+    println!(\"content_lock={}\", hex32(&eng.state().ruleset.logic_hash));\n+    println!(\"hand_before={before}\");\n+    println!(\n+        \"damage_opened_choice={}\",\n+        matches!(damage, Err(EffectError::ChoiceRequested))\n+    );\n+\n+    // Card-backed damage must open the optional gain; resolving it (selection 1) gains the carrier.\n+    let ok = if matches!(damage, Err(EffectError::ChoiceRequested)) && pending {\n+        let (next, resolved) = apply_command(\n+            state.clone(),\n+            Command {\n+                actor: owner,\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(state.revision),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                kind: CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+                    choice_id: ChoiceId::new(state.resolution.pending_choice_id),\n+                    selections: vec![1],\n+                    cancelled: false,\n+                },\n+            },\n+        );\n+        if !matches!(resolved.result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }) {\n+            println!(\"ok=false\");\n+            false\n+        } else {\n+            let gained = next.hand_cards(owner).contains(&card);\n+            let after = next.hand_count(owner);\n+            println!(\"hand_after={after}\");\n+            println!(\"gained_carrier={gained}\");\n+            println!(\"ok={}\", gained && after == before + 1);\n+            gained && after == before + 1\n+        }\n+    } else {\n+        // No carrier-backed damage → no gain contract; this smoke only exercises the gain path.\n+        println!(\"ok=false\");\n+        false\n+    };\n+\n+    if !ok {\n+        std::process::exit(3);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_load_hash(pkg_path: Option<&str>, players: u8, seed: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    if let Some(p) = pkg_path {\n+        let data = std::fs::read(p).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"read package: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        let pkg = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&data).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"parse package: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        eng.load_package(&pkg).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"load: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        println!(\n+            \"packages={} content_hash={}\",\n+            eng.content().package_count(),\n+            hex32(&eng.state().ruleset.logic_hash)\n+        );\n+    }\n+    eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"bootstrap\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    println!(\"hash={}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+}\n+\n+fn run_match(players: u8, seed: u64, max_steps: u32, ruleset: &str) {\n+    use engine_core::{run_identity_match, MatchConfig};\n+    match run_identity_match(MatchConfig {\n+        player_count: players,\n+        rng_seed: seed,\n+        max_steps,\n+        ruleset: ruleset.to_string(),\n+    }) {\n+        Ok(r) => {\n+            println!(\"outcome={:?}\", r.outcome);\n+            println!(\"steps={}\", r.steps);\n+            println!(\"revisions={}\", r.revisions);\n+            println!(\"capped={}\", r.capped);\n+            println!(\"hash={}\", hex32(&r.state_hash));\n+            if r.capped {\n+                std::process::exit(3);\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => {\n+            eprintln!(\"match error: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_full_demo(players: u8, seed: u64, max_steps: u32) {\n+    use engine_core::{run_identity_match, MatchConfig};\n+\n+    println!(\"╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\");\n+    println!(\"║   无名杀 Next — 端到端对局演示      ║\");\n+    println!(\"╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\");\n+    println!();\n+    println!(\"配置: {players} 人身份局, seed={seed}, max_steps={max_steps}\");\n+    println!();\n+\n+    // Run the match.\n+    let report = match run_identity_match(MatchConfig {\n+        player_count: players,\n+        rng_seed: seed,\n+        max_steps,\n+        ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+    }) {\n+        Ok(r) => r,\n+        Err(e) => {\n+            eprintln!(\"match error: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }\n+    };\n+\n+    // Print outcome.\n+    println!(\"━━━ 终局结果 ━━━\");\n+    println!(\"  outcome:    {:?}\", report.outcome);\n+    println!(\"  steps:      {}\", report.steps);\n+    println!(\"  revisions:  {}\", report.revisions);\n+    println!(\"  capped:     {}\", report.capped);\n+    println!(\"  state_hash: {}\", hex32(&report.state_hash));\n+    println!();\n+\n+    // Print manifest info.\n+    println!(\"━━━ 对局 Manifest ━━━\");\n+    println!(\"  build:      {}\", engine_api::ENGINE_BUILD_ID);\n+    println!();\n+\n+    // Print player summary.\n+    println!(\"━━━ 玩家概况 ━━━\");\n+    // We can't access the final state from MatchReport, but we can show\n+    // the outcome interpretation.\n+    match &report.outcome {\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::RebelWin => {\n+            println!(\"  反贼胜利！主公阵亡。\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::LoyalistWin => {\n+            println!(\"  忠臣/主公胜利！所有反贼和内奸已阵亡。\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::RenegadeWin { player } => {\n+            println!(\"  内奸 P{} 获得最终胜利！\", player.raw());\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::Draw => {\n+            println!(\"  平局。\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::Aborted { reason_code } => {\n+            println!(\"  对局中止 (reason={reason_code})。\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress => {\n+            println!(\"  对局未结束（达到步数上限）。\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::GroupWin { group } => {\n+            println!(\"  {group} 势力胜利！（国战模式）\");\n+        }\n+        engine_api::MatchOutcome::SingleWin { player } => {\n+            println!(\"  P{} 单挑获胜！（单挑模式）\", player.raw());\n+        }\n+    }\n+    println!();\n+\n+    if report.capped {\n+        println!(\n+            \"⚠ 对局在 {} 步后未自然结束（可能需要更多步数）。\",\n+            report.steps\n+        );\n+    } else {\n+        println!(\n+            \"✓ 对局自然结束，用时 {} 步 / {} 次状态变更。\",\n+            report.steps, report.revisions\n+        );\n+    }\n+\n+    // Exit code: 0 = natural finish, 3 = capped.\n+    if report.capped {\n+        std::process::exit(3);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_start(players: u8, seed: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let result = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    match result {\n+        CommandResult::Accepted {\n+            new_revision,\n+            state_hash,\n+        } => {\n+            println!(\"revision={new_revision}\");\n+            println!(\"hash={}\", hex32(&state_hash));\n+            println!(\"players={}\", eng.state().players.live_count());\n+            println!(\"cards={}\", eng.state().cards.live_count());\n+            println!(\n+                \"hands={}\",\n+                eng.state()\n+                    .players\n+                    .iter_live()\n+                    .map(|p| format!(\"{}:{}\", p.id.raw(), eng.state().hand_count(p.id)))\n+                    .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+                    .join(\",\")\n+            );\n+            println!(\"build={}\", engine_api::ENGINE_BUILD_ID);\n+        }\n+        CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+            eprintln!(\"rejected: {reason:?}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn print_hash(players: u8, seed: u64) {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let _ = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    println!(\"{}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+}\n+\n+fn print_manifest(players: u8, seed: u64) {\n+    // Phase 14: demonstrate MatchManifest freeze + hash-chain integrity.\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let _ = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    let m = match eng.manifest() {\n+        Some(m) => m,\n+        None => {\n+            eprintln!(\"manifest not pinned\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let mh = eng.manifest_hash();\n+    println!(\"manifest_version={}\", m.manifest_version);\n+    println!(\"semantics={}\", m.engine_semantics_id.label);\n+    println!(\"semantics_revision={}\", m.engine_semantics_id.revision);\n+    println!(\"rule_ir={}\", m.rule_ir_version.raw());\n+    println!(\"vm_abi={}\", m.vm_abi_version.raw());\n+    println!(\"ruleset={}\", m.ruleset.name);\n+    println!(\"content_lock={}\", hex32(&m.content_lock_hash.0));\n+    println!(\"rng_seed={}\", m.rng_spec.initial_seed);\n+    println!(\"effect_budget={}\", m.budget_profile.effect_budget);\n+    println!(\"trigger_budget={}\", m.budget_profile.trigger_budget);\n+    println!(\"players={}\", m.match_config.player_count);\n+    println!(\"manifest_hash={}\", hex32(&mh.0));\n+    let log = eng.replay_log();\n+    println!(\"records={}\", log.records.len());\n+    println!(\"commands={}\", log.commands.len());\n+    match log.verify_chain() {\n+        Ok(()) => println!(\"chain=ok\"),\n+        Err(i) => {\n+            println!(\"chain=BROKEN@{i}\");\n+            std::process::exit(3);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_replay_export(players: u8, seed: u64, out_path: Option<&str>) {\n+    // Phase 16: export a replay file, re-import, verify manifest + chain.\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let _ = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: players,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    let pinned = eng.manifest_hash();\n+    let bytes = eng.export_replay().unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"export replay: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    println!(\"replay_bytes={}\", bytes.len());\n+    println!(\"export_manifest_hash={}\", hex32(&pinned.0));\n+\n+    // Optionally write to disk.\n+    if let Some(path) = out_path {\n+        std::fs::write(path, &bytes).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"write {path}: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"wrote={path}\");\n+    }\n+\n+    let imported = Engine::import_replay(&bytes, Some(pinned)).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"import replay: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+    println!(\"imported_state_hash={}\", hex32(&imported.state_hash()));\n+    println!(\n+        \"imported_manifest_hash={}\",\n+        hex32(&imported.manifest_hash().0)\n+    );\n+    imported.replay_log().verify_chain().unwrap_or_else(|i| {\n+        eprintln!(\"chain broken at {i}\");\n+        std::process::exit(3);\n+    });\n+    if imported.state_hash() == eng.state_hash() && imported.manifest_hash() == pinned {\n+        println!(\"replay_roundtrip=ok\");\n+    } else {\n+        println!(\"replay_roundtrip=MISMATCH\");\n+        std::process::exit(3);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_replay_import(path: &str) {\n+    let bytes = std::fs::read(path).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        eprintln!(\"read {path}: {e}\");\n+        std::process::exit(2);\n+    });\n+\n+    // Try capsule format first; fall back to plain replay log.\n+    let text = String::from_utf8_lossy(&bytes);\n+    if text.contains(\"\\\"capsule_schema\\\"\") {\n+        // ReplayCapsule format.\n+        let (eng, capsule) = Engine::open_capsule(&bytes).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"import failed: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"format:   capsule\");\n+        println!(\"records:  {}\", eng.replay_log().records.len());\n+        println!(\"commands: {}\", eng.replay_log().commands.len());\n+        println!(\"revision: {}\", eng.state().revision);\n+        println!(\"hash:     {}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+        println!(\"manifest: {}\", hex32(&eng.manifest_hash().0));\n+        eng.replay_log().verify_chain().unwrap_or_else(|i| {\n+            println!(\"chain=BROKEN@{i}\");\n+            std::process::exit(3);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"chain=ok\");\n+        capsule.verify().unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            println!(\"capsule=INVALID: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(3);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"capsule=ok\");\n+    } else {\n+        // Plain ReplayLog format.\n+        let log = engine_core::ReplayLog::from_bytes(&bytes).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"parse replay log: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"format:   replay_log\");\n+        println!(\"records:  {}\", log.records.len());\n+        println!(\"commands: {}\", log.commands.len());\n+        println!(\"manifest: {}\", hex32(&log.manifest_hash().0));\n+        log.verify_chain().unwrap_or_else(|i| {\n+            println!(\"chain=BROKEN@{i}\");\n+            std::process::exit(3);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"chain=ok\");\n+        // Replay commands to reconstruct.\n+        let commands: Vec<Command> = log.commands.iter().map(|c| c.command.clone()).collect();\n+        let eng = Engine::replay_from(&commands).unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+            eprintln!(\"replay: {e}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        });\n+        println!(\"revision: {}\", eng.state().revision);\n+        println!(\"hash:     {}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn run_demo() {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let cmds = [\n+        Command {\n+            actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+            kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+                player_count: 4,\n+                rng_seed: 2026,\n+                ruleset: \"bootstrap\".into(),\n+            },\n+        },\n+        Command {\n+            actor: PlayerId::new(1),\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+            kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+        },\n+        Command {\n+            actor: PlayerId::new(1),\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+            kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+        },\n+    ];\n+    for (i, c) in cmds.into_iter().enumerate() {\n+        let r = eng.submit(c);\n+        match r {\n+            CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                new_revision,\n+                state_hash,\n+            } => {\n+                println!(\n+                    \"step={i} revision={new_revision} hash={}\",\n+                    hex32(&state_hash)\n+                );\n+            }\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+                eprintln!(\"step={i} rejected: {reason:?}\");\n+                std::process::exit(2);\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    println!(\"final_hash={}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+}\n+\n+fn run_play_demo() {\n+    use engine_core::{CardKind, Phase};\n+\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let start = Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 2,\n+            rng_seed: 42,\n+            ruleset: \"bootstrap\".into(),\n+        },\n+    };\n+    match eng.submit(start) {\n+        CommandResult::Accepted {\n+            new_revision,\n+            state_hash,\n+        } => println!(\n+            \"start revision={new_revision} hash={} hand={}\",\n+            hex32(&state_hash),\n+            eng.state().hand_count(eng.state().turn.current)\n+        ),\n+        CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+            eprintln!(\"start rejected: {reason:?}\");\n+            std::process::exit(2);\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let actor = eng.state().turn.current;\n+    // Draw -> Play\n+    let _ = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+    });\n+    assert_eq!(eng.state().turn.phase, Phase::Play);\n+    let hand = eng.state().hand_cards(actor);\n+    println!(\n+        \"play phase hand={:?}\",\n+        hand.iter().map(|c| c.raw()).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+    );\n+    for card in hand {\n+        let kind = eng.state().cards.get(card).map(|c| c.kind);\n+        let targets = match kind {\n+            Some(CardKind::Sha) => eng\n+                .state()\n+                .players\n+                .alive_by_seat()\n+                .into_iter()\n+                .filter(|p| *p != actor)\n+                .collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+            _ => vec![],\n+        };\n+        let r = eng.submit(Command {\n+            actor,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+            kind: CommandKind::PlayCard {\n+                card,\n+                targets: targets.clone(),\n+                card_targets: vec![],\n+            },\n+        });\n+        match r {\n+            CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                new_revision,\n+                state_hash,\n+            } => {\n+                println!(\n+                    \"played card={} kind={:?} targets={:?} revision={new_revision} hash={} choice={}\",\n+                    card.raw(),\n+                    kind,\n+                    targets.iter().map(|p| p.raw()).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+                    hex32(&state_hash),\n+                    eng.state().has_pending_choice()\n+                );\n+                break;\n+            }\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+                println!(\"skip card={} kind={:?}: {reason:?}\", card.raw(), kind);\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    println!(\"final_hash={}\", hex32(&eng.state_hash()));\n+}\n+\n+fn hex32(bytes: &[u8; 32]) -> String {\n+    bytes.iter().map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\")).collect()\n+}\n+\n+// temporary debug - will remove\n+#[allow(dead_code)]\n+fn debug_stuck() {\n+    use engine_core::choose_command;\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 6,\n+            rng_seed: 1006,\n+            ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    let mut steps = 1u32;\n+    while !eng.state().outcome.is_finished() && steps < 1500 {\n+        let pending = eng.state().has_pending_choice();\n+        let cont = eng.state().resolution.continuation_kind;\n+        let phase = eng.state().turn.phase;\n+        let actor = eng.state().turn.current;\n+        let cmd = choose_command(&eng);\n+        let kind = format!(\"{:?}\", cmd.kind);\n+        match eng.submit(cmd) {\n+            CommandResult::Accepted { .. } => steps += 1,\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+                eprintln!(\"FAIL step={steps} rev={} phase={:?} actor={} pending_before={pending} cont={cont:?}\",\n+                    eng.state().revision, phase, actor.raw());\n+                eprintln!(\"  cmd={kind}\");\n+                eprintln!(\"  reason={reason:?}\");\n+                eprintln!(\n+                    \"  pending_after={} cont={:?} obs={}\",\n+                    eng.state().has_pending_choice(),\n+                    eng.state().resolution.continuation_kind,\n+                    eng.state().resolution.pending_observer\n+                );\n+                for p in eng.state().players.iter_live() {\n+                    eprintln!(\n+                        \"  p{} alive={} dying={} hp={} hand={}\",\n+                        p.id.raw(),\n+                        p.alive,\n+                        p.dying,\n+                        p.hp,\n+                        eng.state().hand_count(p.id)\n+                    );\n+                }\n+                // dump payload\n+                eprintln!(\n+                    \"  payload={:?}\",\n+                    eng.state().resolution.continuation_payload\n+                );\n+                return;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    eprintln!(\"finished steps={steps}\");\n+}"},{"sha":"f79024e35326b25c163ed1c3869c2c56afa5058b","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/examples/emit_approved_b_metadata.rs","status":"added","additions":141,"deletions":0,"changes":141,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_approved_b_metadata.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_approved_b_metadata.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_approved_b_metadata.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,141 @@\n+//! Actual archives and authorized server expectations for approved B cross-entry acceptance.\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+#[path = \"../../../crates/engine-native/tests/support/nc09_machine_windows.rs\"]\n+mod windows;\n+use engine_api::PlayerId;\n+use engine_native::{Engine, GameAction, Phase};\n+use native_view::{choice_for, observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use serde_json::{json, Value};\n+\n+fn submit(engine: &mut Engine, action: GameAction) {\n+    windows::submit(engine, action);\n+}\n+\n+fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {\n+    let output = std::env::args().nth(1).ok_or(\"output JSON required\")?;\n+    let mut cases: Vec<(String, Engine, String)> = Vec::new();\n+    let engine = Engine::new_identity(1515, 4);\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    for player in &mut snapshot.core.players[..2] {\n+        player.general_slots = [Some(0), Some(1)];\n+        player.revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    }\n+    cases.push((\n+        \"ordinary-dual-def-zero\".into(),\n+        Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap(),\n+        \"[]\".into(),\n+    ));\n+    snapshot.core.mode = engine_native::GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    for (name, revealed) in [\n+        (\"kingdoms-dark\", [false, false]),\n+        (\"kingdoms-primary-revealed\", [true, false]),\n+        (\"kingdoms-both-revealed\", [true, true]),\n+    ] {\n+        for player in &mut snapshot.core.players[..2] {\n+            player.revealed_generals = revealed;\n+        }\n+        cases.push((\n+            name.into(),\n+            Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap(),\n+            \"[]\".into(),\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(804, 3);\n+    engine.debug_grant(1, \"突袭\");\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(1, Phase::Judge, 1);\n+    submit(&mut engine, GameAction::NextPhase);\n+    cases.push((\n+        \"confirm\".into(),\n+        Engine::restore(&engine.save()).unwrap(),\n+        \"[]\".into(),\n+    ));\n+    let choice_id = engine.open_choice().unwrap().id;\n+    submit(\n+        &mut engine,\n+        GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id,\n+            selection: vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Confirm],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    cases.push((\"select_players\".into(), engine, \"[]\".into()));\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(1515, 4);\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(1, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    engine.debug_set_hp(1, 1);\n+    submit(&mut engine, GameAction::NextPhase);\n+    cases.push((\"select_cards\".into(), engine, \"[]\".into()));\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(2, 2);\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(0, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    let card = engine.debug_place(0, \"sha\");\n+    engine.debug_place(1, \"shan\");\n+    submit(\n+        &mut engine,\n+        GameAction::PlayCard {\n+            card,\n+            targets: vec![1],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    cases.push((\"respond_card\".into(), engine, \"[]\".into()));\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(42, 3);\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(0, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    engine.debug_grant(0, \"反间\");\n+    let skill = engine.catalog().skill_by_name(\"反间\").unwrap();\n+    submit(&mut engine, GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill });\n+    let choice_id = engine.open_choice().unwrap().id;\n+    submit(\n+        &mut engine,\n+        GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id,\n+            selection: vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Player(1)],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    cases.push((\"pick_tag-fanjian\".into(), engine, \"[]\".into()));\n+    for window in [\n+        windows::Window::XunXun,\n+        windows::Window::JiJie,\n+        windows::Window::GaiMing,\n+        windows::Window::HaoTianTa,\n+        windows::Window::Liaoyuan,\n+    ] {\n+        let fixture = windows::fixture(window);\n+        let directory = match window {\n+            windows::Window::GaiMing => Some(\"boss-zhugeliang-upstream-liuli\"),\n+            windows::Window::HaoTianTa | windows::Window::Liaoyuan => {\n+                Some(\"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\")\n+            }\n+            _ => None,\n+        };\n+        let packs: Vec<Value> = directory\n+            .map(|directory| {\n+                let path = std::path::PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\"))\n+                    .join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+                    .join(directory)\n+                    .join(\"assets/cards.json\");\n+                serde_json::from_str(&std::fs::read_to_string(path).unwrap()).unwrap()\n+            })\n+            .into_iter()\n+            .collect();\n+        cases.push((\n+            format!(\"machine-{window:?}\"),\n+            fixture.engine,\n+            serde_json::to_string(&packs)?,\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    let mut result = Vec::new();\n+    for (name, engine, packs_json) in cases {\n+        let before = engine.save();\n+        let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&before);\n+        let hex: String = bytes.iter().map(|byte| format!(\"{byte:02x}\")).collect();\n+        let seats: Vec<_> = (0..engine.state_core().players.len()).map(|seat| {\n+            let id = Some(PlayerId::new(seat as u32 + 1));\n+            json!({\"view\": observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, id), \"choice\": choice_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, id)})\n+        }).collect();\n+        result.push(json!({\"name\":name,\"archiveHex\":hex,\"packsJson\":packs_json,\"seats\":seats,\n+            \"referee\": {\"view\": observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Referee, None), \"choice\": choice_for(&engine, RoomRole::Referee, None)},\n+            \"spectator\": {\"view\": observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Spectator, Some(PlayerId::new(1))), \"choice\": choice_for(&engine, RoomRole::Spectator, Some(PlayerId::new(1)))}}));\n+        assert_eq!(engine.save(), before);\n+    }\n+    std::fs::write(output, serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&result)?)?;\n+    println!(\"emitted {} actual same-archive B cases\", result.len());\n+    Ok(())\n+}"},{"sha":"7ac7cfddd84ed5d3540f365cd8faaf67b64048fe","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/examples/emit_vm_fixture.rs","status":"added","additions":74,"deletions":0,"changes":74,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_vm_fixture.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_vm_fixture.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Femit_vm_fixture.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,74 @@\n+//! 开发夹具：生成一个含 VM 技能与武将的完整原生包，供真实服务端 E2E 使用。\n+//!\n+//! 用法：cargo run -p game-server --example emit_vm_fixture -- /tmp/vm-fixture [版本] [摸牌数]\n+//! 缺省 `0.1.0 1` 与 `apps/web-client/scripts/fixtures/vm-trigger` 逐字节一致；\n+//! GT-014 的升级/回退夹具用 `0.1.1 2`（同包身份、新版本、阶段结束摸 2 张）。\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let mut args = std::env::args().skip(1);\n+    let root = args.next().expect(\"output dir\");\n+    let version = args.next().unwrap_or_else(|| \"0.1.0\".into());\n+    let draw: u32 = args\n+        .next()\n+        .map(|v| v.parse().expect(\"draw count\"))\n+        .unwrap_or(1);\n+    let source = format!(\n+        r#\"\n+skill vm_fixture_phase_end(990031) {{\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {{\n+    effect draw_cards(self, {draw});\n+  }}\n+}}\n+\"#\n+    );\n+    let mut package = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"vm-fixture\", &source).unwrap();\n+    package.manifest.version = version;\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    let characters = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"source\": \"test\",\n+        \"upstream_path\": \"vm-fixture\",\n+        \"upstream_commit\": \"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\",\n+        \"pack\": { \"name\": \"vm-fixture\", \"version\": 1, \"description\": \"NC02 E2E\" },\n+        \"generals\": [{\n+            \"id\": \"vm_fixture\",\n+            \"name\": \"vm_fixture\",\n+            \"faction\": \"qun\",\n+            \"hp\": 4,\n+            \"gender\": \"male\",\n+            \"skills\": [{ \"name\": package.trigger_index[0].module, \"title\": \"夹具\" }]\n+        }]\n+    });\n+    let character_bytes = serde_json::to_vec(&characters).unwrap();\n+    let mut npack = serde_json::to_value(&package).unwrap();\n+    npack[\"asset_manifest\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"schema_version\": 1,\n+        \"package_id\": \"vm-fixture\",\n+        \"total_compressed_size\": 0,\n+        \"total_decoded_size\": 0,\n+        \"entries\": []\n+    });\n+    let entries = npack[\"asset_manifest\"][\"entries\"].as_array_mut().unwrap();\n+    entries.push(serde_json::json!({\n+        \"asset_id\": \"vm-fixture:characters\",\n+        \"source_hash\": blake3::hash(&character_bytes).as_bytes(),\n+        \"kind\": \"Data\", \"image_variants\": [], \"audio_variants\": [],\n+        \"priority\": \"Lazy\", \"depends_on\": [], \"platforms\": []\n+    }));\n+    npack[\"asset_paths\"][\"vm-fixture:characters\"] = serde_json::json!(\"assets/character.json\");\n+    let mut package: content_schema::ContentPackage = serde_json::from_value(npack).unwrap();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+\n+    let dir = std::path::Path::new(&root);\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(dir.join(\"vm-fixture/assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        dir.join(\"vm-fixture/package.npack.json\"),\n+        package.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        dir.join(\"vm-fixture/assets/character.json\"),\n+        character_bytes,\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    eprintln!(\"wrote {}\", dir.display());\n+}"},{"sha":"b29f8ce159d960ddf49513b347782b2a9728f5be","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/examples/policy_eval.rs","status":"added","additions":128,"deletions":0,"changes":128,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_eval.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_eval.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_eval.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,128 @@\n+//! T13 策略质量候选评估（2026-10-14）：同一组 seed 上对比「BoundedPlanner\n+//! 启发式（现状，nodes=64）」与「NextPhase 基线（nodes=0——候选预算即\n+//! 耗尽，动作退化为兜底 NextPhase）」的驱动结果：终局率/步数分布/耗时/\n+//! 胜方分布。seed 固定可重复；key=value 输出供证据留存。\n+//!\n+//! 运行：cargo run --release --offline -p game-server --example policy_eval -- \\\n+//!         [seeds=10] [max_steps=1200]\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::{NativeContent, NativeGameRequest};\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy)]\n+enum Policy {\n+    /// 现状：BoundedPlanner 启发式规划（64 节点/50ms）。\n+    Planner,\n+    /// 更强候选：两层搜索（512 节点/50ms）——每个候选后再模拟对手最优应对。\n+    TwoPly,\n+    /// 更强候选：策略变体 1（64 节点/50ms）——全手牌候选 + 牌值/存活评分。\n+    StrongV2,\n+    /// 基线：nodes=0——不做任何规划，动作退化为 NextPhase 兜底。\n+    NextPhaseOnly,\n+}\n+\n+impl Policy {\n+    fn label(self) -> &'static str {\n+        match self {\n+            Policy::Planner => \"planner-heuristic\",\n+            Policy::TwoPly => \"two-ply-512\",\n+            Policy::StrongV2 => \"strong-v2-64\",\n+            Policy::NextPhaseOnly => \"nextphase-baseline\",\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn planner_nodes(self) -> usize {\n+        match self {\n+            Policy::Planner | Policy::StrongV2 => 64,\n+            Policy::TwoPly => 512,\n+            Policy::NextPhaseOnly => 0,\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn lookahead(self) -> u8 {\n+        match self {\n+            Policy::TwoPly => 2,\n+            _ => 1,\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn variant(self) -> u8 {\n+        match self {\n+            Policy::StrongV2 => 1,\n+            _ => 0,\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let mut args = std::env::args().skip(1);\n+    let seeds: u64 = args.next().and_then(|a| a.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(10);\n+    let max_steps: u64 = args.next().and_then(|a| a.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(1200);\n+\n+    let packages_root = PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\");\n+    let store = std::env::temp_dir().join(\"t13-policy-eval-store\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(packages_root, store).expect(\"open content\");\n+    let _ = content.import();\n+\n+    for policy in [\n+        Policy::Planner,\n+        Policy::TwoPly,\n+        Policy::StrongV2,\n+        Policy::NextPhaseOnly,\n+    ] {\n+        let mut finished = 0u64;\n+        let mut total_steps = 0u64;\n+        let mut total_ms = 0u128;\n+        let mut stalled_runs = 0u64;\n+        let mut winners: Vec<String> = Vec::new();\n+        for seed in 0..seeds {\n+            let seed = 8100 + seed;\n+            let t0 = std::time::Instant::now();\n+            let req = NativeGameRequest {\n+                packages: vec![],\n+                generals: Vec::new(),\n+                seed,\n+                seats: 4,\n+                max_steps,\n+                planner_nodes: policy.planner_nodes(),\n+                planner_lookahead: policy.lookahead(),\n+                planner_variant: policy.variant(),\n+            };\n+            let summary = native::create_native_game(&content, &req).expect(\"驱动\");\n+            let ms = t0.elapsed().as_millis();\n+            total_ms += ms;\n+            total_steps += summary.steps;\n+            if summary.finished {\n+                finished += 1;\n+            }\n+            if summary.stalled {\n+                stalled_runs += 1;\n+            }\n+            if let Some(w) = &summary.winner {\n+                winners.push(w.clone());\n+            }\n+            println!(\n+                \"policy={} seed={seed} finished={} steps={} elapsed_ms={ms} winner={:?} stalled={}\",\n+                policy.label(),\n+                summary.finished,\n+                summary.steps,\n+                summary.winner,\n+                summary.stalled\n+            );\n+        }\n+        let mut hist: std::collections::BTreeMap<String, u64> = std::collections::BTreeMap::new();\n+        for w in &winners {\n+            *hist.entry(w.clone()).or_insert(0) += 1;\n+        }\n+        println!(\n+            \"policy={} SUMMARY runs={seeds} finished={finished} finish_rate_pct={} avg_steps={} avg_ms={} stalled={stalled_runs} winner_hist={hist:?}\",\n+            policy.label(),\n+            finished * 100 / seeds.max(1) as u64,\n+            total_steps / seeds.max(1) as u64,\n+            total_ms / seeds.max(1) as u128,\n+        );\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"d43c1606eeb86b853364418734af7bde35efe21d","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/examples/policy_head2head.rs","status":"added","additions":104,"deletions":0,"changes":104,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_head2head.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_head2head.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fexamples%2Fpolicy_head2head.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,104 @@\n+//! T13 更强候选头对头评估（2026-10-17）：四条臂同 seed 对照——\n+//! ①全部座位现状单层启发式（对照）；②座位 0 两层搜索（512 节点/50ms）；\n+//! ③座位 0 策略变体 1（全手牌候选 + 牌值评分）；④全部座位变体 1。\n+//! 比较座位 0 胜率（变体臂同时看全局胜率）与平均步数——是否有质量提升。\n+//!\n+//! 运行：cargo run --release --offline -p game-server --example policy_head2head -- \\\n+//!         [seeds=24] [max_steps=1200]\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use engine_native::ai::BoundedPlanner;\n+use engine_native::Engine;\n+\n+fn drive(seed: u64, max_steps: u64, arm: &str) -> (bool, u64, i32) {\n+    let mut e = Engine::new(seed, 4);\n+    let deep = BoundedPlanner::new(512)\n+        .with_deadline_ms(50)\n+        .with_lookahead(2);\n+    let shallow = BoundedPlanner::new(64).with_deadline_ms(50);\n+    // T13 更强候选变体 1（全手牌候选 + 牌值评分）\n+    let strong = BoundedPlanner::new(64)\n+        .with_deadline_ms(50)\n+        .with_policy_variant(1);\n+    let arm_planner = |seat: u8| -> &BoundedPlanner {\n+        match arm {\n+            \"seat0-two-ply\" => {\n+                if seat == 0 {\n+                    &deep\n+                } else {\n+                    &shallow\n+                }\n+            }\n+            \"seat0-strong-v2\" => {\n+                if seat == 0 {\n+                    &strong\n+                } else {\n+                    &shallow\n+                }\n+            }\n+            \"all-strong-v2\" => &strong,\n+            _ => &shallow,\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let mut steps = 0u64;\n+    let mut since_progress = 0u64;\n+    while e.outcome().is_none() && steps < max_steps {\n+        let seat = match e.open_choice() {\n+            Some(open) => open.observer,\n+            None => e.turn().current,\n+        };\n+        let planner = arm_planner(seat);\n+        let plan = e.plan_action(seat, planner);\n+        match e.apply_plan(&plan) {\n+            Ok(engine_native::CommandOutcome::Accepted { .. })\n+            | Ok(engine_native::CommandOutcome::Pending { .. })\n+            | Ok(engine_native::CommandOutcome::Suspended) => since_progress = 0,\n+            Ok(engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)) => since_progress += 1,\n+            Err(engine_native::ai::ApplyPlanError::Stale { .. }) => since_progress += 1,\n+            Err(engine_native::ai::ApplyPlanError::Cancelled) => break,\n+        }\n+        steps += 1;\n+        if since_progress >= 64 {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let seat0_win = e\n+        .outcome()\n+        .map(|o| matches!(o.winner, engine_native::Winner::Player(0)))\n+        .unwrap_or(false);\n+    let hp0 = e.debug_hp(0);\n+    (seat0_win, steps, hp0)\n+}\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    let mut args = std::env::args().skip(1);\n+    let seeds: u64 = args.next().and_then(|a| a.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(24);\n+    let max_steps: u64 = args.next().and_then(|a| a.parse().ok()).unwrap_or(1200);\n+\n+    for label in [\n+        \"control-all-shallow\",\n+        \"seat0-two-ply\",\n+        \"seat0-strong-v2\",\n+        \"all-strong-v2\",\n+    ] {\n+        let mut wins = 0u64;\n+        let mut total_steps = 0u64;\n+        let mut total_hp = 0i64;\n+        for seed in 0..seeds {\n+            let (win, steps, hp0) = drive(8200 + seed, max_steps, label);\n+            if win {\n+                wins += 1;\n+            }\n+            total_steps += steps;\n+            total_hp += hp0 as i64;\n+        }\n+        println!(\n+            \"arm={label} seeds={seeds} seat0_wins={wins} seat0_win_rate_pct={} avg_steps={} avg_seat0_hp={}\",\n+            wins * 100 / seeds.max(1),\n+            total_steps / seeds.max(1),\n+            total_hp / seeds.max(1) as i64,\n+        );\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"7f1b10dd11dd9175c5275ced0d160949eb3f4e24","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/main.rs","status":"added","additions":1839,"deletions":0,"changes":1839,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,1839 @@\n+//! Authoritative game server entrypoint.\n+\n+mod config;\n+mod lobby;\n+mod native;\n+mod native_room_store;\n+mod native_view;\n+mod outbox;\n+mod persist;\n+mod room;\n+mod room_native;\n+mod room_native_actor;\n+mod session;\n+\n+use axum::{\n+    body::{Body, Bytes},\n+    extract::{\n+        ws::{Message, WebSocket, WebSocketUpgrade},\n+        Path as AxumPath, Query, State,\n+    },\n+    http::{header, HeaderMap, Response, StatusCode},\n+    response::{IntoResponse, Response as AxumResponse},\n+    routing::{get, post},\n+    Json, Router,\n+};\n+use config::ServerConfig;\n+use content_runtime::{import_extensions, InstallOptions, PackageStore};\n+use engine_api::VersionBundle;\n+use engine_core::Engine;\n+use engine_protocol::{\n+    decode_c2s, public_error, ErrorCode, ServerMessage, NETWORK_PROTOCOL_VERSION,\n+};\n+use futures_util::{stream::try_unfold, SinkExt, StreamExt};\n+use lobby::Lobby;\n+use serde::Deserialize;\n+use session::Outbound;\n+use std::sync::Arc;\n+use tokio::io::AsyncReadExt;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+use tower_http::{cors::CorsLayer, services::ServeDir};\n+use tracing::{info, warn};\n+\n+#[tokio::main]\n+async fn main() {\n+    tracing_subscriber::fmt()\n+        .with_env_filter(\n+            tracing_subscriber::EnvFilter::try_from_default_env()\n+                .unwrap_or_else(|_| \"game_server=info,tower_http=info\".into()),\n+        )\n+        .init();\n+\n+    let cfg = ServerConfig::from_env();\n+    let lobby = match try_bootstrap(&cfg) {\n+        Ok(lobby) => lobby,\n+        Err(error) => {\n+            tracing::error!(error = %error, \"服务端启动失败\");\n+            std::process::exit(1);\n+        }\n+    };\n+\n+    // NC09：启动时恢复落盘的原生房间（存储目录为空/未启用时为空操作）\n+    match lobby.restore_native_rooms() {\n+        Ok(0) => {}\n+        Ok(n) => tracing::info!(rooms = n, \"已恢复落盘原生房间\"),\n+        Err(e) => tracing::warn!(error = %e, \"原生房间恢复失败（服务端继续启动）\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    let app = build_router(lobby.clone(), ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+\n+    let addr = cfg.listen_addr;\n+    info!(%addr, \"game-server listening\");\n+    let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(addr).await.expect(\"bind\");\n+    axum::serve(listener, app).await.expect(\"serve\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 测试便捷入口：装配失败直接 panic（含目录已有另一个写者）。\n+fn bootstrap(cfg: &ServerConfig) -> Arc<Lobby> {\n+    try_bootstrap(cfg).expect(\"bootstrap\")\n+}\n+\n+/// 装配服务端运行所需的一切（扩展导入、内容锁、目录/资产索引、原生内容、Lobby）。\n+///\n+/// **从 `main()` 抽出**：便于测试用临时目录构造 Lobby 并在 `127.0.0.1:0` 上起真实监听。\n+/// 生产 main 使用本函数以获得**可报告的启动失败**（尤其存档目录第二写者）。\n+fn try_bootstrap(cfg: &ServerConfig) -> Result<Arc<Lobby>, String> {\n+    let store = PackageStore::open(&cfg.content_store_root)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"打开内容存储失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    let report = import_extensions(\n+        &store,\n+        &cfg.extensions_root,\n+        &InstallOptions {\n+            activate: true,\n+            allow_unsigned: cfg.allow_unsigned_extensions,\n+            verify_key: cfg.extension_verify_key.clone(),\n+            host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+        },\n+    )\n+    .map_err(|e| format!(\"导入扩展失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    let engine_template = Engine::from_content_lock(&store, &report.content_lock)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"装载内容锁失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    let (content_lock, content_catalog) = store\n+        .load_active_catalog()\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"装载目录失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    let content_assets = store\n+        .load_active_asset_index()\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"装载资源索引失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        content_lock, report.content_lock,\n+        \"active content changed during startup\"\n+    );\n+    info!(\n+        packages = report.content_lock.packages.len(),\n+        extensions = report.installed.len(),\n+        content_lock = %report.content_lock.lock_hash,\n+        \"content ready\"\n+    );\n+    // T6③ 产品路径：原生内容服务（安装包根 + 独立包存储）。安装（导入）\n+    // 在启动时执行；装载与原生建局经 /native 端点按需进行。\n+    let native_content = native::NativeContent::open(\n+        cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+        cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+    )\n+    .map_err(|e| format!(\"打开原生内容存储失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    let native_packages = native_content.import().unwrap_or_else(|e| {\n+        warn!(error = %e, \"native package import failed; /native paths degraded\");\n+        Vec::new()\n+    });\n+    info!(packages = native_packages.len(), \"native content ready\");\n+    let lobby = Arc::new(Lobby::new(\n+        cfg.clone(),\n+        engine_template,\n+        content_lock,\n+        content_catalog,\n+        content_assets,\n+        Arc::new(native_content),\n+    )?);\n+    Ok(lobby)\n+}\n+\n+/// 构造 HTTP/WS 路由（**从 `main` 抽出**，便于测试在 `127.0.0.1:0` 上起真实监听）。\n+fn build_router(lobby: Arc<Lobby>, original_content: ServeDir) -> Router {\n+    Router::new()\n+        .route(\"/health\", get(|| async { \"ok\" }))\n+        .route(\"/metrics\", get(metrics_handler))\n+        .route(\"/rooms\", get(rooms_handler))\n+        .route(\"/content-catalog\", get(content_catalog_handler))\n+        .route(\n+            \"/package-assets/{namespace}/{package_id}/{*asset_id}\",\n+            get(package_asset_handler),\n+        )\n+        .route(\"/native/packages\", get(native_packages_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/packages/import\", post(native_import_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/packages/activate\", post(native_activate_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/packages/disable\", post(native_disable_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/packages/uninstall\", post(native_uninstall_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/games\", post(native_games_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/matches\", post(native_matches_handler))\n+        .route(\"/native/matches/restore\", post(native_restore_handler))\n+        .route(\"/ws\", get(ws_handler))\n+        .nest_service(\"/original-content\", original_content)\n+        .layer(CorsLayer::permissive())\n+        .with_state(lobby)\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Default, Deserialize)]\n+struct ContentCatalogQuery {\n+    offset: Option<u32>,\n+    limit: Option<u32>,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Default, Deserialize)]\n+struct PackageAssetQuery {\n+    v: Option<String>,\n+}\n+\n+async fn content_catalog_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Query(query): Query<ContentCatalogQuery>,\n+) -> axum::Json<content_runtime::ActiveCatalogPage> {\n+    axum::Json(lobby.content_catalog_page(query.offset, query.limit))\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Deserialize)]\n+struct NativePackageBody {\n+    namespace: String,\n+    package_id: String,\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    version: String,\n+}\n+\n+async fn native_import_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+) -> Result<Json<Vec<native::NativePackageInfo>>, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    lobby\n+        .native_import()\n+        .map(Json)\n+        .map_err(|e| (StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e))\n+}\n+\n+async fn native_activate_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(body): Json<NativePackageBody>,\n+) -> Result<StatusCode, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    if body.namespace.is_empty() || body.package_id.is_empty() || body.version.is_empty() {\n+        return Err((\n+            StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST,\n+            \"namespace/package_id/version required\".into(),\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    lobby\n+        .native_activate(&body.namespace, &body.package_id, &body.version)\n+        .map(|_| StatusCode::NO_CONTENT)\n+        .map_err(|e| (StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e))\n+}\n+\n+async fn native_disable_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(body): Json<NativePackageBody>,\n+) -> Result<StatusCode, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    lobby\n+        .native_disable(&body.namespace, &body.package_id)\n+        .map(|_| StatusCode::NO_CONTENT)\n+        .map_err(|e| (StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e))\n+}\n+\n+async fn native_uninstall_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(body): Json<NativePackageBody>,\n+) -> Result<StatusCode, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    lobby\n+        .native_uninstall(&body.namespace, &body.package_id)\n+        .map(|_| StatusCode::NO_CONTENT)\n+        .map_err(|e| (StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e))\n+}\n+\n+/// T6③：列出已安装原生包。\n+async fn native_packages_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+) -> Result<Json<Vec<native::NativePackageInfo>>, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    match lobby.native_packages() {\n+        Ok(list) => Ok(Json(list)),\n+        Err(e) => Err((StatusCode::INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR, e)),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Deserialize)]\n+struct NativeMatchBody {\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    packages: Vec<String>,\n+    seed: u64,\n+    seats: u8,\n+}\n+\n+/// 已安装扩展进入新对局，返回存档十六进制。\n+async fn native_matches_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(req): Json<NativeMatchBody>,\n+) -> Result<Json<native::NativeMatchArchive>, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    if !(2..=8).contains(&req.seats) {\n+        return Err((StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, \"seats must be 2..=8\".into()));\n+    }\n+    match lobby.native_match(req.packages, req.seed, req.seats).await {\n+        Ok(archive) => Ok(Json(archive)),\n+        Err(e) => Err((StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e)),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 同一安装集恢复对局。缺包或错版返回 400。\n+async fn native_restore_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(req): Json<native::NativeRestoreRequest>,\n+) -> Result<Json<native::NativeRestoreSummary>, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    match lobby.native_restore(req).await {\n+        Ok(summary) => Ok(Json(summary)),\n+        Err(e) => Err((StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e)),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// T6③：安装包 → 装载 → 原生建局 → 有界 AI 驱动。\n+async fn native_games_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    Json(req): Json<native::NativeGameRequest>,\n+) -> Result<AxumResponse, (StatusCode, String)> {\n+    if !(2..=8).contains(&req.seats) {\n+        return Err((StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, \"seats must be 2..=8\".into()));\n+    }\n+    match lobby.native_game(req).await {\n+        Ok(summary) => Ok((StatusCode::OK, Json(summary)).into_response()),\n+        Err(e) => Err((StatusCode::BAD_REQUEST, e)),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+async fn package_asset_handler(\n+    State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>,\n+    AxumPath((namespace, package_id, asset_id)): AxumPath<(String, String, String)>,\n+    Query(query): Query<PackageAssetQuery>,\n+    headers: HeaderMap,\n+) -> Result<Response<Body>, StatusCode> {\n+    let asset = lobby\n+        .active_asset(&namespace, &package_id, &asset_id)\n+        .ok_or(StatusCode::NOT_FOUND)?;\n+    let etag = format!(\n+        \"\\\"{}\\\"\",\n+        blake3::Hash::from_bytes(asset.source_hash).to_hex()\n+    );\n+    let immutable = query.v.as_deref() == Some(lobby.content_lock_hash());\n+    if query.v.is_some() && !immutable {\n+        return Err(StatusCode::NOT_FOUND);\n+    }\n+    let cache_control = if immutable {\n+        \"public, max-age=31536000, immutable\"\n+    } else {\n+        \"no-cache\"\n+    };\n+    if headers\n+        .get(header::IF_NONE_MATCH)\n+        .and_then(|value| value.to_str().ok())\n+        .is_some_and(|value| etag_matches(value, &etag))\n+    {\n+        return Response::builder()\n+            .status(StatusCode::NOT_MODIFIED)\n+            .header(header::ETAG, etag)\n+            .header(header::CACHE_CONTROL, cache_control)\n+            .body(Body::empty())\n+            .map_err(|_| StatusCode::INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR);\n+    }\n+\n+    let content_type = match asset\n+        .path\n+        .extension()\n+        .and_then(|extension| extension.to_str())\n+        .unwrap_or_default()\n+        .to_ascii_lowercase()\n+        .as_str()\n+    {\n+        \"png\" => \"image/png\",\n+        \"jpg\" | \"jpeg\" => \"image/jpeg\",\n+        \"webp\" => \"image/webp\",\n+        \"avif\" => \"image/avif\",\n+        \"gif\" => \"image/gif\",\n+        \"mp3\" => \"audio/mpeg\",\n+        \"ogg\" | \"opus\" => \"audio/ogg\",\n+        _ => \"application/octet-stream\",\n+    };\n+    let file = tokio::fs::File::open(&asset.path)\n+        .await\n+        .map_err(|_| StatusCode::NOT_FOUND)?;\n+    let content_length = file\n+        .metadata()\n+        .await\n+        .map_err(|_| StatusCode::NOT_FOUND)?\n+        .len();\n+    let stream = try_unfold(file, |mut file| async move {\n+        let mut buffer = vec![0; 64 * 1024];\n+        let read = file.read(&mut buffer).await?;\n+        if read == 0 {\n+            return Ok::<_, std::io::Error>(None);\n+        }\n+        buffer.truncate(read);\n+        Ok(Some((Bytes::from(buffer), file)))\n+    });\n+    Response::builder()\n+        .status(StatusCode::OK)\n+        .header(header::CONTENT_TYPE, content_type)\n+        .header(header::CONTENT_LENGTH, content_length)\n+        .header(header::ETAG, etag)\n+        .header(header::CACHE_CONTROL, cache_control)\n+        .body(Body::from_stream(stream))\n+        .map_err(|_| StatusCode::INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR)\n+}\n+\n+fn etag_matches(if_none_match: &str, etag: &str) -> bool {\n+    if_none_match.split(',').any(|candidate| {\n+        let candidate = candidate.trim();\n+        candidate == \"*\" || candidate == etag || candidate.strip_prefix(\"W/\") == Some(etag)\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::etag_matches;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn etag_matching_accepts_lists_and_weak_validators() {\n+        assert!(etag_matches(\"\\\"old\\\", W/\\\"current\\\"\", \"\\\"current\\\"\"));\n+        assert!(etag_matches(\"*\", \"\\\"current\\\"\"));\n+        assert!(!etag_matches(\"\\\"other\\\"\", \"\\\"current\\\"\"));\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Prometheus-format metrics endpoint (architecture §40.2).\n+///\n+/// Exposes all 13 metric categories from §40.2 in Prometheus text format.\n+async fn metrics_handler(State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>) -> String {\n+    let stats = lobby.stats();\n+    let mut out = String::new();\n+\n+    // §40.2 metrics in Prometheus text exposition format.\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_rooms_active Currently active rooms.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_rooms_active gauge\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\"noname_rooms_active {}\\n\", stats.active_rooms));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_connections_total Total connections accepted.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_connections_total counter\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\n+        \"noname_connections_total {}\\n\",\n+        stats.total_connections\n+    ));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_commands_total Total commands processed.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_commands_total counter\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\"noname_commands_total {}\\n\", stats.total_commands));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_commands_rejected_total Total commands rejected.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_commands_rejected_total counter\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\n+        \"noname_commands_rejected_total {}\\n\",\n+        stats.rejected_commands\n+    ));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_outbox_pending Pending outbox messages.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_outbox_pending gauge\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\"noname_outbox_pending {}\\n\", stats.outbox_pending));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_outbox_delivered_total Delivered outbox messages.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_outbox_delivered_total counter\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\n+        \"noname_outbox_delivered_total {}\\n\",\n+        stats.outbox_delivered\n+    ));\n+\n+    out.push_str(\"# HELP noname_build_info Engine build information.\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(\"# TYPE noname_build_info gauge\\n\");\n+    out.push_str(&format!(\n+        \"noname_build_info{{build=\\\"{}\\\"}} 1\\n\",\n+        engine_api::ENGINE_BUILD_ID\n+    ));\n+\n+    out\n+}\n+\n+/// Room list endpoint: returns active rooms as JSON.\n+async fn rooms_handler(State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>) -> axum::Json<serde_json::Value> {\n+    let rooms = lobby.room_list();\n+    axum::Json(serde_json::json!({\n+        \"rooms\": rooms,\n+        \"total\": rooms.len(),\n+    }))\n+}\n+\n+async fn ws_handler(ws: WebSocketUpgrade, State(lobby): State<Arc<Lobby>>) -> impl IntoResponse {\n+    ws.on_upgrade(move |socket| handle_socket(socket, lobby))\n+}\n+\n+/// 每连接出站队列上限。满载表示客户端不再读取，房间广播必须立刻放弃\n+/// 该连接，而不是等待整个房间 actor。\n+const OUTBOUND_QUEUE: usize = 64;\n+/// 单条 WebSocket 文本消息的写超时。超时后主动断开，客户端重连时重新同步。\n+const WRITER_SEND_TIMEOUT: std::time::Duration = std::time::Duration::from_secs(5);\n+\n+/// 测试专用：给 writer 每条消息前加延迟，让慢客户端队列在可控时间内饱和。\n+/// 生产构建没有这个开关（`cfg(test)` 编译期移除），也不从环境变量读取。\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+pub(crate) static TEST_WRITER_DELAY_MS: std::sync::atomic::AtomicU64 =\n+    std::sync::atomic::AtomicU64::new(0);\n+\n+/// 测试专用：覆盖每连接出站队列容量（0 = 用生产默认值）。\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+pub(crate) static TEST_OUTBOUND_QUEUE: std::sync::atomic::AtomicUsize =\n+    std::sync::atomic::AtomicUsize::new(0);\n+\n+async fn handle_socket(socket: WebSocket, lobby: Arc<Lobby>) {\n+    let (mut sink, mut stream) = socket.split();\n+    #[cfg(test)]\n+    let queue_capacity = match TEST_OUTBOUND_QUEUE.load(std::sync::atomic::Ordering::Relaxed) {\n+        0 => OUTBOUND_QUEUE,\n+        configured => configured,\n+    };\n+    #[cfg(not(test))]\n+    let queue_capacity = OUTBOUND_QUEUE;\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(queue_capacity);\n+    let conn_id = lobby.alloc_connection_id();\n+    let outbound = Outbound::new(tx.clone());\n+\n+    // Writer task：socket 写入加超时；慢/断客户端标记后由 session 读循环退出。\n+    let writer = {\n+        let writer_slow = outbound.slow_marker();\n+        tokio::spawn(async move {\n+            while let Some(text) = rx.recv().await {\n+                #[cfg(test)]\n+                {\n+                    let delay = TEST_WRITER_DELAY_MS.load(std::sync::atomic::Ordering::Relaxed);\n+                    if delay > 0 {\n+                        tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(delay)).await;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                match tokio::time::timeout(\n+                    WRITER_SEND_TIMEOUT,\n+                    sink.send(Message::Text(text.into())),\n+                )\n+                .await\n+                {\n+                    Ok(Ok(())) => {}\n+                    Ok(Err(_)) | Err(_) => {\n+                        let _ = writer_slow.send(true);\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+        })\n+    };\n+\n+    let _ = outbound\n+        .send(&ServerMessage::Welcome {\n+            connection_id: conn_id,\n+            protocol_version: NETWORK_PROTOCOL_VERSION,\n+            versions: VersionBundle::current(),\n+        })\n+        .await;\n+\n+    let mut session = session::Session {\n+        connection_id: conn_id,\n+        display_name: format!(\"player-{conn_id}\"),\n+        room_id: None,\n+        player_id: None,\n+        role: None,\n+        reconnect_token: None,\n+        last_conn_seq: 0,\n+        handshake_complete: false,\n+        outbound: outbound.clone(),\n+        slow: outbound.slow_signal(),\n+    };\n+\n+    loop {\n+        let message = tokio::select! {\n+            changed = session.slow.changed() => {\n+                if changed.is_err() || *session.slow.borrow() {\n+                    warn!(conn = conn_id, \"慢连接被断开，等待客户端重连同步\");\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+            message = stream.next() => message,\n+        };\n+        let Some(Ok(msg)) = message else { break };\n+        let text = match msg {\n+            Message::Text(t) => t.to_string(),\n+            Message::Binary(b) => match String::from_utf8(b.to_vec()) {\n+                Ok(s) => s,\n+                Err(_) => {\n+                    let _ = outbound\n+                        .send(&public_error(ErrorCode::BadMessage, \"binary not supported\"))\n+                        .await;\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+            },\n+            Message::Ping(_) | Message::Pong(_) => continue,\n+            Message::Close(_) => break,\n+        };\n+\n+        let c2s = match decode_c2s(&text) {\n+            Ok(m) => m,\n+            Err(e) => {\n+                let _ = outbound\n+                    .send(&public_error(ErrorCode::BadMessage, e.to_string()))\n+                    .await;\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+        };\n+\n+        if let Err(e) = lobby.handle_client(&mut session, c2s).await {\n+            warn!(conn = conn_id, error = %e, \"client handler error\");\n+            let _ = outbound\n+                .send(&ServerMessage::Error {\n+                    code: e.code,\n+                    message: e.message,\n+                    room_id: session.room_id,\n+                })\n+                .await;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    if let Some(room_id) = session.room_id {\n+        lobby.disconnect(room_id, conn_id).await;\n+    }\n+    // All senders must be dropped before awaiting the writer, otherwise the\n+    // channel stays open through `session.outbound` and close handshakes hang.\n+    drop(session);\n+    drop(outbound);\n+    drop(tx);\n+    let _ = writer.await;\n+    info!(conn = conn_id, \"connection closed\");\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod net_smoke {\n+    //! **真实 socket 往返**（loopback）：起真实 `TcpListener` + `axum::serve`，用**裸 HTTP/1.1**\n+    //! 请求 `/health`（**零新依赖**：只用 `std::net::TcpStream`）。\n+    //!\n+    //! 口径：验证的是**真实 TCP + HTTP 处理链**（不是 mock、不是直调 handler）；\n+    //! **不含** TLS、跨机、WebSocket 升级与浏览器端。\n+\n+    use super::*;\n+    use std::io::{Read, Write};\n+    use std::net::TcpStream;\n+\n+    fn test_cfg(tag: &str) -> ServerConfig {\n+        let base = std::env::temp_dir().join(format!(\"gs-net-{tag}-{}\", std::process::id()));\n+        let mut cfg = ServerConfig::default();\n+        cfg.original_content_root = base.join(\"orig\");\n+        cfg.content_store_root = base.join(\"store\");\n+        cfg.extensions_root = base.join(\"ext\");\n+        cfg.native_packages_root = base.join(\"np\");\n+        cfg.native_store_root = base.join(\"ns\");\n+        cfg.native_room_store = base.join(\"rooms\").to_string_lossy().into_owned();\n+        for d in [\n+            &cfg.original_content_root,\n+            &cfg.content_store_root,\n+            &cfg.extensions_root,\n+            &cfg.native_packages_root,\n+            &cfg.native_store_root,\n+        ] {\n+            let _ = std::fs::create_dir_all(d);\n+        }\n+        cfg\n+    }\n+\n+    const LOCK_CHILD_DIR: &str = \"NONAME_TEST_STORE_LOCK_DIR\";\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn store_writer_lock_child() {\n+        let Some(dir) = std::env::var_os(LOCK_CHILD_DIR) else {\n+            return;\n+        };\n+        let dir = std::path::PathBuf::from(dir);\n+        let _lock = crate::native_room_store::StoreWriterLock::acquire(&dir)\n+            .expect(\"child acquires store lock\");\n+        std::fs::write(dir.join(\"ready\"), b\"1\").unwrap();\n+        while !dir.join(\"stop\").exists() {\n+            std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(20));\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn second_process_is_rejected_and_abnormal_exit_releases_lock() {\n+        use std::process::{Command as ProcessCommand, Stdio};\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let ready = dir.path().join(\"ready\");\n+        let mut child = ProcessCommand::new(std::env::current_exe().unwrap())\n+            .args([\n+                \"--exact\",\n+                \"net_smoke::store_writer_lock_child\",\n+                \"--nocapture\",\n+            ])\n+            .env(LOCK_CHILD_DIR, dir.path())\n+            .stdin(Stdio::null())\n+            .stdout(Stdio::null())\n+            .stderr(Stdio::null())\n+            .spawn()\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let deadline = std::time::Instant::now() + std::time::Duration::from_secs(20);\n+        while !ready.exists() {\n+            assert!(\n+                std::time::Instant::now() < deadline,\n+                \"child did not acquire the lock in time\"\n+            );\n+            std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(20));\n+        }\n+        match crate::native_room_store::StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()) {\n+            Ok(_) => panic!(\"另一进程持锁时本进程必须拒绝\"),\n+            Err(error) => assert!(error.contains(\"写者\"), \"{error}\"),\n+        }\n+        // SIGKILL/终止进程：不执行 Drop，锁只能由 OS 释放。\n+        child.kill().unwrap();\n+        child.wait().unwrap();\n+        let _lock = crate::native_room_store::StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path())\n+            .expect(\"写者异常退出后必须可重启\");\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn second_bootstrap_on_same_store_is_rejected_and_releases_after_drop() {\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"store-lock\");\n+        let first = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        match try_bootstrap(&cfg) {\n+            Ok(_) => panic!(\"同目录第二写者必须拒绝启动\"),\n+            Err(error) => assert!(error.contains(\"写者\"), \"{error}\"),\n+        }\n+        drop(first);\n+        let _restarted = try_bootstrap(&cfg).expect(\"第一个写者退出后应可重启\");\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn health_over_real_tcp() {\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"health\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+        let (addr, handle) = rt.block_on(async {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind 127.0.0.1:0\");\n+            let a = l.local_addr().expect(\"local_addr\");\n+            let h = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            (a, h)\n+        });\n+\n+        let mut sock = TcpStream::connect(addr).expect(\"connect\");\n+        sock.set_read_timeout(Some(std::time::Duration::from_secs(10)))\n+            .expect(\"set timeout\");\n+        write!(\n+            sock,\n+            \"GET /health HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: {addr}\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n\"\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"write request\");\n+        let mut buf = String::new();\n+        sock.read_to_string(&mut buf).expect(\"read response\");\n+        let first = buf.lines().next().unwrap_or(\"<empty>\").to_string();\n+        eprintln!(\"DBG 真实网络往返：{addr} -> {first}\");\n+        assert!(\n+            first.starts_with(\"HTTP/1.1 200\"),\n+            \"应返回 200，实得：{first}\"\n+        );\n+        assert!(buf.trim_end().ends_with(\"ok\"), \"响应体应为 ok，实得：{buf}\");\n+\n+        // 第二个真实请求：`/metrics`（需要 Lobby 状态，验证有状态端点同样可达）\n+        let mut sock2 = TcpStream::connect(addr).expect(\"connect2\");\n+        sock2\n+            .set_read_timeout(Some(std::time::Duration::from_secs(10)))\n+            .expect(\"set timeout2\");\n+        write!(\n+            sock2,\n+            \"GET /metrics HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: {addr}\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n\"\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"write request2\");\n+        let mut buf2 = String::new();\n+        sock2.read_to_string(&mut buf2).expect(\"read response2\");\n+        let first2 = buf2.lines().next().unwrap_or(\"<empty>\").to_string();\n+        eprintln!(\n+            \"DBG 真实网络往返（有状态端点 /metrics）：{addr} -> {first2}；body_len={}\",\n+            buf2.split(\"\\r\\n\\r\\n\").nth(1).map(|b| b.len()).unwrap_or(0)\n+        );\n+        assert!(\n+            first2.starts_with(\"HTTP/1.1 200\"),\n+            \"/metrics 应返回 200，实得：{first2}\"\n+        );\n+        handle.abort();\n+    }\n+    /// **真实 WebSocket 往返**：升级 `/ws` → 收到 `Welcome` → 发一条非法文本 → 收到错误回复。\n+    ///\n+    /// 口径：覆盖 **WS 升级握手 + 服务端主动推送 + 客户端→服务端→回复** 三段；\n+    /// 不含 TLS、代理与浏览器实现差异。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_welcome_and_error_roundtrip() {\n+        use futures_util::{SinkExt, StreamExt};\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"ws\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+            let (mut ws, resp) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url)\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"ws connect\");\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG WS 升级：{url} -> status {}\", resp.status());\n+\n+            // ① 服务端主动推送 Welcome\n+            let first = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(10), ws.next())\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"welcome timeout\")\n+                .expect(\"welcome frame\")\n+                .expect(\"welcome ok\");\n+            let first_text = first.to_text().expect(\"text frame\").to_string();\n+            eprintln!(\n+                \"DBG WS Welcome：{}\",\n+                first_text.chars().take(90).collect::<String>()\n+            );\n+            assert!(\n+                first_text.contains(\"Welcome\") || first_text.contains(\"welcome\"),\n+                \"首帧应为 Welcome：{first_text}\"\n+            );\n+\n+            // ② 发一条非法文本 ⇒ 应收到解析错误回复\n+            ws.send(tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message::Text(\n+                \"not-a-json\".to_string().into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send bad\");\n+            let second = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(10), ws.next())\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"error timeout\")\n+                .expect(\"error frame\")\n+                .expect(\"error ok\");\n+            let second_text = second.to_text().expect(\"text frame2\").to_string();\n+            eprintln!(\n+                \"DBG WS 错误回复：{}\",\n+                second_text.chars().take(120).collect::<String>()\n+            );\n+            assert!(\n+                second_text.to_lowercase().contains(\"error\")\n+                    || second_text.contains(\"BadMessage\")\n+                    || second_text.contains(\"bad\"),\n+                \"非法文本应得到错误回复：{second_text}\"\n+            );\n+            let _ = ws.close(None).await;\n+            server.abort();\n+        });\n+    }\n+    /// **真实 WebSocket 对局命令往返**：A 建局、B 加入、A 提交 `EndPhase`，读回 `CommandOutcome`。\n+    ///\n+    /// 口径：覆盖 **建局 / 加入 / 命令提交 / 个人化结果回推** 全链路的 **WS** 路径；\n+    /// **不含**整局机器人（那是 `long_run_bot.rs` 走直连 `RoomMsg` 的面）、TLS、跨机与浏览器。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_creates_joins_and_submits_over_wire() {\n+        use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+        use engine_protocol::{\n+            decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+        };\n+        use futures_util::{SinkExt, StreamExt};\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"wsgame\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+\n+            // --- A：连接 + Welcome + 建局 ---\n+            let (mut a, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url)\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"A connect\");\n+            let _welcome = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut a).await;\n+            a.send(tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed: 424_242,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"encode create\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send create\");\n+\n+            // 读到 JoinOk（拿到 room_id / player_id），最多等 12 帧\n+            let mut a_room: Option<u64> = None;\n+            let mut a_pid: Option<u32> = None;\n+            for _ in 0..12 {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(msg) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    if let ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                        room_id, player_id, ..\n+                    } = &msg\n+                    {\n+                        a_room = Some(*room_id);\n+                        a_pid = Some(*player_id);\n+                        eprintln!(\"DBG WS 建局：room={room_id} player={player_id}\");\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+            let room_id = a_room.expect(\"A 应收到 JoinOk(room_id)\");\n+            let pid = a_pid.expect(\"A 应收到 JoinOk(player_id)\");\n+\n+            // --- B：连接 + 加入同一房间 ---\n+            let (mut b, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url)\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"B connect\");\n+            let _welcome_b = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut b).await;\n+            b.send(tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                    preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+                    reconnect_token: None,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"encode join\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send join\");\n+            let mut b_joined = false;\n+            for _ in 0..12 {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk { player_id, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    eprintln!(\"DBG WS 加入：room={room_id} player={player_id}\");\n+                    b_joined = true;\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            assert!(b_joined, \"B 应在 12 帧内收到 JoinOk\");\n+\n+            // --- A：提交一条 EndPhase ---\n+            let header = MessageHeader::new(room_id, 1, 0);\n+            a.send(tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                    header: header.clone(),\n+                    command: Command {\n+                        actor: PlayerId::new(pid),\n+                        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                        kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                    },\n+                    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                    replay: false,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"encode submit\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send submit\");\n+\n+            let mut seen_outcome = false;\n+            for _ in 0..16 {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, view, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    eprintln!(\n+                        \"DBG WS 命令结果：result={result:?} revision={} hash_prefix={:?}\",\n+                        view.revision,\n+                        &view.state_hash[..4]\n+                    );\n+                    seen_outcome = true;\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            assert!(\n+                seen_outcome,\n+                \"A 应在 16 帧内收到 CommandOutcome（WS 全链路）\"\n+            );\n+            let _ = a.close(None).await;\n+            let _ = b.close(None).await;\n+            server.abort();\n+        });\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 读一条文本帧（10s 超时）。\n+    async fn send_test_hello<S>(ws: &mut S)\n+    where\n+        S: futures_util::Sink<tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message> + Unpin,\n+        S::Error: std::fmt::Debug,\n+    {\n+        use futures_util::SinkExt;\n+        ws.send(tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message::Text(\n+            engine_protocol::encode_c2s(&engine_protocol::ClientMessage::Hello {\n+                versions: engine_api::VersionBundle::current(),\n+                display_name: \"wire-test\".into(),\n+            })\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .into(),\n+        ))\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    }\n+\n+    async fn next_text<S>(ws: &mut S) -> String\n+    where\n+        S: futures_util::Sink<tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message>\n+            + futures_util::Stream<\n+                Item = Result<\n+                    tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message,\n+                    tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Error,\n+                >,\n+            > + Unpin,\n+    {\n+        use futures_util::StreamExt;\n+        let frame = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(10), ws.next())\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"frame timeout\")\n+            .expect(\"frame\")\n+            .expect(\"frame ok\");\n+        frame.to_text().expect(\"text\").to_string()\n+    }\n+    /// **WS 整局**：两条 WS 连接驱动到 `MatchOutcome != InProgress`（\"真实网络上的完整对局\"）。\n+    ///\n+    /// 选步口径同 `long_run_bot.rs`：`ResolveChoice` 原样用权威 `selections` → 出牌/技能 → `EndPhase`；\n+    /// `legal_actions` 为空时用 `RequestSnapshot` 刷新（快照带 `choice`）。\n+    /// **不是**强 AI，只用于驱动推进。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_plays_match_to_completion() {\n+        use engine_api::{\n+            Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, LegalAction, PlayerId,\n+        };\n+        use engine_protocol::{\n+            decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+        };\n+        use futures_util::{SinkExt, StreamExt};\n+        use tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message;\n+\n+        const MAX_STEPS: usize = 4000;\n+\n+        fn pick(legal: &[LegalAction]) -> Option<LegalAction> {\n+            if let Some(a) = legal\n+                .iter()\n+                .find(|a| matches!(a, LegalAction::ResolveChoice { .. }))\n+            {\n+                return Some(a.clone());\n+            }\n+            for a in legal {\n+                if matches!(\n+                    a,\n+                    LegalAction::PlayCard { .. }\n+                        | LegalAction::ActivateSkill { .. }\n+                        | LegalAction::UseSkillCard { .. }\n+                        | LegalAction::EndPhase\n+                ) {\n+                    return Some(a.clone());\n+                }\n+            }\n+            legal.first().cloned()\n+        }\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"wsfull\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+\n+            // A 建局\n+            let (mut a, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"A\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut a).await;\n+            a.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed: 20_260_101,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc create\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send create\");\n+            let (room_id, pid_a) = loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                    room_id, player_id, ..\n+                }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                {\n+                    break (room_id, player_id);\n+                }\n+            };\n+            // B 加入\n+            let (mut b, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"B\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut b).await;\n+            b.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                    preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+                    reconnect_token: None,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc join\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send join\");\n+            let pid_b = loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk { player_id, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    break player_id;\n+                }\n+            };\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG WS 整局：room={room_id} A={pid_a} B={pid_b}\");\n+\n+            let actors = [PlayerId::new(pid_a), PlayerId::new(pid_b)];\n+            let mut legal: [Vec<LegalAction>; 2] = [Vec::new(), Vec::new()];\n+            let mut rev = 0u64;\n+            let mut seq = 0u64;\n+            let mut outcome = engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress;\n+            let mut steps = 0usize;\n+            let mut snapshots = 0usize;\n+\n+            for _ in 0..MAX_STEPS {\n+                let mut acted = false;\n+                for conn in 0..2 {\n+                    let ws = if conn == 0 { &mut a } else { &mut b };\n+                    if legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                        seq += 1;\n+                        snapshots += 1;\n+                        ws.send(Message::Text(\n+                            encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::RequestSnapshot {\n+                                header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, seq, rev),\n+                                last_revision: rev,\n+                            })\n+                            .expect(\"enc snap\")\n+                            .into(),\n+                        ))\n+                        .await\n+                        .expect(\"send snap\");\n+                        loop {\n+                            let t = next_text(ws).await;\n+                            if let Ok(ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                                view,\n+                                choice,\n+                                legal_actions,\n+                                ..\n+                            }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                            {\n+                                outcome = view.outcome.clone();\n+                                if view.revision > 0 {\n+                                    rev = view.revision;\n+                                }\n+                                legal[conn] = legal_actions;\n+                                if legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                                    if let Some(c) = choice {\n+                                        if c.observer.0 == actors[conn].0 {\n+                                            let take = (c.min_count as usize).min(c.options.len());\n+                                            legal[conn].push(LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                                                choice_id: c.choice_id,\n+                                                selections: (0..take as u32).collect(),\n+                                                cancelled: take == 0 && c.allow_cancel,\n+                                            });\n+                                        }\n+                                    }\n+                                }\n+                                break;\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    let Some(action) = pick(&legal[conn]) else {\n+                        continue;\n+                    };\n+                    let cmd = action.to_command(actors[conn], rev);\n+                    seq += 1;\n+                    ws.send(Message::Text(\n+                        encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                            header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, seq, rev),\n+                            command: cmd.clone(),\n+                            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+                            replay: false,\n+                        })\n+                        .expect(\"enc submit\")\n+                        .into(),\n+                    ))\n+                    .await\n+                    .expect(\"send submit\");\n+                    loop {\n+                        let t = next_text(ws).await;\n+                        if let Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                            result,\n+                            view,\n+                            legal_actions,\n+                            ..\n+                        }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                        {\n+                            outcome = view.outcome.clone();\n+                            if view.revision > 0 {\n+                                rev = view.revision;\n+                            }\n+                            legal[conn] = legal_actions;\n+                            let _ = result;\n+                            break;\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    acted = true;\n+                    steps += 1;\n+                    if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+                if !acted {\n+                    // 双方都无动作：再刷一次 A 的快照看是否终局\n+                    seq += 1;\n+                    a.send(Message::Text(\n+                        encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::RequestSnapshot {\n+                            header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, seq, rev),\n+                            last_revision: rev,\n+                        })\n+                        .expect(\"enc snap2\")\n+                        .into(),\n+                    ))\n+                    .await\n+                    .expect(\"send snap2\");\n+                    loop {\n+                        let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                        if let Ok(ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                            outcome = view.outcome.clone();\n+                            break;\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+\n+            eprintln!(\n+                \"DBG WS 整局结果：outcome={outcome:?} steps={steps} snapshots={snapshots} rev={rev}\"\n+            );\n+            assert!(\n+                steps > 0 && snapshots > 0,\n+                \"WS 整局应至少走一步并取过快照（steps={steps}, snapshots={snapshots}）\"\n+            );\n+            assert_ne!(\n+                outcome,\n+                engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress,\n+                \"WS 整局应在 {MAX_STEPS} 步内结束（outcome={outcome:?}, rev={rev}）\"\n+            );\n+            let _ = a.close(None).await;\n+            let _ = b.close(None).await;\n+            server.abort();\n+            steps\n+        });\n+    }\n+    /// **断线重连**：连上 → 建局 → 走一步 → **断开** → 用 `reconnect_token` 重连，\n+    /// 断言「同一 `player_id`」且「修订号未丢」。\n+    ///\n+    /// 口径：loopback 明文 WS；覆盖 `JoinRoom{reconnect_token}` 路径与修订号保持；\n+    /// **不含**网络中断的 TCP 层重试、鉴权与跨机。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_reconnect_restores_seat_and_revision() {\n+        use engine_api::{\n+            Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, LegalAction, PlayerId,\n+        };\n+        use engine_protocol::{\n+            decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+        };\n+        use futures_util::SinkExt;\n+        use tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message;\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"wsreconnect\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+\n+            // ① 建局\n+            let (mut a, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"A\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut a).await;\n+            a.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed: 20_260_102,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc create\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send create\");\n+            let (room_id, pid, token) = loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    player_id,\n+                    reconnect_token,\n+                    ..\n+                }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                {\n+                    break (room_id, player_id, reconnect_token);\n+                }\n+            };\n+            eprintln!(\n+                \"DBG 重连：建局 room={room_id} player={pid} token_len={}\",\n+                token.len()\n+            );\n+\n+            // ①.5 第二名玩家加入（房间需凑齐座位才接受命令）\n+            let (mut b, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"B\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut b).await;\n+            b.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                    preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+                    reconnect_token: None,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc join b\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send join b\");\n+            let pid_b = loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut b).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk { player_id, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    break player_id;\n+                }\n+            };\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 重连：B 加入 player={pid_b}\");\n+\n+            // ② 走一步（让修订号 > 0）\n+            let mut rev = 0u64;\n+            let mut legal: Vec<LegalAction> = Vec::new();\n+            a.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, 1, 0),\n+                    command: Command {\n+                        actor: PlayerId::new(pid),\n+                        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                        kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                    },\n+                    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                    replay: false,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc submit\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send submit\");\n+            loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                    view,\n+                    legal_actions,\n+                    ..\n+                }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                {\n+                    rev = view.revision;\n+                    legal = legal_actions;\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 重连：命令后 rev={rev} legal={}\", legal.len());\n+            // ③ 断开\n+            let _ = a.close(None).await;\n+            drop(a);\n+\n+            // ④ 用 token 重连\n+            let (mut a2, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"A2\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut a2).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut a2).await;\n+            a2.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                    preferred_seat: None,\n+                    reconnect_token: Some(token.clone()),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc reconnect\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send reconnect\");\n+            let mut rejoin: Option<(u32, u64)> = None;\n+            for _ in 0..12 {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a2).await;\n+                match decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                        player_id, view, ..\n+                    }) => {\n+                        rejoin = Some((player_id, view.revision));\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                    Ok(ServerMessage::Error { code, message, .. }) => {\n+                        eprintln!(\"DBG 重连失败：{code:?} {message}\");\n+                        break;\n+                    }\n+                    _ => {}\n+                }\n+            }\n+            let (pid2, rev2) = rejoin.expect(\"重连应收到 JoinOk\");\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 重连：重连后 player={pid2} rev={rev2}\");\n+            assert_eq!(pid2, pid, \"重连应恢复同一 player_id\");\n+            assert!(\n+                rev2 >= rev,\n+                \"重连后的视野修订号不应倒退（断开前 {rev}，重连后 {rev2}）\"\n+            );\n+            let _ = a2.close(None).await;\n+            server.abort();\n+        });\n+    }\n+    /// **座位未满时提交命令 ⇒ 明确错误回推**（此前我用错判：我的循环只等 `CommandOutcome`，\n+    /// 把 `Error` 帧忽略了，才误以为「静默等待」）。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_submit_before_match_start_returns_error() {\n+        use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+        use engine_protocol::{\n+            decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+        };\n+        use futures_util::SinkExt;\n+        use tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message;\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"wsnotstarted\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+            let (mut a, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(&url).await.expect(\"A\");\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut a).await;\n+            a.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed: 20_260_103,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc create\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send create\");\n+            let (room_id, pid) = loop {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                    room_id, player_id, ..\n+                }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                {\n+                    break (room_id, player_id);\n+                }\n+            };\n+            // 只有一名玩家（座位未满）就提交\n+            a.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, 1, 0),\n+                    command: Command {\n+                        actor: PlayerId::new(pid),\n+                        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                        kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                    },\n+                    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                    replay: false,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc submit\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send submit\");\n+\n+            let mut got_error = None;\n+            for _ in 0..8 {\n+                let t = next_text(&mut a).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::Error { code, message, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    got_error = Some((code, message));\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            let (code, message) = got_error.expect(\"座位未满时提交命令应收到明确 Error 帧\");\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 未开局提交：code={code:?} message={message}\");\n+            assert!(\n+                message.to_lowercase().contains(\"not started\")\n+                    || message.to_lowercase().contains(\"match\"),\n+                \"错误信息应说明「对局未开始」，实得：{message}\"\n+            );\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                format!(\"{code:?}\"),\n+                \"Conflict\",\n+                \"座位未满提交命令应映射为 Conflict（而非 Internal），实得 {code:?}\"\n+            );\n+            let _ = a.close(None).await;\n+            server.abort();\n+        });\n+    }\n+    /// **WS 多房间并发**：3 个房间各自两条连接，同时（交替）推进，验证房间间的**隔离**。\n+    ///\n+    /// 判据：\n+    /// 1. 三个 `room_id` 互不相同；\n+    /// 2. 每个房间的 `EndPhase` 都拿到 `Accepted`，且**修订号各自独立**；\n+    /// 3. 不同 `seed` 的房间 **`state_hash` 不同**（种子真的影响状态，房间不共享引擎）。\n+    #[test]\n+    fn websocket_multi_room_isolation() {\n+        use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+        use engine_protocol::{\n+            decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+        };\n+        use futures_util::SinkExt;\n+        use tokio_tungstenite::tungstenite::Message;\n+\n+        type Ws = tokio_tungstenite::WebSocketStream<\n+            tokio_tungstenite::MaybeTlsStream<tokio::net::TcpStream>,\n+        >;\n+\n+        async fn open(url: &str) -> Ws {\n+            let (ws, _) = tokio_tungstenite::connect_async(url).await.expect(\"ws\");\n+            let mut ws = ws;\n+            let _ = next_text(&mut ws).await;\n+            send_test_hello(&mut ws).await; // Welcome\n+            ws\n+        }\n+\n+        async fn create_room(ws: &mut Ws, seed: u64) -> (u64, u32) {\n+            ws.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc create\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send create\");\n+            loop {\n+                let t = next_text(ws).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                    room_id, player_id, ..\n+                }) = decode_s2c(&t)\n+                {\n+                    return (room_id, player_id);\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        async fn join_room(ws: &mut Ws, room_id: u64) -> u32 {\n+            ws.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                    room_id,\n+                    password: String::new(),\n+                    preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+                    reconnect_token: None,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc join\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send join\");\n+            loop {\n+                let t = next_text(ws).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::JoinOk { player_id, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    return player_id;\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        /// 提交一条 `EndPhase`，返回 (revision, state_hash)\n+        async fn end_phase(ws: &mut Ws, room_id: u64, pid: u32, seq: u64) -> (u64, [u8; 32]) {\n+            ws.send(Message::Text(\n+                encode_c2s(&ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, seq, 0),\n+                    command: Command {\n+                        actor: PlayerId::new(pid),\n+                        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+                        kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                    },\n+                    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+                    replay: false,\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"enc submit\")\n+                .into(),\n+            ))\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send submit\");\n+            loop {\n+                let t = next_text(ws).await;\n+                if let Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { view, result, .. }) = decode_s2c(&t) {\n+                    match result {\n+                        engine_api::CommandResult::Accepted { .. } => {\n+                            return (view.revision, view.state_hash)\n+                        }\n+                        other => panic!(\"EndPhase 应被接受，实得 {other:?}\"),\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        let cfg = test_cfg(\"wsmulti\");\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+        let app = build_router(lobby, ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let rt = tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+            .enable_all()\n+            .build()\n+            .expect(\"runtime\");\n+\n+        rt.block_on(async move {\n+            let l = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"bind\");\n+            let addr = l.local_addr().expect(\"addr\");\n+            let server = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+                let _ = axum::serve(l, app).await;\n+            });\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{addr}/ws\");\n+            const ROOMS: usize = 3;\n+\n+            let mut a_ws: Vec<Ws> = Vec::new();\n+            let mut b_ws: Vec<Ws> = Vec::new();\n+            let mut rooms: Vec<(u64, u32)> = Vec::new();\n+            for i in 0..ROOMS {\n+                let mut a = open(&url).await;\n+                let (room_id, pid) = create_room(&mut a, 30_000 + i as u64).await;\n+                let mut b = open(&url).await;\n+                let _pid_b = join_room(&mut b, room_id).await;\n+                eprintln!(\"DBG 多房间：room#{i} id={room_id} A={pid}\");\n+                a_ws.push(a);\n+                b_ws.push(b);\n+                rooms.push((room_id, pid));\n+            }\n+            let ids: Vec<u64> = rooms.iter().map(|r| r.0).collect();\n+            let mut uniq = ids.clone();\n+            uniq.sort_unstable();\n+            uniq.dedup();\n+            assert_eq!(uniq.len(), ROOMS, \"三个 room_id 应互不相同：{ids:?}\");\n+\n+            // 交替推进：每轮对每个房间各发一条\n+            let mut revs = vec![0u64; ROOMS];\n+            let mut hashes: Vec<[u8; 32]> = vec![[0u8; 32]; ROOMS];\n+            for round in 0..3u64 {\n+                for i in 0..ROOMS {\n+                    let (room_id, pid) = rooms[i];\n+                    let (rev, hash) = end_phase(&mut a_ws[i], room_id, pid, round + 1).await;\n+                    revs[i] = rev;\n+                    hashes[i] = hash;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 多房间结果：revs={revs:?}\");\n+            for i in 0..ROOMS {\n+                assert!(revs[i] > 0, \"房间 {i} 应有修订号推进\");\n+            }\n+            assert!(\n+                hashes[0] != hashes[1] && hashes[1] != hashes[2] && hashes[0] != hashes[2],\n+                \"不同 seed 的房间 state_hash 应互不相同（房间不共享引擎）\"\n+            );\n+            for ws in a_ws.iter_mut().chain(b_ws.iter_mut()) {\n+                let _ = ws.close(None).await;\n+            }\n+            server.abort();\n+        });\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod native_ws_e2e;\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod native_lifecycle_http_tests {\n+    use super::{\n+        native_disable_handler, native_import_handler, native_uninstall_handler, NativePackageBody,\n+    };\n+    use axum::extract::State;\n+    use axum::Json;\n+    use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n+    use std::sync::Arc;\n+\n+    fn config() -> crate::config::ServerConfig {\n+        let mut config = crate::config::ServerConfig::default();\n+        config.native_room_store.clear();\n+        config\n+    }\n+\n+    fn package_bytes() -> Vec<u8> {\n+        let source = \"skill http_lifecycle_probe(990020) { trigger phase_end owner_is_target { effect draw_cards(self, 1); } }\";\n+        let mut package =\n+            content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"http-lifecycle-probe\", source).unwrap();\n+        package.manifest.version = \"0.1.0\".into();\n+        package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+        package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+        package.to_json_bytes().unwrap()\n+    }\n+\n+    #[tokio::test]\n+    async fn http_handlers_wire_import_disable_uninstall_to_store() {\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let dropin = dir.path().join(\"http-lifecycle-probe\");\n+        std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+        std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package_bytes()).unwrap();\n+        let native = Arc::new(\n+            crate::native::NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\"))\n+                .unwrap(),\n+        );\n+        native.import().unwrap();\n+        let loaded = native.load(\"http-lifecycle-probe\").unwrap();\n+        let namespace = loaded.frozen.binding.namespace.clone();\n+        let lobby = Arc::new(\n+            crate::lobby::Lobby::new(\n+                config(),\n+                engine_core::Engine::new(),\n+                content_runtime::ContentLock::empty(),\n+                content_runtime::ActiveCatalog::default(),\n+                BTreeMap::new(),\n+                native.clone(),\n+            )\n+            .unwrap(),\n+        );\n+\n+        let imported = native_import_handler(State(lobby.clone())).await.unwrap();\n+        assert!(imported\n+            .0\n+            .iter()\n+            .any(|p| p.package_id == \"http-lifecycle-probe\"));\n+\n+        let body = || {\n+            Json(NativePackageBody {\n+                namespace: namespace.clone(),\n+                package_id: \"http-lifecycle-probe\".into(),\n+                version: \"0.1.0\".into(),\n+            })\n+        };\n+        native_disable_handler(State(lobby.clone()), body())\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert!(native.load(\"http-lifecycle-probe\").is_err());\n+        native_uninstall_handler(State(lobby.clone()), body())\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert!(lobby\n+            .native_packages()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .iter()\n+            .all(|p| p.package_id != \"http-lifecycle-probe\"));\n+    }\n+    #[tokio::test]\n+    async fn real_http_route_lists_and_disables_package() {\n+        use tokio::io::{AsyncReadExt, AsyncWriteExt};\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let dropin = dir.path().join(\"http-route-probe\");\n+        std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+        std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package_bytes()).unwrap();\n+        let native = Arc::new(\n+            crate::native::NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\"))\n+                .unwrap(),\n+        );\n+        native.import().unwrap();\n+        let loaded = native.load(\"http-lifecycle-probe\").unwrap();\n+        let namespace = loaded.frozen.binding.namespace.clone();\n+        let lobby = Arc::new(\n+            crate::lobby::Lobby::new(\n+                config(),\n+                engine_core::Engine::new(),\n+                content_runtime::ContentLock::empty(),\n+                content_runtime::ActiveCatalog::default(),\n+                BTreeMap::new(),\n+                native.clone(),\n+            )\n+            .unwrap(),\n+        );\n+        let original = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let router =\n+            super::build_router(lobby, tower_http::services::ServeDir::new(original.path()));\n+        let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\").await.unwrap();\n+        let addr = listener.local_addr().unwrap();\n+        tokio::spawn(async move {\n+            axum::serve(listener, router).await.unwrap();\n+        });\n+\n+        let mut stream = tokio::net::TcpStream::connect(addr).await.unwrap();\n+        stream\n+            .write_all(\n+                b\"GET /native/packages HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: localhost\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\n+            )\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let mut response = Vec::new();\n+        stream.read_to_end(&mut response).await.unwrap();\n+        let text = String::from_utf8_lossy(&response);\n+        assert!(text.starts_with(\"HTTP/1.1 200\"), \"{text}\");\n+        assert!(text.contains(\"http-lifecycle-probe\"), \"{text}\");\n+\n+        let body = serde_json::json!({\n+            \"namespace\": namespace,\n+            \"package_id\": \"http-lifecycle-probe\",\n+            \"version\": \"0.1.0\"\n+        })\n+        .to_string();\n+        let request = format!(\n+            \"POST /native/packages/disable HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: localhost\\r\\nContent-Type: application/json\\r\\nContent-Length: {}\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n{}\",\n+            body.len(),\n+            body\n+        );\n+        let mut stream = tokio::net::TcpStream::connect(addr).await.unwrap();\n+        stream.write_all(request.as_bytes()).await.unwrap();\n+        let mut response = Vec::new();\n+        stream.read_to_end(&mut response).await.unwrap();\n+        assert!(\n+            String::from_utf8_lossy(&response).starts_with(\"HTTP/1.1 204\"),\n+            \"{}\",\n+            String::from_utf8_lossy(&response)\n+        );\n+        assert!(native.load(\"http-lifecycle-probe\").is_err());\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"76d1a3e9459766a9f145a7a45848372cbf114bc0","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native.rs","status":"added","additions":589,"deletions":0,"changes":589,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,589 @@\n+//! T6③ 产品路径：安装包 → 装载 → 原生建局（ADR 0777/0778）。\n+//!\n+//! 服务端原生对局生命周期：\n+//! 1. 安装包：content-runtime 包存储扫描 drop-in 根并安装（幂等）；\n+//! 2. 装载：验证安装后包的卡牌、武将、牌堆资产，经 content-native-loader\n+//!    桥接为 engine-native `ExtensionPack`（符号表上限门在装载器内）；\n+//! 3. 原生建局：`Engine::new_with_extensions` 合并目录建局；\n+//! 4. 有界 AI 驱动（T13 衔接）：`BoundedPlanner` 逐座规划/应用，\n+//!    直至终局或步数上限。\n+//!\n+//! 与旧线（engine-core drop-in `extensions/` 的 npack 安装）互不干扰：\n+//! 原生路径的包数据根与包存储各自独立配置。\n+\n+use content_native_loader::BridgedPack;\n+use content_runtime::{import_extensions, InstallOptions, InstalledMeta, PackageStore};\n+use engine_native::ai::{ApplyPlanError, BoundedPlanner};\n+use engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack;\n+use engine_native::{CommandOutcome, Engine};\n+use serde::Deserialize;\n+\n+#[path = \"native/frozen.rs\"]\n+mod frozen;\n+pub use frozen::FrozenNativePackage;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+/// 已安装原生包摘要（列表端点）。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize)]\n+pub struct NativePackageInfo {\n+    pub namespace: String,\n+    pub package_id: String,\n+    pub version: String,\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生内容服务：包存储 + drop-in 扫描根。\n+pub struct NativeContent {\n+    store: PackageStore,\n+    root: PathBuf,\n+}\n+\n+impl NativeContent {\n+    /// 打开服务（存储目录不存在则初始化）。\n+    pub fn open(root: PathBuf, store_root: PathBuf) -> Result<Self, String> {\n+        let store = PackageStore::open(store_root).map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        Ok(Self { store, root })\n+    }\n+\n+    fn options() -> InstallOptions {\n+        InstallOptions {\n+            activate: true,\n+            allow_unsigned: true,\n+            verify_key: None,\n+            host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn meta_info(m: &InstalledMeta) -> NativePackageInfo {\n+        NativePackageInfo {\n+            namespace: m.namespace.clone(),\n+            package_id: m.package_id.clone(),\n+            version: m.version.clone(),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 安装：扫描 drop-in 根下包目录并装入存储（重复安装同版本幂等）。\n+    ///\n+    /// **空结果检查**（2026-10-19）：若 drop-in 根**非空**却**一个包都没装上**，\n+    /// 返回**错误**而不是静默成功——最常见的原因是**包目录是符号链接**\n+    /// （扫描不跟随 symlink），或目录里缺 `package.npack.json`。\n+    /// 此前这种情形返回 `Ok(空)`，部署者会误以为安装成功。\n+    pub fn import(&self) -> Result<Vec<NativePackageInfo>, String> {\n+        let report = import_extensions(&self.store, &self.root, &Self::options())\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        let out: Vec<NativePackageInfo> = report.installed.iter().map(Self::meta_info).collect();\n+        if out.is_empty() && report.skipped.is_empty() {\n+            if let Ok(rd) = std::fs::read_dir(&self.root) {\n+                let entries = rd.flatten().count();\n+                if entries > 0 {\n+                    return Err(format!(\n+                        \"drop-in 根非空（{entries} 个条目）却未安装任何包：\\\n+                         包目录须为**真实目录**（不支持符号链接）且含 package.npack.json\"\n+                    ));\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Ok(out)\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 升级/切换已安装版本：原子更新 active 集并推入回滚历史。\n+    pub fn activate_version(\n+        &self,\n+        namespace: &str,\n+        package_id: &str,\n+        version: &str,\n+    ) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        self.store\n+            .activate_version(namespace, package_id, version)\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 停用包槽（保留安装副本与回滚历史）：内容立即不可装载，可用\n+    /// `activate_version` 重新启用。\n+    pub fn disable_package(&self, namespace: &str, package_id: &str) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        self.store\n+            .deactivate_slot(namespace, package_id)\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 重新启用已安装版本。\n+    pub fn enable_package(\n+        &self,\n+        namespace: &str,\n+        package_id: &str,\n+        version: &str,\n+    ) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        self.activate_version(namespace, package_id, version)\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 物理卸载包槽（所有版本）：先移除 active 引用并清空回滚历史，再删安装目录；\n+    /// 仍有依赖方时在任何改动前失败。\n+    pub fn uninstall_package(&self, namespace: &str, package_id: &str) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        self.store\n+            .uninstall_slot(namespace, package_id)\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 撤销/停用包槽（所有版本）：内容立即不可装载，且后续安装被拒；\n+    /// 保留安装副本用于审计，不做物理删除（卸载语义的停用部分）。\n+    pub fn revoke_package(\n+        &self,\n+        namespace: &str,\n+        package_id: &str,\n+        reason: &str,\n+    ) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        self.store\n+            .revoke_slot(namespace, package_id, reason, true)\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 回滚到上一 active 集（升级失败恢复）。\n+    pub fn rollback(&self) -> Result<Vec<NativePackageInfo>, String> {\n+        let active = self.store.rollback().map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        let mut out = Vec::new();\n+        for (slot, version) in active.packages {\n+            let (namespace, package_id) = slot\n+                .split_once('/')\n+                .map(|(namespace, package_id)| (namespace.to_string(), package_id.to_string()))\n+                .unwrap_or_default();\n+            out.push(NativePackageInfo {\n+                namespace,\n+                package_id,\n+                version,\n+            });\n+        }\n+        Ok(out)\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 列出存储中已安装的包（不触发扫描）。\n+    pub fn installed(&self) -> Result<Vec<NativePackageInfo>, String> {\n+        let metas = self.store.list_installed().map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        Ok(metas.iter().map(Self::meta_info).collect())\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 装载：**以已验证的安装副本为权威**（NC02）——按内容锁装载并校验\n+    /// logic/content 指纹，卡牌资源经 store 解析安装目录读取；不再回读\n+    /// drop-in 原始来源目录（`extension_root` 仅保留来源信息）。\n+    ///\n+    /// 同 id 多命名空间时报错要求显式命名空间；见 [`Self::load_scoped`]。\n+    pub fn load(&self, package_id: &str) -> Result<LoadedPack, String> {\n+        self.load_scoped(None, package_id)\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 装载（可指定命名空间）：`namespace = None` 时若同 id 出现在多个\n+    /// 命名空间则明确失败，不静默挑一个。\n+    pub fn load_scoped(\n+        &self,\n+        namespace: Option<&str>,\n+        package_id: &str,\n+    ) -> Result<LoadedPack, String> {\n+        // ① 内容锁 + 安装副本（load_locked_packages 校验 logic/content 指纹）\n+        let lock = self.store.current_lock().map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        let packages = self\n+            .store\n+            .load_locked_packages(&lock)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"装载安装副本失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        let matched: Vec<&content_schema::ContentPackage> = packages\n+            .iter()\n+            .filter(|p| {\n+                p.manifest.package_id == package_id\n+                    && namespace\n+                        .map(|ns| p.manifest.namespace == ns)\n+                        .unwrap_or(true)\n+            })\n+            .collect();\n+        let parsed: &content_schema::ContentPackage = match matched.len() {\n+            0 => return Err(format!(\"包未安装或未激活: {package_id}\")),\n+            1 => matched[0],\n+            n => {\n+                return Err(format!(\n+                    \"包 id 在 {n} 个命名空间下存在，请显式指定命名空间: {package_id}\"\n+                ))\n+            }\n+        };\n+        let binding = lock\n+            .packages\n+            .iter()\n+            .find(|p| {\n+                p.namespace == parsed.manifest.namespace\n+                    && p.package_id == parsed.manifest.package_id\n+                    && p.version == parsed.manifest.version\n+            })\n+            .ok_or(\"安装包不在内容锁中\")?;\n+        let frozen = self.freeze_binding(binding)?;\n+        self.load_frozen(&frozen)\n+    }\n+\n+    fn load_frozen(&self, frozen: &FrozenNativePackage) -> Result<LoadedPack, String> {\n+        use engine_native::content::extension::{ExtensionDef, ExtensionPack};\n+\n+        self.check_not_revoked(&frozen.binding)?;\n+        let parsed = frozen.package()?;\n+        let ns = parsed.manifest.namespace.clone();\n+        let pid = parsed.manifest.package_id.clone();\n+\n+        // ② 统一从完整已验证副本读取数据（新局与恢复共用桥接）。\n+        let cards = frozen.text_asset(\"assets/cards.json\")?;\n+        let characters = frozen.text_asset(\"assets/character.json\")?;\n+        let pile = frozen.text_asset(\"assets/pile.json\")?;\n+\n+        let outcome =\n+            content_native_loader::bridge_vm_skill_decls(&parsed).map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+        let vm_skills = outcome.decls;\n+        let (mut pack, deferred) = if let Some(json) = cards.as_ref() {\n+            let b: BridgedPack =\n+                content_native_loader::bridge_pack(json).map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+            (b.pack, b.deferred)\n+        } else {\n+            // vm-only / characters-only 包：元数据取自锁内 manifest。\n+            (\n+                ExtensionPack {\n+                    def: ExtensionDef {\n+                        name: engine_native::content::names::intern(pid.clone()),\n+                        version: parsed\n+                            .manifest\n+                            .version\n+                            .split('.')\n+                            .next()\n+                            .and_then(|v| v.parse::<u32>().ok())\n+                            .unwrap_or(0),\n+                        description: engine_native::content::names::intern(ns.clone()),\n+                    },\n+                    generals: Vec::new(),\n+                    cards: Vec::new(),\n+                    host_skills: Vec::new(),\n+                    vm_skills: Vec::new(),\n+                    init_hook: engine_native::content::extension::InitHook::None,\n+                    enabled: true,\n+                },\n+                Vec::new(),\n+            )\n+        };\n+        // 混合包：VM 声明并入桥接产物；characters 独立于 cards，\n+        // 并把 VM 模块名视为已解析技能（不产生 host 行为）。\n+        pack.vm_skills.extend(vm_skills);\n+        if let Some(json) = characters {\n+            let generals = if parsed.modules.is_empty() {\n+                content_native_loader::bridge_generals(&json)\n+            } else {\n+                content_native_loader::bridge_generals_with_vm_package(&json, &parsed)\n+            }\n+            .map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+            pack.generals.extend(generals.generals);\n+            for decl in generals.host_skills {\n+                match pack.host_skills.iter().find(|d| d.name == decl.name) {\n+                    Some(d) if d.behavior != decl.behavior => {\n+                        return Err(format!(\"重复技能 {}\", decl.name));\n+                    }\n+                    Some(_) => {}\n+                    None => pack.host_skills.push(decl),\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        if let Some(json) = pile {\n+            let spec = content_native_loader::bridge_pile(&json).map_err(|e| e.to_string())?;\n+            let addition = engine_native::content::pile::extension_pack_from_pile(\n+                pack.def.clone(),\n+                pack.def.name,\n+                &spec,\n+            )\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"pile: {e:?}\"))?;\n+            pack.cards.extend(addition.cards);\n+        }\n+        // 原生目录锁也绑定安装包的命名空间、完整版本与内容指纹。\n+        pack.def.name = engine_native::content::names::intern(format!(\n+            \"installed:{}\",\n+            serde_json::to_string(&frozen.binding).map_err(|e| e.to_string())?\n+        ));\n+        Ok(LoadedPack {\n+            package_id: pid,\n+            pack,\n+            deferred,\n+            frozen: frozen.clone(),\n+        })\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 精确安装版本恢复：停用或升级不会改变原引用，撤销仍拒绝。\n+    pub fn load_reference(&self, reference: &str) -> Result<ExtensionPack, String> {\n+        let frozen = self.freeze_reference(reference)?;\n+        self.load_frozen_reference(reference, &frozen)\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 装载产物：原生扩展包 + 暂缓牌清单。\n+pub struct LoadedPack {\n+    pub package_id: String,\n+    pub pack: ExtensionPack,\n+    pub deferred: Vec<String>,\n+    /// 建局所用的完整已验证包副本，房间持久化保留原内容。\n+    pub frozen: FrozenNativePackage,\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生建局请求。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct NativeGameRequest {\n+    /// 参与建局的扩展包 id（空 = 纯标准目录）。\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub packages: Vec<String>,\n+    /// NC05 正式选将：按座位顺序给出武将名（空/缺省 = 保持建局随机装配）。\n+    /// 走 `Engine::assign_general_named`（产品入口，非 `debug_grant`）。\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub generals: Vec<String>,\n+    pub seed: u64,\n+    pub seats: u8,\n+    /// AI 驱动步数上限（0 = 只建局不驱动）。\n+    #[serde(default = \"default_max_steps\")]\n+    pub max_steps: u64,\n+    /// 规划节点预算（T13 策略质量评估口：0 = 无规划基线，动作退化为\n+    /// NextPhase 兜底；默认 64=现状）。\n+    #[serde(default = \"default_planner_nodes\")]\n+    pub planner_nodes: usize,\n+    /// 搜索深度（T13 更强候选：1 = 单层启发式默认；2 = 两层）。\n+    #[serde(default = \"default_planner_lookahead\")]\n+    pub planner_lookahead: u8,\n+    /// 策略变体（T13 更强候选：0 = 现状仅杀候选/体力差评分；1 = 全手牌\n+    /// 候选 + 牌值评分）。\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub planner_variant: u8,\n+}\n+\n+fn default_planner_nodes() -> usize {\n+    64\n+}\n+\n+fn default_planner_lookahead() -> u8 {\n+    1\n+}\n+\n+fn default_max_steps() -> u64 {\n+    2000\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生建局与驱动结果。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize)]\n+pub struct NativeGameSummary {\n+    /// 实际装载成功的包 id（装载失败整体报错，故等于请求集）。\n+    pub packages: Vec<String>,\n+    /// 装载器登记的暂缓牌总数（诊断口径，不阻断装载）。\n+    pub deferred_cards: usize,\n+    pub seed: u64,\n+    pub seats: u8,\n+    /// 合并后目录卡牌数。\n+    pub catalog_cards: usize,\n+    /// 纯标准目录卡牌数（对照基线）。\n+    pub base_catalog_cards: usize,\n+    /// 合并后目录武将数（T13 武将包产品面）。\n+    pub catalog_generals: usize,\n+    /// 纯标准目录武将数（对照基线）。\n+    pub base_catalog_generals: usize,\n+    /// 实际驱动步数（每次规划/应用记一步）。\n+    pub steps: u64,\n+    /// 是否到达终局。\n+    pub finished: bool,\n+    /// 终局胜利方（Debug 语义字符串；未终局为 None）。\n+    pub winner: Option<String>,\n+    /// 驱动器停滞退出（连续拒绝/取消，未终局）。\n+    pub stalled: bool,\n+    /// 建局+驱动实测耗时（毫秒）。\n+    pub elapsed_ms: u128,\n+}\n+\n+/// 安装包 → 装载 → 原生建局 → 有界 AI 驱动。\n+///\n+/// 驱动循环：开放询问的座位优先应答，否则当前回合座位行动；\n+/// 规划经 `BoundedPlanner`（节点预算+时限），应用走主通道。\n+/// 连续 64 步无进展记 `stalled` 退出（诚实口径，不伪装终局）。\n+pub fn create_native_game(\n+    content: &NativeContent,\n+    req: &NativeGameRequest,\n+) -> Result<NativeGameSummary, String> {\n+    let started = std::time::Instant::now();\n+    let mut loaded = Vec::new();\n+    for id in &req.packages {\n+        loaded.push(content.load(id)?);\n+    }\n+    let deferred_cards: usize = loaded.iter().map(|l| l.deferred.len()).sum();\n+    let loaded_ids: Vec<String> = loaded.iter().map(|l| l.package_id.clone()).collect();\n+    let pack_refs: Vec<&ExtensionPack> = loaded.iter().map(|l| &l.pack).collect();\n+\n+    let base_catalog_cards = Engine::new(1, req.seats as usize).catalog().cards.len();\n+    let base_catalog_generals = Engine::new(1, req.seats as usize).catalog().general_count();\n+    let mut e = Engine::new_with_extensions(req.seed, req.seats as usize, &pack_refs)\n+        .map_err(|err| format!(\"原生建局失败: {err:?}\"))?;\n+    let catalog_cards = e.catalog().cards.len();\n+    let catalog_generals = e.catalog().general_count();\n+\n+    // NC05 正式选将（产品入口）：按座位顺序装配；失败整体报错。\n+    for (seat, name) in req.generals.iter().enumerate() {\n+        e.assign_general_named(seat as u8, name)\n+            .map_err(|reason| format!(\"选将失败（座位 {seat} → {name}）: {reason:?}\"))?;\n+    }\n+\n+    let mut steps = 0u64;\n+    let mut since_progress = 0u64;\n+    let mut stalled = false;\n+    if req.max_steps > 0 {\n+        let planner = BoundedPlanner::new(req.planner_nodes)\n+            .with_deadline_ms(50)\n+            .with_lookahead(req.planner_lookahead)\n+            .with_policy_variant(req.planner_variant);\n+        while e.outcome().is_none() && steps < req.max_steps {\n+            let seat = match e.open_choice() {\n+                Some(open) => open.observer,\n+                None => e.turn().current,\n+            };\n+            let plan = e.plan_action(seat, &planner);\n+            match e.apply_plan(&plan) {\n+                Ok(CommandOutcome::Accepted { .. })\n+                | Ok(CommandOutcome::Pending { .. })\n+                | Ok(CommandOutcome::Suspended) => since_progress = 0,\n+                Ok(CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)) => since_progress += 1,\n+                Err(ApplyPlanError::Stale { .. }) => since_progress += 1,\n+                Err(ApplyPlanError::Cancelled) => {\n+                    stalled = true;\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            steps += 1;\n+            if since_progress >= 64 {\n+                stalled = true;\n+                break;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    Ok(NativeGameSummary {\n+        packages: loaded_ids,\n+        deferred_cards,\n+        seed: req.seed,\n+        seats: req.seats,\n+        catalog_cards,\n+        base_catalog_cards,\n+        catalog_generals,\n+        base_catalog_generals,\n+        steps,\n+        finished: e.outcome().is_some(),\n+        winner: e.outcome().map(|o| format!(\"{:?}\", o.winner)),\n+        stalled,\n+        elapsed_ms: started.elapsed().as_millis(),\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+fn load_refs<'a>(\n+    content: &'a NativeContent,\n+    packages: &[String],\n+) -> Result<Vec<LoadedPack>, String> {\n+    let mut loaded = Vec::new();\n+    for id in packages {\n+        loaded.push(content.load(id)?);\n+    }\n+    Ok(loaded)\n+}\n+\n+/// 新对局存档（HTTP `/native/matches`）。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize)]\n+pub struct NativeMatchArchive {\n+    pub packages: Vec<String>,\n+    pub catalog_cards: usize,\n+    pub archive_hex: String,\n+}\n+\n+/// 恢复请求（HTTP `/native/matches/restore`）。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct NativeRestoreRequest {\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub packages: Vec<String>,\n+    pub archive_hex: String,\n+}\n+\n+/// 恢复结果。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize)]\n+pub struct NativeRestoreSummary {\n+    pub catalog_cards: usize,\n+}\n+\n+fn hex_encode(bytes: &[u8]) -> String {\n+    const HEX: &[u8; 16] = b\"0123456789abcdef\";\n+    let mut s = String::with_capacity(bytes.len() * 2);\n+    for b in bytes {\n+        s.push(HEX[(b >> 4) as usize] as char);\n+        s.push(HEX[(b & 0xf) as usize] as char);\n+    }\n+    s\n+}\n+\n+fn hex_decode(s: &str) -> Result<Vec<u8>, String> {\n+    if s.len() % 2 != 0 {\n+        return Err(\"存档十六进制长度须为偶数\".into());\n+    }\n+    s.as_bytes()\n+        .chunks_exact(2)\n+        .map(|pair| {\n+            std::str::from_utf8(pair)\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"非法十六进制: {e}\"))\n+                .and_then(|value| {\n+                    u8::from_str_radix(value, 16).map_err(|e| format!(\"非法十六进制: {e}\"))\n+                })\n+        })\n+        .collect()\n+}\n+\n+/// 安装包进入新对局，并交出 NGSA 字节。调用方用同一包 id 列表恢复。\n+pub fn save_fresh_match(\n+    content: &NativeContent,\n+    packages: &[String],\n+    seed: u64,\n+    seats: u8,\n+) -> Result<(Vec<u8>, usize), String> {\n+    let loaded = load_refs(content, packages)?;\n+    let refs: Vec<&ExtensionPack> = loaded.iter().map(|l| &l.pack).collect();\n+    let engine = Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, seats as usize, &refs)\n+        .map_err(|err| format!(\"原生建局失败: {err:?}\"))?;\n+    let cards = engine.catalog().cards.len();\n+    let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&engine.save());\n+    Ok((bytes, cards))\n+}\n+\n+/// 用已安装包恢复对局。缺包在装载阶段失败；错版或另一包集合在内容锁校验失败。\n+/// 成功时返回恢复后的目录牌数。\n+pub fn restore_match(\n+    content: &NativeContent,\n+    packages: &[String],\n+    bytes: &[u8],\n+) -> Result<usize, String> {\n+    let loaded = load_refs(content, packages)?;\n+    let refs: Vec<&ExtensionPack> = loaded.iter().map(|l| &l.pack).collect();\n+    let snapshot = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(bytes)\n+        .map_err(|err| format!(\"存档解码失败: {err:?}\"))?;\n+    let engine = if refs.is_empty() {\n+        Engine::restore(&snapshot).map_err(|err| format!(\"恢复失败: {err:?}\"))?\n+    } else {\n+        Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &refs)\n+            .map_err(|err| format!(\"恢复失败: {err:?}\"))?\n+    };\n+    Ok(engine.catalog().cards.len())\n+}\n+\n+/// HTTP 建局：安装包进入新对局并返回存档十六进制。\n+pub fn open_native_match(\n+    content: &NativeContent,\n+    packages: &[String],\n+    seed: u64,\n+    seats: u8,\n+) -> Result<NativeMatchArchive, String> {\n+    let (bytes, catalog_cards) = save_fresh_match(content, packages, seed, seats)?;\n+    Ok(NativeMatchArchive {\n+        packages: packages.to_vec(),\n+        catalog_cards,\n+        archive_hex: hex_encode(&bytes),\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+/// HTTP 恢复：同一安装集恢复；缺包或错版返回错误。\n+pub fn restore_native_match(\n+    content: &NativeContent,\n+    req: &NativeRestoreRequest,\n+) -> Result<NativeRestoreSummary, String> {\n+    let bytes = hex_decode(&req.archive_hex)?;\n+    let catalog_cards = restore_match(content, &req.packages, &bytes)?;\n+    Ok(NativeRestoreSummary { catalog_cards })\n+}"},{"sha":"b44563ad811d9607b964cb1e060d7fb4fa66b5a2","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_room_store/journal.rs","status":"added","additions":356,"deletions":0,"changes":356,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Fjournal.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Fjournal.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Fjournal.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,356 @@\n+//! 永久撤销依据与显式提交决定；完整候选并不等于已提交记录。\n+\n+use super::*;\n+\n+#[derive(serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+struct DiskRoom {\n+    #[serde(flatten)]\n+    record: StoredRoom,\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    commit_id: Option<String>,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+enum Phase {\n+    Prepared,\n+    Committed,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]\n+pub(super) struct Journal {\n+    version: u8,\n+    room_id: u64,\n+    commit_id: String,\n+    candidate_hash: String,\n+    previous: Option<String>,\n+    phase: Phase,\n+    checksum: String,\n+}\n+\n+impl Journal {\n+    pub(super) fn prepared(\n+        room_id: u64,\n+        commit_id: String,\n+        candidate: &[u8],\n+        previous: Option<Vec<u8>>,\n+    ) -> Result<Self, String> {\n+        let mut journal = Self {\n+            version: 1,\n+            room_id,\n+            commit_id,\n+            candidate_hash: blake3::hash(candidate).to_hex().to_string(),\n+            previous: previous\n+                .map(String::from_utf8)\n+                .transpose()\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"原确认记录不是 UTF-8: {e}\"))?,\n+            phase: Phase::Prepared,\n+            checksum: String::new(),\n+        };\n+        journal.checksum = journal.digest();\n+        Ok(journal)\n+    }\n+\n+    pub(super) fn committed(&self) -> Self {\n+        let mut committed = self.clone();\n+        committed.phase = Phase::Committed;\n+        committed.checksum = committed.digest();\n+        committed\n+    }\n+\n+    fn digest(&self) -> String {\n+        let mut unsigned = self.clone();\n+        unsigned.checksum.clear();\n+        blake3::hash(&serde_json::to_vec(&unsigned).expect(\"日志仅包含 JSON 数据\"))\n+            .to_hex()\n+            .to_string()\n+    }\n+\n+    fn validate(&self, room_id: u64) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        if self.version != 1 || room_id == 0 || self.room_id != room_id {\n+            return Err(\"提交日志版本或房间号不匹配\".into());\n+        }\n+        if self.digest() != self.checksum {\n+            return Err(\"提交日志校验和不匹配\".into());\n+        }\n+        validate_commit_id(&self.commit_id)?;\n+        if self.candidate_hash.len() != 64\n+            || !self.candidate_hash.bytes().all(|b| b.is_ascii_hexdigit())\n+        {\n+            return Err(\"提交日志候选哈希格式错误\".into());\n+        }\n+        if let Some(previous) = &self.previous {\n+            decode(previous.as_bytes(), room_id)?;\n+        }\n+        Ok(())\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn validate_commit_id(id: &str) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    let parsed = uuid::Uuid::parse_str(id).map_err(|e| format!(\"提交标识格式错误: {e}\"))?;\n+    if parsed.to_string() != id {\n+        return Err(\"提交标识不是规范 UUID\".into());\n+    }\n+    Ok(())\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn encode(record: &StoredRoom, commit_id: &str) -> Result<Vec<u8>, String> {\n+    serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&DiskRoom {\n+        record: record.clone(),\n+        commit_id: Some(commit_id.into()),\n+    })\n+    .map_err(|e| format!(\"序列化失败: {e}\"))\n+}\n+\n+fn disk_room(bytes: &[u8], room_id: u64) -> Result<DiskRoom, String> {\n+    let stored: DiskRoom = serde_json::from_slice(bytes).map_err(|e| format!(\"解析失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    if stored.record.room_id != room_id {\n+        return Err(format!(\n+            \"文件名房间号 {room_id} 与记录 {} 不符\",\n+            stored.record.room_id\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    if let Some(commit_id) = &stored.commit_id {\n+        validate_commit_id(commit_id)?;\n+        if stored.record.checksum.is_empty() {\n+            return Err(\"新格式房间记录缺少校验和\".into());\n+        }\n+    }\n+    if !stored.record.checksum.is_empty()\n+        && state_checksum(&stored.record.state) != stored.record.checksum\n+    {\n+        return Err(\"校验和不匹配\".into());\n+    }\n+    Ok(stored)\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn decode(bytes: &[u8], room_id: u64) -> Result<StoredRoom, String> {\n+    Ok(disk_room(bytes, room_id)?.record)\n+}\n+\n+fn read_optional(path: &Path) -> Result<Option<Vec<u8>>, String> {\n+    match std::fs::symlink_metadata(path) {\n+        Ok(meta) if meta.file_type().is_file() => std::fs::read(path)\n+            .map(Some)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"读取 {} 失败: {e}\", path.display())),\n+        Ok(_) => Err(format!(\"{} 不是普通文件\", path.display())),\n+        Err(e) if e.kind() == std::io::ErrorKind::NotFound => Ok(None),\n+        Err(e) => Err(format!(\"读取 {} 类型失败: {e}\", path.display())),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 返回原确认字节以及是否存在尚未提交的候选；不修改任何恢复证据。\n+pub(super) fn confirmed_bytes(dir: &Path, room_id: u64) -> Result<(Option<Vec<u8>>, bool), String> {\n+    let candidate = read_optional(&dir.join(format!(\"{room_id}.json\")))?;\n+    let Some(bytes) = read_optional(&dir.join(format!(\"{room_id}.json.journal\")))? else {\n+        if let Some(candidate) = &candidate {\n+            if disk_room(candidate, room_id)?.commit_id.is_some() {\n+                return Err(\"新格式房间记录缺少提交日志，拒绝按旧格式恢复\".into());\n+            }\n+        }\n+        return Ok((candidate, false));\n+    };\n+    let journal: Journal =\n+        serde_json::from_slice(&bytes).map_err(|e| format!(\"解析提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+    journal.validate(room_id)?;\n+    match journal.phase {\n+        Phase::Prepared => {\n+            if let Some(candidate) = &candidate {\n+                let is_previous =\n+                    journal.previous.as_deref().map(str::as_bytes) == Some(candidate.as_slice());\n+                if !is_previous {\n+                    if let Ok(stored) = serde_json::from_slice::<DiskRoom>(candidate) {\n+                        if stored.commit_id.as_deref() != Some(&journal.commit_id) {\n+                            return Err(\"候选标识与撤销日志不匹配，拒绝使用陈旧日志\".into());\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+            Ok((journal.previous.map(String::into_bytes), true))\n+        }\n+        Phase::Committed => {\n+            let candidate = candidate.ok_or(\"已提交候选缺失，拒绝回退旧局\")?;\n+            let stored = disk_room(&candidate, room_id)?;\n+            if stored.commit_id.as_deref() != Some(&journal.commit_id)\n+                || blake3::hash(&candidate).to_hex().as_str() != journal.candidate_hash\n+            {\n+                return Err(\"已提交候选与提交日志标识或完整哈希不匹配\".into());\n+            }\n+            Ok((Some(candidate), false))\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn reserve_payload_ids(bytes: &[u8], ids: &mut BTreeSet<u64>) {\n+    if let Ok(value) = serde_json::from_slice::<serde_json::Value>(bytes) {\n+        if let Some(id) = value.get(\"room_id\").and_then(serde_json::Value::as_u64) {\n+            ids.insert(id);\n+        }\n+        if let Some(previous) = value.get(\"previous\").and_then(serde_json::Value::as_str) {\n+            if let Ok(value) = serde_json::from_str::<serde_json::Value>(previous) {\n+                if let Some(id) = value.get(\"room_id\").and_then(serde_json::Value::as_u64) {\n+                    ids.insert(id);\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 旧 Prepared 仍在时先固定原确认正文，防止第二次失败覆盖唯一撤销依据。\n+pub(super) fn reconcile(dir: &Path, room_id: u64, confirmed: Option<&[u8]>) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    let path = dir.join(format!(\"{room_id}.json\"));\n+    if read_optional(&path)?.as_deref() == confirmed {\n+        return Ok(());\n+    }\n+    if let Some(confirmed) = confirmed {\n+        let tmp = dir.join(format!(\"{room_id}.json.{}.tmp\", uuid::Uuid::new_v4()));\n+        let mut owns_temp = false;\n+        let mut visible = false;\n+        let result = (|| -> Result<(), String> {\n+            let mut file = std::fs::OpenOptions::new()\n+                .write(true)\n+                .create_new(true)\n+                .open(&tmp)\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"创建撤销临时文件失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            owns_temp = true;\n+            file.write_all(confirmed)\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"写撤销临时文件失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            file.sync_all()\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"同步撤销临时文件失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            drop(file);\n+            replace_file(&tmp, &path, &mut visible)\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"固定原确认正文失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            #[cfg(not(windows))]\n+            sync_directory(dir).map_err(|e| format!(\"同步撤销目录失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            Ok(())\n+        })();\n+        if result.is_err() && owns_temp && !visible {\n+            if let Err(error) = std::fs::remove_file(tmp) {\n+                return Err(format!(\n+                    \"{}；清理撤销临时文件失败: {error}\",\n+                    result.unwrap_err()\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        result\n+    } else {\n+        std::fs::remove_file(path).map_err(|e| format!(\"撤销首次候选失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        #[cfg(not(windows))]\n+        sync_directory(dir).map_err(|e| format!(\"同步首次候选撤销失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        Ok(())\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn write(\n+    dir: &Path,\n+    journal: &Journal,\n+    #[cfg(test)] fault: Option<StoreFault>,\n+) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    let path = dir.join(format!(\"{}.json.journal\", journal.room_id));\n+    let tmp = dir.join(format!(\n+        \"{}.json.{}.tmp\",\n+        journal.room_id,\n+        uuid::Uuid::new_v4()\n+    ));\n+    let had_journal = path.exists();\n+    let mut created = false;\n+    let mut visible = false;\n+    let result = (|| -> Result<(), String> {\n+        let bytes =\n+            serde_json::to_vec_pretty(journal).map_err(|e| format!(\"序列化提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        let mut file = std::fs::OpenOptions::new()\n+            .write(true)\n+            .create_new(true)\n+            .open(&tmp)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"创建提交日志临时文件失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        created = true;\n+        #[cfg(test)]\n+        if matches!(\n+            (journal.phase, fault),\n+            (Phase::Prepared, Some(StoreFault::PrepareWrite))\n+                | (Phase::Committed, Some(StoreFault::DecisionWrite))\n+        ) {\n+            file.write_all(&bytes[..bytes.len() / 2])\n+                .map_err(|e| format!(\"写提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+            return Err(\"注入：部分写入提交日志失败\".into());\n+        }\n+        file.write_all(&bytes)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"写提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        #[cfg(test)]\n+        if matches!(\n+            (journal.phase, fault),\n+            (Phase::Prepared, Some(StoreFault::PrepareSync))\n+                | (Phase::Committed, Some(StoreFault::DecisionSync))\n+        ) {\n+            return Err(\"注入：同步提交日志失败\".into());\n+        }\n+        file.sync_all()\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"同步提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        drop(file);\n+        replace_file(&tmp, &path, &mut visible).map_err(|e| format!(\"替换提交日志失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        #[cfg(test)]\n+        if matches!(\n+            (journal.phase, fault),\n+            (Phase::Prepared, Some(StoreFault::PrepareDirectorySync))\n+                | (Phase::Committed, Some(StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync))\n+        ) {\n+            return Err(\"注入：替换提交日志后同步目录失败\".into());\n+        }\n+        // 已存在旧 journal 时，prepared 的 rename 即使尚未持久化，崩溃后仍可回退到\n+        // 旧 journal；文件内容已 sync。后续 committed 写入会再同步目录。跳过这次\n+        // 目录 fsync 以减少每个已接受命令的写放大。首次写入、committed 与故障注入\n+        // 仍保留目录同步。\n+        let skip_prepared_dir_sync = matches!(journal.phase, Phase::Prepared) && had_journal;\n+        #[cfg(test)]\n+        let skip_prepared_dir_sync =\n+            skip_prepared_dir_sync && !matches!(fault, Some(StoreFault::PrepareDirectorySync));\n+        #[cfg(not(windows))]\n+        if !skip_prepared_dir_sync {\n+            sync_directory(dir).map_err(|e| format!(\"同步提交日志目录失败: {e}\"))?;\n+        }\n+        Ok(())\n+    })();\n+    result.map_err(|mut error| {\n+        if created && !visible {\n+            if let Err(cleanup) = std::fs::remove_file(&tmp) {\n+                error.push_str(&format!(\"；清理提交日志临时文件失败: {cleanup}\"));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        error\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn valid_checksum_does_not_bypass_version_identity_or_previous_validation() {\n+        let original =\n+            Journal::prepared(7, uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string(), b\"candidate\", None).unwrap();\n+        for mutation in 0..5 {\n+            let mut journal = original.clone();\n+            match mutation {\n+                0 => journal.version = 2,\n+                1 => journal.room_id = 99,\n+                2 => journal.commit_id = \"not-a-uuid\".into(),\n+                3 => journal.candidate_hash = \"too short\".into(),\n+                4 => {\n+                    journal.previous = Some(\n+                        serde_json::to_string(&super::super::tests::record(99, \"wrong room\"))\n+                            .unwrap(),\n+                    )\n+                }\n+                _ => unreachable!(),\n+            }\n+            journal.checksum = journal.digest();\n+            assert!(journal.validate(7).is_err(), \"mutation {mutation}\");\n+        }\n+        let mut bad_previous = original;\n+        let mut previous = super::super::tests::record(7, \"tampered\");\n+        previous.checksum = \"bad checksum\".into();\n+        bad_previous.previous = Some(serde_json::to_string(&previous).unwrap());\n+        bad_previous.checksum = bad_previous.digest();\n+        assert!(bad_previous.validate(7).is_err());\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4b13e03dc61cfa2dec7609292188c4b24dd5ed67","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_room_store/lock.rs","status":"added","additions":155,"deletions":0,"changes":155,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Flock.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Flock.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_room_store%2Flock.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,155 @@\n+//! 原生房间存档目录的**单写者**所有权。\n+//!\n+//! 多实例部署前的最低保证：一个存档目录同时只允许一个服务进程写。锁在\n+//! 进程存续期间持有，崩溃/退出由操作系统关闭句柄释放；因此异常退出后可安全\n+//! 重启，而第二个健康进程会在启动时明确失败，不会各自恢复/覆写同一房间。\n+//!\n+//! - Unix：`flock(LOCK_EX | LOCK_NB)`（advisory，但对本服务的所有写者一致）。\n+//! - Windows：打开锁文件时 `share_mode(0)`，其他进程无法同时打开。\n+//! - 锁文件名为 `.writer.lock`，`scan` 只解析 `<room>.json`，不会当作房间记录。\n+\n+use std::fs::{File, OpenOptions};\n+use std::io::{Seek, SeekFrom, Write};\n+use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\n+\n+/// 进程级独占的存档目录写者锁。\n+#[derive(Debug)]\n+pub struct StoreWriterLock {\n+    path: PathBuf,\n+    _file: File,\n+}\n+\n+impl StoreWriterLock {\n+    /// 取得目录独占锁；已有写者时返回可读错误（调用方应拒绝启动）。\n+    pub fn acquire(dir: impl AsRef<Path>) -> Result<Self, String> {\n+        let dir = dir.as_ref();\n+        std::fs::create_dir_all(dir)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"创建存档目录 {} 失败: {e}\", dir.display()))?;\n+        let path = dir.join(\".writer.lock\");\n+        let mut file = open_lock_file(&path)?;\n+        lock_file(&file, &path)?;\n+        // 仅供诊断；锁的权威性来自 OS 句柄，不依赖文件内容。\n+        file.set_len(0)\n+            .and_then(|_| file.seek(SeekFrom::Start(0)).map(|_| ()))\n+            .and_then(|_| write!(file, \"pid={}\\n\", std::process::id()))\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"写锁文件 {} 失败: {e}\", path.display()))?;\n+        Ok(Self { path, _file: file })\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 锁文件路径（诊断/测试）。\n+    pub fn path(&self) -> &Path {\n+        &self.path\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(unix)]\n+fn open_lock_file(path: &Path) -> Result<File, String> {\n+    OpenOptions::new()\n+        .read(true)\n+        .write(true)\n+        .create(true)\n+        .truncate(false)\n+        .open(path)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"打开锁文件 {} 失败: {e}\", path.display()))\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(unix)]\n+fn lock_file(file: &File, path: &Path) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    use std::os::unix::io::AsRawFd;\n+    const LOCK_EX: i32 = 2;\n+    const LOCK_NB: i32 = 4;\n+    unsafe extern \"C\" {\n+        fn flock(fd: i32, operation: i32) -> i32;\n+    }\n+    // SAFETY: `file` 拥有有效 fd，且在本调用期间保持打开。\n+    let rc = unsafe { flock(file.as_raw_fd(), LOCK_EX | LOCK_NB) };\n+    if rc == 0 {\n+        return Ok(());\n+    }\n+    let error = std::io::Error::last_os_error();\n+    Err(format!(\n+        \"存档目录已有另一个写者（{}）：{}\",\n+        path.display(),\n+        error\n+    ))\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(windows)]\n+fn open_lock_file(path: &Path) -> Result<File, String> {\n+    use std::os::windows::fs::OpenOptionsExt;\n+    OpenOptions::new()\n+        .read(true)\n+        .write(true)\n+        .create(true)\n+        .truncate(false)\n+        // 不允许其他进程/句柄同时打开；进程退出时由 OS 关闭。\n+        .share_mode(0)\n+        .open(path)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"打开锁文件 {} 失败（目录已有写者？）: {e}\", path.display()))\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(windows)]\n+fn lock_file(_file: &File, _path: &Path) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    // 互斥已由 `share_mode(0)` 在打开时建立。\n+    Ok(())\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(all(not(unix), not(windows)))]\n+fn open_lock_file(path: &Path) -> Result<File, String> {\n+    OpenOptions::new()\n+        .read(true)\n+        .write(true)\n+        .create(true)\n+        .truncate(false)\n+        .open(path)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"打开锁文件 {} 失败: {e}\", path.display()))\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(all(not(unix), not(windows)))]\n+fn lock_file(_file: &File, path: &Path) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    Err(format!(\n+        \"当前平台不支持目录排他锁（{}）；拒绝在没有单写者保证时启动\",\n+        path.display()\n+    ))\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn second_writer_is_rejected_until_first_is_dropped() {\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let first = StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()).expect(\"首个写者\");\n+        let error = StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()).expect_err(\"第二写者必须拒绝\");\n+        assert!(error.contains(\"写者\"), \"{error}\");\n+        assert!(first.path().exists());\n+        drop(first);\n+        // 进程内释放后同一目录可重新取得（崩溃重启的等价路径）。\n+        StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()).expect(\"释放后可重新取得\");\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn different_directories_are_independent() {\n+        let a = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let b = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let _a = StoreWriterLock::acquire(a.path()).expect(\"a\");\n+        let _b = StoreWriterLock::acquire(b.path()).expect(\"b\");\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn lock_file_is_not_a_room_record() {\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let _lock = StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()).unwrap();\n+        let store = crate::native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path());\n+        assert!(store.scan().unwrap().records.is_empty());\n+        assert!(store.scan().unwrap().issues.is_empty());\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn empty_lock_content_does_not_block_reacquire() {\n+        let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        std::fs::write(dir.path().join(\".writer.lock\"), b\"stale pid=1\\n\").unwrap();\n+        let _lock = StoreWriterLock::acquire(dir.path()).expect(\"陈旧文件不应阻止启动\");\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"e877bd5d74760b344fb3a61d307bcc9478c10687","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_view.rs","status":"added","additions":370,"deletions":0,"changes":370,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_view.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_view.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_view.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,370 @@\n+//! NC09/NC03 桥接：**原生引擎视图 → 产品协议视图**（`engine-api` 类型）。\n+//!\n+//! 联机房间与客户端目前使用 `engine-api` 的 `ObserverSnapshot`/`LegalAction`\n+//! （旧线 `engine-core` 产出）；原生线使用 `engine-native::view::PlayerView` 与\n+//! 内核权威动作查询。本模块提供**唯一的映射点**，让同一原生会话契约接入产品\n+//! 协议，不要求客户端改类型，也不允许各自再写一套投影规则。\n+//!\n+//! 口径：\n+//! - 座位投影：自己手牌与公开牌区可见，他人手牌仅数量（原生视图保证）；\n+//!   `known_cards` 为这些可见牌附上真实牌面。\n+//! - 观察者：`Spectator` 仅公开信息；可信宿主授予的 `Referee` 使用共享全信息视图；\n+//! - 权威动作：`Engine::legal_actions`（内核校验同源）→ `LegalAction`；\n+//! - 摘要：`Engine::state_hash`（规范摘要）逐字节带上，供客户端比对修订。\n+\n+use engine_api::{\n+    CardKindTag, CardView, CardZoneTag, IdentityTag, LegalAction, MatchOutcome, ObserverKind,\n+    ObserverSnapshot, PlayerId as ApiPlayerId, SeatView, SkillId, SkillView, TurnPhaseTag,\n+};\n+use engine_native::view::{HandView, PlayerView};\n+use engine_native::{Engine, GameAction};\n+\n+/// 房间角色由可信成员记录决定，不能取自客户端自报角色（座位号由 `seat` 给出）。\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]\n+pub enum RoomRole {\n+    /// 入座玩家。\n+    Player,\n+    /// 观战者（公开信息）。\n+    Spectator,\n+    /// 裁判（可信宿主授予；完整隐藏信息）。\n+    Referee,\n+}\n+\n+/// 本人手牌与公开牌区均从已经按观察者过滤的原生视图取得。\n+fn known_cards_for(engine: &Engine, view: &PlayerView) -> Vec<CardView> {\n+    let mut cards = Vec::new();\n+    let mut push = |id, owner, zone| {\n+        let def = &engine.catalog().cards[id as usize];\n+        cards.push(CardView {\n+            id: engine_api::CardId::new(id),\n+            def: Some(kind_code_u32(def.kind)),\n+            suit: Some(match def.suit {\n+                engine_native::catalog::Suit::Spade => engine_api::Suit::Spade,\n+                engine_native::catalog::Suit::Heart => engine_api::Suit::Heart,\n+                engine_native::catalog::Suit::Club => engine_api::Suit::Club,\n+                engine_native::catalog::Suit::Diamond => engine_api::Suit::Diamond,\n+            }),\n+            rank: Some(def.rank),\n+            owner,\n+            zone,\n+            kind: kind_tag(def.kind),\n+        });\n+    };\n+    for card in &view.cards {\n+        use engine_native::snap::PhysicalCardZone as Z;\n+        let zone = match card.zone {\n+            Z::Hand => CardZoneTag::Hand,\n+            Z::Equip => CardZoneTag::Equip,\n+            Z::Judge => CardZoneTag::Judge,\n+            Z::DiscardPile => CardZoneTag::DiscardPile,\n+            Z::Processing => CardZoneTag::Processing,\n+            Z::DrawPile => CardZoneTag::DrawPile,\n+            Z::Removed => CardZoneTag::Removed,\n+            Z::Expansion => CardZoneTag::Expansion,\n+        };\n+        push(\n+            card.id,\n+            card.owner.map(|seat| ApiPlayerId::new(seat as u32 + 1)),\n+            zone,\n+        );\n+    }\n+    cards\n+}\n+\n+fn identity_tag(role: engine_native::state::Role) -> IdentityTag {\n+    match role {\n+        engine_native::state::Role::Lord => IdentityTag::Lord,\n+        engine_native::state::Role::Loyalist => IdentityTag::Loyalist,\n+        engine_native::state::Role::Rebel => IdentityTag::Rebel,\n+        engine_native::state::Role::Traitor => IdentityTag::Renegade,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生牌种 → 协议公开规则类别（未建模者 `Other`，不猜测）。\n+fn kind_tag(kind: engine_native::catalog::CardKind) -> CardKindTag {\n+    use engine_native::catalog::CardKind as K;\n+    match kind {\n+        K::Sha => CardKindTag::Sha,\n+        K::Tao => CardKindTag::Tao,\n+        K::Shan => CardKindTag::Shan,\n+        K::Jiu => CardKindTag::Jiu,\n+        K::FireSha => CardKindTag::ShaFire,\n+        K::LeiSha => CardKindTag::ShaThunder,\n+        _ => CardKindTag::Other,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 牌种码（仅用于 `CardView.def` 的稳定标识）：取牌种在目录枚举中的序号。\n+fn kind_code_u32(kind: engine_native::catalog::CardKind) -> u32 {\n+    // `CardKind` 是 `#[repr(u16)]` 风格枚举：用 `as u16` 得到稳定序号\n+    kind as u16 as u32\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生 `Phase` → 协议 `TurnPhaseTag`。\n+fn phase_tag(p: engine_native::Phase) -> TurnPhaseTag {\n+    match p {\n+        engine_native::Phase::Judge => TurnPhaseTag::Judge,\n+        engine_native::Phase::Draw => TurnPhaseTag::Draw,\n+        engine_native::Phase::Play => TurnPhaseTag::Play,\n+        engine_native::Phase::Discard => TurnPhaseTag::Discard,\n+        engine_native::Phase::End => TurnPhaseTag::End,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 生成该观察者的协议快照（唯一映射点）。\n+pub fn observer_snapshot_for(\n+    engine: &Engine,\n+    role: RoomRole,\n+    seat: Option<ApiPlayerId>,\n+) -> ObserverSnapshot {\n+    let native_seat = native_seat(engine, seat);\n+    let view: PlayerView = match (role, native_seat) {\n+        (RoomRole::Player, Some(p)) => engine.view_for(p),\n+        (RoomRole::Referee, _) => engine.view_referee(),\n+        _ => engine.view_spectator(),\n+    };\n+    let observer = match role {\n+        RoomRole::Player => ObserverKind::Player(seat.unwrap_or(ApiPlayerId::NONE)),\n+        RoomRole::Spectator => ObserverKind::Spectator,\n+        RoomRole::Referee => ObserverKind::Referee,\n+    };\n+    let seats: Vec<SeatView> = view\n+        .players\n+        .iter()\n+        .map(|cell| SeatView {\n+            player: ApiPlayerId::new(cell.seat as u32 + 1),\n+            // 主将槽的武将 def（无将 = 0）——客户端据此显示立绘/名字\n+            character_def: cell.generals[0].as_ref().map(|g| g.def as u32).unwrap_or(0),\n+            generals: std::array::from_fn(|slot| {\n+                cell.generals[slot]\n+                    .as_ref()\n+                    .map(|general| engine_api::GeneralSlotView {\n+                        def: general.def as u32,\n+                        name: general.name.to_owned(),\n+                        faction: format!(\"{:?}\", general.faction).to_lowercase(),\n+                        revealed: cell.revealed_generals[slot],\n+                    })\n+            }),\n+            seat: engine_api::SeatIndex::new(cell.seat),\n+            hp: cell.hp,\n+            max_hp: cell.max_hp,\n+            alive: cell.alive,\n+            turned_over: cell.turned_over,\n+            // 座位仅给手牌数量；授权牌面由 known_cards 提供。\n+            hand_count: match &cell.hand {\n+                HandView::Own(cards) => cards.len() as u32,\n+                HandView::Hidden => cell.hand_count as u32,\n+            },\n+            // 身份可见性：本人、主公（公开）与已死亡者（遗言公开）可见；其余为 None\n+            identity: cell.role.map(identity_tag),\n+            // 技能：以**内核技能实例**为准（不是「目录里有就算在册」）：\n+            // - `def` = 目录定义 id；`id` 同 def（原生 `ActivateSkill{skill: def}` 以此为键，\n+            //   见 `legal_actions_for`——协议注释的「运行时实例 id」在原生即 def）；\n+            // - `enabled` = 实例启用位；`use_count` = `once_used`（0/1，本回合已发动）；\n+            // - `locked` = 无主动形态（`SkillBehavior::activate` 默认 None）→ 视为锁定/被动；\n+            // - `active` = 该实例**当前可被主动发动**（走内核 `is_legal_action` 同源校验）；\n+            // - `view_as` = 原生未建模「视为技」候选面 → 恒 false（**不猜测**，登记待办）。\n+            skills: cell\n+                .skills\n+                .iter()\n+                .filter_map(|name| {\n+                    let def = engine.catalog().skill_by_name(name)?;\n+                    let inst = engine.state_core().skills.get(&(cell.seat, def));\n+                    let enabled = inst.map(|i| i.enabled).unwrap_or(false);\n+                    let use_count = inst.map(|i| u32::from(i.once_used)).unwrap_or(0);\n+                    let active = enabled\n+                        && engine\n+                            .is_legal_action(cell.seat, &GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill: def });\n+                    // 主动形态判定：该实例当前能否被 `ActivateSkill` 接受（`active` 已表达）；\n+                    // `locked` 取「无主动形态」的保守口径：当前不可主动且未启用主动例外。\n+                    let locked = !active;\n+                    Some(SkillView {\n+                        id: SkillId::new(def as u32),\n+                        def: def as u32,\n+                        enabled,\n+                        use_count,\n+                        active,\n+                        view_as: false,\n+                        locked,\n+                    })\n+                })\n+                .collect(),\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    // 原生 outcome 只有胜者座位；协议 `MatchOutcome` 为身份局语义枚举。\n+    // 未终局 → InProgress；终局 → 按原生胜者映射（非身份局按 Loyalist/Rebel 语义\n+    // 无法判定时用 `LoyalistWin` 占位是**不诚实**的，故统一用 `InProgress` 之外\n+    // 的可表达项：见下方 TODO 注释与证据 README「未覆盖」。\n+    let outcome = match engine.outcome() {\n+        None => MatchOutcome::InProgress,\n+        Some(o) => match o.winner {\n+            // 原型/单挑：唯一存活者\n+            engine_native::Winner::Player(p) => MatchOutcome::SingleWin {\n+                player: ApiPlayerId::new(p as u32 + 1),\n+            },\n+            engine_native::Winner::LordSide => MatchOutcome::LoyalistWin,\n+            engine_native::Winner::Rebels => MatchOutcome::RebelWin,\n+            engine_native::Winner::Traitor => {\n+                // 内奸胜：取仍存活的座位（通常唯一）\n+                let renegade = (0..engine.state_core().players.len() as u8)\n+                    .find(|s| engine.state_core().player(*s).alive)\n+                    .unwrap_or(0);\n+                MatchOutcome::RenegadeWin {\n+                    player: ApiPlayerId::new(renegade as u32 + 1),\n+                }\n+            }\n+            engine_native::Winner::Faction(f) => MatchOutcome::GroupWin {\n+                group: format!(\"{f:?}\").to_lowercase(),\n+            },\n+            engine_native::Winner::Versus(_)\n+            | engine_native::Winner::Doudizhu { .. }\n+            | engine_native::Winner::Boss { .. } => {\n+                // 协议枚举无对应项：**不猜测**，保持 InProgress 并在证据中登记\n+                MatchOutcome::InProgress\n+            }\n+        },\n+    };\n+    ObserverSnapshot {\n+        revision: engine.revision(),\n+        state_hash: engine.state_hash(),\n+        observer,\n+        round: view.round,\n+        current_player: ApiPlayerId::new(view.turn as u32 + 1),\n+        phase: phase_tag(view.phase),\n+        seats,\n+        known_cards: known_cards_for(engine, &view),\n+        outcome,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn native_seat(engine: &Engine, seat: Option<ApiPlayerId>) -> Option<u8> {\n+    let seat = seat?.raw().checked_sub(1)?;\n+    (seat < engine.state_core().players.len() as u32).then(|| seat as u8)\n+}\n+\n+impl From<engine_protocol::ClientRole> for RoomRole {\n+    fn from(role: engine_protocol::ClientRole) -> Self {\n+        match role {\n+            engine_protocol::ClientRole::Player => Self::Player,\n+            engine_protocol::ClientRole::Spectator => Self::Spectator,\n+            engine_protocol::ClientRole::Referee => Self::Referee,\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Full options for the owner or trusted referee; role always comes from membership.\n+pub fn choice_for(\n+    engine: &Engine,\n+    role: RoomRole,\n+    seat: Option<ApiPlayerId>,\n+) -> Option<engine_api::ChoiceRequest> {\n+    let view = match role {\n+        RoomRole::Player => engine.choice_view_for(Some(native_seat(engine, seat)?)),\n+        RoomRole::Referee => engine.choice_view_referee(),\n+        RoomRole::Spectator => return None,\n+    }?;\n+    let engine_native::view::ChoiceView::Own {\n+        id,\n+        kind,\n+        options,\n+        min,\n+        max,\n+        allow_cancel,\n+        prompt,\n+        source_skill,\n+    } = view\n+    else {\n+        return None;\n+    };\n+    let observer = ApiPlayerId::new(engine.open_choice()?.observer as u32 + 1);\n+    // 协议 `ChoiceOption` 是 `{token, label_key}` 二元组（token 即 ResolveChoice 的\n+    // 选择值；label_key 只用于本地化/显示，不参与规则）。token 与原生选项一一对应：\n+    // 使用**候选下标**（与前端适配层/`answer()` 同口径），label_key 保留语义标签。\n+    let options: Vec<engine_api::ChoiceOption> = options\n+        .iter()\n+        .enumerate()\n+        .map(|(idx, opt)| engine_api::ChoiceOption {\n+            token: idx as u32,\n+            label_key: match opt {\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Confirm => \"confirm\".to_string(),\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Pass => \"pass\".to_string(),\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Card(c) => format!(\"card:{c}\"),\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Player(p) => format!(\"player:{}\", *p as u32 + 1),\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Tag(t) => format!(\"tag:{t}\"),\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Skill(s) => {\n+                    format!(\"skill:{}\", engine.catalog().skill_name(*s))\n+                }\n+                engine_native::ChoiceOption::Kind(k) => format!(\"kind:{k}\"),\n+            },\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    Some(engine_api::ChoiceRequest {\n+        choice_id: engine_api::ChoiceId::new(id as u32),\n+        observer,\n+        options,\n+        continuation_id: id,\n+        kind: if prompt == \"trigger_order\" {\n+            engine_api::ChoiceKind::OrderTriggers\n+        } else {\n+            engine_api::choice_kind_from_native(engine_native::view::choice_kind_name(kind))\n+                .expect(\"canonical native choice kind\")\n+        },\n+        native_kind: Some(engine_native::view::choice_kind_name(kind).to_owned()),\n+        source_skill: source_skill.map(str::to_owned),\n+        prompt: Some(prompt.to_owned()),\n+        min_count: min as u8,\n+        max_count: max as u8,\n+        allow_cancel,\n+        timeout_policy: engine_api::TimeoutPolicy::None,\n+        deadline_unix_ms: None,\n+        revision: engine.revision(),\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+/// 权威动作 → 协议动作（只映射本内核可表达的形态；未覆盖形态见待办）。\n+pub fn legal_actions_for(engine: &Engine, seat: ApiPlayerId) -> Vec<LegalAction> {\n+    let Some(seat_u8) = native_seat(engine, Some(seat)) else {\n+        return Vec::new();\n+    };\n+    engine\n+        .legal_actions(seat_u8)\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter_map(|a| match a {\n+            GameAction::NextPhase => Some(LegalAction::EndPhase),\n+            GameAction::PlayCard { card, targets } => Some(LegalAction::PlayCard {\n+                card: engine_api::CardId::new(card as u32),\n+                targets: targets\n+                    .iter()\n+                    .map(|t| ApiPlayerId::new(*t as u32 + 1))\n+                    .collect(),\n+            }),\n+            GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection,\n+            } => Some(LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                choice_id: engine_api::ChoiceId::new(choice_id as u32),\n+                selections: selection\n+                    .iter()\n+                    .map(|opt| {\n+                        engine\n+                            .open_choice()?\n+                            .spec\n+                            .options\n+                            .iter()\n+                            .position(|candidate| candidate == opt)\n+                            .map(|idx| idx as u32)\n+                    })\n+                    .collect::<Option<Vec<_>>>()?,\n+                cancelled: selection.is_empty(),\n+            }),\n+            // 主动技/明置：协议需要运行时技能实例 id 与目标/牌输入，原生候选未展开\n+            // 这些形态（NC10 待办），此处不伪造映射。\n+            GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill } => Some(LegalAction::ActivateSkill {\n+                skill: engine_api::SkillId::new(skill as u32),\n+                targets: Vec::new(),\n+                card_targets: Vec::new(),\n+            }),\n+            GameAction::RevealGeneral { .. } | GameAction::TimeoutAction { .. } => None,\n+        })\n+        .collect()\n+}"},{"sha":"ff5fe7cc6b29686dff5f9a489db8b54d7bbcd03e","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e.rs","status":"added","additions":945,"deletions":0,"changes":945,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,945 @@\n+//! Production native rooms over loopback TCP/WebSocket, including restart and content locks.\n+\n+mod authority;\n+mod c331;\n+mod commit_crash;\n+mod double_failure;\n+mod durability;\n+mod referee;\n+mod source_skill;\n+\n+use super::{bootstrap, build_router, config::ServerConfig, lobby::Lobby};\n+use engine_api::{\n+    ChoiceRequest, Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey,\n+    LegalAction, ObserverKind, ObserverSnapshot, PlayerId, RejectReason,\n+};\n+use engine_protocol::{\n+    decode_s2c, encode_c2s, ClientMessage, ClientRole, ErrorCode, MessageHeader, ServerMessage,\n+};\n+use futures_util::{SinkExt, StreamExt};\n+use std::{path::Path, sync::Arc, time::Duration};\n+use tokio::{net::TcpStream, task::JoinHandle};\n+use tokio_tungstenite::{tungstenite::Message, MaybeTlsStream, WebSocketStream};\n+use tower_http::services::ServeDir;\n+\n+const PASSWORD: &str = \"native-ws-test-password\";\n+const SEED: u64 = 424_242;\n+\n+struct Server {\n+    url: String,\n+    lobby: Arc<Lobby>,\n+    task: JoinHandle<()>,\n+}\n+\n+impl Server {\n+    async fn start(cfg: &ServerConfig, restored: usize) -> Self {\n+        let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\")\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"bind loopback\");\n+        Self::start_on(cfg, restored, listener).await\n+    }\n+\n+    async fn start_on(\n+        cfg: &ServerConfig,\n+        restored: usize,\n+        listener: tokio::net::TcpListener,\n+    ) -> Self {\n+        let lobby = bootstrap(cfg);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            lobby.restore_native_rooms().expect(\"restore rooms\"),\n+            restored\n+        );\n+        let app = build_router(lobby.clone(), ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+        let url = format!(\"ws://{}/ws\", listener.local_addr().unwrap());\n+        let task = tokio::spawn(async move { axum::serve(listener, app).await.unwrap() });\n+        Self { url, lobby, task }\n+    }\n+\n+    async fn stop(mut self) {\n+        self.task.abort();\n+        let _ = (&mut self.task).await;\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl Drop for Server {\n+    fn drop(&mut self) {\n+        self.task.abort();\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+struct Peer {\n+    ws: WebSocketStream<MaybeTlsStream<TcpStream>>,\n+    room: u64,\n+    player: PlayerId,\n+    token: String,\n+    seq: u64,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]\n+struct State {\n+    view: ObserverSnapshot,\n+    legal: Vec<LegalAction>,\n+    choice: Option<ChoiceRequest>,\n+}\n+\n+impl State {\n+    fn from_message(message: ServerMessage) -> Self {\n+        match message {\n+            ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+                view,\n+                legal_actions,\n+                choice,\n+                ..\n+            }\n+            | ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                view,\n+                legal_actions,\n+                choice,\n+                ..\n+            }\n+            | ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                view,\n+                legal_actions,\n+                choice,\n+                ..\n+            } => Self {\n+                view,\n+                legal: legal_actions,\n+                choice,\n+            },\n+            other => panic!(\"expected personalized state, got {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn assert_player(&self, player: PlayerId) {\n+        assert_eq!(self.view.observer, ObserverKind::Player(player));\n+        let hand: Vec<_> = self\n+            .view\n+            .known_cards\n+            .iter()\n+            .filter(|card| card.zone == engine_api::CardZoneTag::Hand)\n+            .collect();\n+        assert!(hand.iter().all(|card| card.owner == Some(player)));\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            hand.len() as u32,\n+            self.view\n+                .seats\n+                .iter()\n+                .find(|seat| seat.player == player)\n+                .unwrap()\n+                .hand_count\n+        );\n+        assert!(self.view.known_cards.iter().all(|card| {\n+            card.def.is_some()\n+                && card.suit.is_some()\n+                && card.rank.is_some()\n+                && matches!(\n+                    card.zone,\n+                    engine_api::CardZoneTag::Hand\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::Equip\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::Judge\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::DiscardPile\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::Processing\n+                )\n+        }));\n+        if let Some(choice) = &self.choice {\n+            assert_eq!(choice.observer, player);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    fn assert_spectator(&self) {\n+        assert_eq!(self.view.observer, ObserverKind::Spectator);\n+        assert!(self.view.known_cards.iter().all(|card| {\n+            card.def.is_some()\n+                && card.suit.is_some()\n+                && card.rank.is_some()\n+                && matches!(\n+                    card.zone,\n+                    engine_api::CardZoneTag::Equip\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::Judge\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::DiscardPile\n+                        | engine_api::CardZoneTag::Processing\n+                )\n+        }));\n+        assert!(self.legal.is_empty());\n+        assert!(self.choice.is_none());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+mod peer;\n+\n+fn config(base: &Path) -> ServerConfig {\n+    let mut cfg = ServerConfig::default();\n+    cfg.original_content_root = base.join(\"original\");\n+    cfg.extensions_root = base.join(\"legacy-extensions\");\n+    cfg.content_store_root = base.join(\"legacy-store\");\n+    cfg.native_packages_root =\n+        Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\");\n+    cfg.native_store_root = base.join(\"native-store\");\n+    cfg.native_room_store = base.join(\"rooms\").to_str().unwrap().to_owned();\n+    cfg.native_rooms = true;\n+    cfg.native_room_packages = vec![\"shahai-swd\".into(), \"wudian\".into()];\n+    cfg.max_cmds_per_sec = 1000;\n+    for path in [&cfg.original_content_root, &cfg.extensions_root] {\n+        std::fs::create_dir_all(path).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    cfg\n+}\n+\n+fn local_config(base: &Path) -> ServerConfig {\n+    let mut cfg = config(base);\n+    let source = cfg.native_packages_root.clone();\n+    cfg.native_packages_root = base.join(\"packages\");\n+    for package in [\"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\", \"wudian-upstream-noname\"] {\n+        copy_directory(\n+            &source.join(package),\n+            &cfg.native_packages_root.join(package),\n+        );\n+    }\n+    cfg\n+}\n+\n+fn disable_packages(cfg: &ServerConfig) {\n+    for entry in std::fs::read_dir(&cfg.native_packages_root).unwrap() {\n+        let path = entry.unwrap().path().join(\"manifest.json\");\n+        let mut descriptor: serde_json::Value =\n+            serde_json::from_slice(&std::fs::read(&path).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        descriptor[\"enabled\"] = serde_json::json!(false);\n+        std::fs::write(path, serde_json::to_vec(&descriptor).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    let content = super::native::NativeContent::open(\n+        cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+        cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .is_err());\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&cfg.native_store_root).unwrap();\n+    assert!(store.current_lock().unwrap().packages.is_empty());\n+    std::fs::remove_dir_all(cfg.native_store_root.join(\"packages\")).unwrap();\n+}\n+\n+fn assert_synchronized(a: &State, b: &State, spectator: &State) {\n+    a.assert_player(PlayerId::new(1));\n+    b.assert_player(PlayerId::new(2));\n+    spectator.assert_spectator();\n+    for state in [b, spectator] {\n+        assert_eq!(state.view.revision, a.view.revision);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            state.view.state_hash, a.view.state_hash,\n+            \"authority hash is shared\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(state.view.current_player, a.view.current_player);\n+        assert_eq!(state.view.phase, a.view.phase);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn runtime() -> tokio::runtime::Runtime {\n+    tokio::runtime::Builder::new_multi_thread()\n+        .worker_threads(4)\n+        .enable_all()\n+        .build()\n+        .unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_reconnects_after_disk_restart() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    // Dropping each runtime joins its workers before another bootstrap can write the same store.\n+    let (room, tokens, before_a, before_b, before_spectator, saved_hex, initial_hash) = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial_a = a.create().await;\n+        let initial_hash = initial_a.view.state_hash;\n+        let content = super::native::NativeContent::open(\n+            cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+            cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+        let swd = content\n+            .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let wudian = content\n+            .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"wudian\")\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let expected =\n+            engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(SEED, 2, &[&swd.pack, &wudian.pack]).unwrap();\n+        let standard = engine_native::Engine::new(SEED, 2);\n+        assert!(expected.catalog().cards.len() > standard.catalog().cards.len());\n+        assert!(expected.view_for(1).deck_count > standard.view_for(1).deck_count);\n+        assert_ne!(\n+            expected.state_hash(),\n+            standard.state_hash(),\n+            \"extensions change actual initial state\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            initial_a.view.state_hash,\n+            expected.state_hash(),\n+            \"WS authority uses the real extension deck\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            initial_a\n+                .view\n+                .known_cards\n+                .iter()\n+                .map(|card| card.id.raw())\n+                .collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+            expected\n+                .state_core()\n+                .player(0)\n+                .hand\n+                .iter()\n+                .map(|card| *card as u32)\n+                .collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+            \"real shuffled extension hand reaches the socket projection\"\n+        );\n+        assert!(initial_a.legal.contains(&LegalAction::EndPhase));\n+        let room = a.room;\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial_b = b.join(room, 1, None).await;\n+        assert!(\n+            initial_b.legal.is_empty(),\n+            \"other seat cannot advance this turn\"\n+        );\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial_spectator = spectator.spectate(room).await;\n+        assert_synchronized(&initial_a, &initial_b, &initial_spectator);\n+\n+        let mut intruder = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        intruder\n+            .send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                room_id: room,\n+                password: \"wrong-password\".into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+                reconnect_token: Some(a.token.clone()),\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        intruder.error(ErrorCode::Unauthorized).await;\n+        intruder.close().await;\n+\n+        let (spoofed, unchanged) = b.submit(a.player, initial_a.view.revision, 100, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(spoofed, CommandResult::Rejected { .. }),\n+            \"non-turn connection must not control A\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(unchanged.view.revision, initial_b.view.revision);\n+        assert_eq!(unchanged.view.state_hash, initial_b.view.state_hash);\n+\n+        let mut latest = initial_a;\n+        for key in [101, 102, 103] {\n+            assert!(latest.legal.contains(&LegalAction::EndPhase));\n+            let before = latest.view.revision;\n+            let (result, state) = a.submit(b.player, before, key, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, state_hash }\n+                if new_revision > before && new_revision == state.view.revision && state_hash == state.view.state_hash)\n+            );\n+            let pushed_b = b.pushed(key).await;\n+            let pushed_spectator = spectator.pushed(key).await;\n+            assert_synchronized(&state, &pushed_b, &pushed_spectator);\n+            latest = state;\n+        }\n+        assert!(latest.view.revision >= 3);\n+        let choice = latest.choice.as_ref().expect(\"EndPhase into Discard opens a real choice\");\n+        assert_eq!(choice.min_count, 2, \"six drawn cards require discarding two at hp four\");\n+        assert_eq!(choice.observer, a.player);\n+        for (index, option) in choice.options.iter().enumerate() {\n+            assert_eq!(option.token, index as u32, \"wire answers use option indices\");\n+        }\n+        let answers: Vec<_> = latest.legal.iter().filter_map(|action| match action {\n+            LegalAction::ResolveChoice { choice_id, selections, cancelled: false } => {\n+                assert_eq!(*choice_id, choice.choice_id);\n+                assert!(selections.len() >= choice.min_count as usize);\n+                assert!(selections.len() <= choice.max_count as usize);\n+                assert!(selections.iter().all(|token| choice.options.iter().any(|option| option.token == *token)));\n+                Some(action)\n+            }\n+            _ => None,\n+        }).collect();\n+        assert!(!answers.is_empty(), \"owner receives a usable authoritative answer\");\n+        let (stale, unchanged) = a.submit(a.player, 1, 104, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(stale, CommandResult::Rejected {\n+            reason: RejectReason::StaleRevision { current, expected: 1 }\n+        } if current == latest.view.revision));\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            unchanged, latest,\n+            \"stale command must not mutate personalized state\"\n+        );\n+\n+        a.seq += 1;\n+        let stale_sequence = a.seq;\n+        a.send(ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(room, stale_sequence, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: a.player,\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(1),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(106),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(106),\n+        replay: false,\n+}).await;\n+        let stale_body = a.until(|message| matches!(message,\n+            ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { header, .. } if header.conn_seq == stale_sequence\n+        )).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(&stale_body, ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            result: CommandResult::Rejected { reason: RejectReason::StaleRevision { current, expected: 1 } }, ..\n+        } if *current == latest.view.revision), \"an unspecified header must preserve the body's expected revision\");\n+        assert_eq!(State::from_message(stale_body), latest);\n+\n+        let before_a = a.snapshot().await;\n+        assert_eq!(before_a, latest, \"snapshot preserves the complete pending choice\");\n+        let before_b = b.snapshot().await;\n+        let before_spectator = spectator.snapshot().await;\n+        assert_synchronized(&before_a, &before_b, &before_spectator);\n+        assert!(before_b.choice.is_none() && before_b.legal.is_empty(), \"personal barrier stays with its owner\");\n+        let tokens = [a.token.clone(), b.token.clone()];\n+        let stored = super::native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store)\n+            .load_all()\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(stored.len(), 1);\n+        assert_eq!(stored[0].state.pack_refs.len(), 2);\n+        for package in [\"shahai-swd\", \"wudian\"] {\n+            assert!(stored[0]\n+                .state\n+                .pack_refs\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|reference| reference.contains(package)));\n+        }\n+        assert!(!stored[0].password_hash.is_empty());\n+        assert_ne!(stored[0].password_hash, PASSWORD);\n+        a.close().await;\n+        b.close().await;\n+        spectator.close().await;\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        (room, tokens, before_a, before_b, before_spectator, stored[0].state.snapshot_hex.clone(), initial_hash)\n+    });\n+\n+    disable_packages(&cfg);\n+    for phase in [\"disabled\", \"same-version-repacked\", \"upgraded\"] {\n+        if phase != \"disabled\" {\n+            upgrade_packages(\n+                &cfg,\n+                if phase == \"upgraded\" {\n+                    \"1.1.0\"\n+                } else {\n+                    \"1.0.0\"\n+                },\n+            );\n+        }\n+        runtime().block_on(async {\n+            let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+            let mut a = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+            assert_eq!(a.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[0].clone())).await, before_a);\n+            assert_eq!(a.token, tokens[0]);\n+            let mut b = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+            assert_eq!(b.join(room, 1, Some(tokens[1].clone())).await, before_b);\n+            assert_eq!(b.token, tokens[1]);\n+            let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+            assert_eq!(spectator.spectate(room).await, before_spectator);\n+            if phase != \"upgraded\" {\n+                println!(\"NATIVE_WS frozen_restore=pass packages={phase} choice=pending\");\n+                a.close().await;\n+                b.close().await;\n+                spectator.close().await;\n+                restarted.stop().await;\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            let content = super::native::NativeContent::open(\n+                cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+                cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+            )\n+            .unwrap();\n+            let swd = content\n+                .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+                .unwrap();\n+            let wudian = content\n+                .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"wudian\")\n+                .unwrap();\n+            assert!(swd.pack.def.name.contains(\"1.1.0\"));\n+            let expected =\n+                engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(SEED, 2, &[&swd.pack, &wudian.pack])\n+                    .unwrap();\n+            let mut new_game = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+            let upgraded_initial = new_game.create().await;\n+            assert_ne!(new_game.room, room);\n+            assert_eq!(upgraded_initial.view.state_hash, expected.state_hash());\n+            assert_ne!(\n+                upgraded_initial.view.state_hash, initial_hash,\n+                \"new rooms must use the changed active version rather than the old frozen copy\"\n+            );\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                a.snapshot().await,\n+                before_a,\n+                \"new active content must not change the restored room\"\n+            );\n+            new_game.close().await;\n+\n+            let answer = before_a\n+                .legal\n+                .iter()\n+                .find(|action| {\n+                    matches!(\n+                        action,\n+                        LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                            cancelled: false,\n+                            ..\n+                        }\n+                    )\n+                })\n+                .expect(\"restored authoritative answer\");\n+            let command = answer.to_command(a.player, before_a.view.revision);\n+            let (result, after) = a\n+                .submit(a.player, before_a.view.revision, 105, command.kind)\n+                .await;\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. }\n+        if new_revision > before_a.view.revision)\n+            );\n+            let pushed_b = b.pushed(105).await;\n+            let pushed_spectator = spectator.pushed(105).await;\n+            assert_synchronized(&after, &pushed_b, &pushed_spectator);\n+            assert_ne!(\n+                super::native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store)\n+                    .load_all()\n+                    .unwrap()[0]\n+                    .state\n+                    .snapshot_hex,\n+                saved_hex,\n+                \"continued WS command must reach disk\"\n+            );\n+            println!(\n+                \"NATIVE_WS lifecycle=pass real_packages=shahai-swd,wudian revision={} restored=1\",\n+                after.view.revision\n+            );\n+            a.close().await;\n+            b.close().await;\n+            spectator.close().await;\n+            restarted.stop().await;\n+        });\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn copy_directory(from: &Path, to: &Path) {\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(to).unwrap();\n+    for entry in std::fs::read_dir(from).unwrap() {\n+        let entry = entry.unwrap();\n+        let destination = to.join(entry.file_name());\n+        if entry.file_type().unwrap().is_dir() {\n+            copy_directory(&entry.path(), &destination);\n+        } else {\n+            std::fs::copy(entry.path(), destination).unwrap();\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn change_package(root: &Path, version: &str) {\n+    let directory = root.join(\"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\");\n+    let cards_path = directory.join(\"assets/cards.json\");\n+    let mut cards: serde_json::Value =\n+        serde_json::from_slice(&std::fs::read(&cards_path).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    let original_rank = cards[\"cards\"][0][\"rank\"].as_u64().unwrap();\n+    cards[\"cards\"][0][\"rank\"] = serde_json::json!(original_rank % 13 + 1);\n+    cards[\"cards\"]\n+        .as_array_mut()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .push(serde_json::json!({\n+            \"name\": \"swd_ws_upgraded_hufu\", \"kind\": \"hufu\", \"suit\": \"club\", \"rank\": 13\n+        }));\n+    let cards = serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&cards).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(cards_path, &cards).unwrap();\n+    let manifest_path = directory.join(\"package.npack.json\");\n+    let mut package =\n+        content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&std::fs::read(&manifest_path).unwrap())\n+            .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(package.manifest.version, \"1.0.0\");\n+    package.manifest.version = version.into();\n+    let asset = package\n+        .asset_paths\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|(_, path)| path.as_str() == \"assets/cards.json\")\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .0\n+        .clone();\n+    package\n+        .asset_manifest\n+        .as_mut()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .entries\n+        .iter_mut()\n+        .find(|entry| entry.asset_id == asset)\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .source_hash = *blake3::hash(&cards).as_bytes();\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+    package.validate().unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(manifest_path, package.to_json_bytes().unwrap()).unwrap();\n+}\n+\n+fn upgrade_packages(cfg: &ServerConfig, version: &str) {\n+    let original = Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\");\n+    for package in [\"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\", \"wudian-upstream-noname\"] {\n+        let target = cfg.native_packages_root.join(package);\n+        std::fs::remove_dir_all(&target).unwrap();\n+        copy_directory(&original.join(package), &target);\n+    }\n+    change_package(&cfg.native_packages_root, version);\n+    let content = super::native::NativeContent::open(\n+        cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+        cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let lock = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&cfg.native_store_root)\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .current_lock()\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(lock\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|package| package.package_id == \"shahai-swd\" && package.version == version));\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_fails_closed_for_invalid_frozen_content() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    let (room, token, record) = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        a.create().await;\n+        let room = a.room;\n+        let token = a.token.clone();\n+        let record_path = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\"));\n+        let record: serde_json::Value =\n+            serde_json::from_slice(&std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            record[\"state\"][\"frozen_packages\"].as_array().unwrap().len(),\n+            2\n+        );\n+        a.close().await;\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        (room, token, record)\n+    });\n+\n+    for failure in [\n+        \"package-tampered\",\n+        \"asset-tampered\",\n+        \"asset-missing\",\n+        \"copy-missing\",\n+        \"wrong-lock\",\n+        \"old-lock-without-copy\",\n+        \"revoked-hash\",\n+        \"revoked-slot\",\n+    ] {\n+        let base = directory.path().join(failure);\n+        let has_active = matches!(\n+            failure,\n+            \"package-tampered\" | \"asset-tampered\" | \"asset-missing\" | \"copy-missing\" | \"wrong-lock\"\n+        );\n+        let mut variant = if has_active {\n+            local_config(&base)\n+        } else {\n+            config(&base)\n+        };\n+        if !has_active {\n+            variant.native_packages_root = base.join(\"packages\");\n+            std::fs::create_dir_all(&variant.native_packages_root).unwrap();\n+        }\n+        let mut damaged = record.clone();\n+        let copies = damaged[\"state\"][\"frozen_packages\"].as_array_mut().unwrap();\n+        let binding = copies[0][\"binding\"].clone();\n+        match failure {\n+            \"package-tampered\" => {\n+                let json = copies[0][\"package_json\"].as_str().unwrap().to_owned() + \" \";\n+                copies[0][\"package_json\"] = serde_json::json!(json);\n+            }\n+            \"asset-tampered\" => {\n+                let bytes = copies[0][\"assets\"]\n+                    .as_object_mut()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .values_mut()\n+                    .next()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .as_array_mut()\n+                    .unwrap();\n+                bytes[0] = serde_json::json!(bytes[0].as_u64().unwrap() ^ 1);\n+            }\n+            \"asset-missing\" => {\n+                copies[0][\"assets\"] = serde_json::json!({});\n+            }\n+            \"copy-missing\" => {\n+                copies.clear();\n+            }\n+            \"wrong-lock\" => {\n+                let mut hash = copies[0][\"binding\"][\"content_hash\"]\n+                    .as_str()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .to_owned();\n+                hash.replace_range(..1, if &hash[..1] == \"0\" { \"1\" } else { \"0\" });\n+                copies[0][\"binding\"][\"content_hash\"] = serde_json::json!(hash);\n+            }\n+            \"old-lock-without-copy\" => {\n+                damaged[\"state\"]\n+                    .as_object_mut()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .remove(\"frozen_packages\");\n+            }\n+            \"revoked-hash\" | \"revoked-slot\" => {\n+                let store =\n+                    content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&variant.native_store_root).unwrap();\n+                if failure == \"revoked-hash\" {\n+                    let hash = binding[\"content_hash\"].as_str().unwrap();\n+                    store\n+                        .revoke_content_hash(hash, \"WS frozen regression\", true)\n+                        .unwrap();\n+                } else {\n+                    store\n+                        .revoke_slot(\n+                            binding[\"namespace\"].as_str().unwrap(),\n+                            binding[\"package_id\"].as_str().unwrap(),\n+                            \"WS frozen regression\",\n+                            true,\n+                        )\n+                        .unwrap();\n+                }\n+            }\n+            _ => unreachable!(),\n+        }\n+        let record_path = Path::new(&variant.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\"));\n+        // 内容策略反例须先通过存储完整性，避免仅因缺少提交日志而被拒绝。\n+        let storage = super::native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(&variant.native_room_store);\n+        storage\n+            .save(&serde_json::from_value(damaged).unwrap())\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            storage.load_all().unwrap().len(),\n+            1,\n+            \"storage-valid {failure}\"\n+        );\n+        let bytes = std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap();\n+        runtime().block_on(async {\n+            let unavailable = Server::start(&variant, 0).await;\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap(),\n+                bytes,\n+                \"failed restore must preserve the save ({failure})\"\n+            );\n+            let mut peer = Peer::connect(&unavailable).await;\n+            peer.send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                room_id: room,\n+                password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+                reconnect_token: Some(token.clone()),\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+            peer.error(ErrorCode::RoomNotFound).await;\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                unavailable.lobby.stats().active_rooms,\n+                0,\n+                \"no fallback room\"\n+            );\n+            peer.send(ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                players: 2,\n+                seed: SEED,\n+                password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+            if has_active {\n+                peer.join_result().await;\n+                assert_ne!(\n+                    peer.room, room,\n+                    \"valid active copies may create a new room, never replace a broken frozen save\"\n+                );\n+            } else {\n+                peer.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+                assert_eq!(\n+                    unavailable.lobby.stats().active_rooms,\n+                    0,\n+                    \"a frozen save must not activate its packages for a new room\"\n+                );\n+            }\n+            assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap(), bytes);\n+            println!(\"NATIVE_WS frozen_fail_closed={failure} saved_record=preserved\");\n+            peer.close().await;\n+            unavailable.stop().await;\n+        });\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// P1 回归（真 TCP/WS）：旧档无收据的重放必须受控拒绝，不能推进 revision。\n+#[test]\n+fn native_ws_replay_without_receipt_is_rejected() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial = a.create().await;\n+        let before = initial.view.revision;\n+        let (result, state) = a\n+            .submit_replay(a.player, before, 7_777, CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(\n+            result,\n+            CommandResult::Rejected {\n+                reason: engine_api::RejectReason::IllegalAction { ref code }\n+            } if code == \"legacy_replay_no_receipt\"\n+        ));\n+        assert_eq!(state.view.revision, before, \"拒绝不得推进 revision\");\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+/// P1 回归（真 TCP/WS）：一个停止读取的旁观者让出站队列饱和后，房间 actor\n+/// 仍必须继续处理其他玩家的命令；慢连接被断开并可重新同步。\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_slow_spectator_does_not_block_commands() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        // Bound both TCP buffers: an unread loopback socket otherwise fits all broadcasts\n+        // on some OSes, regardless of an artificial delay between writer sends.\n+        let listener = tokio::net::TcpSocket::new_v4().unwrap();\n+        listener.set_send_buffer_size(1024).unwrap();\n+        let send_buffer = listener.send_buffer_size().unwrap();\n+        assert!(send_buffer <= 64 * 1024, \"unexpected TCP send buffer: {send_buffer}\");\n+        listener.bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\".parse().unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        let listener = listener.listen(128).unwrap();\n+        let address = listener.local_addr().unwrap();\n+        let server = Server::start_on(&cfg, 0, listener).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial = a.create().await;\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        b.join(a.room, 1, None).await;\n+        // B 只是占座；持续读掉广播，避免它自己成为慢连接干扰断言。\n+        let b_reader = tokio::spawn(async move {\n+            let mut outcomes = 0;\n+            let mut text_bytes = 0;\n+            while let Some(frame) = b.ws.next().await {\n+                match frame.unwrap() {\n+                    Message::Text(text) => {\n+                        text_bytes += text.len();\n+                        let message = decode_s2c(text.as_ref()).unwrap();\n+                        if let ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { idempotency_key, .. } = &message {\n+                            outcomes += 1;\n+                            State::from_message(message.clone()).assert_player(PlayerId::new(2));\n+                            if idempotency_key.0 == 9999 {\n+                                return (outcomes, text_bytes);\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    Message::Close(_) => break,\n+                    _ => {}\n+                }\n+            }\n+            panic!(\"reading player disconnected before the accepted command\");\n+        });\n+        let socket = tokio::net::TcpSocket::new_v4().unwrap();\n+        socket.set_recv_buffer_size(1024).unwrap();\n+        let recv_buffer = socket.recv_buffer_size().unwrap();\n+        assert!(recv_buffer <= 64 * 1024, \"unexpected TCP receive buffer: {recv_buffer}\");\n+        let stream = socket.connect(address).await.unwrap();\n+        let (ws, response) = tokio_tungstenite::client_async(\n+            &server.url,\n+            MaybeTlsStream::Plain(stream),\n+        ).await.unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(response.status().as_u16(), 101);\n+        let mut slow = Peer::from_ws(ws).await;\n+        slow.spectate(a.room).await.assert_spectator();\n+        let token = slow.token.clone();\n+        let store = super::native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store);\n+        let original_member = store.load_all().unwrap()[0].state.members.iter()\n+            .find(|member| member.reconnect_token == token).unwrap().connection_id;\n+        // From here until the close check, the real Spectator socket is never read.\n+        let mut revision = initial.view.revision;\n+        for key in 1..=300u64 {\n+            let (result, state) = tokio::time::timeout(\n+                Duration::from_secs(3),\n+                a.submit(\n+                    a.player,\n+                    revision,\n+                    key,\n+                    CommandKind::PlayCard {\n+                        card: engine_api::CardId::new(999_999),\n+                        targets: Vec::new(),\n+                        card_targets: Vec::new(),\n+                    },\n+                ),\n+            )\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap_or_else(|_| panic!(\"慢旁观者阻塞了第 {key} 条命令\"));\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Rejected { .. }),\n+                \"无效牌应被拒绝，实得 {result:?}\"\n+            );\n+            revision = state.view.revision;\n+            // A 每命令还会收到名册广播；用短等待排空，保持其队列不因测试\n+            // 自身的读取节奏而饱和。\n+            loop {\n+                match tokio::time::timeout(Duration::from_millis(2), a.ws.next()).await {\n+                    Err(_) => break,\n+                    Ok(Some(Ok(Message::Text(_)))) => {}\n+                    other => panic!(\"active player must remain connected: {other:?}\"),\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        let (accepted, after) = tokio::time::timeout(\n+            Duration::from_secs(3),\n+            a.submit(a.player, revision, 9999, CommandKind::EndPhase),\n+        )\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"慢连接断开后当前玩家仍能推进\");\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(accepted, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            \"{accepted:?}\"\n+        );\n+        // Missing broadcasts plus a real close prove saturation; starting to read a\n+        // merely buffered socket here must not turn the test green.\n+        let mut outcomes = 0;\n+        let mut wire_bytes = 0;\n+        tokio::time::timeout(Duration::from_secs(10), async {\n+            while let Some(frame) = slow.ws.next().await {\n+                match frame {\n+                    Ok(Message::Close(_)) | Err(_) => break,\n+                    Ok(Message::Text(text)) => {\n+                        wire_bytes += text.len();\n+                        let message = decode_s2c(text.as_ref()).unwrap();\n+                        if matches!(message, ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { .. }) {\n+                            State::from_message(message).assert_spectator();\n+                            outcomes += 1;\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    Ok(_) => {}\n+                }\n+            }\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"慢连接应在期限内被断开\");\n+        assert!(outcomes > 0 && outcomes < 301,\n+            \"backpressure must drop broadcasts before reading resumes: {outcomes}\");\n+\n+        let mut reconnected = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let restored = reconnected.join(a.room, 0, Some(token.clone())).await;\n+        restored.assert_spectator();\n+        assert_eq!(restored.view.revision, after.view.revision);\n+        assert_eq!(restored.view.state_hash, after.view.state_hash);\n+        assert_eq!(reconnected.snapshot().await, restored);\n+        let records = store.load_all().unwrap();\n+        let members = &records[0].state.members;\n+        assert_eq!(members.len(), 3, \"reconnect must reclaim the old member\");\n+        assert!(!members.iter().any(|member| member.connection_id == original_member));\n+        assert_eq!(members.iter().filter(|member| member.reconnect_token == token).count(), 1);\n+        reconnected.close().await;\n+        let (healthy_outcomes, healthy_bytes) = tokio::time::timeout(Duration::from_secs(3), b_reader)\n+            .await.expect(\"reading player receives all commands\").unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(healthy_outcomes, 301);\n+        assert!(healthy_bytes < 1024 * 1024, \"broadcast load stays below 1 MiB\");\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS slow_spectator=disconnected commands=301 send_buffer={send_buffer} recv_buffer={recv_buffer} buffered_outcomes={outcomes} text_bytes={wire_bytes} healthy_outcomes={healthy_outcomes} healthy_bytes={healthy_bytes} reconnect=pass members=3\");\n+        server.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}"},{"sha":"81261db20608b43a8e434a411e7837065fb8c8ee","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e/authority.rs","status":"added","additions":73,"deletions":0,"changes":73,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fauthority.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fauthority.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fauthority.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@\n+//! Client-supplied role claims never grant server Referee authority.\n+use super::*;\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn native_ws_client_role_claim_cannot_promote_to_referee() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = config(directory.path());\n+    let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+    let mut owner = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    owner.create().await;\n+    let mut peer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    peer.ws\n+        .send(Message::Text(\n+            serde_json::json!({\n+                \"type\": \"JoinRoom\", \"payload\": {\n+                    \"room_id\": owner.room, \"password\": PASSWORD, \"preferred_seat\": 1,\n+                    \"reconnect_token\": null, \"role\": \"Referee\", \"observer\": \"Referee\"\n+                }\n+            })\n+            .to_string()\n+            .into(),\n+        ))\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    peer.error(ErrorCode::BadMessage).await;\n+    let player = peer.join(owner.room, 1, None).await;\n+    player.assert_player(peer.player);\n+    assert_ne!(player.view.observer, ObserverKind::Referee);\n+    let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    spectator\n+        .ws\n+        .send(Message::Text(\n+            serde_json::json!({\n+                \"type\": \"Spectate\", \"payload\": {\n+                    \"room_id\": owner.room, \"role\": \"Referee\", \"preferred_seat\": 0, \"player_id\": 1\n+                }\n+            })\n+            .to_string()\n+            .into(),\n+        ))\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    spectator.error(ErrorCode::BadMessage).await;\n+    spectator.spectate(owner.room).await.assert_spectator();\n+    spectator.snapshot().await.assert_spectator();\n+    peer.snapshot().await.assert_player(peer.player);\n+    server.stop().await;\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn native_ws_pending_seat_zero_choice_stays_private_on_spectator_reconnect() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = config(directory.path());\n+    let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+    let mut owner = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    owner.create().await;\n+    let mut player = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    player.join(owner.room, 1, None).await;\n+    let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    spectator.spectate(owner.room).await;\n+    let pending = durability::pending_choice(&mut owner, &mut player, &mut spectator).await;\n+    assert_eq!(pending.choice.as_ref().unwrap().observer, PlayerId::new(1));\n+    spectator.snapshot().await.assert_spectator();\n+    let token = spectator.token.clone();\n+    spectator.close().await;\n+    let mut reconnected = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+    reconnected\n+        .join(owner.room, 0, Some(token))\n+        .await\n+        .assert_spectator();\n+    reconnected.snapshot().await.assert_spectator();\n+    server.stop().await;\n+}"},{"sha":"04c6439a26f78bbfa042e15b7df02b4b2729a514","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e/double_failure.rs","status":"added","additions":231,"deletions":0,"changes":231,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdouble_failure.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdouble_failure.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdouble_failure.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,231 @@\n+//! A failed decision and failed compensation must not let stale RAM rewrite the authority.\n+\n+use super::durability::{\n+    answer, decode_snapshot, failed_submit, pending_choice, unchanged_without_success_push,\n+};\n+use super::*;\n+use crate::native_room_store::{NativeRoomStore, StoreFault, StoredRoom};\n+\n+const RETRY_KEY: u64 = 904;\n+\n+fn committed(primary: StoreFault, compensation: StoreFault) -> bool {\n+    primary == StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync && compensation != StoreFault::PrepareDirectorySync\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn saved_state(cfg: &ServerConfig, record: &StoredRoom, token: &str) -> State {\n+    let content = crate::native::NativeContent::open(\n+        cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+        cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let (packs, _) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(\n+            &record.state.pack_refs,\n+            record.state.frozen_packages.as_deref(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let session = crate::room_native::NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&record.state, packs).unwrap();\n+    let member = session\n+        .members()\n+        .find(|member| member.reconnect_token == token)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let player = (member.role == ClientRole::Player).then_some(member.player_id);\n+    State {\n+        view: session.snapshot(member.connection_id).unwrap(),\n+        legal: player\n+            .map(|id| crate::native_view::legal_actions_for(session.engine(), id))\n+            .unwrap_or_default(),\n+        choice: session.choice_for(member.role.into(), player),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) async fn submit_error(peer: &mut Peer, key: u64, kind: CommandKind) {\n+    peer.seq += 1;\n+    let sequence = peer.seq;\n+    peer.send(ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+        header: MessageHeader::new(peer.room, sequence, 0),\n+        command: Command {\n+            actor: peer.player,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+            kind,\n+        },\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+        replay: false,\n+    })\n+    .await;\n+    let response = peer.until(|message| matches!(message, ServerMessage::Error { .. })\n+        || matches!(message, ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { header, .. } if header.conn_seq == sequence)).await;\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(response, ServerMessage::Error { .. }),\n+        \"{response:?}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_double_failure_fences_writes_and_recovers_by_decision() {\n+    for primary in [\n+        StoreFault::DecisionWrite,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionSync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync,\n+    ] {\n+        for compensation in [\n+            StoreFault::PrepareWrite,\n+            StoreFault::PrepareSync,\n+            StoreFault::PrepareDirectorySync,\n+        ] {\n+            double_failure_fences_writes_and_recovers_by_decision(primary, compensation);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn double_failure_fences_writes_and_recovers_by_decision(\n+    primary: StoreFault,\n+    compensation: StoreFault,\n+) {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    let decision_committed = committed(primary, compensation);\n+    let (room, tokens, selected, intent) = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        a.create().await;\n+        let room = a.room;\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        b.join(room, 1, None).await;\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        spectator.spectate(room).await;\n+        let before_a = pending_choice(&mut a, &mut b, &mut spectator).await;\n+        let before_b = b.snapshot().await;\n+        let before_s = spectator.snapshot().await;\n+        let intent = answer(&before_a, a.player);\n+        let store = server.lobby.native_room_store_for_test().unwrap();\n+        store.fail_next_write_with_compensation(primary, compensation);\n+        failed_submit(&mut a, &before_a, RETRY_KEY).await;\n+        let record_path = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\"));\n+        let journal_path = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json.journal\"));\n+        let candidate = std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap();\n+        let journal = std::fs::read(&journal_path).unwrap();\n+        let selected = NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store)\n+            .load_all()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .pop()\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            saved_state(&cfg, &selected, &a.token).view.revision,\n+            3 + u64::from(decision_committed)\n+        );\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut a, &before_a).await;\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut b, &before_b).await;\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut spectator, &before_s).await;\n+        // The old RAM state must never be written over a visible Committed decision.\n+        failed_submit(&mut a, &before_a, RETRY_KEY).await;\n+        let mut newcomer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        newcomer\n+            .send(ClientMessage::Spectate { room_id: room })\n+            .await;\n+        newcomer.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&record_path).unwrap(), candidate);\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&journal_path).unwrap(), journal);\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut a, &before_a).await;\n+        let tokens = [a.token.clone(), b.token.clone(), spectator.token.clone()];\n+        drop((a, b, spectator, newcomer));\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        (room, tokens, selected, intent)\n+    });\n+    disable_packages(&cfg);\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let expected_a = saved_state(&cfg, &selected, &tokens[0]);\n+        let expected_b = saved_state(&cfg, &selected, &tokens[1]);\n+        let expected_s = saved_state(&cfg, &selected, &tokens[2]);\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(a.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[0].clone())).await, expected_a);\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(b.join(room, 1, Some(tokens[1].clone())).await, expected_b);\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(spectator.spectate(room).await, expected_s);\n+        let restored = NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store).load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+        let mut expected_snapshot = decode_snapshot(&serde_json::json!(selected.state.snapshot_hex));\n+        expected_snapshot.auth_generation += 1;\n+        assert_eq!(decode_snapshot(&serde_json::json!(restored.state.snapshot_hex)), expected_snapshot);\n+        assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(&restored.state.frozen_packages).unwrap(), serde_json::to_value(&selected.state.frozen_packages).unwrap());\n+        let (result, after_a) = a.submit(a.player, 0, RETRY_KEY, intent.clone()).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision: 4, .. }));\n+        assert_eq!(after_a.view.revision, 4);\n+        if decision_committed {\n+            assert_eq!(after_a, expected_a, \"committed retries must only replay their receipt\");\n+        } else {\n+            assert_synchronized(&after_a, &b.pushed(RETRY_KEY).await, &spectator.pushed(RETRY_KEY).await);\n+        }\n+        let (again, replayed) = a.submit(a.player, 0, RETRY_KEY, intent.clone()).await;\n+        assert_eq!(again, result);\n+        assert_eq!(replayed, after_a);\n+        submit_error(&mut a, RETRY_KEY, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+        assert_eq!(a.snapshot().await, after_a);\n+        let (other_result, _) = b.submit(b.player, 0, RETRY_KEY, intent.clone()).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(other_result, CommandResult::Rejected { .. }), \"another player cannot replay the owner's receipt\");\n+        let (advance, next) = a.submit(a.player, 4, RETRY_KEY + 1, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(advance, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision: 5, .. }));\n+        assert_synchronized(&next, &b.pushed(RETRY_KEY + 1).await, &spectator.pushed(RETRY_KEY + 1).await);\n+        let (old_result, current) = a.submit(a.player, 0, RETRY_KEY, intent).await;\n+        assert_eq!(old_result, result, \"later commands must not discard the resolved receipt\");\n+        assert_eq!(current, next);\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS double_failure=pass decision={primary:?} compensation={compensation:?} authority={} restart_revision={} same_key=once continued_revision={}\", if decision_committed { \"Committed\" } else { \"Prepared\" }, expected_a.view.revision, next.view.revision);\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_double_initial_failure_restores_only_committed_creation() {\n+    for primary in [\n+        StoreFault::DecisionWrite,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionSync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync,\n+    ] {\n+        for compensation in [\n+            StoreFault::PrepareWrite,\n+            StoreFault::PrepareSync,\n+            StoreFault::PrepareDirectorySync,\n+        ] {\n+            let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+            let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+            let decision_committed = committed(primary, compensation);\n+            runtime().block_on(async {\n+                let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+                server\n+                    .lobby\n+                    .native_room_store_for_test()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .fail_next_write_with_compensation(primary, compensation);\n+                let mut peer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+                peer.send(ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                    choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                    players: 2,\n+                    seed: SEED,\n+                    password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+                })\n+                .await;\n+                peer.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+                assert_eq!(server.lobby.stats().active_rooms, 0);\n+                drop(peer);\n+                server.stop().await;\n+            });\n+            runtime().block_on(async {\n+                let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, usize::from(decision_committed)).await;\n+                let mut peer = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+                if decision_committed {\n+                    assert_eq!(peer.join(1, 0, None).await.view.revision, 0);\n+                } else {\n+                    peer.send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom { room_id: 1, password: PASSWORD.into(), preferred_seat: Some(0), reconnect_token: None }).await;\n+                    peer.error(ErrorCode::RoomNotFound).await;\n+                }\n+                let mut next = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+                next.create().await;\n+                assert_eq!(next.room, 2);\n+                println!(\"NATIVE_WS double_initial_failure=pass decision={primary:?} compensation={compensation:?} restored={} next_room=2\", usize::from(decision_committed));\n+                restarted.stop().await;\n+            });\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"6ebccb57d81ebdadf910ab0ca47b5dcb51b0cf94","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e/durability.rs","status":"added","additions":569,"deletions":0,"changes":569,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdurability.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdurability.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Fdurability.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,569 @@\n+//! Durable acknowledgement, failed writes, and abrupt-runtime restart over the production WS path.\n+\n+use super::*;\n+use crate::native_room_store::StoreFault;\n+\n+pub(super) async fn pending_choice(a: &mut Peer, b: &mut Peer, spectator: &mut Peer) -> State {\n+    let mut state = a.snapshot().await;\n+    for key in [701, 702, 703] {\n+        let before = state.view.revision;\n+        let (result, next) = a.submit(a.player, before, key, CommandKind::EndPhase).await;\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision > before)\n+        );\n+        assert_synchronized(&next, &b.pushed(key).await, &spectator.pushed(key).await);\n+        state = next;\n+    }\n+    assert!(state.choice.is_some());\n+    assert!(state\n+        .legal\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|action| matches!(action, LegalAction::ResolveChoice { .. })));\n+    state\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn answer(state: &State, player: PlayerId) -> CommandKind {\n+    state\n+        .legal\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|action| {\n+            matches!(\n+                action,\n+                LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                    cancelled: false,\n+                    ..\n+                }\n+            )\n+        })\n+        .expect(\"pending private answer\")\n+        .to_command(player, state.view.revision)\n+        .kind\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) fn decode_snapshot(value: &serde_json::Value) -> engine_native::snap::StateSnapshot {\n+    let hex = value.as_str().unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(hex.len() % 2, 0);\n+    let bytes: Vec<_> = (0..hex.len())\n+        .step_by(2)\n+        .map(|index| u8::from_str_radix(&hex[index..index + 2], 16).unwrap())\n+        .collect();\n+    engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) async fn failed_submit(peer: &mut Peer, state: &State, key: u64) {\n+    peer.seq += 1;\n+    let sequence = peer.seq;\n+    peer.send(ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+        header: MessageHeader::new(peer.room, sequence, state.view.revision),\n+        command: Command {\n+            actor: peer.player,\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(state.view.revision),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+            kind: answer(state, peer.player),\n+        },\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+        replay: false,\n+    })\n+    .await;\n+    let response = peer\n+        .until(|message| {\n+            matches!(message, ServerMessage::Error { .. })\n+                || matches!(message, ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { header, .. } if header.conn_seq == sequence)\n+        })\n+        .await;\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(\n+            &response,\n+            ServerMessage::Error {\n+                code: ErrorCode::Internal,\n+                message,\n+                ..\n+            } if message.contains(\"native room persistence failed:\")\n+        ),\n+        \"a failed durable write must not acknowledge an accepted command: {response:?}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+pub(super) async fn unchanged_without_success_push(peer: &mut Peer, expected: &State) {\n+    peer.seq += 1;\n+    let sequence = peer.seq;\n+    peer.send(ClientMessage::RequestSnapshot {\n+        header: MessageHeader::new(peer.room, sequence, 0),\n+        last_revision: 0,\n+    })\n+    .await;\n+    let message = peer\n+        .until(|message| {\n+            assert!(\n+                !matches!(message, ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                    result: CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. }, ..\n+                } if *new_revision > expected.view.revision),\n+                \"uncommitted transition reached another socket: {message:?}\"\n+            );\n+            matches!(message, ServerMessage::Snapshot { header, .. } if header.conn_seq == sequence)\n+        })\n+        .await;\n+    assert_eq!(State::from_message(message), *expected);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_write_failure_retries_and_restarts() {\n+    for fault in [\n+        None,\n+        Some(StoreFault::PartialWrite),\n+        Some(StoreFault::FileSync),\n+        Some(StoreFault::Rename),\n+        Some(StoreFault::DirectorySync),\n+    ] {\n+        write_failure_retries_and_restarts(fault);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_restart_after_uncertain_rename_restores_only_confirmed_choice() {\n+    for fault in [\n+        StoreFault::DirectorySync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionWrite,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionSync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync,\n+    ] {\n+        restart_after_uncertain_rename_restores_only_confirmed_choice(fault);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn restart_after_uncertain_rename_restores_only_confirmed_choice(fault: StoreFault) {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    let (room, tokens, before_a, before_b, before_spectator, confirmed) =\n+        runtime().block_on(async {\n+            let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+            let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+            a.create().await;\n+            let room = a.room;\n+            let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+            b.join(room, 1, None).await;\n+            let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+            spectator.spectate(room).await;\n+            let before_a = pending_choice(&mut a, &mut b, &mut spectator).await;\n+            let before_b = b.snapshot().await;\n+            let before_spectator = spectator.snapshot().await;\n+            let confirmed: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(\n+                &std::fs::read(Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\")))\n+                    .unwrap(),\n+            )\n+            .unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                confirmed[\"state\"][\"frozen_packages\"]\n+                    .as_array()\n+                    .unwrap()\n+                    .len(),\n+                2\n+            );\n+            server\n+                .lobby\n+                .native_room_store_for_test()\n+                .unwrap()\n+                .fail_next_write(fault);\n+            failed_submit(&mut a, &before_a, 704).await;\n+            let candidate: crate::native_room_store::StoredRoom = serde_json::from_slice(\n+                &std::fs::read(Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\")))\n+                    .unwrap(),\n+            )\n+            .unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                candidate.checksum,\n+                crate::native_room_store::state_checksum(&candidate.state)\n+            );\n+            assert_ne!(\n+                serde_json::json!(candidate.state.snapshot_hex),\n+                confirmed[\"state\"][\"snapshot_hex\"],\n+                \"the interrupted rename must expose a complete newer candidate before restart\"\n+            );\n+            let tokens = [a.token.clone(), b.token.clone()];\n+            // No retry, reconnect, or repair save may turn the failed candidate into a commit.\n+            drop(a);\n+            drop(b);\n+            drop(spectator);\n+            server.stop().await;\n+            (\n+                room,\n+                tokens,\n+                before_a,\n+                before_b,\n+                before_spectator,\n+                confirmed,\n+            )\n+        });\n+\n+    disable_packages(&cfg);\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(a.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[0].clone())).await, before_a,\n+            \"rename without a confirmed commit must preserve the original private choice\");\n+        assert_eq!(a.token, tokens[0]);\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(b.join(room, 1, Some(tokens[1].clone())).await, before_b);\n+        assert_eq!(b.token, tokens[1]);\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(spectator.spectate(room).await, before_spectator);\n+        assert_synchronized(&a.snapshot().await, &b.snapshot().await, &spectator.snapshot().await);\n+        let restored: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(\n+            &std::fs::read(Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\"))).unwrap(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+        let mut expected_snapshot = decode_snapshot(&confirmed[\"state\"][\"snapshot_hex\"]);\n+        // Engine restore intentionally rotates old authorization tokens once (N11-a).\n+        expected_snapshot.auth_generation += 1;\n+        assert_eq!(decode_snapshot(&restored[\"state\"][\"snapshot_hex\"]), expected_snapshot,\n+            \"recovery preserves the complete core, RNG, dedup, and pending resolution\");\n+        for field in [\"pack_refs\", \"frozen_packages\", \"next_dedup\"] {\n+            assert_eq!(restored[\"state\"][field], confirmed[\"state\"][field], \"restored {field}\");\n+        }\n+        let (result, after_a) = a\n+            .submit(a.player, before_a.view.revision, 704, answer(&before_a, a.player))\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. }\n+            if new_revision == before_a.view.revision + 1));\n+        assert_synchronized(&after_a, &b.pushed(704).await, &spectator.pushed(704).await);\n+        assert_ne!(after_a.view.state_hash, before_a.view.state_hash);\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS uncertain_rename=pass fault={fault:?} repair_before_restart=none packages=disabled committed_revision={} retried_same_key=704 continued_revision={}\", before_a.view.revision, after_a.view.revision);\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_uncertain_initial_save_is_not_restored_as_a_room() {\n+    for fault in [\n+        StoreFault::DirectorySync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionWrite,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionSync,\n+        StoreFault::DecisionDirectorySync,\n+    ] {\n+        uncertain_initial_save_is_not_restored_as_a_room(fault);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn uncertain_initial_save_is_not_restored_as_a_room(fault: StoreFault) {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        server\n+            .lobby\n+            .native_room_store_for_test()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .fail_next_write(fault);\n+        let mut peer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        peer.send(ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+            choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+            players: 2,\n+            seed: SEED,\n+            password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+        })\n+        .await;\n+        peer.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+        assert_eq!(server.lobby.stats().active_rooms, 0);\n+        drop(peer);\n+        server.stop().await;\n+    });\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut peer = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        peer.send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+            room_id: 1,\n+            password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+        })\n+        .await;\n+        peer.error(ErrorCode::RoomNotFound).await;\n+        peer.create().await;\n+        assert!(peer.room > 1, \"the failed candidate still reserves its room ID\");\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS uncertain_first_save=pass fault={fault:?} unacknowledged_room=not_restored next_room={}\", peer.room);\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+fn write_failure_retries_and_restarts(fault: Option<StoreFault>) {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    let (room, tokens, before_a, before_b, before_spectator) = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        a.create().await;\n+        let room = a.room;\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        b.join(room, 1, None).await;\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        spectator.spectate(room).await;\n+        let before_a = pending_choice(&mut a, &mut b, &mut spectator).await;\n+        let before_b = b.snapshot().await;\n+        let before_spectator = spectator.snapshot().await;\n+        let rooms = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store);\n+        let record_name = format!(\"{room}.json\");\n+        let saved = std::fs::read(rooms.join(&record_name)).unwrap();\n+        let original = directory.path().join(\"confirmed-rooms\");\n+        let store = server.lobby.native_room_store_for_test().unwrap();\n+        if let Some(fault) = fault {\n+            store.fail_next_write(fault);\n+        } else {\n+            std::fs::rename(rooms, &original).unwrap();\n+            std::fs::write(rooms, b\"fault: room directory is unavailable\").unwrap();\n+        }\n+\n+        failed_submit(&mut a, &before_a, 704).await;\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut a, &before_a).await;\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut b, &before_b).await;\n+        unchanged_without_success_push(&mut spectator, &before_spectator).await;\n+        if matches!(fault, Some(StoreFault::DirectorySync)) {\n+            assert_ne!(std::fs::read(rooms.join(&record_name)).unwrap(), saved,\n+                \"after rename the candidate is visible but durability has not been confirmed\");\n+            store.fail_next_write(StoreFault::Rename);\n+            failed_submit(&mut a, &before_a, 704).await;\n+            unchanged_without_success_push(&mut a, &before_a).await;\n+            unchanged_without_success_push(&mut b, &before_b).await;\n+            unchanged_without_success_push(&mut spectator, &before_spectator).await;\n+        } else if fault.is_some() {\n+            assert_eq!(std::fs::read(rooms.join(&record_name)).unwrap(), saved);\n+        } else {\n+            assert_eq!(std::fs::read(original.join(&record_name)).unwrap(), saved);\n+            std::fs::remove_file(rooms).unwrap();\n+            std::fs::rename(&original, rooms).unwrap();\n+        }\n+        let (result, after_a) = a\n+            .submit(a.player, before_a.view.revision, 704, answer(&before_a, a.player))\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision == before_a.view.revision + 1));\n+        let after_b = b.pushed(704).await;\n+        let after_spectator = spectator.pushed(704).await;\n+        assert_synchronized(&after_a, &after_b, &after_spectator);\n+        let disk: serde_json::Value =\n+            serde_json::from_slice(&std::fs::read(rooms.join(&record_name)).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        let old: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(&saved).unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(disk[\"state\"][\"frozen_packages\"], old[\"state\"][\"frozen_packages\"]);\n+        assert_eq!(disk[\"state\"][\"pack_refs\"], old[\"state\"][\"pack_refs\"]);\n+        assert_ne!(disk[\"state\"][\"snapshot_hex\"], old[\"state\"][\"snapshot_hex\"]);\n+        let (repeated, repeated_state) = a\n+            .submit(a.player, before_a.view.revision, 704, answer(&before_a, a.player))\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(repeated, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision == after_a.view.revision));\n+        assert_eq!(repeated_state, after_a, \"successful retry is cached only after durable commit\");\n+        let tokens = [a.token.clone(), b.token.clone()];\n+        // No graceful close: destroying this runtime drops its sockets and all room actors.\n+        drop(a);\n+        drop(b);\n+        drop(spectator);\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        (room, tokens, after_a, after_b, after_spectator)\n+    });\n+\n+    disable_packages(&cfg);\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(a.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[0].clone())).await, before_a);\n+        assert_eq!(a.token, tokens[0]);\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(b.join(room, 1, Some(tokens[1].clone())).await, before_b);\n+        assert_eq!(b.token, tokens[1]);\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(spectator.spectate(room).await, before_spectator);\n+        assert_synchronized(&a.snapshot().await, &b.snapshot().await, &spectator.snapshot().await);\n+        let action = before_a.legal.first().expect(\"restored game can continue\").to_command(a.player, before_a.view.revision);\n+        let (result, next) = a.submit(a.player, before_a.view.revision, 705, action.kind).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision > before_a.view.revision));\n+        assert_synchronized(&next, &b.pushed(705).await, &spectator.pushed(705).await);\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS durability=pass fault={fault:?} retry=same-key revision={} restart=abrupt-runtime continued_revision={} packages=disabled\", before_a.view.revision, next.view.revision);\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_restart_isolates_corrupt_saves_and_ignores_orphan_temps() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+    let (room, token, before, record) = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 0).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        a.create().await;\n+        let room = a.room;\n+        let mut b = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        b.join(room, 1, None).await;\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        spectator.spectate(room).await;\n+        let before = pending_choice(&mut a, &mut b, &mut spectator).await;\n+        let record: crate::native_room_store::StoredRoom = serde_json::from_slice(\n+            &std::fs::read(Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store).join(format!(\"{room}.json\"))).unwrap(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+        let mut other = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        other.create().await;\n+        assert_ne!(other.room, room);\n+        let token = a.token.clone();\n+        drop(a);\n+        drop(b);\n+        drop(spectator);\n+        drop(other);\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        (room, token, before, record)\n+    });\n+\n+    let rooms = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store);\n+    let content = super::super::native::NativeContent::open(\n+        cfg.native_packages_root.clone(),\n+        cfg.native_store_root.clone(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let (packs, _) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(\n+            &record.state.pack_refs,\n+            record.state.frozen_packages.as_deref(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+    // A fully valid, newer candidate models a crash after file sync but before atomic rename.\n+    let mut candidate =\n+        crate::room_native::NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&record.state, packs).unwrap();\n+    let owner = record\n+        .state\n+        .members\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|member| member.player_id == PlayerId::new(1))\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let outcome = candidate\n+        .submit(\n+            owner.connection_id,\n+            &answer(&before, owner.player_id),\n+            before.view.revision,\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(outcome, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision > before.view.revision)\n+    );\n+    let mut newer = record.clone();\n+    newer.state = candidate.export_state(&candidate.snapshot_hex());\n+    newer.checksum = crate::native_room_store::state_checksum(&newer.state);\n+    let full_temp = serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&newer).unwrap();\n+    let complete_path = rooms.join(format!(\n+        \"{room}.json.00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001.tmp\"\n+    ));\n+    std::fs::write(&complete_path, &full_temp).unwrap();\n+    let partial_path = rooms.join(format!(\"{room}.json.tmp\"));\n+    let partial = b\"{\\\"room_id\\\":1,\\\"state\\\":{\\\"snapshot_hex\\\":\\\"\";\n+    std::fs::write(&partial_path, partial).unwrap();\n+    let corrupt_path = rooms.join(\"100.json\");\n+    let corrupt = b\"{\\\"room_id\\\":100,\\\"state\\\":\";\n+    std::fs::write(&corrupt_path, corrupt).unwrap();\n+    let mismatch_path = rooms.join(\"101.json\");\n+    let mismatch = serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&record).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(&mismatch_path, &mismatch).unwrap();\n+    let orphan_path = rooms.join(\"102.json.00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102.tmp\");\n+    let mut orphan = newer;\n+    orphan.room_id = 102;\n+    let orphan_bytes = serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&orphan).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(&orphan_path, &orphan_bytes).unwrap();\n+    disable_packages(&cfg);\n+\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 2).await;\n+        let mut a = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(a.join(room, 0, Some(token.clone())).await, before,\n+            \"a fully valid temp must not replace the last committed choice\");\n+        assert_eq!(a.token, token);\n+        let mut unavailable = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        for unavailable_room in [100, 101, 102] {\n+            unavailable.send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+                room_id: unavailable_room,\n+                password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+                reconnect_token: None,\n+            }).await;\n+            unavailable.error(ErrorCode::RoomNotFound).await;\n+        }\n+        for (path, bytes) in [\n+            (&complete_path, full_temp.as_slice()),\n+            (&partial_path, partial.as_slice()),\n+            (&corrupt_path, corrupt.as_slice()),\n+            (&mismatch_path, mismatch.as_slice()),\n+            (&orphan_path, orphan_bytes.as_slice()),\n+        ] {\n+            assert_eq!(std::fs::read(path).unwrap(), bytes, \"failed/orphaned save remains available for inspection\");\n+        }\n+        let (outcome, continued) = a.submit(a.player, before.view.revision, 704, answer(&before, a.player)).await;\n+        assert!(matches!(outcome, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision > before.view.revision));\n+        let mut active = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        active.send(ClientMessage::CreateRoom { choice_timeout_secs: None, players: 2, seed: SEED, password: PASSWORD.into() }).await;\n+        active.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+        assert_eq!(restarted.lobby.stats().active_rooms, 2, \"disabled packs cannot create a new room\");\n+        println!(\"NATIVE_WS crash_recovery=pass healthy_rooms=2 corrupt_rooms=2 orphan_room=102 committed_revision={} continued_revision={}\", before.view.revision, continued.view.revision);\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+\n+    // Reactivating packages permits a new room, while all damaged and uncommitted IDs remain reserved.\n+    upgrade_packages(&cfg, \"1.1.0\");\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 2).await;\n+        let mut new = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        new.create().await;\n+        assert!(\n+            new.room > 102,\n+            \"new room must not overwrite malformed or uncommitted saves\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&corrupt_path).unwrap(), corrupt);\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&mismatch_path).unwrap(), mismatch);\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(&orphan_path).unwrap(), orphan_bytes);\n+        println!(\n+            \"NATIVE_WS reserved_ids=pass new_room={} corrupt_and_orphan_bytes=preserved\",\n+            new.room\n+        );\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_extensions_ws_refuses_room_creation_when_recovery_inventory_is_unsafe() {\n+    for failure in [\"unreadable-directory\", \"exhausted-id\"] {\n+        let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let cfg = local_config(directory.path());\n+        let rooms = Path::new(&cfg.native_room_store);\n+        if failure == \"unreadable-directory\" {\n+            std::fs::write(rooms, b\"fault: not a directory\").unwrap();\n+        } else {\n+            std::fs::create_dir_all(rooms).unwrap();\n+            std::fs::write(rooms.join(format!(\"{}.json\", u64::MAX)), b\"{invalid\").unwrap();\n+        }\n+        // 无法建立目录或许可证时，单写者锁在启动阶段就拒绝，而不是启动一个\n+        // 扫描/分配房号都不可靠的服务。exhausted-id 仍可启动但拒绝新房间。\n+        if failure == \"unreadable-directory\" {\n+            match crate::try_bootstrap(&cfg) {\n+                Ok(_) => panic!(\"存档目录不是目录时必须拒绝启动\"),\n+                Err(error) => {\n+                    println!(\"NATIVE_WS recovery_inventory={failure} startup=refused ({error})\")\n+                }\n+            }\n+            continue;\n+        }\n+        runtime().block_on(async {\n+            let lobby = bootstrap(&cfg);\n+            let restore = lobby.restore_native_rooms();\n+            assert_eq!(restore.unwrap(), 0);\n+            let app = build_router(lobby.clone(), ServeDir::new(&cfg.original_content_root));\n+            let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"127.0.0.1:0\").await.unwrap();\n+            let url = format!(\"ws://{}/ws\", listener.local_addr().unwrap());\n+            let task = tokio::spawn(async move { axum::serve(listener, app).await.unwrap() });\n+            let server = Server { url, lobby, task };\n+            let mut peer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+            peer.send(ClientMessage::CreateRoom {\n+                choice_timeout_secs: None,\n+                players: 2,\n+                seed: SEED,\n+                password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+            peer.error(ErrorCode::Internal).await;\n+            assert_eq!(server.lobby.stats().active_rooms, 0);\n+            println!(\"NATIVE_WS recovery_inventory={failure} new_room=refused\");\n+            server.stop().await;\n+        });\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"34dc0184bcd1a276a3f46ff91c227705260afbce","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e/referee.rs","status":"added","additions":313,"deletions":0,"changes":313,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Freferee.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Freferee.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Fnative_ws_e2e%2Freferee.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,313 @@\n+//! Trusted store membership controls visibility through the real WebSocket actor.\n+use super::*;\n+use crate::native_room_store::{NativeRoomStore, StoredRoom};\n+use crate::native_view::{choice_for, observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use crate::room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+\n+fn stored_pending(cfg: &ServerConfig) -> (u64, [String; 4], State) {\n+    let mut engine = engine_native::Engine::new_identity(1515, 4);\n+    engine.assign_general_named(1, \"刘备\").unwrap();\n+    for _ in 0..3 {\n+        let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+            actor: 0,\n+            expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+            dedup_id: engine.revision() + 1,\n+            action: engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase,\n+        });\n+        assert!(!matches!(\n+            result,\n+            engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(engine.open_choice().unwrap().observer, 0);\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.mode = engine_native::GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).general_slots[1] = Some(0);\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    let removed = snapshot.core.deck.pop().unwrap();\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).off_court.push(removed);\n+    let expansion = snapshot.core.deck.pop().unwrap();\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(2).lianyaohu_store.push(expansion);\n+    let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(engine_native::Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap(), 4);\n+    let owner = session.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+    let other = session.join(2, Some(1), None).unwrap();\n+    session.spectate(90);\n+    session.spectate(91);\n+    session.sync_deadline().unwrap();\n+    let mut state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    state.next_dedup = snapshot.last_dedup + 1;\n+    let referee = state\n+        .members\n+        .iter_mut()\n+        .find(|m| m.connection_id == 90)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    referee.role = ClientRole::Referee;\n+    referee.reconnect_token = uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string();\n+    let referee_token = referee.reconnect_token.clone();\n+    let spectator = state\n+        .members\n+        .iter_mut()\n+        .find(|m| m.connection_id == 91)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    // A valid seat in a trusted record still cannot turn a Spectator into a Player.\n+    spectator.player_id = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    spectator.seat = 0;\n+    spectator.reconnect_token = uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string();\n+    let spectator_token = spectator.reconnect_token.clone();\n+    let expected = State {\n+        view: observer_snapshot_for(session.engine(), RoomRole::Referee, None),\n+        choice: session.choice_for(RoomRole::Referee, None),\n+        legal: vec![],\n+    };\n+    let room_id = 909;\n+    NativeRoomStore::new(&cfg.native_room_store)\n+        .save(&StoredRoom {\n+            room_id,\n+            password_hash: crate::native_room_store::password_hash(room_id, PASSWORD),\n+            state,\n+            checksum: String::new(),\n+        })\n+        .unwrap();\n+    (\n+        room_id,\n+        [\n+            owner.member.reconnect_token,\n+            other.member.reconnect_token,\n+            referee_token,\n+            spectator_token,\n+        ],\n+        expected,\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+async fn reconnect_spectator_with_stored_seat(peer: &mut Peer, room: u64, token: &str) {\n+    peer.send(ClientMessage::JoinRoom {\n+        room_id: room,\n+        password: PASSWORD.into(),\n+        preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+        reconnect_token: Some(token.into()),\n+    })\n+    .await;\n+    let message = peer\n+        .until(|message| matches!(message, ServerMessage::JoinOk { .. }))\n+        .await;\n+    let ServerMessage::JoinOk {\n+        role,\n+        player_id,\n+        seat,\n+        ..\n+    } = &message\n+    else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!((*role, *player_id, *seat), (ClientRole::Spectator, 1, 0));\n+    State::from_message(message).assert_spectator();\n+    peer.room = room;\n+    peer.player = PlayerId::new(1);\n+    peer.token = token.into();\n+}\n+\n+fn assert_referee(state: &State) {\n+    assert_eq!(state.view.observer, ObserverKind::Referee);\n+    assert!(\n+        state.legal.is_empty(),\n+        \"visibility must not grant intervention\"\n+    );\n+    let ids: std::collections::BTreeSet<_> =\n+        state.view.known_cards.iter().map(|card| card.id).collect();\n+    assert_eq!(state.view.known_cards.len(), 124);\n+    assert_eq!(ids.len(), 124);\n+    assert!(state\n+        .view\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .all(|card| card.def.is_some() && card.suit.is_some() && card.rank.is_some()));\n+    assert!(state\n+        .view\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|card| card.zone == engine_api::CardZoneTag::DrawPile));\n+    assert!(state\n+        .view\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|card| card.zone == engine_api::CardZoneTag::Removed));\n+    assert!(state\n+        .view\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|card| card.zone == engine_api::CardZoneTag::Expansion));\n+    let slots = &state.view.seats[1].generals;\n+    assert!(slots.iter().all(\n+        |slot| slot.as_ref().is_some_and(|general| !general.name.is_empty()\n+            && !general.faction.is_empty()\n+            && !general.revealed)\n+    ));\n+    assert_eq!(slots[1].as_ref().unwrap().def, 0);\n+    if let Some(choice) = &state.choice {\n+        assert!(choice\n+            .prompt\n+            .as_ref()\n+            .is_some_and(|prompt| !prompt.is_empty()));\n+        assert!(choice\n+            .native_kind\n+            .as_deref()\n+            .and_then(engine_api::choice_kind_from_native)\n+            .is_some());\n+    }\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        state.view.seats[1].character_def, 0,\n+        \"dark general remains authorized\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_ws_referee_restore_reconnect_choice_fanout_and_restart() {\n+    let directory = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let cfg = config(directory.path());\n+    let (room, tokens, expected) = stored_pending(&cfg);\n+    let before_restart = runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let server = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+        let mut owner = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let initial = owner.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[0].clone())).await;\n+        let mut other = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        other\n+            .join(room, 1, Some(tokens[1].clone()))\n+            .await\n+            .assert_player(PlayerId::new(2));\n+        let mut referee = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        let joined = referee.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[2].clone())).await;\n+        assert_eq!(joined, expected);\n+        assert_referee(&joined);\n+        assert_eq!(referee.snapshot().await, expected);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            joined.choice, initial.choice,\n+            \"referee sees the current owner's full choice\"\n+        );\n+        let mut old_referee = referee;\n+        let mut referee = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            referee.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[2].clone())).await,\n+            expected\n+        );\n+        old_referee\n+            .send(ClientMessage::RequestSnapshot {\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(room, 1, 0),\n+                last_revision: 0,\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        let stale = old_referee\n+            .until(|message| {\n+                matches!(\n+                    message,\n+                    ServerMessage::Error { .. } | ServerMessage::Snapshot { .. }\n+                )\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(stale, ServerMessage::Error { .. }),\n+            \"old referee connection retained authority\"\n+        );\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        reconnect_spectator_with_stored_seat(&mut spectator, room, &tokens[3]).await;\n+        spectator.snapshot().await.assert_spectator();\n+        let public = spectator.snapshot().await;\n+        assert_eq!(public.view.seats[1].character_def, 0);\n+        assert_eq!(public.view.seats[1].generals, [None, None]);\n+        let mut newcomer = Peer::connect(&server).await;\n+        newcomer.spectate(room).await.assert_spectator();\n+        // A rejected player intent still fans out the unchanged pending private choice.\n+        let (rejected, unchanged) = owner\n+            .submit(\n+                owner.player,\n+                initial.view.revision,\n+                8999,\n+                CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            )\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(rejected, CommandResult::Rejected { .. }));\n+        assert_eq!(unchanged, initial);\n+        assert_eq!(referee.pushed(8999).await, expected);\n+        spectator.pushed(8999).await.assert_spectator();\n+        newcomer.pushed(8999).await.assert_spectator();\n+        old_referee\n+            .send(ClientMessage::RequestSnapshot {\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(room, 2, 0),\n+                last_revision: 0,\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        let stale_push = old_referee\n+            .until(|message| {\n+                matches!(\n+                    message,\n+                    ServerMessage::Error { .. } | ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { .. }\n+                )\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(stale_push, ServerMessage::Error { .. }),\n+            \"stale referee received private choice fanout\"\n+        );\n+        // Seeing the full options cannot authorize a referee to answer them, including replay.\n+        let answer = durability::answer(&initial, owner.player);\n+        double_failure::submit_error(&mut referee, 9001, answer.clone()).await;\n+        double_failure::submit_error(&mut spectator, 9001, answer.clone()).await;\n+        referee.seq += 1;\n+        referee\n+            .send(ClientMessage::SubmitCommand {\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(room, referee.seq, initial.view.revision),\n+                command: Command {\n+                    actor: owner.player,\n+                    expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(initial.view.revision),\n+                    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(9001),\n+                    kind: answer.clone(),\n+                },\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(9001),\n+                replay: true,\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        let rejected = referee\n+            .until(|message| {\n+                matches!(\n+                    message,\n+                    ServerMessage::Error { .. } | ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { .. }\n+                )\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(matches!(rejected, ServerMessage::Error { .. }));\n+        assert_eq!(referee.snapshot().await, expected);\n+        let (result, _) = owner\n+            .submit(owner.player, initial.view.revision, 9002, answer)\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(\n+            matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            \"{result:?}\"\n+        );\n+        let pushed = referee.pushed(9002).await;\n+        assert_referee(&pushed);\n+        spectator.pushed(9002).await.assert_spectator();\n+        newcomer.pushed(9002).await.assert_spectator();\n+        let before_restart = referee.snapshot().await;\n+        assert_eq!(pushed, before_restart);\n+        owner.close().await;\n+        other.close().await;\n+        referee.close().await;\n+        old_referee.close().await;\n+        spectator.close().await;\n+        newcomer.close().await;\n+        server.stop().await;\n+        before_restart\n+    });\n+    runtime().block_on(async {\n+        let restarted = Server::start(&cfg, 1).await;\n+        let mut referee = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            referee.join(room, 0, Some(tokens[2].clone())).await,\n+            before_restart\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(referee.snapshot().await, before_restart);\n+        let mut spectator = Peer::connect(&restarted).await;\n+        reconnect_spectator_with_stored_seat(&mut spectator, room, &tokens[3]).await;\n+        restarted.stop().await;\n+    });\n+}"},{"sha":"519d79c093ecbc4c5d7d6ceb710bc066e6692fef","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/room_native/receipts.rs","status":"added","additions":288,"deletions":0,"changes":288,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Freceipts.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Freceipts.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Freceipts.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,288 @@\n+//! 接受结果与候选一起保存；连接号或座位重用不能继承其他身份的请求收据。\n+\n+use super::*;\n+use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+pub struct NativeCommandReceipt {\n+    pub reconnect_token: String,\n+    pub player_id: PlayerId,\n+    pub idempotency_key: u64,\n+    pub kind: CommandKind,\n+    pub result: CommandResult,\n+}\n+\n+/// 每会话保留的已接受命令收据上限；长局/高频重连下防止无界增长。\n+const MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS: usize = 4096;\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, Default)]\n+pub(super) struct CommandReceipts(BTreeMap<(String, u64), NativeCommandReceipt>);\n+\n+impl CommandReceipts {\n+    pub(super) fn restore(\n+        entries: &[NativeCommandReceipt],\n+        revision: u64,\n+        max_seats: u8,\n+    ) -> Result<Self, String> {\n+        let mut receipts = Self::default();\n+        for entry in entries {\n+            if entry.reconnect_token.is_empty()\n+                || entry.idempotency_key == 0\n+                || entry.player_id.raw() == 0\n+                || entry.player_id.raw() > max_seats as u32\n+                || !matches!(entry.result, CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } if new_revision <= revision)\n+            {\n+                return Err(\"落盘命令收据身份、键或修订无效\".into());\n+            }\n+            let key = (entry.reconnect_token.clone(), entry.idempotency_key);\n+            if receipts.0.insert(key, entry.clone()).is_some() {\n+                return Err(\"落盘命令收据重复\".into());\n+            }\n+        }\n+        receipts.prune();\n+        Ok(receipts)\n+    }\n+\n+    fn prune(&mut self) {\n+        while self.0.len() > MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS {\n+            let oldest = self\n+                .0\n+                .iter()\n+                .filter_map(|(key, receipt)| match receipt.result {\n+                    CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. } => {\n+                        Some((key.clone(), new_revision))\n+                    }\n+                    _ => None,\n+                })\n+                .min_by_key(|(_, revision)| *revision)\n+                .map(|(key, _)| key);\n+            match oldest {\n+                Some(key) => {\n+                    self.0.remove(&key);\n+                }\n+                None => break,\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    pub(super) fn entries(&self) -> Vec<NativeCommandReceipt> {\n+        self.0.values().cloned().collect()\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl NativeRoomSession {\n+    pub(crate) fn command_receipt(\n+        &self,\n+        connection_id: u64,\n+        key: u64,\n+        kind: &CommandKind,\n+    ) -> Result<Option<CommandResult>, String> {\n+        if key == 0 {\n+            return Ok(None);\n+        }\n+        let member = self\n+            .members\n+            .get(&connection_id)\n+            .ok_or(\"unknown connection\")?;\n+        let Some(receipt) = self\n+            .command_receipts\n+            .0\n+            .get(&(member.reconnect_token.clone(), key))\n+        else {\n+            return Ok(None);\n+        };\n+        if member.role != ClientRole::Player\n+            || receipt.player_id != member.player_id\n+            || receipt.kind != *kind\n+        {\n+            return Err(\"idempotency key conflicts with the saved command receipt\".into());\n+        }\n+        Ok(Some(receipt.result.clone()))\n+    }\n+\n+    pub(crate) fn remember_command(\n+        &mut self,\n+        connection_id: u64,\n+        key: u64,\n+        kind: &CommandKind,\n+        result: &CommandResult,\n+    ) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        if key == 0 {\n+            return Ok(());\n+        }\n+        let member = self\n+            .members\n+            .get(&connection_id)\n+            .ok_or(\"unknown connection\")?;\n+        if member.role != ClientRole::Player || !matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }) {\n+            return Err(\"only accepted player commands have receipts\".into());\n+        }\n+        self.command_receipts.0.insert(\n+            (member.reconnect_token.clone(), key),\n+            NativeCommandReceipt {\n+                reconnect_token: member.reconnect_token.clone(),\n+                player_id: member.player_id,\n+                idempotency_key: key,\n+                kind: kind.clone(),\n+                result: result.clone(),\n+            },\n+        );\n+        self.command_receipts.prune();\n+        Ok(())\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    fn accepted(session: &mut NativeRoomSession, key: u64) -> CommandResult {\n+        let result = session.submit(1, &CommandKind::EndPhase, 0).unwrap();\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }));\n+        session\n+            .remember_command(1, key, &CommandKind::EndPhase, &result)\n+            .unwrap();\n+        result\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn accepted_receipt_survives_restore_and_rebinding_without_executing_again() {\n+        let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 2), 2);\n+        let token = session\n+            .join(1, Some(0), None)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .member\n+            .reconnect_token;\n+        let result = accepted(&mut session, 91);\n+        let state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+        let mut restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+        restored.join(10, Some(0), Some(token)).unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            restored\n+                .command_receipt(10, 91, &CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+                .unwrap(),\n+            Some(result)\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(restored.engine().revision(), 1);\n+        assert!(restored\n+            .command_receipt(\n+                10,\n+                91,\n+                &CommandKind::StartGame {\n+                    rng_seed: 4242,\n+                    player_count: 2,\n+                    ruleset: String::new()\n+                }\n+            )\n+            .is_err());\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn rollback_drops_candidate_receipt_and_reclaimed_seat_does_not_inherit_it() {\n+        let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 2), 2);\n+        session.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+        let before = session.checkpoint();\n+        accepted(&mut session, 91);\n+        session.rollback(before);\n+        assert!(session\n+            .command_receipt(1, 91, &CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .is_none());\n+        accepted(&mut session, 91);\n+        session.reclaim_seat(1);\n+        session.join(2, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+        assert!(session\n+            .command_receipt(2, 91, &CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .is_none());\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn restore_prunes_receipts_above_cap() {\n+        let entries: Vec<_> = (1..=MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS as u64 + 2)\n+            .map(|key| NativeCommandReceipt {\n+                reconnect_token: \"token\".into(),\n+                player_id: PlayerId::new(1),\n+                idempotency_key: key,\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                result: CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                    new_revision: key,\n+                    state_hash: [0; 32],\n+                },\n+            })\n+            .collect();\n+        let receipts =\n+            CommandReceipts::restore(&entries, MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS as u64 + 2, 2).unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(receipts.0.len(), MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS);\n+        assert!(!receipts.0.contains_key(&(\"token\".into(), 1)));\n+        assert!(receipts\n+            .0\n+            .contains_key(&(\"token\".into(), MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS as u64 + 2)));\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn receipts_are_bounded_and_keep_newest_revisions() {\n+        let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 2), 2);\n+        session.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+        let total = MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS + 3;\n+        for key in 1..=total as u64 {\n+            session\n+                .remember_command(\n+                    1,\n+                    key,\n+                    &CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+                    &CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                        new_revision: key,\n+                        state_hash: [0; 32],\n+                    },\n+                )\n+                .unwrap();\n+        }\n+        assert_eq!(session.command_receipts.0.len(), MAX_COMMAND_RECEIPTS);\n+        assert!(session\n+            .command_receipt(1, 1, &CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .is_none());\n+        assert!(session\n+            .command_receipt(1, total as u64, &CommandKind::EndPhase)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .is_some());\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn malformed_receipts_fail_restore_and_old_empty_state_keeps_its_json_shape() {\n+        let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 2), 2);\n+        session.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+        let empty = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+        assert!(serde_json::to_value(&empty)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .get(\"command_receipts\")\n+            .is_none());\n+        accepted(&mut session, 91);\n+        let state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+        for mutation in 0..6 {\n+            let mut invalid = state.clone();\n+            let receipt = &mut invalid.command_receipts[0];\n+            match mutation {\n+                0 => receipt.idempotency_key = 0,\n+                1 => receipt.reconnect_token.clear(),\n+                2 => receipt.player_id = PlayerId::NONE,\n+                3 => receipt.player_id = PlayerId::new(3),\n+                4 => {\n+                    receipt.result = CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                        new_revision: 99,\n+                        state_hash: [0; 32],\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                5 => invalid\n+                    .command_receipts\n+                    .push(invalid.command_receipts[0].clone()),\n+                _ => unreachable!(),\n+            }\n+            assert!(\n+                NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&invalid, vec![]).is_err(),\n+                \"mutation {mutation}\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"08d99add94666890edb00e0bb8ed8d425e8222d8","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/room_native/wal.rs","status":"added","additions":273,"deletions":0,"changes":273,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Fwal.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Fwal.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native%2Fwal.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,273 @@\n+//! Server-private, exhaustive command codec. Recovery never reruns a policy.\n+use super::*;\n+use engine_native::ChoiceOption;\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]\n+pub struct NativeWalState {\n+    pub base_snapshot_hex: String,\n+    pub entries: Vec<NativeWalEntry>,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]\n+pub struct NativeWalEntry {\n+    pub actor: u8,\n+    pub expected_revision: u64,\n+    pub dedup_id: u64,\n+    action: StoredNativeAction,\n+    pub revision: u64,\n+    pub state_hash: [u8; 32],\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]\n+enum StoredNativeAction {\n+    PlayCard {\n+        card: u32,\n+        targets: Vec<u8>,\n+    },\n+    NextPhase,\n+    ActivateSkill {\n+        skill: u16,\n+    },\n+    RevealGeneral {\n+        slot: u8,\n+    },\n+    Answer {\n+        choice_id: u64,\n+        selection: Vec<StoredChoiceOption>,\n+    },\n+    TimeoutAction {\n+        choice_id: u64,\n+        selection: Vec<StoredChoiceOption>,\n+    },\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]\n+enum StoredChoiceOption {\n+    Confirm,\n+    Pass,\n+    Card(u32),\n+    Player(u8),\n+    Tag(u8),\n+    Kind(u16),\n+    Skill(u16),\n+}\n+\n+impl From<ChoiceOption> for StoredChoiceOption {\n+    fn from(value: ChoiceOption) -> Self {\n+        match value {\n+            ChoiceOption::Confirm => Self::Confirm,\n+            ChoiceOption::Pass => Self::Pass,\n+            ChoiceOption::Card(v) => Self::Card(v),\n+            ChoiceOption::Player(v) => Self::Player(v),\n+            ChoiceOption::Tag(v) => Self::Tag(v),\n+            ChoiceOption::Kind(v) => Self::Kind(v),\n+            ChoiceOption::Skill(v) => Self::Skill(v),\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+impl From<StoredChoiceOption> for ChoiceOption {\n+    fn from(value: StoredChoiceOption) -> Self {\n+        match value {\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Confirm => Self::Confirm,\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Pass => Self::Pass,\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Card(v) => Self::Card(v),\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Player(v) => Self::Player(v),\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Tag(v) => Self::Tag(v),\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Kind(v) => Self::Kind(v),\n+            StoredChoiceOption::Skill(v) => Self::Skill(v),\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+impl From<GameAction> for StoredNativeAction {\n+    fn from(value: GameAction) -> Self {\n+        match value {\n+            GameAction::PlayCard { card, targets } => Self::PlayCard { card, targets },\n+            GameAction::NextPhase => Self::NextPhase,\n+            GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill } => Self::ActivateSkill { skill },\n+            GameAction::RevealGeneral { slot } => Self::RevealGeneral { slot },\n+            GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection,\n+            } => Self::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection: selection.into_iter().map(Into::into).collect(),\n+            },\n+            GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection,\n+            } => Self::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection: selection.into_iter().map(Into::into).collect(),\n+            },\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+impl From<StoredNativeAction> for GameAction {\n+    fn from(value: StoredNativeAction) -> Self {\n+        match value {\n+            StoredNativeAction::PlayCard { card, targets } => Self::PlayCard { card, targets },\n+            StoredNativeAction::NextPhase => Self::NextPhase,\n+            StoredNativeAction::ActivateSkill { skill } => Self::ActivateSkill { skill },\n+            StoredNativeAction::RevealGeneral { slot } => Self::RevealGeneral { slot },\n+            StoredNativeAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection,\n+            } => Self::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection: selection.into_iter().map(Into::into).collect(),\n+            },\n+            StoredNativeAction::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection,\n+            } => Self::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection: selection.into_iter().map(Into::into).collect(),\n+            },\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl NativeWalEntry {\n+    pub(super) fn new(command: GameCommand, engine: &Engine) -> Self {\n+        Self {\n+            actor: command.actor,\n+            expected_revision: command.expected_revision,\n+            dedup_id: command.dedup_id,\n+            action: command.action.into(),\n+            revision: engine.revision(),\n+            state_hash: engine.state_hash(),\n+        }\n+    }\n+    pub fn command(&self) -> GameCommand {\n+        GameCommand {\n+            actor: self.actor,\n+            expected_revision: self.expected_revision,\n+            dedup_id: self.dedup_id,\n+            action: self.action.clone().into(),\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl NativeWalState {\n+    pub(super) fn new(engine: &Engine) -> Self {\n+        Self {\n+            base_snapshot_hex: hex_encode(&engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&engine.save())),\n+            entries: vec![],\n+        }\n+    }\n+    pub(super) fn recover(\n+        &self,\n+        packs: &[&engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack],\n+    ) -> Result<Engine, String> {\n+        let bytes = hex_decode(&self.base_snapshot_hex).ok_or(\"WAL base hex invalid\")?;\n+        let snapshot =\n+            engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).map_err(|e| format!(\"{e:?}\"))?;\n+        let mut engine = if packs.is_empty() {\n+            Engine::restore(&snapshot)\n+        } else {\n+            Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, packs)\n+        }\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"{e:?}\"))?;\n+        for entry in &self.entries {\n+            let command = entry.command();\n+            if let GameAction::Answer { selection, .. }\n+            | GameAction::TimeoutAction { selection, .. } = &command.action\n+            {\n+                if selection.len() > 4096 || selection.iter().any(|o| matches!(o, ChoiceOption::Kind(k) if engine_native::archive::kind_from_code(*k).is_err())) {\n+                    return Err(\"invalid WAL selection\".into());\n+                }\n+            }\n+            // All values, including Kind, must be present in the restored authorized choice.\n+            // submit validates candidates, count, duplicates, observer, revision and dedup.\n+            if matches!(engine.submit(command), CommandOutcome::Rejected(_))\n+                || engine.revision() != entry.revision\n+                || engine.state_hash() != entry.state_hash\n+            {\n+                return Err(\"WAL command/revision/摘要不一致\".into());\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Ok(engine)\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl NativeRoomSession {\n+    pub(crate) fn compact_wal(&mut self, every: u64) {\n+        if every > 0 && self.engine.revision() % every == 0 {\n+            self.wal = NativeWalState::new(&self.engine);\n+        }\n+    }\n+    pub(super) fn validate_wal(&self) -> Result<engine_native::snap::StateSnapshot, String> {\n+        let engine = self.wal.recover(&self.pack_refs())?;\n+        let mut replayed = engine.save();\n+        // restore rotates authentication tokens; generation is session security, not rule state.\n+        replayed.auth_generation = self.engine.save().auth_generation;\n+        if engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&replayed)\n+            != engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&self.engine.save())\n+        {\n+            return Err(\"WAL final full snapshot mismatch\".into());\n+        }\n+        Ok(replayed)\n+    }\n+    pub(crate) fn recover_wal(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {\n+        let snapshot = self.validate_wal()?;\n+        let packs = self.pack_refs();\n+        let engine = if packs.is_empty() {\n+            Engine::restore(&snapshot)\n+        } else {\n+            Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &packs)\n+        }\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"{e:?}\"))?;\n+        self.replace_engine(engine);\n+        Ok(())\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn stored_actions_and_all_seven_choice_values_round_trip_without_debug_encoding() {\n+        let selection = vec![\n+            ChoiceOption::Confirm,\n+            ChoiceOption::Pass,\n+            ChoiceOption::Card(42),\n+            ChoiceOption::Player(3),\n+            ChoiceOption::Tag(4),\n+            ChoiceOption::Kind(0),\n+            ChoiceOption::Skill(65535),\n+        ];\n+        for action in [\n+            GameAction::PlayCard {\n+                card: 42,\n+                targets: vec![1, 3],\n+            },\n+            GameAction::NextPhase,\n+            GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill: 65535 },\n+            GameAction::RevealGeneral { slot: 1 },\n+            GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id: u64::MAX,\n+                selection: selection.clone(),\n+            },\n+            GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id: u64::MAX,\n+                selection,\n+            },\n+        ] {\n+            let encoded = serde_json::to_vec(&StoredNativeAction::from(action.clone())).unwrap();\n+            let decoded: StoredNativeAction = serde_json::from_slice(&encoded).unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(GameAction::from(decoded), action);\n+        }\n+        assert!(serde_json::from_str::<StoredNativeAction>(\n+            r#\"{\"TimeoutAction\":{\"choice_id\":1,\"selection\":[{\"Skill\":65536}]}}\"#\n+        )\n+        .is_err());\n+        assert!(serde_json::from_str::<StoredNativeAction>(\n+            r#\"{\"TimeoutAction\":{\"choice_id\":1,\"selection\":[],\"managed\":true}}\"#\n+        )\n+        .is_err());\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"1d897d0e648555a3a18e9ecc667f42fc383806fe","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/src/room_native_actor.rs","status":"added","additions":928,"deletions":0,"changes":928,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native_actor.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native_actor.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Fsrc%2Froom_native_actor.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,928 @@\n+//! NC09 原生权威房间 actor：**与旧线房间并行的原生 IO 接线**。\n+//!\n+//! 设计取舍（登记）：`room.rs` 的 actor 绑定旧线 `engine_core::Engine` 与旧线\n+//! `RoomPersist`（`engine_api::Snapshot` 是结构化旧线状态，不能直接装原生归档）；\n+//! 且旧线房间还承载锦标赛 WAL 分块签名等**已测试**能力。因此本模块**并行**实现\n+//! 原生 actor（复用 [`crate::room_native`] 的会话与持久化面、`RoomMsg` 消息类型、\n+//! `Outbound` 广播）；大厅按 `native_rooms` 配置选择原生或旧线房间。\n+//!\n+//! 覆盖：入座/重连/观战、命令（幂等重放、反冒充、接受后记 WAL）、快照请求、\n+//! 断开、名册广播、按 `snapshot_every` 落原生归档快照、WAL 重放恢复。\n+\n+use crate::native_room_store::{NativeRoomStore, StoredRoom};\n+use crate::native_view::{legal_actions_for, observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use crate::persist::RoomPersist;\n+use crate::room::{JoinReply, RoomHandle, RoomMsg};\n+use crate::room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+use crate::session::SendStatus;\n+use engine_api::{CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey};\n+use engine_protocol::{ClientRole, MessageHeader, SeatPresence, ServerMessage};\n+use std::collections::HashMap;\n+use tokio::sync::{mpsc, oneshot};\n+use tracing::{debug, info};\n+\n+/// NC09 缺席座位回收时限（秒；0 = 关闭）。由 `spawn_*` 侧从配置/环境写入，\n+/// 使 actor 循环不直接读环境变量（生产源码门禁：禁止 env::var）。\n+pub static SEAT_TIMEOUT_SECS: std::sync::atomic::AtomicU64 = std::sync::atomic::AtomicU64::new(600);\n+\n+/// 设置缺席座位回收时限（秒；0 = 关闭）。\n+pub fn set_seat_timeout_secs(secs: u64) {\n+    SEAT_TIMEOUT_SECS.store(secs, std::sync::atomic::Ordering::Relaxed);\n+}\n+\n+#[path = \"room_native_actor/durability.rs\"]\n+mod durability;\n+use durability::RoomDurability;\n+#[path = \"room_native_actor/timeout.rs\"]\n+mod timeout;\n+\n+/// 原生房间成员（含广播句柄）。\n+struct NativeActorMember {\n+    connection_id: u64,\n+    display_name: String,\n+    player_id: engine_api::PlayerId,\n+    seat: u8,\n+    role: ClientRole,\n+    outbound: Option<crate::session::Outbound>,\n+    /// NC09 缺席座位回收：该成员最后一次活动的时刻（惰性超时判据）。\n+    last_seen: std::time::Instant,\n+}\n+\n+/// 启动原生权威房间 actor（与 `room::spawn_room*` 同签名形态）。\n+\n+/// A reconnect replay for which the room has no saved receipt cannot prove the\n+/// command was not already executed. Reject it instead of risking a duplicate.\n+fn legacy_replay_rejection(\n+    session: &NativeRoomSession,\n+    connection_id: u64,\n+    player_id: engine_api::PlayerId,\n+    id: u64,\n+    conn_seq: u64,\n+    idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey,\n+) -> Result<ServerMessage, String> {\n+    let view = session.snapshot(connection_id).unwrap_or_else(|_| {\n+        crate::native_view::observer_snapshot_for(\n+            session.engine(),\n+            crate::native_view::RoomRole::Player,\n+            Some(player_id),\n+        )\n+    });\n+    Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+        header: MessageHeader::new(id, conn_seq, session.engine().revision()),\n+        idempotency_key,\n+        result: CommandResult::Rejected {\n+            reason: engine_api::RejectReason::IllegalAction {\n+                code: \"legacy_replay_no_receipt\".into(),\n+            },\n+        },\n+        view,\n+        legal_actions: legal_actions_for(session.engine(), player_id),\n+        choice: session.choice_for(RoomRole::Player, Some(player_id)),\n+        public_event_codes: vec![],\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+pub fn spawn_room_native(\n+    id: u64,\n+    session: NativeRoomSession,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+) -> RoomHandle {\n+    spawn_room_native_with_password(id, session, mailbox, snapshot_every, String::new())\n+}\n+\n+/// 启动原生房间 actor（带房间密码；空串 = 无密码）。\n+pub fn spawn_room_native_with_password(\n+    id: u64,\n+    session: NativeRoomSession,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    password: String,\n+) -> RoomHandle {\n+    spawn_room_native_persisted(id, session, mailbox, snapshot_every, password, None)\n+}\n+\n+/// 带**落盘存储**启动（每条接受命令后写盘；`None` = 不落盘，测试/临时房间）。\n+pub fn spawn_room_native_persisted(\n+    id: u64,\n+    session: NativeRoomSession,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    password: String,\n+    store: Option<NativeRoomStore>,\n+) -> RoomHandle {\n+    // 运行期只保留**哈希**（明文仅在入座比对时短暂存在）\n+    let hash = crate::native_room_store::password_hash(id, &password);\n+    spawn_room_native_persisted_with_hash(id, session, mailbox, snapshot_every, hash, store)\n+}\n+\n+/// 带**密码哈希**启动（恢复路径用：磁盘上只有哈希，没有明文）。\n+pub fn spawn_room_native_persisted_with_hash(\n+    id: u64,\n+    session: NativeRoomSession,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    password_hash: String,\n+    store: Option<NativeRoomStore>,\n+) -> RoomHandle {\n+    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel(mailbox);\n+    tokio::spawn(native_room_loop(\n+        id,\n+        session,\n+        rx,\n+        snapshot_every,\n+        password_hash,\n+        store,\n+    ));\n+    RoomHandle::new(id, tx)\n+}\n+\n+/// 从落盘记录恢复并启动房间（服务端启动时调用）。\n+///\n+/// `load_pack(ref)` 由调用方提供：按 `包名@版本` 重新装载同内容包（缺包/版本不符由\n+/// `from_saved` 明确报错）。\n+pub fn restore_room_from_disk(\n+    record: &StoredRoom,\n+    load_pack: &mut dyn FnMut(\n+        &str,\n+    )\n+        -> Result<engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack, String>,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    store: NativeRoomStore,\n+) -> Result<RoomHandle, String> {\n+    let mut packs = Vec::new();\n+    for r in &record.state.pack_refs {\n+        packs.push(load_pack(r)?);\n+    }\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&record.state, packs)?;\n+    if session.engine().outcome().is_some() {\n+        return Err(\"原生房间已结束，不恢复为运行中房间\".into());\n+    }\n+    store.save(record)?;\n+    // 恢复时把**哈希**带回运行期：入座校验用哈希比对（运行期不再持有明文）\n+    Ok(spawn_room_native_persisted_with_hash(\n+        record.room_id,\n+        session,\n+        mailbox,\n+        snapshot_every,\n+        record.password_hash.clone(),\n+        Some(store),\n+    ))\n+}\n+\n+async fn native_room_loop(\n+    id: u64,\n+    mut session: NativeRoomSession,\n+    mut rx: mpsc::Receiver<RoomMsg>,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    room_password: String,\n+    store: Option<NativeRoomStore>,\n+) {\n+    // NC09 缺席座位回收（惰性）：入座满员且新客户端要座位时，回收**离线**且超过\n+    // 该时限的成员（0 = 关闭）。时限来自环境变量 `NONAME_NATIVE_SEAT_TIMEOUT_SECS`\n+    // （默认 600 秒），由 spawn 侧读取后传入，避免在生产源码里直接读环境变量。\n+    let seat_timeout_secs = SEAT_TIMEOUT_SECS.load(std::sync::atomic::Ordering::Relaxed);\n+    let mut durability = RoomDurability::new(id, room_password.clone(), store);\n+    // 旧线锦标赛 WAL 面保留占位（原生分块签名未做，登记待办）\n+    let _legacy_wal = RoomPersist::new();\n+    let mut members: HashMap<u64, NativeActorMember> = session\n+        .members()\n+        .map(|m| {\n+            (\n+                m.connection_id,\n+                NativeActorMember {\n+                    connection_id: m.connection_id,\n+                    display_name: \"player\".into(),\n+                    player_id: m.player_id,\n+                    seat: m.seat,\n+                    role: m.role,\n+                    outbound: None,\n+                    last_seen: std::time::Instant::now(),\n+                },\n+            )\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    let mut last_revision = session.engine().revision();\n+    if let Err(error) = session\n+        .sync_deadline()\n+        .and_then(|_| durability.commit(&mut session, None))\n+    {\n+        tracing::error!(room = id, %error, \"initial choice deadline could not be persisted\");\n+        return;\n+    }\n+    let mut automatic_allowed = true;\n+    let mut paused_revision = None;\n+    loop {\n+        let revision = session.engine().revision();\n+        let now = crate::room_native::unix_ms();\n+        if paused_revision != Some(revision) {\n+            match now {\n+                Ok(now) => {\n+                    if let Some(candidate) = session.automatic_command(now, automatic_allowed) {\n+                        if let Err(error) = timeout::automatic_step(\n+                            id,\n+                            &mut session,\n+                            &mut durability,\n+                            &mut members,\n+                            snapshot_every,\n+                            candidate,\n+                        )\n+                        .await\n+                        {\n+                            tracing::warn!(room = id, %error, \"automatic input paused\");\n+                            paused_revision = Some(session.engine().revision());\n+                        }\n+                        last_revision = session.engine().revision();\n+                        automatic_allowed = false;\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                Err(ref error) => {\n+                    tracing::error!(room = id, %error, \"automatic clock unavailable\");\n+                    paused_revision = Some(revision);\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        let now = now.ok();\n+        let managed_ready = now.is_some_and(|now| session.automatic_command(now, true).is_some());\n+        let wait = if paused_revision == Some(revision) {\n+            None\n+        } else if managed_ready {\n+            Some(std::time::Duration::ZERO)\n+        } else {\n+            session.timeout_state().deadline.as_ref().map(|d| {\n+                std::time::Duration::from_millis(\n+                    d.deadline_unix_ms\n+                        .saturating_sub(now.expect(\"clock checked before timer\")),\n+                )\n+            })\n+        };\n+        // Expiry was checked before removing a message; managed successors yield to queued people.\n+        let msg = tokio::select! {\n+            biased;\n+            _ = async {\n+                if !managed_ready {\n+                    match wait {\n+                        Some(delay) => tokio::time::sleep(delay).await,\n+                        None => std::future::pending::<()>().await,\n+                    }\n+                } else {\n+                    std::future::pending::<()>().await\n+                }\n+            } => {\n+                automatic_allowed = true;\n+                continue;\n+            },\n+            msg = rx.recv() => match msg {\n+                Some(msg) => msg,\n+                None => break,\n+            },\n+            _ = async {\n+                match wait {\n+                    Some(delay) => tokio::time::sleep(delay).await,\n+                    None => std::future::pending::<()>().await,\n+                }\n+            } => {\n+                automatic_allowed = true;\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+        };\n+        automatic_allowed = true;\n+        match msg {\n+            RoomMsg::Join {\n+                connection_id,\n+                display_name,\n+                preferred_seat,\n+                reconnect_token,\n+                password: pw,\n+                outbound,\n+                reply,\n+            } => {\n+                if !room_password.is_empty()\n+                    && crate::native_room_store::password_hash(id, &pw) != room_password\n+                {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(\"unauthorized\".into()));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                let mut before = match durability.checkpoint(&session) {\n+                    Ok(before) => before,\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                let mut reclaimed = None;\n+                // 回收与新入座同一次提交，失败不能丢失原座位或令牌。\n+                if seat_timeout_secs > 0\n+                    && reconnect_token.is_none()\n+                    && !members.contains_key(&connection_id)\n+                {\n+                    let idle = std::time::Duration::from_secs(seat_timeout_secs);\n+                    let now = std::time::Instant::now();\n+                    let occupied = members\n+                        .values()\n+                        .filter(|m| m.role == ClientRole::Player)\n+                        .count();\n+                    if occupied >= session.max_seats() as usize {\n+                        let victim = members\n+                            .values()\n+                            .filter(|m| m.role == ClientRole::Player && m.outbound.is_none())\n+                            .min_by_key(|m| m.last_seen)\n+                            .map(|m| (m.connection_id, m.seat, m.last_seen));\n+                        if let Some((conn, seat, seen)) = victim {\n+                            if now.duration_since(seen) >= idle {\n+                                if before.is_none() {\n+                                    before = Some(session.checkpoint());\n+                                }\n+                                session.reclaim_seat(conn);\n+                                reclaimed = Some((conn, seat));\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                match session.join(connection_id, preferred_seat, reconnect_token) {\n+                    Ok(joined) => {\n+                        paused_revision = None;\n+                        if let Err(error) = durability.commit(&mut session, before) {\n+                            let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                            continue;\n+                        }\n+                        if let Some((conn, seat)) = reclaimed {\n+                            members.remove(&conn);\n+                            info!(room = id, conn, seat, \"原生房间回收缺席座位（惰性超时）\");\n+                        }\n+                        let m = NativeActorMember {\n+                            last_seen: std::time::Instant::now(),\n+                            connection_id,\n+                            display_name,\n+                            player_id: joined.member.player_id,\n+                            seat: joined.member.seat,\n+                            role: joined.member.role,\n+                            outbound: Some(outbound),\n+                        };\n+                        let reply_payload = JoinReply {\n+                            player_id: joined.member.player_id.raw(),\n+                            seat: joined.member.seat,\n+                            role: joined.member.role,\n+                            reconnect_token: joined.member.reconnect_token.clone(),\n+                            view: joined.view,\n+                            choice: session.choice_for(\n+                                joined.member.role.into(),\n+                                Some(joined.member.player_id),\n+                            ),\n+                            legal_actions: joined.legal_actions,\n+                        };\n+                        members.retain(|connection, _| {\n+                            session\n+                                .members()\n+                                .any(|member| member.connection_id == *connection)\n+                        });\n+                        members.insert(connection_id, m);\n+                        broadcast_roster_native(id, &mut members, &session).await;\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Ok(reply_payload));\n+                    }\n+                    Err(e) => {\n+                        if let Some(before) = before {\n+                            session.rollback(before);\n+                        }\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(e));\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+            RoomMsg::Spectate {\n+                connection_id,\n+                display_name,\n+                outbound,\n+                reply,\n+            } => {\n+                if members.contains_key(&connection_id) {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(\"connection already in room\".into()));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                let before = match durability.checkpoint(&session) {\n+                    Ok(before) => before,\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                let spec = session.spectate(connection_id);\n+                if let Err(error) = durability.commit(&mut session, before) {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                let m = NativeActorMember {\n+                    last_seen: std::time::Instant::now(),\n+                    connection_id,\n+                    display_name,\n+                    player_id: engine_api::PlayerId::NONE,\n+                    seat: u8::MAX,\n+                    role: ClientRole::Spectator,\n+                    outbound: Some(outbound),\n+                };\n+                members.insert(connection_id, m);\n+                broadcast_roster_native(id, &mut members, &session).await;\n+                let _ = reply.send(Ok(JoinReply {\n+                    player_id: 0,\n+                    seat: u8::MAX,\n+                    role: ClientRole::Spectator,\n+                    reconnect_token: spec.member.reconnect_token.clone(),\n+                    view: spec.view,\n+                    choice: None,\n+                    legal_actions: Vec::new(),\n+                }));\n+            }\n+            RoomMsg::Submit {\n+                connection_id,\n+                header,\n+                command,\n+                idempotency_key,\n+                replay,\n+                reply,\n+            } => {\n+                if let Some(m) = members.get_mut(&connection_id) {\n+                    m.last_seen = std::time::Instant::now();\n+                }\n+                let Some(m) = members.get(&connection_id) else {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(\"not in room\".into()));\n+                    continue;\n+                };\n+                if m.role != ClientRole::Player {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(\"spectator cannot submit\".into()));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                let checkpoint = match durability.checkpoint(&session) {\n+                    Ok(before) => before,\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                // 幂等重放\n+                match session.command_receipt(connection_id, idempotency_key.0, &command.kind) {\n+                    Ok(Some(prev)) => {\n+                        let view = session.snapshot(connection_id).unwrap_or_else(|_| {\n+                            crate::native_view::observer_snapshot_for(\n+                                session.engine(),\n+                                crate::native_view::RoomRole::Player,\n+                                Some(m.player_id),\n+                            )\n+                        });\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                            header: MessageHeader::new(\n+                                id,\n+                                header.conn_seq,\n+                                session.engine().revision(),\n+                            ),\n+                            idempotency_key,\n+                            result: prev,\n+                            view,\n+                            legal_actions: legal_actions_for(session.engine(), m.player_id),\n+                            choice: session.choice_for(m.role.into(), Some(m.player_id)),\n+                            public_event_codes: vec![],\n+                        }));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                    Ok(None) => {}\n+                }\n+                if replay {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(legacy_replay_rejection(\n+                        &session,\n+                        connection_id,\n+                        m.player_id,\n+                        id,\n+                        header.conn_seq,\n+                        idempotency_key,\n+                    ));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                // 反冒充：以入座座位为准（协议 actor 不可信）\n+                let expected = if header.revision != 0 {\n+                    header.revision\n+                } else if command.expected_revision.0 != 0 {\n+                    command.expected_revision.0\n+                } else {\n+                    session.engine().revision()\n+                };\n+                if header.revision != 0\n+                    && command.expected_revision.0 != 0\n+                    && header.revision != command.expected_revision.0\n+                {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(\"conflicting command revisions\".into()));\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+                let before = session.engine().revision();\n+                let result = match session.submit(connection_id, &command.kind, expected) {\n+                    Ok(r) => r,\n+                    Err(e) => {\n+                        if let Some(before) = checkpoint {\n+                            session.rollback(before);\n+                        }\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(e));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                if let CommandResult::Accepted {\n+                    new_revision,\n+                    state_hash: _,\n+                } = &result\n+                {\n+                    if let Err(error) = session.remember_command(\n+                        connection_id,\n+                        idempotency_key.0,\n+                        &command.kind,\n+                        &result,\n+                    ) {\n+                        if let Some(before) = checkpoint {\n+                            session.rollback(before);\n+                        }\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                    session.compact_wal(snapshot_every);\n+                    if let Err(error) = durability.commit(&mut session, checkpoint) {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                    paused_revision = None;\n+                    if *new_revision > before {\n+                        last_revision = *new_revision;\n+                    }\n+                } else if let Some(before) = checkpoint {\n+                    session.rollback(before);\n+                }\n+                let public_event_codes = session.take_public_event_codes();\n+                let view = session.snapshot(connection_id).unwrap_or_else(|_| {\n+                    observer_snapshot_for(session.engine(), RoomRole::Player, Some(m.player_id))\n+                });\n+                let legal = legal_actions_for(session.engine(), m.player_id);\n+                let choice = session.choice_for(m.role.into(), Some(m.player_id));\n+                let _ = reply.send(Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(id, header.conn_seq, last_revision),\n+                    idempotency_key,\n+                    result: result.clone(),\n+                    view,\n+                    legal_actions: legal,\n+                    choice,\n+                    public_event_codes: public_event_codes.clone(),\n+                }));\n+                // 命令后**个性化推送**：其余成员各收自己的视图/动作/选择（提交者走 oneshot）。\n+                // 发送必须有界：慢客户端的队列满时立即标记/移出广播，绝不 await。\n+                let mut stalled = Vec::new();\n+                for other in members.values() {\n+                    if other.connection_id == connection_id {\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                    let Some(out) = other.outbound.as_ref() else {\n+                        continue;\n+                    };\n+                    let role = match other.role {\n+                        ClientRole::Player => RoomRole::Player,\n+                        ClientRole::Spectator => RoomRole::Spectator,\n+                        ClientRole::Referee => RoomRole::Referee,\n+                    };\n+                    let seat = if other.role == ClientRole::Player {\n+                        Some(other.player_id)\n+                    } else {\n+                        None\n+                    };\n+                    let msg = ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                        header: MessageHeader::new(id, 0, last_revision),\n+                        idempotency_key,\n+                        result: result.clone(),\n+                        view: observer_snapshot_for(session.engine(), role, seat),\n+                        legal_actions: if other.role == ClientRole::Player {\n+                            legal_actions_for(session.engine(), other.player_id)\n+                        } else {\n+                            Vec::new()\n+                        },\n+                        choice: session.choice_for(role, seat),\n+                        public_event_codes: public_event_codes.clone(),\n+                    };\n+                    if out.try_send(&msg) == SendStatus::Full {\n+                        stalled.push(other.connection_id);\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                drop_stalled(&mut members, stalled);\n+                broadcast_roster_native(id, &mut members, &session).await;\n+            }\n+            RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id,\n+                header,\n+                reply,\n+            } => match session.snapshot(connection_id) {\n+                Ok(view) => {\n+                    let member = members.get(&connection_id);\n+                    let role = member.map(|m| m.role.into()).unwrap_or(RoomRole::Spectator);\n+                    let (seat, is_player) = match member {\n+                        Some(m) if m.role == ClientRole::Player => (Some(m.player_id), true),\n+                        _ => (None, false),\n+                    };\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Ok(ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                        header: MessageHeader::new(\n+                            id,\n+                            header.conn_seq,\n+                            session.engine().revision(),\n+                        ),\n+                        view,\n+                        choice: session.choice_for(role, seat),\n+                        legal_actions: if is_player {\n+                            legal_actions_for(session.engine(), seat.expect(\"player seat\"))\n+                        } else {\n+                            Vec::new()\n+                        },\n+                    }));\n+                }\n+                Err(e) => {\n+                    let _ = reply.send(Err(e));\n+                }\n+            },\n+            RoomMsg::ChooseGeneral {\n+                connection_id,\n+                name,\n+                reply,\n+            } => {\n+                // 座位以入座座位为准（反冒充）；成功后向全体推送新视图（选将不推进\n+                // revision，故推送判据是「操作成功」而不是 revision 变化）。\n+                let before = match durability.checkpoint(&session) {\n+                    Ok(before) => before,\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                match session.assign_general(connection_id, &name) {\n+                    Ok((revision, hash)) => {\n+                        if let Err(error) = durability.commit(&mut session, before) {\n+                            let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                            continue;\n+                        }\n+\n+                        paused_revision = None;\n+                        let mut stalled = Vec::new();\n+                        for other in members.values() {\n+                            let Some(out) = other.outbound.as_ref() else {\n+                                continue;\n+                            };\n+                            let role = match other.role {\n+                                ClientRole::Player => RoomRole::Player,\n+                                ClientRole::Spectator => RoomRole::Spectator,\n+                                ClientRole::Referee => RoomRole::Referee,\n+                            };\n+                            let seat = if other.role == ClientRole::Player {\n+                                Some(other.player_id)\n+                            } else {\n+                                None\n+                            };\n+                            let msg = ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                                header: MessageHeader::new(id, 0, revision),\n+                                view: observer_snapshot_for(session.engine(), role, seat),\n+                                choice: session.choice_for(role, seat),\n+                                legal_actions: if other.role == ClientRole::Player {\n+                                    legal_actions_for(session.engine(), seat.expect(\"player seat\"))\n+                                } else {\n+                                    Vec::new()\n+                                },\n+                            };\n+                            if out.try_send(&msg) == SendStatus::Full {\n+                                stalled.push(other.connection_id);\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                        drop_stalled(&mut members, stalled);\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Ok(format!(\n+                            \"{{\\\"revision\\\":{revision},\\\"state_hash\\\":\\\"{hash}\\\"}}\"\n+                        )));\n+                    }\n+                    Err(e) => {\n+                        if let Some(before) = before {\n+                            session.rollback(before);\n+                        }\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(e));\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+\n+            RoomMsg::Disconnect { connection_id } => {\n+                if let Some(m) = members.get_mut(&connection_id) {\n+                    m.outbound = None;\n+                    m.last_seen = std::time::Instant::now();\n+                    session.disconnect(connection_id);\n+                    debug!(\n+                        room = id,\n+                        conn = connection_id,\n+                        \"native member disconnected\"\n+                    );\n+                }\n+                broadcast_roster_native(id, &mut members, &session).await;\n+            }\n+            RoomMsg::Recover { reply } => {\n+                let before = match durability.checkpoint(&session) {\n+                    Ok(before) => before,\n+                    Err(error) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                        continue;\n+                    }\n+                };\n+                match session.recover_wal() {\n+                    Ok(()) => {\n+                        if let Err(error) = durability.commit(&mut session, before) {\n+                            let _ = reply.send(Err(error));\n+                            continue;\n+                        }\n+                        paused_revision = None;\n+                        last_revision = session.engine().revision();\n+                        debug!(room = id, \"native room recovered\");\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Ok(()));\n+                    }\n+                    Err(e) => {\n+                        let _ = reply.send(Err(e));\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    info!(room = id, \"native room task exit\");\n+}\n+\n+fn roster_message(\n+    room_id: u64,\n+    members: &HashMap<u64, NativeActorMember>,\n+    session: &NativeRoomSession,\n+) -> ServerMessage {\n+    let mut seats: Vec<SeatPresence> = members\n+        .values()\n+        .filter(|m| m.role == ClientRole::Player)\n+        .map(|m| SeatPresence {\n+            seat: m.seat,\n+            player_id: m.player_id.raw(),\n+            display_name: m.display_name.clone(),\n+            connected: m.outbound.is_some(),\n+            managed: session.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&m.seat),\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    seats.sort_by_key(|s| s.seat);\n+    ServerMessage::RoomRoster {\n+        room_id,\n+        seats,\n+        started: true,\n+        finished: session.engine().outcome().is_some(),\n+        choice_timeout_secs: Some(session.timeout_state().choice_timeout_secs),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 慢连接移出房间广播（但保留座位/令牌，供重连时恢复）。\n+fn drop_stalled(members: &mut HashMap<u64, NativeActorMember>, stalled: Vec<u64>) {\n+    for connection_id in stalled {\n+        if let Some(m) = members.get_mut(&connection_id) {\n+            if m.outbound.take().is_some() {\n+                m.last_seen = std::time::Instant::now();\n+                tracing::warn!(\n+                    conn = connection_id,\n+                    \"房间广播队列已满，断开慢连接并要求重连同步\"\n+                );\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+async fn broadcast_roster_native(\n+    room_id: u64,\n+    members: &mut HashMap<u64, NativeActorMember>,\n+    session: &NativeRoomSession,\n+) {\n+    let msg = roster_message(room_id, members, session);\n+    let mut stalled = Vec::new();\n+    for m in members.values() {\n+        if let Some(out) = &m.outbound {\n+            if out.try_send(&msg) == SendStatus::Full {\n+                stalled.push(m.connection_id);\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    if stalled.is_empty() {\n+        return;\n+    }\n+    drop_stalled(members, stalled);\n+    // 已断开的连接不应再出现在名册的 connected=true 中；仅对剩余连接重发。\n+    let msg = roster_message(room_id, members, session);\n+    for m in members.values() {\n+        if let Some(out) = &m.outbound {\n+            let _ = out.try_send(&msg);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 后端选择：按配置构造房间句柄。\n+///\n+/// - `native = false` → 由调用方走旧线 `room::spawn_room_with_engine`（本函数返回 `None`）；\n+/// - `native = true` → 用 `NativeContent` 装载配置指定的包构建原生会话并起原生 actor。\n+///   装载失败**明确报错**（不静默回退旧线——回退会让「原生后端已启用」变成假象）。\n+pub fn spawn_native_room_if_configured(\n+    id: u64,\n+    players: u8,\n+    seed: u64,\n+    password: String,\n+    mailbox: usize,\n+    snapshot_every: u64,\n+    content: &crate::native::NativeContent,\n+    native: bool,\n+    namespace: &str,\n+    packages: &[String],\n+    store: Option<NativeRoomStore>,\n+    choice_timeout_secs: u8,\n+) -> Result<Option<RoomHandle>, String> {\n+    if !native {\n+        return Ok(None);\n+    }\n+    let mut packs = Vec::new();\n+    let mut frozen = Vec::new();\n+    for id in packages {\n+        let loaded = content.load_scoped(Some(namespace), id)?;\n+        packs.push(loaded.pack);\n+        frozen.push(loaded.frozen);\n+    }\n+    let refs: Vec<&engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack> = packs.iter().collect();\n+    let engine = if refs.is_empty() {\n+        engine_native::Engine::new(seed, players as usize)\n+    } else {\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, players as usize, &refs)\n+            .map_err(|e| format!(\"原生房间建局失败: {e:?}\"))?\n+    };\n+    let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, packs, players);\n+    session.set_frozen_packages(frozen);\n+    session.set_choice_timeout_secs(choice_timeout_secs)?;\n+    session.sync_deadline()?;\n+    let hash = crate::native_room_store::password_hash(id, &password);\n+    let mut durability = RoomDurability::new(id, hash, store.clone());\n+    durability.commit(&mut session, None)?;\n+    Ok(Some(spawn_room_native_persisted(\n+        id,\n+        session,\n+        mailbox,\n+        snapshot_every,\n+        password,\n+        store,\n+    )))\n+}\n+\n+/// 供测试构造：把原生会话交给 actor 的便捷入口（`oneshot` 回复通道）。\n+pub fn join_reply_channel() -> (\n+    oneshot::Sender<Result<JoinReply, String>>,\n+    oneshot::Receiver<Result<JoinReply, String>>,\n+) {\n+    oneshot::channel()\n+}\n+\n+/// 供测试构造命令提交通道。\n+pub fn submit_reply_channel() -> (\n+    oneshot::Sender<Result<ServerMessage, String>>,\n+    oneshot::Receiver<Result<ServerMessage, String>>,\n+) {\n+    oneshot::channel()\n+}\n+\n+/// 供测试构造幂等键。\n+pub fn idem(key: u64) -> IdempotencyKey {\n+    IdempotencyKey(key)\n+}\n+\n+/// 供测试构造期望修订号。\n+pub fn expected(revision: u64) -> ExpectedRevision {\n+    ExpectedRevision(revision)\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod replay_tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn replay_without_receipt_is_rejected_not_executed() {\n+        let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(engine_native::Engine::new(7, 2), 2);\n+        session.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+        let before = session.engine().revision();\n+        let message = legacy_replay_rejection(\n+            &session,\n+            1,\n+            engine_api::PlayerId::new(1),\n+            9,\n+            3,\n+            IdempotencyKey(77),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+        let ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. } = message else {\n+            panic!(\"expected outcome\");\n+        };\n+        assert!(matches!(\n+            result,\n+            CommandResult::Rejected {\n+                reason: engine_api::RejectReason::IllegalAction { code }\n+            } if code == \"legacy_replay_no_receipt\"\n+        ));\n+        assert_eq!(session.engine().revision(), before);\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4fd1fd367f6525ac87bd1753efd4bf7e3076873d","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/adr0787_timeout.rs","status":"added","additions":723,"deletions":0,"changes":723,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fadr0787_timeout.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fadr0787_timeout.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fadr0787_timeout.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,723 @@\n+//! ADR0787: actual commands, durable control and the public actor timer.\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_room_store.rs\"]\n+mod native_room_store;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native.rs\"]\n+mod room_native;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native_actor.rs\"]\n+mod room_native_actor;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+use engine_api::{CommandKind, CommandResult};\n+use engine_native::{ChoiceOption, Engine, GameAction, GameCommand};\n+use room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+\n+fn pending() -> NativeRoomSession {\n+    let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 4), 4);\n+    for seat in 0..4 {\n+        session\n+            .join(10 + u64::from(seat), Some(seat), None)\n+            .unwrap();\n+    }\n+    for _ in 0..1000 {\n+        if session.engine().open_choice().is_some() {\n+            return session;\n+        }\n+        let seat = session.engine().turn().current;\n+        let action = session\n+            .engine()\n+            .legal_actions(seat)\n+            .into_iter()\n+            .next()\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let result = session\n+            .submit_native(seat, action, session.engine().revision())\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }));\n+    }\n+    panic!(\"fixture must open a real machine choice\");\n+}\n+fn bytes(session: &NativeRoomSession) -> Vec<u8> {\n+    let mut saved = session.engine().save();\n+    saved.auth_generation = 0;\n+    engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&saved)\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn timeout_uses_answer_validation_and_recorded_command_replays_full_snapshot() {\n+    let mut session = pending();\n+    let choice = session.engine().open_choice().unwrap().clone();\n+    let before = bytes(&session);\n+    let deadline = session.timeout_state().deadline.clone().unwrap();\n+    assert!(session\n+        .automatic_command(deadline.deadline_unix_ms - 1, true)\n+        .is_none());\n+    let (seat, action, takeover) = session\n+        .automatic_command(deadline.deadline_unix_ms, true)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(takeover);\n+    assert!(matches!(action, GameAction::TimeoutAction { .. }));\n+    for (actor, action) in [\n+        ((seat + 1) % 4, action.clone()),\n+        (\n+            seat,\n+            GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id: choice.id + 1,\n+                selection: vec![],\n+            },\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            seat,\n+            GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+                choice_id: choice.id,\n+                selection: vec![ChoiceOption::Card(u32::MAX)],\n+            },\n+        ),\n+    ] {\n+        assert!(matches!(\n+            session.submit_automatic(actor, action, true).unwrap(),\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { .. }\n+        ));\n+        assert_eq!(bytes(&session), before);\n+        assert!(session.timeout_state().managed_seats.is_empty());\n+    }\n+    let mut answer = session.engine().clone();\n+    let GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+        choice_id,\n+        selection,\n+    } = action.clone()\n+    else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    let expected = answer.revision();\n+    let dedup = answer.save().last_dedup + 1;\n+    assert!(!matches!(\n+        answer.submit(GameCommand {\n+            actor: seat,\n+            expected_revision: expected,\n+            dedup_id: dedup,\n+            action: GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id,\n+                selection\n+            }\n+        }),\n+        engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)\n+    ));\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        session.submit_automatic(seat, action, takeover).unwrap(),\n+        CommandResult::Accepted { .. }\n+    ));\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        bytes(&session),\n+        engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&answer.save())\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(session.engine().log(), answer.log());\n+    assert!(session.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    let state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    let json = serde_json::to_value(&state).unwrap();\n+    assert!(json[\"wal\"][\"entries\"]\n+        .as_array()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .iter()\n+        .any(|e| e[\"action\"].get(\"TimeoutAction\").is_some()));\n+    let restored =\n+        NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&serde_json::from_value(json.clone()).unwrap(), vec![])\n+            .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(bytes(&session), bytes(&restored));\n+    for key in [\"actor\", \"expected_revision\", \"dedup_id\", \"revision\"] {\n+        let mut corrupt = json.clone();\n+        let entries = corrupt[\"wal\"][\"entries\"].as_array_mut().unwrap();\n+        entries.last_mut().unwrap()[key] = serde_json::json!(u64::MAX);\n+        assert!(\n+            serde_json::from_value::<room_native::NativeRoomState>(corrupt)\n+                .map_or(true, |state| NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![])\n+                    .is_err()),\n+            \"{key}\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn durable_deadline_configuration_reconnect_illegal_and_receipt_rules() {\n+    let mut session = pending();\n+    let deadline = session.timeout_state().deadline.clone().unwrap();\n+    for secs in [10, 15, 30, 60, 90] {\n+        session.set_choice_timeout_secs(secs).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    for secs in [0, 9, 11, 91, 255] {\n+        assert!(session.set_choice_timeout_secs(secs).is_err());\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(session.timeout_state().deadline.as_ref(), Some(&deadline));\n+    let (seat, action, takeover) = session\n+        .automatic_command(deadline.deadline_unix_ms, true)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let conn = 10 + u64::from(seat);\n+    let token = session\n+        .members()\n+        .find(|m| m.seat == seat)\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .reconnect_token\n+        .clone();\n+    session.submit_automatic(seat, action, takeover).unwrap();\n+    assert!(session.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    let snapshot = session.snapshot_hex();\n+    let state = session.export_state(&snapshot);\n+    let mut restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        serde_json::to_value(restored.timeout_state()).unwrap(),\n+        serde_json::to_value(session.timeout_state()).unwrap()\n+    );\n+    let current_deadline = restored.timeout_state().deadline.clone();\n+    assert!(restored.join(100, None, Some(\"invalid\".into())).is_err());\n+    assert!(restored.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    assert!(restored\n+        .submit(\n+            conn,\n+            &CommandKind::TimeoutAction { choice_id: None },\n+            restored.engine().revision()\n+        )\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(restored.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    restored.join(100, Some(seat), Some(token)).unwrap();\n+    assert!(!restored.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    assert_eq!(restored.timeout_state().deadline, current_deadline);\n+    assert!(restored\n+        .submit(conn, &CommandKind::EndPhase, restored.engine().revision())\n+        .is_err());\n+    // Optional aggregates preserve the exact legacy checksum shape, but cannot restore new rules.\n+    let mut missing = serde_json::to_value(&state).unwrap();\n+    missing.as_object_mut().unwrap().remove(\"timeout\");\n+    missing.as_object_mut().unwrap().remove(\"wal\");\n+    let old: room_native::NativeRoomState = serde_json::from_value(missing.clone()).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(&old).unwrap(), missing);\n+    assert!(NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&old, vec![]).is_err());\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn real_actor_ten_seconds_commits_timeout_to_disk() {\n+    let mut session = pending();\n+    session.set_choice_timeout_secs(10).unwrap();\n+    // Fixture already opened a default window: set configuration before creating the actor window.\n+    let mut state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    let deadline = state.timeout.as_mut().unwrap().deadline.as_mut().unwrap();\n+    deadline.deadline_unix_ms = room_native::unix_ms().unwrap() + 10_000;\n+    let seat = deadline.observer;\n+    let choice_id = deadline.choice_id;\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path());\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native_persisted(\n+        787,\n+        session,\n+        16,\n+        1000,\n+        String::new(),\n+        Some(store.clone()),\n+    );\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(128);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    let token = state\n+        .members\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|m| m.seat == seat)\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .reconnect_token\n+        .clone();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 999,\n+            display_name: \"timeout\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(seat),\n+            reconnect_token: Some(token),\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let joined = response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let started = std::time::Instant::now();\n+    let choice = joined.choice.unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(u64::from(choice.choice_id.raw()), choice_id);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        choice.deadline_unix_ms,\n+        state\n+            .timeout\n+            .as_ref()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .deadline\n+            .as_ref()\n+            .map(|d| d.deadline_unix_ms)\n+    );\n+    tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(12), async {\n+        while let Some(text) = rx.recv().await {\n+            if let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { .. } =\n+                engine_protocol::decode_s2c(&text).unwrap()\n+            {\n+                break;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    })\n+    .await\n+    .expect(\"10 second deadline must run actual actor\");\n+    assert!(started.elapsed() >= std::time::Duration::from_secs(9));\n+    let saved = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    let wal = serde_json::to_value(&saved.state.wal).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        wal[\"entries\"]\n+            .as_array()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .iter()\n+            .filter(|e| e[\"action\"].get(\"TimeoutAction\").is_some())\n+            .count(),\n+        1\n+    );\n+    NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&saved.state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn real_329_archive_rejects_without_rewriting_its_original_room_checksum() {\n+    let raw = include_bytes!(\"fixtures/adr0787-room329.json\");\n+    let record: native_room_store::StoredRoom = serde_json::from_slice(raw).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        native_room_store::state_checksum(&record.state),\n+        record.checksum\n+    );\n+    let error = match NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&record.state, vec![]) {\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"329 must reject\"),\n+        Err(e) => e,\n+    };\n+    assert!(error.contains(\"RuleVersionMismatch\"), \"{error}\");\n+    assert!(record.state.timeout.is_none());\n+    assert!(record.state.wal.is_none());\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn timeout_and_human_races_commit_once_and_replayed_receipt_does_not_release_control() {\n+    let mut session = pending();\n+    let deadline = session.timeout_state().deadline.clone().unwrap();\n+    let (seat, timeout, _) = session\n+        .automatic_command(deadline.deadline_unix_ms, true)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let GameAction::TimeoutAction {\n+        choice_id,\n+        selection,\n+    } = timeout.clone()\n+    else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    let conn = 10 + u64::from(seat);\n+    let before = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    let command = CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+        choice_id: engine_api::ChoiceId::new(choice_id as u32),\n+        selections: (0..selection.len() as u32).collect(),\n+        cancelled: selection.is_empty(),\n+    };\n+    let result = session\n+        .submit(conn, &command, session.engine().revision())\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }));\n+    session\n+        .remember_command(conn, 787, &command, &result)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        session\n+            .submit_automatic(seat, timeout.clone(), true)\n+            .unwrap(),\n+        CommandResult::Rejected { .. }\n+    ));\n+    assert!(session.timeout_state().managed_seats.is_empty());\n+    let mut managed = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    managed.timeout.as_mut().unwrap().managed_seats = vec![seat];\n+    let mut managed = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&managed, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        managed.command_receipt(conn, 787, &command).unwrap(),\n+        Some(result)\n+    );\n+    assert!(managed.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    assert!(managed\n+        .submit(\n+            conn,\n+            &CommandKind::TimeoutAction { choice_id: None },\n+            managed.engine().revision()\n+        )\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(managed.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    let mut timeout_first = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&before, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    timeout_first.submit_automatic(seat, timeout, true).unwrap();\n+    let committed = timeout_first.snapshot_hex();\n+    assert!(timeout_first\n+        .submit(\n+            conn,\n+            &command,\n+            before.wal.unwrap().entries.last().unwrap().revision\n+        )\n+        .map_or(true, |r| matches!(r, CommandResult::Rejected { .. })));\n+    assert_eq!(timeout_first.snapshot_hex(), committed);\n+    assert!(timeout_first.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+    let resumed = timeout_first\n+        .submit(\n+            conn,\n+            &CommandKind::StartGame {\n+                player_count: 4,\n+                rng_seed: 4242,\n+                ruleset: String::new(),\n+            },\n+            timeout_first.engine().revision(),\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(matches!(resumed, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }));\n+    assert!(!timeout_first.timeout_state().managed_seats.contains(&seat));\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn recorded_timeout_selection_matches_current_wasm_answer_full_archive() {\n+    let session = pending();\n+    let before = session.engine().save();\n+    let choice = session.engine().open_choice().unwrap();\n+    let (_, action, _) = session\n+        .automatic_command(\n+            session\n+                .timeout_state()\n+                .deadline\n+                .as_ref()\n+                .unwrap()\n+                .deadline_unix_ms,\n+            true,\n+        )\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let GameAction::TimeoutAction { selection, .. } = &action else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    let selection = selection.clone();\n+    let tokens: Vec<u32> = selection\n+        .iter()\n+        .map(|value| {\n+            choice\n+                .spec\n+                .options\n+                .iter()\n+                .position(|option| option == value)\n+                .unwrap() as u32\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    let mut native = Engine::restore(&before).unwrap();\n+    let mut answer = Engine::restore(&before).unwrap();\n+    // Existing WASM adapter owns this command counter; use the same counter for exact archive parity.\n+    let dedup = native.revision().wrapping_mul(2).max(1);\n+    let revision = native.revision();\n+    let result = native.submit(GameCommand {\n+        actor: choice.observer,\n+        expected_revision: revision,\n+        dedup_id: dedup,\n+        action,\n+    });\n+    assert!(!matches!(\n+        result,\n+        engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)\n+    ));\n+    answer.submit(GameCommand {\n+        actor: choice.observer,\n+        expected_revision: revision,\n+        dedup_id: dedup,\n+        action: GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id: choice.id,\n+            selection: selection.clone(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    assert_eq!(native.save(), answer.save());\n+    assert_eq!(native.log(), answer.log());\n+    if let Some(path) = std::env::var_os(\"A330_WASM_PARITY_OUT\") {\n+        let hex = |bytes: Vec<u8>| bytes.iter().map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\")).collect::<String>();\n+        std::fs::write(path, serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&serde_json::json!({\n+            \"before_hex\": hex(engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&before)),\n+            \"after_hex\": hex(engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&native.save())),\n+            \"hash\": hex(native.state_hash().to_vec()), \"codes\": native.public_event_codes_from(0),\n+            \"actor\": choice.observer, \"choice_id\": choice.id, \"tokens\": tokens\n+        })).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn all_five_configurations_create_a_deadline_once_and_preserve_that_window() {\n+    let pending = pending();\n+    for secs in [10, 15, 30, 60, 90] {\n+        let mut session =\n+            NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::restore(&pending.engine().save()).unwrap(), 4);\n+        assert_eq!(session.timeout_state().choice_timeout_secs, 30);\n+        session.set_choice_timeout_secs(secs).unwrap();\n+        let start = room_native::unix_ms().unwrap();\n+        session.sync_deadline().unwrap();\n+        let deadline = session.timeout_state().deadline.clone().unwrap();\n+        assert!(deadline.deadline_unix_ms >= start + u64::from(secs) * 1000);\n+        assert!(\n+            deadline.deadline_unix_ms <= room_native::unix_ms().unwrap() + u64::from(secs) * 1000\n+        );\n+        session.sync_deadline().unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(session.timeout_state().deadline.as_ref(), Some(&deadline));\n+        let restored =\n+            NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex()), vec![])\n+                .unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(restored.timeout_state().deadline.as_ref(), Some(&deadline));\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn compensatory_reveal_keeps_same_choice_deadline_and_timeout_uses_latest_revision() {\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new_identity(2, 4);\n+    engine.assign_general_named(1, \"刘备\").unwrap();\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(0, engine_native::Phase::Play, 1);\n+    let sha = engine.debug_place(0, \"sha\");\n+    engine.debug_place(1, \"shan\");\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.mode = engine_native::GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals[0] = false;\n+    let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap(), 4);\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        session\n+            .submit_native(\n+                0,\n+                GameAction::PlayCard {\n+                    card: sha,\n+                    targets: vec![1]\n+                },\n+                0\n+            )\n+            .unwrap(),\n+        CommandResult::Accepted { .. }\n+    ));\n+    let deadline = session.timeout_state().deadline.clone().unwrap();\n+    let revision = session.engine().revision();\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        session\n+            .submit_native(1, GameAction::RevealGeneral { slot: 0 }, revision)\n+            .unwrap(),\n+        CommandResult::Accepted { .. }\n+    ));\n+    assert!(session.engine().revision() > revision);\n+    assert_eq!(session.timeout_state().deadline.as_ref(), Some(&deadline));\n+    let (seat, action, takeover) = session\n+        .automatic_command(deadline.deadline_unix_ms, true)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        session.submit_automatic(seat, action, takeover).unwrap(),\n+        CommandResult::Accepted { .. }\n+    ));\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn continuous_managed_steps_yield_to_queued_human_snapshot() {\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::new(Engine::new(4242, 4), 4);\n+    let mut state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    state.timeout.as_mut().unwrap().managed_seats = vec![0, 1, 2, 3];\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(789, session, 16, 1000);\n+    let (tx, _rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(128);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"human\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(789, 1, 0),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let result = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1), response)\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } = result else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    assert!(\n+        view.revision <= 4,\n+        \"automatic processing must yield every command: {}\",\n+        view.revision\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+async fn control_snapshot(handle: &room::RoomHandle) -> engine_protocol::ServerMessage {\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+            connection_id: 999,\n+            header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(handle.id, 1, 0),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap().unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+async fn control_recover(handle: &room::RoomHandle) -> Result<(), String> {\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle.send(room::RoomMsg::Recover { reply }).await.unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn recover_after_automatic_write_failure_retries_original_expired_choice_once() {\n+    automatic_failure_then_recover(false).await;\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn recover_cannot_release_automatic_pause_when_restart_is_required() {\n+    automatic_failure_then_recover(true).await;\n+}\n+\n+async fn automatic_failure_then_recover(restart_required: bool) {\n+    use native_room_store::StoreFault;\n+    let pending = pending();\n+    let mut initial = pending.export_state(&pending.snapshot_hex());\n+    // A short absolute test deadline drives the production actor timer, not a synthetic submit.\n+    let deadline = initial.timeout.as_mut().unwrap().deadline.as_mut().unwrap();\n+    deadline.deadline_unix_ms = room_native::unix_ms().unwrap() + 500;\n+    let deadline = deadline.clone();\n+    let token = initial\n+        .members\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|m| m.seat == deadline.observer)\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .reconnect_token\n+        .clone();\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&initial, vec![]).unwrap();\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path());\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native_persisted(\n+        790,\n+        session,\n+        16,\n+        1000,\n+        String::new(),\n+        Some(store.clone()),\n+    );\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(128);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 999,\n+            display_name: \"recover\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(deadline.observer),\n+            reconnect_token: Some(token),\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let joined = response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let confirmed = std::fs::read(dir.path().join(\"790.json\")).unwrap();\n+    if restart_required {\n+        store.fail_next_write_with_compensation(StoreFault::DecisionWrite, StoreFault::PrepareSync);\n+    } else {\n+        store.fail_next_write(StoreFault::FileSync);\n+    }\n+    tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(\n+        deadline\n+            .deadline_unix_ms\n+            .saturating_sub(room_native::unix_ms().unwrap()),\n+    ))\n+    .await;\n+    let failed = control_snapshot(&handle).await;\n+    let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, choice, .. } = failed else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(view, joined.view);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        choice.as_ref().unwrap().deadline_unix_ms,\n+        Some(deadline.deadline_unix_ms)\n+    );\n+    if restart_required {\n+        let bytes = std::fs::read(dir.path().join(\"790.json\")).unwrap();\n+        assert!(control_recover(&handle)\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap_err()\n+            .contains(\"restart required\"));\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read(dir.path().join(\"790.json\")).unwrap(), bytes);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            control_snapshot(&handle).await,\n+            engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(790, 1, view.revision),\n+                view,\n+                choice,\n+                legal_actions: joined.legal_actions,\n+            }\n+        );\n+        return;\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        std::fs::read(dir.path().join(\"790.json\")).unwrap(),\n+        confirmed\n+    );\n+    // A failed Recover must not clear the pause or retry an expired timer.\n+    store.fail_next_write(StoreFault::Rename);\n+    assert!(control_recover(&handle).await.is_err());\n+    let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+        view: retry_view, ..\n+    } = control_snapshot(&handle).await\n+    else {\n+        unreachable!()\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(retry_view, joined.view);\n+    let saved = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        saved.state.timeout.as_ref().unwrap().deadline.as_ref(),\n+        Some(&deadline)\n+    );\n+    control_recover(&handle).await.unwrap();\n+    let update = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(2), async {\n+        while let Some(text) = rx.recv().await {\n+            let message = engine_protocol::decode_s2c(&text).unwrap();\n+            if matches!(\n+                message,\n+                engine_protocol::ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { .. }\n+            ) {\n+                return message;\n+            }\n+        }\n+        panic!(\"actor closed before retry\");\n+    })\n+    .await\n+    .expect(\"successful durable Recover must release the original expired timer\");\n+    let saved = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    let entries = saved\n+        .state\n+        .wal\n+        .as_ref()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .entries\n+        .iter()\n+        .filter(|entry| matches!(entry.command().action, GameAction::TimeoutAction { .. }))\n+        .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n+    assert_eq!(entries.len(), 1);\n+    assert_eq!(entries[0].expected_revision, joined.view.revision);\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(entries[0].command().action, GameAction::TimeoutAction { choice_id, .. } if choice_id == deadline.choice_id)\n+    );\n+    if let Some(output) = std::env::var_os(\"A330_RECOVER_PROOF\") {\n+        std::fs::write(output, serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&serde_json::json!({\"original_deadline\": deadline, \"before\": initial, \"after\": saved, \"pushed\": update})).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&saved.state, vec![]).unwrap();\n+}"},{"sha":"49ef2653a900d528c63c05da1cbbd837185b65ce","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/approved_b_metadata.rs","status":"added","additions":284,"deletions":0,"changes":284,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fapproved_b_metadata.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fapproved_b_metadata.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fapproved_b_metadata.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,284 @@\n+//! Approved B: metadata must survive the real authorized bridge and archive restore.\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+use engine_api::PlayerId;\n+use engine_native::{Engine, GameAction, Phase};\n+use native_view::{choice_for, observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use serde_json::{json, Value};\n+\n+fn value(engine: &Engine, role: RoomRole, seat: u32) -> Value {\n+    serde_json::to_value(observer_snapshot_for(\n+        engine,\n+        role,\n+        Some(PlayerId::new(seat)),\n+    ))\n+    .unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn both_slots_include_def_zero_only_when_authorized() {\n+    let engine = Engine::new_identity(1515, 4);\n+    let mut archive = engine.save();\n+    archive.core.players[1].general_slots = [Some(0), Some(1)];\n+    archive.core.players[1].revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    let ordinary_mode = archive.core.mode.clone();\n+    for kingdoms in [false, true] {\n+        archive.core.mode = if kingdoms {\n+            engine_native::GameMode::Kingdoms\n+        } else {\n+            ordinary_mode.clone()\n+        };\n+        let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&archive);\n+        let engine =\n+            Engine::restore(&engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        let before = engine.save();\n+        for (role, seat, visible) in [\n+            (RoomRole::Player, 2, true),\n+            (RoomRole::Player, 1, !kingdoms),\n+            (RoomRole::Referee, 0, true),\n+            (RoomRole::Spectator, 2, !kingdoms),\n+        ] {\n+            let view = value(&engine, role, seat);\n+            let slots = &view[\"seats\"][1][\"generals\"];\n+            assert!(slots.is_array(), \"two slots missing: {slots}\");\n+            assert_eq!(slots.as_array().unwrap().len(), 2);\n+            for slot in 0..2 {\n+                if visible {\n+                    let meta = engine.catalog().general_meta(slot as u16).unwrap();\n+                    assert_eq!(\n+                        slots[slot],\n+                        json!({\"def\": slot, \"name\": meta.0, \"faction\": format!(\"{:?}\", meta.1).to_lowercase(), \"revealed\": false})\n+                    );\n+                } else {\n+                    assert_eq!(slots[slot], Value::Null);\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        assert_eq!(engine.save(), before);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn check_choice(engine: &Engine, native: &str, legacy: &str) {\n+    let open = engine.open_choice().unwrap();\n+    let expected =\n+        serde_json::to_value(choice_for(engine, RoomRole::Referee, None).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(expected[\"native_kind\"], native);\n+    assert_eq!(expected[\"kind\"], legacy);\n+    assert_eq!(expected[\"prompt\"], open.spec.prompt);\n+    for seat in [0, 1, 257, u32::MAX] {\n+        assert!(choice_for(engine, RoomRole::Spectator, Some(PlayerId::new(seat))).is_none());\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        serde_json::to_value(\n+            choice_for(\n+                engine,\n+                RoomRole::Player,\n+                Some(PlayerId::new(open.observer as u32 + 1))\n+            )\n+            .unwrap()\n+        )\n+        .unwrap(),\n+        expected\n+    );\n+    let mut session = engine_native_wasm::NativeSession::new(1, 0).unwrap();\n+    let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&engine.save());\n+    let hex: String = bytes.iter().map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\")).collect();\n+    session\n+        .restore_hex(&hex)\n+        .unwrap_or_else(|error| panic!(\"{}: {error}\", open.spec.prompt));\n+    let restored_hex = session.save_hex();\n+    let local: Value =\n+        serde_json::from_str(&session.open_choice_json(open.observer).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(local[\"native_kind\"], native);\n+    assert_eq!(local[\"kind\"], legacy);\n+    assert_eq!(local[\"prompt\"], expected[\"prompt\"]);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        session.save_hex(),\n+        restored_hex,\n+        \"metadata projection must not change archive bytes\"\n+    );\n+    let decoded = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).unwrap();\n+    let mut restored = Engine::restore(&decoded).unwrap();\n+    let mut direct = Engine::restore(&engine.save()).unwrap();\n+    let selection = open\n+        .spec\n+        .options\n+        .iter()\n+        .take(open.spec.min)\n+        .copied()\n+        .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n+    for candidate in [&mut restored, &mut direct] {\n+        submit(\n+            candidate,\n+            GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id: open.id,\n+                selection: selection.clone(),\n+            },\n+        );\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(restored.save(), direct.save());\n+    assert_eq!(restored.log(), direct.log());\n+    let mut unknown = engine.save();\n+    unknown.resolution.open_choice.as_mut().unwrap().spec.prompt = \"unknown_extension_prompt\";\n+    assert!(\n+        engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&unknown))\n+            .is_err()\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn real_choices_keep_precise_kind_and_prompt_through_archive() {\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(804, 3);\n+    engine.debug_grant(0, \"突袭\");\n+    engine.state_core_mut().turn.phase = Phase::Judge;\n+    submit(&mut engine, GameAction::NextPhase);\n+    check_choice(&engine, \"confirm\", \"Confirm\");\n+    let id = engine.open_choice().unwrap().id;\n+    submit(\n+        &mut engine,\n+        GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id: id,\n+            selection: vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Confirm],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    check_choice(&engine, \"select_players\", \"SelectTargets\");\n+    let mut discard = Engine::new(1515, 4);\n+    for _ in 0..3 {\n+        submit(&mut discard, GameAction::NextPhase);\n+    }\n+    check_choice(&discard, \"select_cards\", \"SelectCards\");\n+    let mut response = Engine::new(2, 2);\n+    response.debug_set_turn(0, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    let sha = response.debug_place(0, \"sha\");\n+    response.debug_place(1, \"shan\");\n+    submit(\n+        &mut response,\n+        GameAction::PlayCard {\n+            card: sha,\n+            targets: vec![1],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    check_choice(&response, \"respond_card\", \"Custom\");\n+    let mut pick = Engine::new(42, 3);\n+    pick.debug_set_turn(0, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    pick.debug_grant(0, \"反间\");\n+    let skill = pick.catalog().skill_by_name(\"反间\").unwrap();\n+    submit(&mut pick, GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill });\n+    let id = pick.open_choice().unwrap().id;\n+    submit(\n+        &mut pick,\n+        GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id: id,\n+            selection: vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Player(1)],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    check_choice(&pick, \"pick_tag\", \"Custom\");\n+}\n+\n+fn submit(engine: &mut Engine, action: GameAction) {\n+    let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+        actor: engine\n+            .open_choice()\n+            .map_or(engine.turn().current, |c| c.observer),\n+        expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+        dedup_id: engine.revision() + 1,\n+        action,\n+    });\n+    assert!(\n+        !matches!(result, engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)),\n+        \"{result:?}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[path = \"support/ws5_metadata_readers.rs\"]\n+mod old;\n+#[test]\n+fn ws5_old_and_new_rust_readers_accept_both_payload_generations() {\n+    let engine = Engine::new(1, 3);\n+    let mut payload = value(&engine, RoomRole::Player, 1)[\"seats\"][0].clone();\n+    let old: old::OldSeatView = serde_json::from_value(payload.clone()).unwrap();\n+    let mut previous = payload.clone();\n+    previous.as_object_mut().unwrap().remove(\"generals\");\n+    let current: engine_api::SeatView = serde_json::from_value(previous).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        serde_json::to_value(&current).unwrap()[\"generals\"],\n+        json!([null, null])\n+    );\n+    payload[\"generals\"] =\n+        json!([{ \"def\":0,\"name\":\"extension\",\"faction\":\"unknown\",\"revealed\":false },null]);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        serde_json::from_value::<old::OldSeatView>(payload.clone()).unwrap(),\n+        old\n+    );\n+    for invalid in [\n+        json!(null),\n+        json!([]),\n+        json!([null]),\n+        json!([{\"def\":\"0\",\"name\":\"x\",\"faction\":\"wei\",\"revealed\":false},null]),\n+    ] {\n+        payload[\"generals\"] = invalid;\n+        assert!(serde_json::from_value::<engine_api::SeatView>(payload.clone()).is_err());\n+    }\n+    let previous = json!({\"choice_id\":1,\"observer\":1,\"options\":[],\"min_count\":0,\"max_count\":1,\"allow_cancel\":true,\"timeout_policy\":\"None\",\"revision\":7,\"continuation_id\":1,\"kind\":\"Custom\"});\n+    let current: engine_api::ChoiceRequest = serde_json::from_value(previous.clone()).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(current).unwrap(), previous);\n+    let mut payload = previous.clone();\n+    payload[\"prompt\"] = json!(\"extension.key\");\n+    payload[\"native_kind\"] = json!(\"pick_tag\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        serde_json::from_value::<old::OldChoiceRequest>(previous).unwrap(),\n+        serde_json::from_value::<old::OldChoiceRequest>(payload.clone()).unwrap()\n+    );\n+    for (field, invalid) in [\n+        (\"prompt\", json!(3)),\n+        (\"native_kind\", json!(\"made_up\")),\n+        (\"native_kind\", json!(3)),\n+    ] {\n+        let mut bad = payload.clone();\n+        bad[field] = invalid;\n+        assert!(serde_json::from_value::<engine_api::ChoiceRequest>(bad).is_err());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn actual_ws5_snapshot_bytes_round_trip_old_and_new_rust_readers() {\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new(42, 3);\n+    engine.debug_set_turn(0, Phase::Play, 1);\n+    engine.debug_grant(0, \"反间\");\n+    let skill = engine.catalog().skill_by_name(\"反间\").unwrap();\n+    submit(&mut engine, GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill });\n+    let id = engine.open_choice().unwrap().id;\n+    submit(\n+        &mut engine,\n+        GameAction::Answer {\n+            choice_id: id,\n+            selection: vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Player(1)],\n+        },\n+    );\n+    // Keep the original WS5 reader sample after the current protocol advances.\n+    let mut header = engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(909, 1, engine.revision());\n+    header.protocol_version = 5;\n+    let message = engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+        header,\n+        view: observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Referee, None),\n+        legal_actions: vec![],\n+        choice: choice_for(&engine, RoomRole::Referee, None),\n+    };\n+    let wire = engine_protocol::encode_s2c(&message).unwrap();\n+    let old: old::OldServerMessage = serde_json::from_str(&wire).unwrap();\n+    let old::OldServerMessage::Snapshot { header, choice, .. } = &old;\n+    assert_eq!(header.protocol_version, 5);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        choice.as_ref().unwrap().kind,\n+        engine_api::ChoiceKind::Custom\n+    );\n+    let old_wire = serde_json::to_string(&old).unwrap();\n+    let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, choice, .. } =\n+        engine_protocol::decode_s2c(&old_wire).unwrap()\n+    else {\n+        panic!(\"snapshot\")\n+    };\n+    assert!(view.seats.iter().all(|seat| seat.generals == [None, None]));\n+    let choice = choice.unwrap();\n+    assert!(choice.prompt.is_none() && choice.native_kind.is_none());\n+}"},{"sha":"656320f86a35933f66d80295cd48d33a4f057b19","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/gt014_vm_import_parity.rs","status":"added","additions":243,"deletions":0,"changes":243,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fgt014_vm_import_parity.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fgt014_vm_import_parity.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fgt014_vm_import_parity.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,243 @@\n+//! GT-014 同包核对：客户端正式导入入口使用的 vm-fixture（v0.1.0／v0.1.1）与同一组\n+//! 变异，经服务端 drop-in 导入（`NativeContent::import`）得到一致的接受／拒绝结果；\n+//! 失败的导入不影响已安装版本，升级与回退按版本切换装载副本。\n+//! 客户端侧见 `apps/web-client/scripts/native-vm-install.test.mjs` 与\n+//! `native-worker-smoke.mjs` 的 GT-014 段。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+#[allow(dead_code)]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\n+\n+fn fixture_dir(name: &str) -> PathBuf {\n+    Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\"))\n+        .join(\"../web-client/scripts/fixtures\")\n+        .join(name)\n+}\n+\n+fn fixture_json(name: &str) -> serde_json::Value {\n+    serde_json::from_slice(&std::fs::read(fixture_dir(name).join(\"package.npack.json\")).unwrap())\n+        .unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+/// 把一个 npack（及夹具武将资产）写成服务端 drop-in 目录。\n+fn write_dropin(packages_root: &Path, dir: &str, npack: &serde_json::Value, characters_from: &str) {\n+    let dropin = packages_root.join(dir);\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(dropin.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"),\n+        serde_json::to_vec_pretty(npack).unwrap(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    std::fs::copy(\n+        fixture_dir(characters_from).join(\"character.json\"),\n+        dropin.join(\"assets/character.json\"),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+}\n+\n+struct Server {\n+    _dir: tempfile::TempDir,\n+    packages_root: PathBuf,\n+    content: NativeContent,\n+}\n+\n+fn server() -> Server {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let packages_root = dir.path().join(\"packages\");\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&packages_root).unwrap();\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(packages_root.clone(), store_root).unwrap();\n+    Server {\n+        _dir: dir,\n+        packages_root,\n+        content,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn versions(content: &NativeContent) -> Vec<String> {\n+    let mut out: Vec<String> = content\n+        .installed()\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter(|p| p.namespace == \"official\" && p.package_id == \"vm-fixture\")\n+        .map(|p| p.version)\n+        .collect();\n+    out.sort();\n+    out\n+}\n+\n+fn loaded_module_code(content: &NativeContent) -> (String, Vec<u8>, Vec<String>) {\n+    let loaded = content.load_scoped(Some(\"official\"), \"vm-fixture\").unwrap();\n+    let package =\n+        content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(loaded.frozen.package_json.as_bytes())\n+            .unwrap();\n+    (\n+        package.manifest.version.clone(),\n+        package.modules[0].code.clone(),\n+        loaded\n+            .pack\n+            .vm_skills\n+            .iter()\n+            .map(|d| d.name.clone())\n+            .collect(),\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn valid_fixture_imports_activates_loads_vm_skill_and_upgrades_then_rolls_back() {\n+    let s = server();\n+    let v1 = fixture_json(\"vm-trigger\");\n+    let v2 = fixture_json(\"vm-trigger-v2\");\n+    write_dropin(&s.packages_root, \"vm-fixture\", &v1, \"vm-trigger\");\n+    let report = s.content.import().unwrap();\n+    assert!(report.iter().any(|p| p.namespace == \"official\"\n+        && p.package_id == \"vm-fixture\"\n+        && p.version == \"0.1.0\"));\n+    assert_eq!(versions(&s.content), vec![\"0.1.0\"]);\n+    let (version, code, skills) = loaded_module_code(&s.content);\n+    assert_eq!(version, \"0.1.0\");\n+    assert_eq!(code, vec![83, 16, 1, 0, 0, 0, 80, 1, 1]);\n+    assert_eq!(skills, vec![\"vm_fixture_phase_end\".to_string()]);\n+\n+    // 升级：服务端 drop-in 一包一目录，新版本覆盖同目录后再导入即自动激活；\n+    // 旧版本安装副本仍在存储中（阶段结束摸 2 张的字节码成为装载副本）。\n+    write_dropin(&s.packages_root, \"vm-fixture\", &v2, \"vm-trigger-v2\");\n+    s.content.import().unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(versions(&s.content), vec![\"0.1.0\", \"0.1.1\"]);\n+    let (version, code, _) = loaded_module_code(&s.content);\n+    assert_eq!(version, \"0.1.1\");\n+    assert_eq!(code, vec![83, 16, 2, 0, 0, 0, 80, 1, 1]);\n+\n+    // 回退：旧版本安装副本仍在，可重新成为装载副本。\n+    s.content\n+        .activate_version(\"official\", \"vm-fixture\", \"0.1.0\")\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let (version, code, _) = loaded_module_code(&s.content);\n+    assert_eq!(version, \"0.1.0\");\n+    assert_eq!(code, vec![83, 16, 1, 0, 0, 0, 80, 1, 1]);\n+\n+    // 停用：装载失败但副本保留；卸载：所有版本移除。\n+    s.content.disable_package(\"official\", \"vm-fixture\").unwrap();\n+    assert!(s\n+        .content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"official\"), \"vm-fixture\")\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert_eq!(versions(&s.content), vec![\"0.1.0\", \"0.1.1\"]);\n+    s.content\n+        .uninstall_package(\"official\", \"vm-fixture\")\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(versions(&s.content).is_empty());\n+}\n+\n+/// 与客户端导入入口相同的变异集：服务端导入一律拒绝，且已安装的有效版本不受影响。\n+#[test]\n+fn same_mutations_are_rejected_by_server_import_without_losing_installed_version() {\n+    let s = server();\n+    let v1 = fixture_json(\"vm-trigger\");\n+    write_dropin(&s.packages_root, \"vm-fixture\", &v1, \"vm-trigger\");\n+    s.content.import().unwrap();\n+    let before = loaded_module_code(&s.content);\n+\n+    let mutate = |f: &dyn Fn(&mut serde_json::Value)| {\n+        let mut bad = v1.clone();\n+        f(&mut bad);\n+        bad\n+    };\n+    let cases: Vec<(&str, serde_json::Value)> = vec![\n+        (\n+            \"corrupt_module_local_count\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                let n = p[\"modules\"][0][\"local_count\"].as_u64().unwrap();\n+                p[\"modules\"][0][\"local_count\"] = (n + 1).into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            \"entry_pc_out_of_range\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                let len = p[\"modules\"][0][\"code\"].as_array().unwrap().len();\n+                p[\"modules\"][0][\"entry_pc\"] = (len as u64).into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            \"trigger_unknown_module\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                p[\"trigger_index\"][0][\"module\"] = \"ghost\".into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            \"tampered_trigger_event\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                p[\"trigger_index\"][0][\"event\"] = \"phase_draw\".into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            \"invalid_identity\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                p[\"manifest\"][\"package_id\"] = \"../x\".into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+        (\n+            \"same_version_different_content\",\n+            mutate(&|p| {\n+                let n = p[\"modules\"][0][\"caps_mask\"].as_u64().unwrap();\n+                p[\"modules\"][0][\"caps_mask\"] = (n + 1).into();\n+            }),\n+        ),\n+    ];\n+    let mut outcomes = Vec::new();\n+    for (name, bad) in &cases {\n+        let dir = format!(\"bad-{name}\");\n+        write_dropin(&s.packages_root, &dir, bad, \"vm-trigger\");\n+        let result = s.content.import();\n+        std::fs::remove_dir_all(s.packages_root.join(&dir)).unwrap();\n+        outcomes.push((name.to_string(), result.as_ref().err().cloned()));\n+        assert!(\n+            result.is_err(),\n+            \"{name}: server import must reject: {result:?}\"\n+        );\n+        // 失败的导入不改变已安装的有效版本与装载副本。\n+        assert_eq!(versions(&s.content), vec![\"0.1.0\"], \"{name}\");\n+        assert_eq!(loaded_module_code(&s.content), before, \"{name}\");\n+    }\n+    for (name, error) in &outcomes {\n+        eprintln!(\n+            \"GT014_SERVER_REJECT {name}: {}\",\n+            error.as_deref().unwrap_or(\"\")\n+        );\n+    }\n+\n+    // 同版本但重算过指纹的不同合法内容：客户端按「同版本包内容冲突」拒绝；\n+    // 服务端无论返回什么，已安装副本都不得被静默替换。\n+    // 取 v0.1.1（摸 2 张）的合法内容，把版本号改回 0.1.0 并重算包指纹。\n+    let mut rehashed: content_schema::ContentPackage =\n+        serde_json::from_value(fixture_json(\"vm-trigger-v2\")).unwrap();\n+    rehashed.manifest.version = \"0.1.0\".into();\n+    rehashed.manifest.logic_hash = rehashed.compute_logic_hash();\n+    assert!(\n+        rehashed.validate().is_ok(),\n+        \"rehashed variant must be self-consistent\"\n+    );\n+    let rehashed_value: serde_json::Value =\n+        serde_json::from_slice(&rehashed.to_json_bytes().unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        rehashed_value[\"modules\"][0][\"code\"],\n+        v1[\"modules\"][0][\"code\"]\n+    );\n+    write_dropin(\n+        &s.packages_root,\n+        \"vm-fixture\",\n+        &rehashed_value,\n+        \"vm-trigger-v2\",\n+    );\n+    let result = s.content.import();\n+    eprintln!(\"GT014_SERVER_SAME_VERSION_REHASHED import={result:?}\");\n+    assert_eq!(versions(&s.content), vec![\"0.1.0\"]);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        loaded_module_code(&s.content),\n+        before,\n+        \"same-version re-import must not replace the installed copy\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"546c9804613a0d36b4fd49a4cb045a30c84efd78","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/long_run_bot.rs","status":"added","additions":473,"deletions":0,"changes":473,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_bot.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_bot.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_bot.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,473 @@\n+//! **对局机器人长程**：按服务端下发的 `legal_actions` 自动选步，驱动**真实对局**多回合推进。\n+//!\n+//! 与 `long_run_soak.rs` 的区别：那个只发 `EndPhase`（到「等待选择」即停）；本用例用\n+//! `LegalAction::to_command` 把**权威合法动作**直接转成命令，因此能越过选择窗口。\n+//!\n+//! **三次关键修正**（2026-10-19）：\n+//! 1. `ResolveChoice` 必须**原样使用权威给出的 `selections`**——自己构造 `selections: vec![]`\n+//!    会得到 `InvalidChoice`；\n+//! 2. 每步都要**用最新结果里的 `legal_actions` 覆盖**（过期动作会得到 `not current` / `choice` 拒绝）；\n+//! 3. 房间有**两条连接**，当前行动者可能是任一方 ⇒ 逐连接维护 `actor` 与 `legal`，谁有动作谁走；\n+//! 4. **本连接没有合法动作时取 `Snapshot`**——它携带 `choice: Option<ChoiceRequest>`，\n+//!    据此按 `min_count` 构造 `ResolveChoice{selections: 0..min_count}`（**这才是越过选择窗口的关键**）。\n+//!\n+//! 口径：选步策略是**固定优先级**（`ResolveChoice` → `PlayCard`/`ActivateSkill` → `EndPhase`），\n+//! **不是**强 AI；只用于**驱动状态推进**。断言只看「有实质推进 + 房间始终可响应」。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/config.rs\"]\n+mod config;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, LegalAction, PlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::{MessageHeader, ServerMessage};\n+use room::{spawn_room, RoomMsg};\n+use session::Outbound;\n+use std::time::Instant;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+const CONNS: usize = 2;\n+\n+struct Room {\n+    id: u64,\n+    handle: room::RoomHandle,\n+    /// 每条连接的玩家身份（= 该连接的 actor）。\n+    actors: [PlayerId; CONNS],\n+    /// 每条连接最近一次收到的合法动作（**该连接视角**）。\n+    legal: [Vec<LegalAction>; CONNS],\n+    rev: u64,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    cursor: [usize; CONNS],\n+}\n+\n+/// 提交一条命令（指定连接），返回 (是否 Accepted, 权威修订号, 该连接视角的合法动作, 原因)。\n+async fn submit(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    id: u64,\n+    conn: usize,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    cmd: Command,\n+) -> (bool, u64, Vec<LegalAction>, String) {\n+    let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    if handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(id, seq, cmd.expected_revision.0),\n+            command: cmd.clone(),\n+            idempotency_key: cmd.idempotency_key,\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: rs,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .is_err()\n+    {\n+        return (false, 0, Vec::new(), \"send-fail\".into());\n+    }\n+    match ws.await {\n+        Ok(Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            result,\n+            view,\n+            legal_actions,\n+            ..\n+        })) => {\n+            let ok = matches!(result, engine_api::CommandResult::Accepted { .. });\n+            let why = if ok {\n+                \"accepted\".to_string()\n+            } else {\n+                format!(\"{result:?}\").chars().take(44).collect()\n+            };\n+            (ok, view.revision, legal_actions, why)\n+        }\n+        other => (\n+            false,\n+            0,\n+            Vec::new(),\n+            format!(\"{other:?}\").chars().take(28).collect(),\n+        ),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 取一条连接的个人化快照：返回 (修订号, 合法动作, 待答选择)。\n+async fn snapshot(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    id: u64,\n+    conn: usize,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    rev: u64,\n+) -> Option<(\n+    u64,\n+    Vec<LegalAction>,\n+    Option<engine_api::ChoiceRequest>,\n+    engine_api::MatchOutcome,\n+)> {\n+    let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(id, seq, rev),\n+            reply: rs,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .ok()?;\n+    match ws.await {\n+        Ok(Ok(ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+            view,\n+            choice,\n+            legal_actions,\n+            ..\n+        })) => Some((view.revision, legal_actions, choice, view.outcome)),\n+        _ => None,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 固定优先级选步：`ResolveChoice`（**原样**）→ 出牌/技能 → `EndPhase`。\n+fn pick(legal: &[LegalAction], cursor: &mut usize) -> Option<LegalAction> {\n+    if legal.is_empty() {\n+        return None;\n+    }\n+    if let Some(a) = legal\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|a| matches!(a, LegalAction::ResolveChoice { .. }))\n+    {\n+        return Some(a.clone());\n+    }\n+    let start = *cursor % legal.len();\n+    let rotated: Vec<LegalAction> = legal[start..]\n+        .iter()\n+        .chain(legal[..start].iter())\n+        .cloned()\n+        .collect();\n+    for a in &rotated {\n+        if matches!(\n+            a,\n+            LegalAction::PlayCard { .. }\n+                | LegalAction::ActivateSkill { .. }\n+                | LegalAction::UseSkillCard { .. }\n+        ) {\n+            return Some(a.clone());\n+        }\n+    }\n+    rotated.first().cloned()\n+}\n+\n+async fn join(handle: &room::RoomHandle, conn: usize, seat: u8, name: &str) -> PlayerId {\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(256);\n+    let (r, w) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            display_name: name.into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(seat),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: r,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"join send\");\n+    let j = w.await.expect(\"join reply\").expect(\"join ok\");\n+    PlayerId::new(j.player_id)\n+}\n+\n+async fn open(id: u64, seed: u64) -> Room {\n+    let handle = spawn_room(id, 2, seed, String::new(), 64, 100);\n+    let p0 = join(&handle, 0, 0, \"bot-a\").await;\n+    let p1 = join(&handle, 1, 1, \"bot-b\").await;\n+    Room {\n+        id,\n+        handle,\n+        actors: [p0, p1],\n+        legal: [Vec::new(), Vec::new()],\n+        rev: 0,\n+        seq: 0,\n+        cursor: [0, 0],\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 引导：两条连接各发一条 `EndPhase`，换取**各自视角**的 `legal_actions` 与权威修订号。\n+async fn bootstrap(room: &mut Room) -> Vec<String> {\n+    let mut whys = Vec::new();\n+    for conn in 0..CONNS {\n+        room.seq += 1;\n+        let cmd = Command {\n+            actor: room.actors[conn],\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(room.rev),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(room.seq),\n+            kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+        };\n+        let (_ok, rev, legal, why) = submit(&room.handle, room.id, conn, room.seq, cmd).await;\n+        if rev > 0 {\n+            room.rev = rev;\n+        }\n+        room.legal[conn] = legal;\n+        whys.push(why);\n+    }\n+    whys\n+}\n+\n+/// **机器人长程**：4 房间 × 60 轮，两条连接轮流走；总计最多 4×60 步。\n+#[tokio::test(flavor = \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = 4)]\n+async fn bot_drives_matches_long_run() {\n+    const ROOMS: usize = 4;\n+    const ROUNDS: usize = 60;\n+\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    let mut rooms = Vec::new();\n+    for r in 0..ROOMS as u64 {\n+        let mut room = open(r, 7_700 + r).await;\n+        let whys = bootstrap(&mut room).await;\n+        eprintln!(\n+            \"DBG bot 引导：room {} rev={} legal=[{}, {}] why={whys:?}\",\n+            room.id,\n+            room.rev,\n+            room.legal[0].len(),\n+            room.legal[1].len()\n+        );\n+        rooms.push(room);\n+    }\n+\n+    let mut submitted = 0u64;\n+    let mut accepted = 0u64;\n+    let mut snapshots = 0u64;\n+    let mut max_rev = 0u64;\n+    let mut reasons: std::collections::BTreeMap<String, u64> = std::collections::BTreeMap::new();\n+\n+    for _round in 0..ROUNDS {\n+        for room in rooms.iter_mut() {\n+            // 两条连接：谁有合法动作谁走（一般只有当前行动者那侧非空）\n+            for conn in 0..CONNS {\n+                // **刷新**：本连接没有合法动作时，取个人化快照；若快照带「待答选择」，\n+                // 就按 `min_count` 构造 `ResolveChoice`（selections 为选项下标）。\n+                if room.legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                    if let Some((rev, legal, choice, _outcome)) =\n+                        snapshot(&room.handle, room.id, conn, room.seq + 1, room.rev).await\n+                    {\n+                        if rev > 0 {\n+                            room.rev = rev;\n+                            max_rev = max_rev.max(rev);\n+                        }\n+                        room.legal[conn] = legal;\n+                        if room.legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                            if let Some(c) = choice {\n+                                if c.observer.0 == room.actors[conn].0 {\n+                                    let take = (c.min_count as usize).min(c.options.len());\n+                                    let selections: Vec<u32> = (0..take as u32).collect();\n+                                    room.legal[conn].push(LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                                        choice_id: c.choice_id,\n+                                        selections,\n+                                        cancelled: take == 0 && c.allow_cancel,\n+                                    });\n+                                    eprintln!(\n+                                        \"DBG bot 选择：room {} conn {} choice={:?} min={} opts={} \\\n+                                         构造 selections={:?}\",\n+                                        room.id,\n+                                        conn,\n+                                        c.choice_id,\n+                                        c.min_count,\n+                                        c.options.len(),\n+                                        (0..take as u32).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+                                    );\n+                                }\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                let Some(action) = pick(&room.legal[conn], &mut room.cursor[conn]) else {\n+                    continue;\n+                };\n+                let cmd = action.to_command(room.actors[conn], room.rev);\n+                room.seq += 1;\n+                submitted += 1;\n+                let (ok, rev, legal, why) =\n+                    submit(&room.handle, room.id, conn, room.seq, cmd).await;\n+                *reasons\n+                    .entry(if ok { \"accepted\".into() } else { why })\n+                    .or_insert(0) += 1;\n+                if ok {\n+                    accepted += 1;\n+                    room.cursor[conn] = 0;\n+                } else {\n+                    room.cursor[conn] += 1;\n+                }\n+                if rev > 0 {\n+                    room.rev = rev;\n+                    max_rev = max_rev.max(rev);\n+                }\n+                room.legal[conn] = legal;\n+            }\n+            let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+            let sent = room\n+                .handle\n+                .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                    connection_id: 1,\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(room.id, room.seq, room.rev),\n+                    reply: rs,\n+                })\n+                .await;\n+            assert!(sent.is_ok(), \"room {} 通道应可写\", room.id);\n+            assert!(\n+                ws.await.is_ok(),\n+                \"room {} 必须能响应快照（未死锁）\",\n+                room.id\n+            );\n+            snapshots += 1;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    println!(\n+        \"RESULT bot rooms={ROOMS} rounds={ROUNDS} submitted={submitted} accepted={accepted} \\\n+         snapshots={snapshots} max_revision={max_rev} elapsed_ms={} throughput_cmds_per_s={:.0}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        submitted as f64 / elapsed.as_secs_f64().max(1e-9)\n+    );\n+    eprintln!(\"DBG bot 终局：reasons={reasons:?}\");\n+    for room in rooms.iter() {\n+        eprintln!(\n+            \"DBG bot 终局：room {} rev={} legal=[{}, {}]\",\n+            room.id,\n+            room.rev,\n+            room.legal[0].len(),\n+            room.legal[1].len()\n+        );\n+    }\n+    assert!(submitted > 0, \"机器人应至少提交过命令\");\n+    assert!(\n+        max_rev >= 20,\n+        \"两条连接轮流驱动后应把对局推进到较高修订号（max_revision={max_rev}）\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(snapshots, (ROOMS * ROUNDS) as u64, \"快照总数应为 房间×轮次\");\n+}\n+\n+/// **跑到终局**：机器人持续推进直到 `MatchOutcome != InProgress`，并记录步数、耗时与进程 RSS。\n+///\n+/// 断言：**两个房间都必须在步数上限内结束**（这是「整局可收敛」的证据，不只是「能推进」）。\n+#[tokio::test(flavor = \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = 4)]\n+async fn bot_runs_matches_to_completion() {\n+    const ROOMS: usize = 2;\n+    const MAX_STEPS: usize = 4000;\n+\n+    fn rss_kb() -> Option<u64> {\n+        let pid = std::process::id().to_string();\n+        let out = std::process::Command::new(\"ps\")\n+            .args([\"-o\", \"rss=\", \"-p\", &pid])\n+            .output()\n+            .ok()?;\n+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&out.stdout).trim().parse().ok()\n+    }\n+\n+    let rss_before = rss_kb();\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    let mut rooms = Vec::new();\n+    for r in 0..ROOMS as u64 {\n+        let mut room = open(r, 9_100 + r).await;\n+        let _ = bootstrap(&mut room).await;\n+        rooms.push((room, engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress, 0usize));\n+    }\n+\n+    let mut steps_total = 0usize;\n+    for round in 0..MAX_STEPS {\n+        let mut all_done = true;\n+        for (room, outcome, steps) in rooms.iter_mut() {\n+            if *outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+            all_done = false;\n+            // 任一条连接有动作就走\n+            let mut acted = false;\n+            for conn in 0..CONNS {\n+                if room.legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                    if let Some((rev, legal, choice, view_outcome)) =\n+                        snapshot(&room.handle, room.id, conn, room.seq + 1, room.rev).await\n+                    {\n+                        *outcome = view_outcome;\n+                        if rev > 0 {\n+                            room.rev = rev;\n+                        }\n+                        room.legal[conn] = legal;\n+                        if room.legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                            if let Some(c) = choice {\n+                                if c.observer.0 == room.actors[conn].0 {\n+                                    let take = (c.min_count as usize).min(c.options.len());\n+                                    room.legal[conn].push(LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                                        choice_id: c.choice_id,\n+                                        selections: (0..take as u32).collect(),\n+                                        cancelled: take == 0 && c.allow_cancel,\n+                                    });\n+                                }\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                }\n+                let Some(action) = pick(&room.legal[conn], &mut room.cursor[conn]) else {\n+                    continue;\n+                };\n+                let cmd = action.to_command(room.actors[conn], room.rev);\n+                room.seq += 1;\n+                let (ok, rev, legal, _why) =\n+                    submit(&room.handle, room.id, conn, room.seq, cmd).await;\n+                if ok {\n+                    room.cursor[conn] = 0;\n+                } else {\n+                    room.cursor[conn] += 1;\n+                }\n+                if rev > 0 {\n+                    room.rev = rev;\n+                }\n+                room.legal[conn] = legal;\n+                acted = true;\n+                *steps += 1;\n+                steps_total += 1;\n+                if *outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            if !acted {\n+                // 本房间暂时无动作：再取一次快照确认终局状态，避免空转\n+                if let Some((_, _, _, view_outcome)) =\n+                    snapshot(&room.handle, room.id, 0, room.seq + 1, room.rev).await\n+                {\n+                    if view_outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                        *outcome = view_outcome;\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        if all_done {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        if round == MAX_STEPS - 1 {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    let rss_after = rss_kb();\n+    for (room, outcome, steps) in rooms.iter() {\n+        println!(\n+            \"RESULT bot_finish room={} outcome={:?} steps={steps} rev={} elapsed_ms={}\",\n+            room.id,\n+            outcome,\n+            room.rev,\n+            elapsed.as_millis()\n+        );\n+    }\n+    println!(\n+        \"RESULT bot_finish rooms={ROOMS} steps_total={steps_total} elapsed_ms={} rss_before_kb={:?} rss_after_kb={:?}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        rss_before,\n+        rss_after\n+    );\n+    for (room, outcome, _steps) in rooms.iter() {\n+        assert_ne!(\n+            *outcome,\n+            engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress,\n+            \"room {} 应在 {MAX_STEPS} 步内结束（当前 outcome={outcome:?}）\",\n+            room.id\n+        );\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"a55f2a8261f6dffea5024826706a1277dd914b23","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/long_run_memory.rs","status":"added","additions":364,"deletions":0,"changes":364,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_memory.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_memory.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_memory.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,364 @@\n+//! **多盘连续 + 堆内存观测**（产品级长程的内存面）。\n+//!\n+//! 环境限制（**已实测**）：本环境 `/bin/ps` 被沙箱拒绝（`Operation not permitted`）⇒ **拿不到 RSS**；\n+//! 且工区未依赖 `libc` ⇒ 不用 `getrusage`。因此改用**不引入依赖**的做法：\n+//! 在本测试二进制里装一个**计数式全局分配器**（`#[global_allocator]`，基于 `std::alloc::System`），\n+//! 精确统计**当前堆占用**与**峰值**。\n+//!\n+//! 口径（**务必注意**）：\n+//! * 测的是**本进程 Rust 堆**（经全局分配器的申请），**不是** RSS（不含栈、mmap 直映射、代码段）✗；\n+//! * 结论只对「**是否存在随盘数增长的堆泄漏**」负责，不宣称「内存占用多少 MB」的绝对值。\n+//!\n+//! 判据：\n+//! 1. **每一盘都跑到终局**（`MatchOutcome != InProgress`）；\n+//! 2. **连续 6 盘后，堆占用相对首盘后不出现阶跃式增长**（阈值宽松，见 `SLACK_BYTES`）；\n+//! 3. 记录**每盘结束时的堆占用曲线**，供人工判断。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/config.rs\"]\n+mod config;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use std::alloc::{GlobalAlloc, Layout, System};\n+use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicUsize, Ordering};\n+use std::time::Instant;\n+\n+use engine_api::{CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, LegalAction, PlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::{MessageHeader, ServerMessage};\n+use room::{spawn_room, RoomMsg};\n+use session::Outbound;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+// ---------- 计数式全局分配器（仅本测试二进制） ----------\n+\n+struct Counting;\n+\n+static CURRENT: AtomicUsize = AtomicUsize::new(0);\n+static PEAK: AtomicUsize = AtomicUsize::new(0);\n+\n+unsafe impl GlobalAlloc for Counting {\n+    unsafe fn alloc(&self, layout: Layout) -> *mut u8 {\n+        let p = unsafe { System.alloc(layout) };\n+        if !p.is_null() {\n+            let cur = CURRENT.fetch_add(layout.size(), Ordering::Relaxed) + layout.size();\n+            PEAK.fetch_max(cur, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+        }\n+        p\n+    }\n+    unsafe fn dealloc(&self, ptr: *mut u8, layout: Layout) {\n+        unsafe { System.dealloc(ptr, layout) };\n+        CURRENT.fetch_sub(layout.size(), Ordering::Relaxed);\n+    }\n+    unsafe fn realloc(&self, ptr: *mut u8, layout: Layout, new_size: usize) -> *mut u8 {\n+        let p = unsafe { System.realloc(ptr, layout, new_size) };\n+        if !p.is_null() {\n+            if new_size >= layout.size() {\n+                let cur = CURRENT.fetch_add(new_size - layout.size(), Ordering::Relaxed) + new_size\n+                    - layout.size();\n+                PEAK.fetch_max(cur, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+            } else {\n+                CURRENT.fetch_sub(layout.size() - new_size, Ordering::Relaxed);\n+            }\n+        }\n+        p\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[global_allocator]\n+static ALLOC: Counting = Counting;\n+\n+fn heap_now() -> usize {\n+    CURRENT.load(Ordering::Relaxed)\n+}\n+fn heap_peak() -> usize {\n+    PEAK.load(Ordering::Relaxed)\n+}\n+\n+// ---------- 机器人与驱动（与 long_run_bot.rs 同构的最小子集） ----------\n+\n+const CONNS: usize = 2;\n+/// 连续盘数。\n+const MATCHES: usize = 30;\n+/// 单盘步数上限（防止不收敛）。\n+const MAX_STEPS: usize = 4000;\n+/// 允许的堆增长（宽松阈值，只用于抓**阶跃式**泄漏）。\n+const SLACK_BYTES: usize = 32 * 1024 * 1024;\n+\n+async fn join(handle: &room::RoomHandle, conn: usize, seat: u8, name: &str) -> PlayerId {\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(256);\n+    let (r, w) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            display_name: name.into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(seat),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: r,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"join send\");\n+    let j = w.await.expect(\"join reply\").expect(\"join ok\");\n+    PlayerId::new(j.player_id)\n+}\n+\n+async fn snapshot(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    id: u64,\n+    conn: usize,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    rev: u64,\n+) -> Option<(\n+    u64,\n+    Vec<LegalAction>,\n+    Option<engine_api::ChoiceRequest>,\n+    engine_api::MatchOutcome,\n+)> {\n+    let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(id, seq, rev),\n+            reply: rs,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .ok()?;\n+    match ws.await {\n+        Ok(Ok(ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+            view,\n+            choice,\n+            legal_actions,\n+            ..\n+        })) => Some((view.revision, legal_actions, choice, view.outcome)),\n+        _ => None,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+async fn submit(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    id: u64,\n+    conn: usize,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    cmd: engine_api::Command,\n+) -> (bool, u64, Vec<LegalAction>) {\n+    let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    if handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: (conn + 1) as u64,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(id, seq, cmd.expected_revision.0),\n+            command: cmd.clone(),\n+            idempotency_key: cmd.idempotency_key,\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: rs,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .is_err()\n+    {\n+        return (false, 0, Vec::new());\n+    }\n+    match ws.await {\n+        Ok(Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            result,\n+            view,\n+            legal_actions,\n+            ..\n+        })) => (\n+            matches!(result, engine_api::CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            view.revision,\n+            legal_actions,\n+        ),\n+        _ => (false, 0, Vec::new()),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+fn pick(legal: &[LegalAction], cursor: &mut usize) -> Option<LegalAction> {\n+    if legal.is_empty() {\n+        return None;\n+    }\n+    if let Some(a) = legal\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|a| matches!(a, LegalAction::ResolveChoice { .. }))\n+    {\n+        return Some(a.clone());\n+    }\n+    let start = *cursor % legal.len();\n+    let rotated: Vec<LegalAction> = legal[start..]\n+        .iter()\n+        .chain(legal[..start].iter())\n+        .cloned()\n+        .collect();\n+    for a in &rotated {\n+        if matches!(\n+            a,\n+            LegalAction::PlayCard { .. }\n+                | LegalAction::ActivateSkill { .. }\n+                | LegalAction::UseSkillCard { .. }\n+        ) {\n+            return Some(a.clone());\n+        }\n+    }\n+    rotated.first().cloned()\n+}\n+\n+/// 跑**一整盘**，返回 (是否终局, 结局, 步数, 最终修订号)。\n+async fn play_one(room_id: u64, seed: u64) -> (bool, engine_api::MatchOutcome, usize, u64) {\n+    let handle = spawn_room(room_id, 2, seed, String::new(), 64, 100);\n+    let actors = [\n+        join(&handle, 0, 0, \"m-a\").await,\n+        join(&handle, 1, 1, \"m-b\").await,\n+    ];\n+    let mut legal: [Vec<LegalAction>; CONNS] = [Vec::new(), Vec::new()];\n+    let mut cursor = [0usize; CONNS];\n+    let mut rev = 0u64;\n+    let mut seq = 0u64;\n+    let mut outcome = engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress;\n+    let mut steps = 0usize;\n+\n+    // 引导\n+    for conn in 0..CONNS {\n+        seq += 1;\n+        let cmd = engine_api::Command {\n+            actor: actors[conn],\n+            expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(rev),\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+            kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+        };\n+        let (_ok, r, l) = submit(&handle, room_id, conn, seq, cmd).await;\n+        if r > 0 {\n+            rev = r;\n+        }\n+        legal[conn] = l;\n+    }\n+\n+    for _ in 0..MAX_STEPS {\n+        let mut acted = false;\n+        for conn in 0..CONNS {\n+            if legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                if let Some((r, l, choice, o)) =\n+                    snapshot(&handle, room_id, conn, seq + 1, rev).await\n+                {\n+                    outcome = o;\n+                    if r > 0 {\n+                        rev = r;\n+                    }\n+                    legal[conn] = l;\n+                    if legal[conn].is_empty() {\n+                        if let Some(c) = choice {\n+                            if c.observer.0 == actors[conn].0 {\n+                                let take = (c.min_count as usize).min(c.options.len());\n+                                legal[conn].push(LegalAction::ResolveChoice {\n+                                    choice_id: c.choice_id,\n+                                    selections: (0..take as u32).collect(),\n+                                    cancelled: take == 0 && c.allow_cancel,\n+                                });\n+                            }\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+            let Some(action) = pick(&legal[conn], &mut cursor[conn]) else {\n+                continue;\n+            };\n+            let cmd = action.to_command(actors[conn], rev);\n+            seq += 1;\n+            let (ok, r, l) = submit(&handle, room_id, conn, seq, cmd).await;\n+            if ok {\n+                cursor[conn] = 0;\n+            } else {\n+                cursor[conn] += 1;\n+            }\n+            if r > 0 {\n+                rev = r;\n+            }\n+            legal[conn] = l;\n+            acted = true;\n+            steps += 1;\n+            if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                break;\n+            }\n+        }\n+        if !acted {\n+            if let Some((_, _, _, o)) = snapshot(&handle, room_id, 0, seq + 1, rev).await {\n+                if o != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                    outcome = o;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+                break;\n+            }\n+            // 无动作且未终局：再试一轮（避免立刻判定卡死）\n+            continue;\n+        }\n+        if outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    drop(handle);\n+    (\n+        outcome != engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress,\n+        outcome,\n+        steps,\n+        rev,\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+/// **多盘连续**：30 盘逐盘跑完，记录每盘后的堆占用与结局分布，\n+/// 并比较**前 5 盘均值**与**后 5 盘均值**（用于发现缓慢上升趋势）。\n+#[tokio::test(flavor = \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = 4)]\n+async fn thirty_consecutive_matches_do_not_leak_heap() {\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    let base = heap_now();\n+    let mut after_first: Option<usize> = None;\n+    let mut curve: Vec<(usize, bool, String, usize, usize)> = Vec::new();\n+\n+    for i in 0..MATCHES {\n+        let (finished, outcome, steps, rev) = play_one(1_000 + i as u64, 12_345 + i as u64).await;\n+        let now = heap_now();\n+        if i == 0 {\n+            after_first = Some(now);\n+        }\n+        curve.push((i, finished, format!(\"{outcome:?}\"), steps, now));\n+        println!(\n+            \"RESULT mem_match idx={i} finished={finished} outcome={outcome:?} steps={steps} rev={rev} heap_bytes={now}\"\n+        );\n+        assert!(finished, \"第 {i} 盘应在 {MAX_STEPS} 步内跑到终局\");\n+    }\n+\n+    let end = heap_now();\n+    let first = after_first.unwrap_or(base);\n+    let growth = end.saturating_sub(first);\n+    println!(\n+        \"RESULT mem_summary matches={MATCHES} base_bytes={base} after_first_bytes={first} end_bytes={end} growth_bytes={growth} peak_bytes={} slack_bytes={SLACK_BYTES} elapsed_ms={}\",\n+        heap_peak(),\n+        t0.elapsed().as_millis()\n+    );\n+    for (i, finished, outcome, steps, heap) in &curve {\n+        println!(\"RESULT mem_curve idx={i} finished={finished} outcome={outcome} steps={steps} heap_bytes={heap}\");\n+    }\n+    // 结局分布\n+    let mut tally: std::collections::BTreeMap<String, usize> = std::collections::BTreeMap::new();\n+    for (_, _, outcome, _, _) in &curve {\n+        *tally.entry(outcome.clone()).or_insert(0) += 1;\n+    }\n+    let steps_total: usize = curve.iter().map(|c| c.3).sum();\n+    // 前后各 5 盘的堆均值（趋势判据）\n+    let head: usize = curve.iter().take(5).map(|c| c.4).sum::<usize>() / 5;\n+    let tail: usize = curve.iter().rev().take(5).map(|c| c.4).sum::<usize>() / 5;\n+    println!(\n+        \"RESULT mem_trend head5_avg={head} tail5_avg={tail} delta={} steps_total={steps_total} outcomes={tally:?}\",\n+        tail as i64 - head as i64\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        (tail as i64 - head as i64).abs() < SLACK_BYTES as i64,\n+        \"后 5 盘堆均值与首 5 盘相差过大（head={head}, tail={tail}）\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        growth < SLACK_BYTES,\n+        \"连续 {MATCHES} 盘后堆增长 {growth} 字节，超出宽松阈值 {SLACK_BYTES}（疑似泄漏）\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"5f1f9220b6c13b079f21325bb36443ea1b270959","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/long_run_soak.rs","status":"added","additions":195,"deletions":0,"changes":195,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_soak.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_soak.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Flong_run_soak.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,195 @@\n+//! **长程浸入（soak）**：多房间 × 多轮命令 + 周期性快照，验证产品路径在**长时间运行**下\n+//! 不 panic、不死锁、房间始终可响应、修订号单调。\n+//!\n+//! 定位：这是「产品级长程」这一项的**可复现切片**（单进程、内存态、tokio 多线程），\n+//! **不等于**真实网络/多机/浏览器长跑（那部分仍待办）。\n+//!\n+//! 口径：全部命令结果**如实计数**（`accepted` / 其它），**不假设零拒绝**——\n+//! `expected_revision` 固定为 0，重复提交后引擎可能按修订号拒绝，这是**正常语义**。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/config.rs\"]\n+mod config;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::{MessageHeader, ServerMessage};\n+use room::{spawn_room, RoomMsg};\n+use session::Outbound;\n+use std::time::Instant;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+/// 一个房间：加入两名玩家，返回 (handle, player_id, 两个出站接收端)。\n+async fn open_room(\n+    room_id: u64,\n+    seed: u64,\n+) -> (\n+    room::RoomHandle,\n+    u32,\n+    mpsc::Receiver<String>,\n+    mpsc::Receiver<String>,\n+) {\n+    let handle = spawn_room(room_id, 2, seed, String::new(), 64, 100);\n+    let (tx1, rx1) = mpsc::channel::<String>(64);\n+    let (r1, w1) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"soak-a\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: Outbound::new(tx1),\n+            reply: r1,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"join a\");\n+    let j1 = w1.await.expect(\"join a reply\").expect(\"join a ok\");\n+    let (tx2, rx2) = mpsc::channel::<String>(64);\n+    let (r2, w2) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 2,\n+            display_name: \"soak-b\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: Outbound::new(tx2),\n+            reply: r2,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"join b\");\n+    let _ = w2.await.expect(\"join b reply\").expect(\"join b ok\");\n+    (handle, j1.player_id, rx1, rx2)\n+}\n+\n+/// 提交一条 `EndPhase`，返回 (是否 `Accepted`, 权威修订号)。\n+///\n+/// **关键**：`expected_revision` 用**上一轮拿到的权威修订号**（来自 `CommandOutcome.view.revision`），\n+/// 否则命令会按修订号被拒（只剩拒绝路径可测）。\n+async fn submit_end_phase(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    room_id: u64,\n+    player: u32,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    expected: u64,\n+) -> (bool, u64) {\n+    let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    if handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(room_id, seq, expected),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(player),\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(expected),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: rs,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .is_err()\n+    {\n+        return (false, expected);\n+    }\n+    match ws.await {\n+        Ok(Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, view, .. })) => (\n+            matches!(result, engine_api::CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            view.revision,\n+        ),\n+        _ => (false, expected),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// **长程浸入**：8 房间 × 25 轮 × 4 命令 = 800 条命令；每轮校验快照可响应。\n+#[tokio::test(flavor = \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = 4)]\n+async fn soak_8_rooms_25_rounds() {\n+    const ROOMS: u64 = 8;\n+    const ROUNDS: u64 = 25;\n+    const PER_ROUND: u64 = 4;\n+\n+    let t0 = Instant::now();\n+    let mut rooms = Vec::new();\n+    for r in 0..ROOMS {\n+        let (h, pid, rx1, rx2) = open_room(r, 9_000 + r).await;\n+        rooms.push((r, h, pid, rx1, rx2));\n+    }\n+\n+    let mut revs = vec![0u64; ROOMS as usize];\n+    let mut final_rev = 0u64;\n+    let mut accepted = 0u64;\n+    let mut submitted = 0u64;\n+    let mut snapshots = 0u64;\n+    for round in 0..ROUNDS {\n+        for (room_id, handle, pid, rx1, rx2) in rooms.iter_mut() {\n+            for k in 0..PER_ROUND {\n+                let seq = round * PER_ROUND + k;\n+                submitted += 1;\n+                let (ok, rev) =\n+                    submit_end_phase(handle, *room_id, *pid, seq, revs[*room_id as usize]).await;\n+                revs[*room_id as usize] = rev;\n+                final_rev = final_rev.max(rev);\n+                if ok {\n+                    accepted += 1;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            // 清空出站，避免通道堆积影响后续\n+            while rx1.try_recv().is_ok() {}\n+            while rx2.try_recv().is_ok() {}\n+        }\n+        // 每轮收尾：每个房间必须仍能响应快照（死锁/崩溃会在这里暴露）\n+        for (room_id, handle, _pid, _rx1, _rx2) in rooms.iter_mut() {\n+            let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+            let sent = handle\n+                .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                    connection_id: 1,\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(*room_id, round, 0),\n+                    reply: rs,\n+                })\n+                .await;\n+            assert!(sent.is_ok(), \"room {room_id} 通道应在第 {round} 轮仍可写\");\n+            assert!(\n+                ws.await.is_ok(),\n+                \"room {room_id} 必须在第 {round} 轮仍能响应快照（未死锁/崩溃）\"\n+            );\n+            snapshots += 1;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    let elapsed = t0.elapsed();\n+    println!(\n+        \"RESULT soak rooms={ROOMS} rounds={ROUNDS} per_round={PER_ROUND} \\\n+         submitted={submitted} accepted={accepted} snapshots={snapshots} max_revision={final_rev} \\\n+         elapsed_ms={} throughput_cmds_per_s={:.0}\",\n+        elapsed.as_millis(),\n+        submitted as f64 / elapsed.as_secs_f64().max(1e-9)\n+    );\n+    assert!(submitted == ROOMS * ROUNDS * PER_ROUND, \"命令总数应确定\");\n+    assert!(snapshots == ROOMS * ROUNDS, \"快照总数应确定\");\n+    assert!(accepted > 0, \"长程运行中至少应有命令被接受\");\n+    // **重要限制（如实断言，不掩盖）**：本用例只发 `EndPhase`，对局进行到「等待选择」后\n+    // 该命令不再合法 ⇒ 修订号停在小值（实测 max_revision≈5）。因此这里**只断言「有推进」**，\n+    // 不断言「多数命令被接受」——后者需要按 `legal_actions` 构造 `Answer`/`PlayCard` 等命令（已登记待办）。\n+    assert!(\n+        final_rev > 0,\n+        \"长程运行中权威修订号应推进过（max_revision={final_rev}）\"\n+    );\n+    // 全部房间在所有轮次都响应过快照（上面的 assert 未 panic 即成立）\n+    for (room_id, handle, ..) in &rooms {\n+        let (rs, ws) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        let _ = handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(*room_id, ROUNDS, 0),\n+                reply: rs,\n+            })\n+            .await;\n+        assert!(ws.await.is_ok(), \"room {room_id} 收尾应仍可响应\");\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"cbe4cda46c34134dc3ce59e08a1c21c073ff51b9","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/m8_rolling_upgrade.rs","status":"added","additions":190,"deletions":0,"changes":190,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fm8_rolling_upgrade.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fm8_rolling_upgrade.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fm8_rolling_upgrade.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,190 @@\n+//! M8 gate 2: 滚动升级演练——进行中对局不受影响.\n+//!\n+//! Rehearsal: the lobby pins a ContentLock per room; a \"rolling upgrade\" is\n+//! simulated by running two rooms concurrently, one from the old content\n+//! (standard only) and one from new content (standard + sp). Each room keeps its\n+//! pinned content: identical templates reproduce identical state hashes while\n+//! the different-content room runs in parallel without interference.\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/config.rs\"]\n+mod config;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+use engine_core::Engine;\n+use engine_protocol::{ClientRole, MessageHeader, ServerMessage};\n+use room::{spawn_room_with_engine, RoomMsg};\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+const SP_PACKAGE: &[u8] = include_bytes!(\"../../../content/original/ported/sp/sp.npack.json\");\n+\n+fn template(with_sp: bool) -> Engine {\n+    let mut engine = Engine::new();\n+    if with_sp {\n+        let pkg = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(SP_PACKAGE).unwrap();\n+        engine.load_package(&pkg).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    engine\n+}\n+\n+async fn join_and_start(handle: &room::RoomHandle, conn: u64, name: &str) -> (u32, u64) {\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = mpsc::channel(16);\n+    let outbound = session::Outbound::new(tx);\n+    let (reply, wait) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            display_name: name.into(),\n+            preferred_seat: None,\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound,\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let joined = wait.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let mut drained = 0;\n+    while rx.try_recv().is_ok() {\n+        drained += 1;\n+    }\n+    (joined.player_id, drained)\n+}\n+\n+async fn submit_end_phase(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    conn: u64,\n+    player: u32,\n+    seq: u64,\n+) -> ([u8; 32], u64) {\n+    let (reply, wait) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(1, seq, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(player),\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(seq),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    match wait.await.unwrap().unwrap() {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, view, .. } => {\n+            eprintln!(\n+                \"submit conn={conn} player={player} current={:?} result={:?}\",\n+                view.current_player, result\n+            );\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+                \"end-phase rejected: {result:?}\"\n+            );\n+            (view.state_hash, view.revision)\n+        }\n+        other => panic!(\"unexpected {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn rolling_upgrade_keeps_matches_on_their_pinned_content() {\n+    // Two \"old-content\" rooms (standard only) — deterministic twins.\n+    let a1 = spawn_room_with_engine(1, 2, 42, String::new(), 32, 5, template(false));\n+    let a2 = spawn_room_with_engine(2, 2, 42, String::new(), 32, 5, template(false));\n+    // One \"new-content\" room (standard + sp) — the rolling upgrade.\n+    let b = spawn_room_with_engine(3, 2, 42, String::new(), 32, 5, template(true));\n+\n+    for (handle, base) in [(&a1, 100u64), (&a2, 200), (&b, 300)] {\n+        let (p1, _) = join_and_start(handle, base, \"p1\").await;\n+        let (_p2, _) = join_and_start(handle, base + 1, \"p2\").await;\n+        let (hash, _rev) = submit_end_phase(handle, base, p1, base + 2).await;\n+        assert_ne!(\n+            hash, [0u8; 32],\n+            \"room {base} started with a real state hash\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+\n+    // Determinism: the two old-content rooms produced identical states.\n+    let (h_a1, r_a1) = {\n+        let (reply, wait) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        a1.send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: 100,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(1, 50, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(1),\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(50),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(50),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+        match wait.await.unwrap().unwrap() {\n+            ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { view, .. } => (view.state_hash, view.revision),\n+            other => panic!(\"unexpected {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let (h_a2, r_a2) = {\n+        let (reply, wait) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        a2.send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: 200,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(1, 51, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(1),\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(51),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(51),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+        match wait.await.unwrap().unwrap() {\n+            ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { view, .. } => (view.state_hash, view.revision),\n+            other => panic!(\"unexpected {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(h_a1, h_a2, \"old-content rooms stay byte-identical\");\n+    assert_eq!(r_a1, r_a2, \"old-content rooms advance identically\");\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn different_content_locks_do_not_collide() {\n+    // The new-content room carries a different pinned content lock than the old one:\n+    // its start state must differ (standard+sp vs standard-only), proving the\n+    // rolling upgrade does not silently mutate old rooms.\n+    let old = spawn_room_with_engine(11, 2, 7, String::new(), 32, 5, template(false));\n+    let new = spawn_room_with_engine(12, 2, 7, String::new(), 32, 5, template(true));\n+    let mut new_hash = [0u8; 32];\n+    for (handle, base, capture) in [(&old, 400u64, false), (&new, 500, true)] {\n+        let (p1, _) = join_and_start(handle, base, \"p1\").await;\n+        let (_p2, _) = join_and_start(handle, base + 1, \"p2\").await;\n+        let (hash, _) = submit_end_phase(handle, base, p1, base + 2).await;\n+        if capture {\n+            new_hash = hash;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    // Re-run the new room's match in isolation: identical (deterministic content pin).\n+    let alone = spawn_room_with_engine(13, 2, 7, String::new(), 32, 5, template(true));\n+    let (p1, _) = join_and_start(&alone, 600, \"p1\").await;\n+    let (_p2, _) = join_and_start(&alone, 601, \"p2\").await;\n+    let (alone_hash, _) = submit_end_phase(&alone, 600, p1, 602).await;\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        alone_hash, new_hash,\n+        \"new-content room is deterministic in isolation\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"efb40b15fce33efc76f0146572be27b3d97b38fa","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/native_frozen_packages.rs","status":"added","additions":399,"deletions":0,"changes":399,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_frozen_packages.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_frozen_packages.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_frozen_packages.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,399 @@\n+//! 原局完整包副本：原始指纹、VM 与非核心资产，及停用/升级/撤销边界。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::{FrozenNativePackage, NativeContent};\n+use std::path::Path;\n+\n+const DSL: &str =\n+    \"skill frozen_vm(990201) { trigger phase_end owner_is_target { effect recover_hp(self, 1); } }\";\n+\n+fn write_package(root: &Path, version: &str, source: &str) -> Vec<u8> {\n+    let package = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"frozen-vm\", source).unwrap();\n+    let characters = serde_json::to_vec(&serde_json::json!({\n+        \"source\": \"test\", \"upstream_path\": \"frozen-vm\",\n+        \"upstream_commit\": \"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\",\n+        \"pack\": { \"name\": \"frozen-vm\", \"version\": 1, \"description\": \"test\" },\n+        \"generals\": [{\n+            \"id\": \"frozen_probe\", \"name\": \"frozen_probe\", \"faction\": \"qun\", \"hp\": 4,\n+            \"gender\": \"male\", \"skills\": [{ \"name\": package.trigger_index[0].module }]\n+        }]\n+    }))\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let mut value = serde_json::to_value(package).unwrap();\n+    let resource = b\"\\0binary asset, retained even without a bridge reader\\xff\";\n+    value[\"manifest\"][\"version\"] = version.into();\n+    value[\"asset_manifest\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"schema_version\": 1, \"package_id\": \"frozen-vm\",\n+        \"total_compressed_size\": 0, \"total_decoded_size\": 0,\n+        \"entries\": [{\n+            \"asset_id\": \"frozen-vm:resource\", \"source_hash\": blake3::hash(resource).as_bytes(),\n+            \"kind\": \"Data\", \"image_variants\": [], \"audio_variants\": [],\n+            \"priority\": \"Lazy\", \"depends_on\": [], \"platforms\": []\n+        }, {\n+            \"asset_id\": \"frozen-vm:characters\", \"source_hash\": blake3::hash(&characters).as_bytes(),\n+            \"kind\": \"Data\", \"image_variants\": [], \"audio_variants\": [],\n+            \"priority\": \"Lazy\", \"depends_on\": [], \"platforms\": []\n+        }]\n+    });\n+    value[\"asset_paths\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"frozen-vm:resource\": \"assets/resource.bin\",\n+        \"frozen-vm:characters\": \"assets/character.json\"\n+    });\n+    let mut package: content_schema::ContentPackage = serde_json::from_value(value).unwrap();\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+    // 保留原始空白，不能以反序列化后重录 JSON 的指纹代替内容锁。\n+    let mut bytes = package.to_json_bytes().unwrap();\n+    bytes.extend_from_slice(b\"\\n  \\n\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(root.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(root.join(\"package.npack.json\"), &bytes).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(root.join(\"assets/resource.bin\"), resource).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(root.join(\"assets/character.json\"), characters).unwrap();\n+    bytes\n+}\n+\n+fn fixture() -> (\n+    tempfile::TempDir,\n+    NativeContent,\n+    String,\n+    FrozenNativePackage,\n+) {\n+    let temp = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let sources = temp.path().join(\"sources\");\n+    let bytes = write_package(&sources.join(\"frozen-vm\"), \"1.0.0\", DSL);\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(sources, temp.path().join(\"store\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"frozen-vm\").unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.frozen.package_json.as_bytes(), bytes);\n+    let reference = format!(\"{}@{}\", loaded.pack.def.name, loaded.pack.def.version);\n+    (temp, content, reference, loaded.frozen)\n+}\n+\n+fn with_rehashed_package(\n+    copy: &mut FrozenNativePackage,\n+    edit: impl FnOnce(&mut content_schema::ContentPackage),\n+) {\n+    let mut package =\n+        content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(copy.package_json.as_bytes()).unwrap();\n+    edit(&mut package);\n+    copy.package_json = String::from_utf8(package.to_json_bytes().unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    copy.binding.content_hash = content_runtime::content_hash_hex(copy.package_json.as_bytes());\n+}\n+\n+fn copy_reference(copy: &FrozenNativePackage) -> String {\n+    format!(\n+        \"installed:{}@1\",\n+        serde_json::to_string(&copy.binding).unwrap()\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn frozen_vm_and_binary_assets_restore_without_sources_or_installed_versions() {\n+    let (temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    let pack = content.load_frozen_reference(&reference, &frozen).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(pack.vm_skills.len(), 1);\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(4242, 2, &[&pack]).unwrap();\n+    let snapshot = engine.save();\n+    std::fs::remove_dir_all(temp.path().join(\"sources\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    std::fs::remove_dir_all(temp.path().join(\"store/packages\")).unwrap();\n+    assert!(content.load(\"frozen-vm\").is_err());\n+    assert!(content.load_reference(&reference).is_err());\n+    let (packs, retained) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference], Some(&[frozen]))\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(retained[0].assets.len(), 2);\n+    assert_eq!(packs[0].vm_skills.len(), 1);\n+    let restored = engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&packs[0]]).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(restored.state_hash(), engine.state_hash());\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn vm_character_survives_upgrade_rollback_and_uninstall_via_frozen_copy() {\n+    let (temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    let original = content.load(\"frozen-vm\").unwrap();\n+    let mut engine =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(990_003, 4, &[&original.pack]).unwrap();\n+    engine.assign_general_named(0, \"frozen_probe\").unwrap();\n+    assert!(engine.view_for(0).players[0].skills.contains(&\"frozen_vm\"));\n+    engine.debug_set_hp(0, 2);\n+    let snapshot = engine.save();\n+\n+    let upgraded_dsl = DSL.replace(\"recover_hp(self, 1)\", \"recover_hp(self, 2)\");\n+    write_package(\n+        &temp.path().join(\"sources/frozen-vm\"),\n+        \"2.0.0\",\n+        &upgraded_dsl,\n+    );\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let upgraded = content.load(\"frozen-vm\").unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(upgraded.frozen.binding.version, \"2.0.0\");\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        upgraded.frozen.binding.logic_hash,\n+        frozen.binding.logic_hash\n+    );\n+    assert!(matches!(\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&upgraded.pack]),\n+        Err(engine_native::SnapshotError::RuleVersionMismatch { .. })\n+    ));\n+    let mut upgraded_engine =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(990_003, 4, &[&upgraded.pack]).unwrap();\n+    upgraded_engine\n+        .assign_general_named(0, \"frozen_probe\")\n+        .unwrap();\n+    upgraded_engine.debug_set_hp(0, 2);\n+    advance_until_recovery(&mut upgraded_engine, 4);\n+    let (upgrade_packs, _) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], Some(&[frozen.clone()]))\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let mut during_upgrade =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&upgrade_packs[0]]).unwrap();\n+    content.rollback().unwrap();\n+    let rolled_back = content.load(\"frozen-vm\").unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(rolled_back.frozen.binding, frozen.binding);\n+    let mut after_rollback =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&rolled_back.pack]).unwrap();\n+\n+    content\n+        .uninstall_package(&frozen.binding.namespace, \"frozen-vm\")\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(content.load(\"frozen-vm\").is_err());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], None)\n+        .is_err());\n+    let (packs, retained) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference], Some(&[frozen.clone()]))\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(retained[0].binding, frozen.binding);\n+    let mut restored =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&packs[0]]).unwrap();\n+\n+    for branch in [\n+        &mut engine,\n+        &mut during_upgrade,\n+        &mut after_rollback,\n+        &mut restored,\n+    ] {\n+        advance_until_recovery(branch, 3);\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(during_upgrade.state_hash(), engine.state_hash());\n+    assert_eq!(after_rollback.state_hash(), engine.state_hash());\n+    assert_eq!(restored.state_hash(), engine.state_hash());\n+}\n+\n+fn advance_until_recovery(engine: &mut engine_native::Engine, expected_hp: i32) {\n+    for step in 0..80u64 {\n+        if engine.view_for(0).players[0].hp == expected_hp {\n+            assert_eq!(engine.turn().current, 0);\n+            assert_eq!(engine.turn().phase, engine_native::Phase::End);\n+            return;\n+        }\n+        let (actor, action) = if let Some(choice) = engine.open_choice() {\n+            let selection = choice\n+                .spec\n+                .options\n+                .iter()\n+                .take(choice.spec.min as usize)\n+                .cloned()\n+                .collect();\n+            (\n+                choice.observer,\n+                engine_native::GameAction::Answer {\n+                    choice_id: choice.id,\n+                    selection,\n+                },\n+            )\n+        } else {\n+            (engine.turn().current, engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase)\n+        };\n+        let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+            actor,\n+            expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+            dedup_id: 30_000 + step,\n+            action,\n+        });\n+        assert!(\n+            !matches!(result, engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)),\n+            \"{result:?}\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+    panic!(\"VM 技能未在结束阶段回复至 {expected_hp} 点体力\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn frozen_copy_rejects_tampering_missing_extra_assets_and_invalid_manifest() {\n+    let (_temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    let reject = |copy: &FrozenNativePackage| {\n+        assert!(content.load_frozen_reference(&reference, copy).is_err());\n+    };\n+    let mut raw_changed = frozen.clone();\n+    raw_changed.package_json.push('\\n');\n+    reject(&raw_changed);\n+    let mut asset_changed = frozen.clone();\n+    asset_changed.assets.get_mut(\"assets/resource.bin\").unwrap()[0] ^= 1;\n+    reject(&asset_changed);\n+    let mut missing = frozen.clone();\n+    missing.assets.clear();\n+    reject(&missing);\n+    let mut extra = frozen.clone();\n+    extra.assets.insert(\"assets/undeclared.bin\".into(), vec![0]);\n+    reject(&extra);\n+    let mut wrong_logic = frozen.clone();\n+    wrong_logic.binding.logic_hash = \"00\".repeat(32);\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_frozen_reference(&copy_reference(&wrong_logic), &wrong_logic)\n+        .is_err());\n+    let mut invalid_manifest = frozen.clone();\n+    with_rehashed_package(&mut invalid_manifest, |pkg| {\n+        pkg.manifest.logic_hash = [0; 32]\n+    });\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_frozen_reference(&copy_reference(&invalid_manifest), &invalid_manifest)\n+        .is_err());\n+    let mut traversal = frozen.clone();\n+    with_rehashed_package(&mut traversal, |pkg| {\n+        pkg.asset_paths\n+            .insert(\"frozen-vm:resource\".into(), \"../outside\".into());\n+        pkg.manifest.asset_hash = pkg.compute_asset_hash();\n+    });\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_frozen_reference(&copy_reference(&traversal), &traversal)\n+        .is_err());\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn room_packages_are_exact_ordered_and_do_not_fallback_to_active_packages() {\n+    let (_temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], Some(&[]))\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[], Some(&[frozen.clone()]))\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(\n+            &[reference.clone(), reference.clone()],\n+            Some(&[frozen.clone(), frozen.clone()])\n+        )\n+        .is_err());\n+    let mut wrong = frozen.clone();\n+    wrong.binding.namespace = \"different-namespace\".into();\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], Some(&[wrong]))\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.replace(\"@1\", \"@2\")], Some(&[frozen]))\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[\"frozen-vm@1\".into()], None)\n+        .is_err());\n+    assert!(content.load_room_packages(&[], None).unwrap().0.is_empty());\n+    assert!(content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[], Some(&[]))\n+        .unwrap()\n+        .1\n+        .is_empty());\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn legacy_exact_reference_migrates_disabled_old_version_and_upgrade_leaves_original_copy() {\n+    let (temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    let source = temp.path().join(\"sources/frozen-vm\");\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        source.join(\"manifest.json\"),\n+        br#\"{\"schema_version\":1,\"enabled\":false}\"#,\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    assert!(content.import().unwrap().is_empty(), \"全停用是合法配置\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"frozen-vm\").is_err(), \"停用包不能开新局\");\n+    let (old, migrated) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], None)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(migrated[0].binding, frozen.binding);\n+    assert_eq!(old[0].def.name, reference.rsplit_once('@').unwrap().0);\n+    std::fs::remove_file(source.join(\"manifest.json\")).unwrap();\n+    write_package(&source, \"2.0.0\", DSL);\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let current = content.load(\"frozen-vm\").unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(current.frozen.binding.version, \"2.0.0\");\n+    assert_ne!(current.frozen.binding, frozen.binding);\n+    let (_, migrated_again) = content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], None)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(migrated_again[0].binding.version, \"1.0.0\");\n+    let old_root = temp\n+        .path()\n+        .join(\"store/packages\")\n+        .join(format!(\n+            \"{}__{}\",\n+            frozen.binding.namespace, frozen.binding.package_id\n+        ))\n+        .join(\"1.0.0\");\n+    std::fs::remove_dir_all(old_root).unwrap();\n+    assert!(\n+        content\n+            .load_room_packages(&[reference.clone()], None)\n+            .is_err(),\n+        \"旧档不得猜新版\"\n+    );\n+    content\n+        .load_room_packages(&[reference], Some(&[frozen]))\n+        .unwrap();\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn frozen_copies_obey_current_hash_and_slot_revocations() {\n+    for by_hash in [true, false] {\n+        let (temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+        let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(temp.path().join(\"store\")).unwrap();\n+        if by_hash {\n+            store\n+                .revoke_content_hash(&frozen.binding.content_hash, \"test\", true)\n+                .unwrap();\n+        } else {\n+            store\n+                .revoke_slot(\n+                    &frozen.binding.namespace,\n+                    &frozen.binding.package_id,\n+                    \"test\",\n+                    true,\n+                )\n+                .unwrap();\n+        }\n+        assert!(content\n+            .load_frozen_reference(&reference, &frozen)\n+            .err()\n+            .expect(\"撤销应拒绝\")\n+            .contains(\"已撤销\"));\n+        assert!(content\n+            .freeze_reference(&reference)\n+            .unwrap_err()\n+            .contains(\"已撤销\"));\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(unix)]\n+#[test]\n+fn freezing_installed_assets_rejects_symlinks_outside_package_root() {\n+    use std::os::unix::fs::symlink;\n+    let (temp, content, reference, frozen) = fixture();\n+    let installed = temp\n+        .path()\n+        .join(\"store/packages\")\n+        .join(format!(\n+            \"{}__{}\",\n+            frozen.binding.namespace, frozen.binding.package_id\n+        ))\n+        .join(&frozen.binding.version);\n+    let asset = installed.join(\"assets/resource.bin\");\n+    let outside = temp.path().join(\"outside.bin\");\n+    std::fs::write(&outside, frozen.assets.get(\"assets/resource.bin\").unwrap()).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::remove_file(&asset).unwrap();\n+    symlink(&outside, &asset).unwrap();\n+    assert!(content\n+        .freeze_reference(&reference)\n+        .unwrap_err()\n+        .contains(\"越界\"));\n+}"},{"sha":"2c5d58259f68bf9bd67a4834f8532916a0058c22","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/native_onlyol_general.rs","status":"added","additions":74,"deletions":0,"changes":74,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_onlyol_general.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_onlyol_general.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_onlyol_general.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,74 @@\n+//! N01：onlyOL 现有 npack + ol_zhuhuan 角色资产，经正式 NativeContent 安装/装载/选将。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+\n+const ONLYOL: &[u8] = include_bytes!(\"../../../content/original/ported/onlyOL/onlyOL.npack.json\");\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn onlyol_requires_abi758_and_native_rejects_until_supported() {\n+    let characters = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"source\": \"test\",\n+        \"upstream_path\": \"onlyOL\",\n+        \"upstream_commit\": \"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\",\n+        \"pack\": { \"name\": \"onlyOL\", \"version\": 1, \"description\": \"N01\" },\n+        \"generals\": [{\n+            \"id\": \"ol_zhuhuan\",\n+            \"name\": \"ol_zhuhuan\",\n+            \"faction\": \"wu\",\n+            \"hp\": 4,\n+            \"gender\": \"male\",\n+            \"skills\": [\n+                { \"name\": \"ol_fenli_phase_draw\", \"title\": \"奋励\" },\n+                { \"name\": \"ol_fenli_phase_play\", \"title\": \"奋励\" },\n+                { \"name\": \"ol_fenli_phase_discard\", \"title\": \"奋励\" },\n+                { \"name\": \"ol_pingkou_phase_end\", \"title\": \"平寇\" }\n+            ]\n+        }]\n+    });\n+    let character_bytes = serde_json::to_vec(&characters).unwrap();\n+    let mut npack: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(ONLYOL).unwrap();\n+    let manifest = npack[\"asset_manifest\"].as_object_mut().unwrap();\n+    let entries = manifest[\"entries\"].as_array_mut().unwrap();\n+    // Keep the complete real module/index set; isolate its rule gate from unrelated assets/dependencies.\n+    entries.clear();\n+    entries.push(serde_json::json!({\n+        \"asset_id\": \"onlyOL:characters\",\n+        \"source_hash\": blake3::hash(&character_bytes).as_bytes(),\n+        \"kind\": \"Data\", \"image_variants\": [], \"audio_variants\": [],\n+        \"priority\": \"Lazy\", \"depends_on\": [], \"platforms\": []\n+    }));\n+    npack[\"asset_paths\"] = serde_json::json!({});\n+    npack[\"asset_paths\"][\"onlyOL:characters\"] = serde_json::json!(\"assets/character.json\");\n+    let mut package: content_schema::ContentPackage = serde_json::from_value(npack).unwrap();\n+    for character in &mut package.character_index {\n+        character.portrait_asset = None;\n+        character.skin_assets.clear();\n+    }\n+    package.manifest.dependencies.clear();\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let npack = package.to_json_bytes().unwrap();\n+\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"onlyOL\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(dropin.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), &npack).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"assets/character.json\"), &character_bytes).unwrap();\n+\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content\n+        .import()\n+        .expect(\"complete rule module package installs with assets and dependencies isolated\");\n+    let error = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"official\"), \"onlyOL\")\n+        .err()\n+        .expect(\"full onlyOL still requires unsupported phase_prepare\");\n+    assert!(\n+        error.contains(\"phase_prepare\"),\n+        \"unexpected import error: {error}\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"0ff9cd871cbbdf5e67b0a48cfb2d35c54d954a76","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/native_product_path.rs","status":"added","additions":553,"deletions":0,"changes":553,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_product_path.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_product_path.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_product_path.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,553 @@\n+//! T6③ 产品路径回归：安装包 → 装载 → 原生建局 → 有界 AI 驱动。\n+//!\n+//! 全链路在服务端同进程内验证（HTTP 层薄封装，逻辑在\n+//! `src/native.rs`）：content-runtime 安装 → content-native-loader\n+//! 桥接 → engine-native 建局 → BoundedPlanner 驱动（T13 衔接）。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::{\n+    create_native_game, restore_match, save_fresh_match, NativeContent, NativeGameRequest,\n+};\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+/// 全链路：安装欢乐卡牌 → 装载 → 带扩展建局 → AI 驱动推进。\n+#[test]\n+fn t63_import_load_build_and_drive_with_extension() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装包\");\n+    assert!(\n+        installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"huanle-cards\"),\n+        \"欢乐卡牌应安装\"\n+    );\n+    let listed = content.installed().expect(\"列出已安装\");\n+    assert!(\n+        listed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"huanle-cards\"),\n+        \"存储应能列出已安装包\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"huanle-cards\").expect(\"装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        loaded.pack.card_count(),\n+        7,\n+        \"与 G1 装载口径一致（含伴随技）\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let req = NativeGameRequest {\n+        packages: vec![\"huanle-cards\".into()],\n+        generals: Vec::new(),\n+        seed: 7301,\n+        seats: 3,\n+        max_steps: 600,\n+        planner_nodes: 64,\n+        planner_lookahead: 1,\n+        planner_variant: 0,\n+    };\n+    let summary = create_native_game(&content, &req).expect(\"建局+驱动\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        summary.catalog_cards,\n+        summary.base_catalog_cards + 7,\n+        \"扩展牌应并入目录\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(summary.steps > 0, \"驱动器应有推进\");\n+    assert!(\n+        !summary.stalled,\n+        \"驱动器不得停滞（steps={} finished={}）\",\n+        summary.steps, summary.finished\n+    );\n+    println!(\n+        \"T6③ 带扩展实测: steps={} finished={} winner={:?} elapsed_ms={}\",\n+        summary.steps, summary.finished, summary.winner, summary.elapsed_ms\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// T13-NATIVE-GENERALS-PRODUCT（武将包产品面）：玩点论杀武将包经\n+/// `/native` 产品路径装载——generals 面并入目录，建局与目录计数可见。\n+#[test]\n+fn t13_generals_package_loads_via_native_path() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let _ = content.import().expect(\"安装包\");\n+    let listed = content.installed().expect(\"列出已安装\");\n+    assert!(\n+        listed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"wudian\"),\n+        \"玩点论杀武将包应可发现\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"wudian\").expect(\"装载武将包\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.generals.len(), 9, \"九名武将与 G1 装载口径一致\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.card_count(), 14, \"14 张实体牌与 G1 口径一致\");\n+\n+    let req = NativeGameRequest {\n+        packages: vec![\"wudian\".into()],\n+        generals: Vec::new(),\n+        seed: 4242,\n+        seats: 4,\n+        max_steps: 0,\n+        planner_nodes: 0,\n+        planner_lookahead: 1,\n+        planner_variant: 0,\n+    };\n+    let summary = create_native_game(&content, &req).expect(\"武将包建局\");\n+    assert_eq!(summary.packages, vec![\"wudian\".to_string()]);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        summary.catalog_generals,\n+        summary.base_catalog_generals + 9,\n+        \"武将包九名武将并入目录\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        summary.catalog_cards,\n+        summary.base_catalog_cards + 14,\n+        \"武将包 14 张实体牌并入目录\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// T8 增量 4：drop-in 编译包（package.npack.json 含 rule-vm 模块）→\n+/// 安装 → 装载器 bridge_vm_skill_decls → 建局 → 触发落账——不重编译\n+/// 安装含新技能的包（C1 数据流的服务端磁盘路径）。\n+#[test]\n+fn t8_native_disk_path_vm_package_end_to_end() {\n+    const JIUWEI_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill hnl_jiuwei_t8(990001) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {\n+    if hp(self) < max_hp(self) {\n+      effect recover_hp(self, 1);\n+    } else {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"t8-disk-vm\", JIUWEI_DSL).expect(\"DSL 编译\");\n+    let npack_json = serde_json::to_string(&pkg).expect(\"npack 序列化\");\n+\n+    // drop-in 目录：仅 package.npack.json（vm-only 包，无 cards.json）\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"t8-vm-pack\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), npack_json).unwrap();\n+\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装编译包\");\n+    assert!(\n+        installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"t8-disk-vm\"),\n+        \"编译包应安装\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"t8-disk-vm\").expect(\"装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.len(), 1, \"VM 声明经磁盘装载入包\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills[0].name, \"hnl_jiuwei_t8\");\n+\n+    // 建局 → 授技 → 推进到持有者阶段结束：VM 效果落账（hp 2→3）\n+    let mut e =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(920001, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    e.debug_grant(1, \"hnl_jiuwei_t8\");\n+    e.debug_set_hp(1, 2);\n+    let mut converged = false;\n+    for _ in 0..40 {\n+        if e.turn().current == 1 && e.debug_hp(1) == 3 {\n+            converged = true;\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        if e.outcome().is_some() {\n+            panic!(\"对局提前结束\");\n+        }\n+        let actor = e.turn().current;\n+        submit_next_phase(&mut e, actor);\n+        answer_pending(&mut e);\n+    }\n+    assert!(converged, \"VM 技能：服务端磁盘路径阶段结束受伤回 1\");\n+}\n+\n+fn submit_next_phase(e: &mut engine_native::Engine, actor: u8) {\n+    let rev = e.revision();\n+    let _ = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+        actor,\n+        expected_revision: rev,\n+        dedup_id: (std::time::SystemTime::now()\n+            .duration_since(std::time::UNIX_EPOCH)\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .as_nanos() as u64)\n+            | 1,\n+        action: engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase,\n+    });\n+}\n+\n+fn answer_pending(e: &mut engine_native::Engine) {\n+    if let Some(c) = e.open_choice() {\n+        let sel: Vec<engine_native::ChoiceOption> = c\n+            .spec\n+            .options\n+            .iter()\n+            .filter(|o| matches!(o, engine_native::ChoiceOption::Card(_)))\n+            .copied()\n+            .take(c.spec.min.max(1))\n+            .collect();\n+        let (cid, obs) = (c.id, c.observer);\n+        let selection = if sel.is_empty() && !c.spec.options.is_empty() {\n+            vec![c.spec.options[0].clone()]\n+        } else {\n+            sel\n+        };\n+        let rev = e.revision();\n+        let _ = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+            actor: obs,\n+            expected_revision: rev,\n+            dedup_id: (std::time::SystemTime::now()\n+                .duration_since(std::time::UNIX_EPOCH)\n+                .unwrap()\n+                .as_nanos() as u64)\n+                | 1,\n+            action: engine_native::GameAction::Answer {\n+                choice_id: cid,\n+                selection,\n+            },\n+        });\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 纯标准目录建局 + 驱动（无扩展包的产品路径基线）。\n+#[test]\n+fn t63_standard_only_build_and_drive() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let req = NativeGameRequest {\n+        packages: vec![],\n+        generals: Vec::new(),\n+        seed: 7302,\n+        seats: 3,\n+        max_steps: 300,\n+        planner_nodes: 64,\n+        planner_lookahead: 1,\n+        planner_variant: 0,\n+    };\n+    let summary = create_native_game(&content, &req).expect(\"建局+驱动\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        summary.catalog_cards, summary.base_catalog_cards,\n+        \"无扩展时目录等于标准基线\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(summary.steps > 0);\n+    assert!(!summary.stalled, \"标准对局驱动器不得停滞\");\n+    println!(\n+        \"T6③ 标准实测: steps={} finished={} elapsed_ms={}\",\n+        summary.steps, summary.finished, summary.elapsed_ms\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 已安装扩展进入新对局，保存后再用同一包恢复；缺包与另一包集合被拒绝。\n+#[test]\n+fn t13_installed_extension_enters_match_and_restores() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let packages = vec![\"huanle-cards\".to_string()];\n+    let (bytes, cards) = save_fresh_match(&content, &packages, 17017, 4).expect(\"新对局\");\n+    let base = engine_native::Engine::new(1, 4).catalog().cards.len();\n+    assert_eq!(cards, base + 7, \"欢乐卡牌 7 张进入新对局\");\n+\n+    let restored = restore_match(&content, &packages, &bytes).expect(\"同包恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(restored, cards, \"恢复后目录牌数不变\");\n+\n+    let missing = restore_match(&content, &[], &bytes);\n+    match missing {\n+        Err(msg) => assert!(msg.contains(\"恢复失败\"), \"缺包必须拒绝: {msg}\"),\n+        Ok(n) => panic!(\"缺包必须拒绝，得到 {n}\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    let other = restore_match(&content, &[\"wuxing\".into()], &bytes);\n+    match other {\n+        Err(msg) => assert!(\n+            msg.contains(\"恢复失败\"),\n+            \"另一已安装包必须因内容锁拒绝: {msg}\"\n+        ),\n+        Ok(n) => panic!(\"另一已安装包必须拒绝，得到 {n}\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    let unknown = restore_match(&content, &[\"not-installed\".into()], &bytes);\n+    match unknown {\n+        Err(msg) => assert!(msg.contains(\"包未安装\"), \"{msg}\"),\n+        Ok(n) => panic!(\"未安装包必须拒绝，得到 {n}\"),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 未安装包装载必须可处理报错（不 panic）。\n+#[test]\n+fn t63_load_unknown_package_errors_cleanly() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let err = match content.load(\"no-such-package\") {\n+        Err(err) => err,\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"未安装包装载应报错\"),\n+    };\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"包未安装\"), \"错误应指明未安装: {err}\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_character_only_installed_package_enters_match() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load(\"d3-select\")\n+        .expect(\"仅 character.json 的正式包\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.generals.len(), 1);\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.host_skills.len(), 2);\n+    assert!(loaded.pack.cards.is_empty());\n+    let mut engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(4242, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).unwrap();\n+    let name = loaded.pack.generals[0].name;\n+    engine\n+        .assign_general_named(0, name)\n+        .expect(\"正式武将可选入局\");\n+    let slot = engine.state_core().players[0].general_slots[0].unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(engine.catalog().general_meta(slot).unwrap().0, name);\n+    assert_eq!(engine.state_core().players[0].hp, 4);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_pile_only_installed_package_adds_physical_draw_cards() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let json = std::fs::read_to_string(\n+        repo_packages_root().join(\"cardpile-upstream-noname/assets/pile.json\"),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let spec = content_native_loader::bridge_pile(&json).unwrap();\n+    let expected: usize = spec\n+        .entries\n+        .iter()\n+        .flat_map(|entry| entry.counts.iter().map(|(_, count)| *count as usize))\n+        .sum();\n+    assert!(\n+        content.load(\"cardpile\").is_err(),\n+        \"双来源同 id 必须要求命名空间\"\n+    );\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"cardpile\")\n+        .expect(\"仅 pile.json 的正式包\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.cards.len(), expected);\n+    assert!(expected > 0);\n+    let base = engine_native::Engine::new(4242, 4).catalog().cards.len();\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(4242, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).unwrap();\n+    let physical = engine.state_core().deck.iter().chain(\n+        engine\n+            .state_core()\n+            .players\n+            .iter()\n+            .flat_map(|player| player.hand.iter()),\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        physical.filter(|card| **card as usize >= base).count(),\n+        expected,\n+        \"扩展实体牌必须进入可抽取牌堆或已发手牌，而不只加入目录\"\n+    );\n+    let reference = format!(\"{}@{}\", loaded.pack.def.name, loaded.pack.def.version);\n+    let snapshot = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&engine_native::archive::encode_archive(\n+        &engine.save(),\n+    ))\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let reloaded = content.load_reference(&reference).unwrap();\n+    let restored = engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&reloaded]).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(restored.state_hash(), engine.state_hash());\n+    assert_eq!(restored.catalog().cards.len(), base + expected);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn native_installed_asset_tampering_rejects_load_and_restore() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store.clone()).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let packages = vec![\"huanle-cards\".to_string()];\n+    let (bytes, _) = save_fresh_match(&content, &packages, 4242, 4).unwrap();\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"huanle-cards\").unwrap();\n+    let reference = format!(\"{}@{}\", loaded.pack.def.name, loaded.pack.def.version);\n+    let asset = store.join(\"packages/upstream-noname__huanle-cards/1.0.0/assets/cards.json\");\n+    let mut data = std::fs::read(&asset).unwrap();\n+    data.push(b'\\n');\n+    std::fs::write(&asset, data).unwrap();\n+    let error = content\n+        .load(\"huanle-cards\")\n+        .err()\n+        .expect(\"篡改资产必须拒绝\");\n+    assert!(error.contains(\"hash 不匹配\"), \"{error}\");\n+    assert!(\n+        content.load_reference(&reference).is_err(),\n+        \"房间内容锁不能绕过资产校验\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        restore_match(&content, &packages, &bytes).is_err(),\n+        \"存档恢复不能绕过资产校验\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 服务端正式安装路径：npack（模块）+ `assets/character.json`（武将引用 VM 模块）\n+/// → 安装 → 桥接 → 建局 → 选将 → VM 技能真实触发。\n+#[test]\n+fn vm_package_with_characters_installs_loads_and_runs() {\n+    const DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill vm_probe(990003) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {\n+    effect recover_hp(self, 1);\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"server-vm-char\", DSL).expect(\"compile\");\n+    let characters = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"source\": \"test\",\n+        \"upstream_path\": \"server-vm-char\",\n+        \"upstream_commit\": \"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\",\n+        \"pack\": { \"name\": \"server-vm-char\", \"version\": 1, \"description\": \"test\" },\n+        \"generals\": [{\n+            \"id\": \"vm_probe\",\n+            \"name\": \"vm_probe\",\n+            \"faction\": \"qun\",\n+            \"hp\": 4,\n+            \"gender\": \"male\",\n+            \"skills\": [{ \"name\": \"vm_probe_phase_end\", \"title\": \"探针\" }]\n+        }]\n+    })\n+    .to_string();\n+    let character_bytes = characters.as_bytes();\n+    let mut npack = serde_json::to_value(&pkg).unwrap();\n+    npack[\"asset_manifest\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"schema_version\": 1,\n+        \"package_id\": \"server-vm-char\",\n+        \"total_compressed_size\": 0,\n+        \"total_decoded_size\": 0,\n+        \"entries\": [{\n+            \"asset_id\": \"server-vm-char:characters\",\n+            \"source_hash\": blake3::hash(character_bytes).as_bytes(),\n+            \"kind\": \"Data\", \"image_variants\": [], \"audio_variants\": [],\n+            \"priority\": \"Lazy\", \"depends_on\": [], \"platforms\": []\n+        }]\n+    });\n+    npack[\"asset_paths\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"server-vm-char:characters\": \"assets/character.json\"\n+    });\n+    let mut package: content_schema::ContentPackage = serde_json::from_value(npack).unwrap();\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+\n+    // 真实安装副本的资产哈希也要匹配：只改变引用名并重算资产哈希。\n+    let bad_characters = characters.replace(\"vm_probe_phase_end\", \"missing_vm_skill\");\n+    let mut bad_package = serde_json::to_value(&package).unwrap();\n+    bad_package[\"asset_manifest\"][\"entries\"][0][\"source_hash\"] =\n+        serde_json::json!(blake3::hash(bad_characters.as_bytes()).as_bytes());\n+    let mut bad_package: content_schema::ContentPackage =\n+        serde_json::from_value(bad_package).unwrap();\n+    bad_package.manifest.asset_hash = bad_package.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let bad_dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let bad_dropin = bad_dir.path().join(\"server-vm-char\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(bad_dropin.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        bad_dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"),\n+        bad_package.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(bad_dropin.join(\"assets/character.json\"), bad_characters).unwrap();\n+    let bad_content =\n+        NativeContent::open(bad_dir.path().to_path_buf(), bad_dir.path().join(\"store\")).unwrap();\n+    bad_content.import().expect(\"验证过的包可安装\");\n+    let error = bad_content\n+        .load(\"server-vm-char\")\n+        .err()\n+        .expect(\"未解析技能必须拒绝装载\");\n+    assert!(error.contains(\"missing_vm_skill\"), \"{error}\");\n+\n+    let npack = package.to_json_bytes().unwrap();\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"server-vm-char\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(dropin.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), &npack).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"assets/character.json\"), character_bytes).unwrap();\n+\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    assert!(installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"server-vm-char\"));\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"server-vm-char\").expect(\"装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.len(), 1);\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.generals.len(), 1);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        loaded.pack.generals[0].skills,\n+        vec![engine_native::content::names::intern(\n+            \"vm_probe\".to_string()\n+        )]\n+    );\n+\n+    let mut engine =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(990_003, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    engine.assign_general_named(0, \"vm_probe\").expect(\"选将\");\n+    assert!(engine.view_for(0).players[0].skills.contains(&\"vm_probe\"));\n+    engine.debug_set_hp(0, 3);\n+    let mut restored =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&engine.save(), &[&loaded.pack])\n+            .expect(\"按原包恢复\");\n+    for branch in [&mut engine, &mut restored] {\n+        advance_until_vm_recovery(branch);\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(engine.state_hash(), restored.state_hash());\n+}\n+\n+fn advance_until_vm_recovery(engine: &mut engine_native::Engine) {\n+    for step in 0..80u64 {\n+        if engine.view_for(0).players[0].hp == 4 {\n+            assert_eq!(engine.turn().current, 0);\n+            assert_eq!(engine.turn().phase, engine_native::Phase::End);\n+            return;\n+        }\n+        if engine.outcome().is_some() {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        if let Some(choice) = engine.open_choice() {\n+            let selection = choice\n+                .spec\n+                .options\n+                .iter()\n+                .take(choice.spec.min as usize)\n+                .cloned()\n+                .collect();\n+            let actor = choice.observer;\n+            let choice_id = choice.id;\n+            let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+                actor,\n+                expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+                dedup_id: 30_000 + step,\n+                action: engine_native::GameAction::Answer {\n+                    choice_id,\n+                    selection,\n+                },\n+            });\n+            assert!(\n+                !matches!(result, engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)),\n+                \"{result:?}\"\n+            );\n+        } else {\n+            let actor = engine.turn().current;\n+            let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+                actor,\n+                expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+                dedup_id: 30_000 + step,\n+                action: engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase,\n+            });\n+            assert!(\n+                !matches!(result, engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)),\n+                \"{result:?}\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+    }\n+    panic!(\"服务端安装的 VM 武将技能未在结束阶段回复 1 点体力\");\n+}"},{"sha":"3fa84ed079f9621034f6d97090974e1a81ef2377","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/native_upgrade_rollback.rs","status":"added","additions":126,"deletions":0,"changes":126,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_upgrade_rollback.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_upgrade_rollback.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnative_upgrade_rollback.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,126 @@\n+//! NC02：同包安装新版本后，显式 activate 才切换；rollback 恢复上一版本。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::{restore_match, save_fresh_match, NativeContent};\n+\n+fn package(version: &str) -> Vec<u8> {\n+    let source = format!(\n+        \"skill upgrade_probe(990010) {{ trigger phase_end owner_is_target {{ effect draw_cards(self, 1); }} }}\"\n+    );\n+    let mut package =\n+        content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"upgrade-probe\", &source).expect(\"compile\");\n+    package.manifest.version = version.into();\n+    package.manifest.logic_hash = package.compute_logic_hash();\n+    package.manifest.asset_hash = package.compute_asset_hash();\n+    package.to_json_bytes().unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn activate_new_version_then_rollback() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"upgrade-probe\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.1.0\")).unwrap();\n+\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"install v1\");\n+    let v1 = content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").expect(\"load v1\");\n+    assert_eq!(v1.frozen.binding.version, \"0.1.0\");\n+\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.2.0\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().expect(\"install v2\");\n+    let v2 = content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").expect(\"load v2\");\n+    assert_eq!(v2.frozen.binding.version, \"0.2.0\", \"导入 v2 后自动激活\");\n+\n+    let namespace = v2.frozen.binding.namespace.clone();\n+    content\n+        .activate_version(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\", \"0.2.0\")\n+        .expect(\"activate v2\");\n+\n+    content.rollback().expect(\"rollback\");\n+    let back = content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").expect(\"load rollback\");\n+    assert_eq!(back.frozen.binding.version, \"0.1.0\", \"rollback 应恢复 v1\");\n+\n+    content\n+        .revoke_package(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\", \"uninstall test\")\n+        .expect(\"revoke\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").is_err(), \"撤销后不得再装载\");\n+    assert!(\n+        content\n+            .activate_version(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\", \"0.2.0\")\n+            .is_err(),\n+        \"撤销后不得再激活\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn physical_uninstall_removes_active_slot_and_versions() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"upgrade-probe\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.1.0\")).unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"install\");\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").expect(\"load\");\n+    let namespace = loaded.frozen.binding.namespace.clone();\n+\n+    content\n+        .uninstall_package(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\")\n+        .expect(\"uninstall\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").is_err(), \"卸载后不可装载\");\n+    assert!(\n+        content\n+            .installed()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .iter()\n+            .all(|p| p.package_id != \"upgrade-probe\"),\n+        \"卸载后不应再列出\"\n+    );\n+    // 无撤销标记：重新导入可恢复安装。\n+    content.import().expect(\"reinstall\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").is_ok(), \"重新安装后应可装载\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn disable_then_enable_keeps_installed_copy() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"disable-probe\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.1.0\")).unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"install\");\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").expect(\"load\");\n+    let namespace = loaded.frozen.binding.namespace.clone();\n+\n+    content\n+        .disable_package(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\")\n+        .expect(\"disable\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").is_err(), \"停用后不可装载\");\n+    content\n+        .enable_package(&namespace, \"upgrade-probe\", \"0.1.0\")\n+        .expect(\"enable\");\n+    assert!(content.load(\"upgrade-probe\").is_ok(), \"启用后恢复装载\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn content_lock_rejects_restoring_after_package_upgrade() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin = dir.path().join(\"lock-probe\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.1.0\")).unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(dir.path().to_path_buf(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"install v1\");\n+    let (bytes, _) = save_fresh_match(&content, &[\"upgrade-probe\".into()], 42, 2).expect(\"save v1\");\n+\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"), package(\"0.2.0\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().expect(\"install v2\");\n+    let error = restore_match(&content, &[\"upgrade-probe\".into()], &bytes)\n+        .expect_err(\"升级后旧局必须因内容锁拒绝\");\n+    assert!(error.contains(\"恢复失败\"), \"unexpected: {error}\");\n+}"},{"sha":"645ccd235055966d21a88fcb0cc56eb5a3838337","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc02_install_identity.rs","status":"added","additions":318,"deletions":0,"changes":318,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc02_install_identity.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc02_install_identity.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc02_install_identity.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,318 @@\n+//! NC02 安装包身份与执行内容一致：以**已验证安装副本**为权威。\n+//!\n+//! 审计反例（2026-10-18 架构审查 `loader-probe.log`，使用正式\n+//! `NativeContent` 导入/装载流程）：\n+//! 1. VM 包导入后移除原始来源目录 → 已安装记录与 store 仍在，装载却因\n+//!    回读来源路径失败；\n+//! 2. 同一已安装 VM 包不重新安装，只在原始来源新增有效 `assets/cards.json`\n+//!    → 装载结果由 1 个 VM 技能变为 0 个，并载入 7 张卡牌。\n+//!\n+//! 本文件按 NC02 验收项逐条覆盖：删除/修改来源仍加载安装版本；同 id 不同\n+//! 命名空间与多版本准确选择；混合卡牌与 VM 包不丢技能；安装内容损坏明确\n+//! 失败；重复装载稳定；升级不改写已固定内容锁的局。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\n+\n+const JIUWEI_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill nc02_jiuwei(990101) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {\n+    if hp(self) < max_hp(self) {\n+      effect recover_hp(self, 1);\n+    } else {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn write_vm_package(dir: &Path, name: &str) -> String {\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(name, JIUWEI_DSL).expect(\"DSL 编译\");\n+    let dropin = dir.join(name);\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"),\n+        serde_json::to_string(&pkg).unwrap(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    dropin.to_string_lossy().to_string()\n+}\n+\n+/// 反例 1：删除原始来源目录后仍能从安装副本装载（VM 技能不丢）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_loads_installed_copy_after_source_removed() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin_root = dir.path().to_path_buf();\n+    let dropin = write_vm_package(&dropin_root, \"nc02-vm-a\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(dropin_root.clone(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    assert!(installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == \"nc02-vm-a\"));\n+\n+    // 移除 drop-in 原始来源（模拟作者撤下/移动来源目录）\n+    std::fs::remove_dir_all(&dropin).expect(\"移除来源\");\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"nc02-vm-a\").expect(\"装载安装副本\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.len(), 1, \"VM 技能来自安装副本\");\n+    assert!(loaded.pack.vm_skills[0].name.starts_with(\"nc02_jiuwei\"));\n+}\n+\n+/// 反例 2：只改原始来源的 `assets/cards.json`，不重装 → 执行内容不变。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_source_mutation_does_not_change_execution_content() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin_root = dir.path().to_path_buf();\n+    let dropin = write_vm_package(&dropin_root, \"nc02-vm-b\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(dropin_root.clone(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+\n+    // 在原始来源写入一份「有效但未安装」的 cards.json（7 张卡）\n+    let bogus = r#\"{\n+      \"pack\": { \"name\": \"nc02-bogus\", \"version\": 1, \"card_prefix\": \"nc02b_\" },\n+      \"cards\": [\n+        {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha1\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"}, {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha2\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"},\n+        {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha3\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"}, {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha4\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"},\n+        {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha5\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"}, {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha6\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"},\n+        {\"name\": \"nc02b_sha7\", \"kind\": \"Sha\"}\n+      ],\n+      \"skills\": [], \"generals\": []\n+    }\"#;\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(Path::new(&dropin).join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(Path::new(&dropin).join(\"assets/cards.json\"), bogus).unwrap();\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(\"nc02-vm-b\").expect(\"装载安装副本\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.len(), 1, \"来源改动不影响执行内容\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.cards.len(), 0, \"未安装的卡牌不得进入目录\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 混合包：`package.npack.json`（VM 声明）与 `assets/cards.json` 并存时两者都在。\n+///\n+/// npack 由 DSL 编译后**追加卡牌资产登记**（`asset_manifest` + `asset_paths`），\n+/// 与真实转换包（如 epic-cards）的资产形状一致；安装走 `import_extensions`。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_mixed_package_keeps_cards_and_vm_skills() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin_root = dir.path().to_path_buf();\n+    let name = \"nc02-mixed\";\n+    let cards = r#\"{\n+      \"pack\": { \"name\": \"nc02-mixed\", \"version\": 1, \"card_prefix\": \"nc02m_\" },\n+      \"cards\": [ {\"name\": \"nc02m_sha\", \"kind\": \"sha\", \"suit\": \"spade\", \"rank\": 7} ],\n+      \"skills\": [], \"generals\": []\n+    }\"#;\n+    // 编译 VM 包并追加卡牌资产登记\n+    let mut pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(name, JIUWEI_DSL).expect(\"DSL 编译\");\n+    let raw = String::from_utf8(pkg.to_json_bytes().unwrap()).expect(\"npack UTF-8\");\n+    let mut value: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(&raw).expect(\"npack JSON\");\n+    let hash: Vec<u8> = blake3::hash(cards.as_bytes()).as_bytes().to_vec();\n+    value[\"asset_manifest\"] = serde_json::json!({\n+        \"schema_version\": 1,\n+        \"package_id\": name,\n+        \"total_compressed_size\": 0,\n+        \"total_decoded_size\": 0,\n+        \"entries\": [{\n+            \"asset_id\": format!(\"{name}:cards\"),\n+            \"source_hash\": hash,\n+            \"kind\": \"Data\",\n+            \"image_variants\": [],\n+            \"audio_variants\": [],\n+            \"priority\": \"Lazy\",\n+            \"depends_on\": [],\n+            \"platforms\": [],\n+        }],\n+    });\n+    value[\"asset_paths\"] = serde_json::json!({ format!(\"{name}:cards\"): \"assets/cards.json\" });\n+    pkg = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(\n+        serde_json::to_string(&value).unwrap().as_bytes(),\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"重建 npack\");\n+    pkg.manifest.logic_hash = pkg.compute_logic_hash();\n+    pkg.manifest.asset_hash = pkg.compute_asset_hash();\n+\n+    let dropin = dropin_root.join(name);\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(dropin.join(\"assets\")).unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(\n+        dropin.join(\"package.npack.json\"),\n+        pkg.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    std::fs::write(dropin.join(\"assets/cards.json\"), cards).unwrap();\n+\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(dropin_root.clone(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装混合包\");\n+\n+    let loaded = content.load(name).expect(\"装载混合包\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.len(), 1, \"VM 技能保留\");\n+    assert_eq!(loaded.pack.cards.len(), 1, \"卡牌并入目录\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 同 id 不同命名空间：默认装载明确失败，指定命名空间可准确选择。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_same_id_different_namespace_requires_explicit_selection() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装仓库包\");\n+\n+    // 构造第二个命名空间下的同 id 包：直接用 store 安装\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"huanle-cards\", JIUWEI_DSL).expect(\"DSL 编译\");\n+    let mut dup = pkg.clone();\n+    dup.manifest.namespace = \"nc02-alt\".into();\n+    dup.manifest.logic_hash = dup.compute_logic_hash();\n+    dup.manifest.asset_hash = dup.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&store_root).expect(\"store\");\n+    store\n+        .install(\n+            &dup.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+            None,\n+            &content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+                activate: true,\n+                allow_unsigned: true,\n+                verify_key: None,\n+                host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+            },\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"安装同 id 异命名空间\");\n+\n+    let err = match content.load(\"huanle-cards\") {\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"同 id 多命名空间应明确失败\"),\n+        Err(e) => e,\n+    };\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"命名空间\"), \"错误信息应提示命名空间: {err}\");\n+\n+    let picked = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"huanle-cards\")\n+        .expect(\"指定命名空间可装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(picked.package_id, \"huanle-cards\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 安装内容损坏：装载明确失败（不静默降级）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_corrupt_installed_copy_fails_clearly() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let dropin_root = dir.path().to_path_buf();\n+    write_vm_package(&dropin_root, \"nc02-corrupt\");\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(dropin_root.clone(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+\n+    // 破坏安装副本的 package.json（逻辑指纹不再匹配内容锁）\n+    let pkg_dir = std::fs::read_dir(store_root.join(\"packages\"))\n+        .expect(\"packages 目录\")\n+        .filter_map(|e| e.ok())\n+        .map(|e| e.path())\n+        .find(|p| {\n+            p.file_name()\n+                .map(|n| n.to_string_lossy().ends_with(\"__nc02-corrupt\"))\n+                .unwrap_or(false)\n+        })\n+        .expect(\"nc02-corrupt 包目录\");\n+    let version_dir = std::fs::read_dir(&pkg_dir)\n+        .expect(\"包目录\")\n+        .filter_map(|e| e.ok())\n+        .map(|e| e.path())\n+        .find(|p| p.is_dir())\n+        .expect(\"版本目录\");\n+    std::fs::write(version_dir.join(\"package.json\"), b\"{ not json\").unwrap();\n+\n+    let err = match content.load(\"nc02-corrupt\") {\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"损坏安装副本应失败\"),\n+        Err(e) => e,\n+    };\n+    assert!(\n+        !err.is_empty(),\n+        \"损坏安装副本必须明确失败（不静默降级）: {err}\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        err.contains(\"装载安装副本失败\")\n+            || err.contains(\"失败\")\n+            || err.contains(\"key must be a string\")\n+            || err.contains(\"content lock\"),\n+        \"错误应指向安装副本或内容锁: {err}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 重复装载稳定：两次装载的 VM 技能与卡牌一致。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_repeated_loads_are_stable() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装仓库包\");\n+    let a = content.load(\"huanle-cards\").expect(\"首次装载\");\n+    let b = content.load(\"huanle-cards\").expect(\"二次装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(a.pack.cards.len(), b.pack.cards.len(), \"卡牌数稳定\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        a.pack.vm_skills.len(),\n+        b.pack.vm_skills.len(),\n+        \"VM 技能数稳定\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(a.pack.def.name, b.pack.def.name, \"包身份稳定\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 升级不改写已固定内容锁的局：旧锁仍装载旧版本。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc02_upgrade_does_not_rewrite_pinned_lock() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装仓库包\");\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&store_root).expect(\"store\");\n+\n+    let pinned = store.current_lock().expect(\"内容锁\");\n+    let pinned_entry = pinned\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == \"huanle-cards\")\n+        .expect(\"锁含 huanle-cards\")\n+        .clone();\n+\n+    // 升级到 2.0.0（改写活动集）\n+    let bytes = store\n+        .load_active_package_bytes(\"upstream-noname\", \"huanle-cards\")\n+        .expect(\"读活动包\");\n+    let mut upgraded = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&bytes).expect(\"解析活动包\");\n+    upgraded.manifest.version = \"2.0.0\".into();\n+    upgraded.manifest.logic_hash = upgraded.compute_logic_hash();\n+    upgraded.manifest.asset_hash = upgraded.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let version_dir = store\n+        .root()\n+        .join(\"packages\")\n+        .join(\"upstream-noname__huanle-cards\")\n+        .join(pinned_entry.version.clone());\n+    store\n+        .install_with_assets(\n+            &upgraded.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+            None,\n+            &content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+                activate: true,\n+                allow_unsigned: true,\n+                verify_key: None,\n+                host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+            },\n+            &version_dir,\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"安装 2.0.0\");\n+\n+    // 旧锁仍可装载旧版本（不改写已固定内容锁的局）\n+    let locked = store.load_locked_packages(&pinned).expect(\"按旧锁装载\");\n+    let old = locked\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.manifest.package_id == \"huanle-cards\")\n+        .expect(\"旧版本仍在锁内\");\n+    assert_eq!(old.manifest.version, pinned_entry.version, \"旧锁版本不变\");\n+\n+    // 新装载（活动集）取到新版本\n+    let active = store.current_lock().expect(\"新锁\");\n+    let active_entry = active\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == \"huanle-cards\")\n+        .expect(\"活动集含 huanle-cards\");\n+    assert_eq!(active_entry.version, \"2.0.0\", \"活动集已升级\");\n+}"},{"sha":"0ab49b1c5f2e7dc55340b1daf4325cd1231bae3d","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc05_campaign_profile.rs","status":"added","additions":169,"deletions":0,"changes":169,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_campaign_profile.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_campaign_profile.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_campaign_profile.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,169 @@\n+//! NC05 第二类纵向案例：**战役/跨局档案 + 升级恢复**（Boss 关卡进度）。\n+//!\n+//! 案例来源：`boss-play-upstream-liuli`（Boss 模式扩展包）+ 原生 Boss 关卡状态\n+//! （`GameMode::Boss.stage`：关卡种类/等级/孟婆旗标/禁将表/选将挂起）。\n+//!\n+//! 验收（产品入口，非调试授技）：\n+//! 1. 独立安装扩展包 → 装载（安装副本为权威）→ **Boss 关卡建局**（产品构造入口）；\n+//! 2. 关卡进度写入 → **归档往返**（`encode_archive`/`decode_archive` + 带扩展恢复）\n+//!    后进度与目录规模一致；\n+//! 3. 固定内容锁：扩展包升级到 9.9.9 后，**旧锁仍装载旧版本**（战役档案不被改写）；\n+//! 4. 回退/重新激活原版本后，档案仍可恢复且进度不变。\n+//!\n+//! 未覆盖（登记待办）：跨局档案的**产品持久化层**（game-server `persist.rs` 的\n+//! 房间存档）与真实客户端；本文件覆盖内核档案 + 内容锁的升级/恢复语义。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+const PACKAGE_ID: &str = \"boss-play\";\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn options() -> content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+    content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+        activate: true,\n+        allow_unsigned: true,\n+        verify_key: None,\n+        host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 战役/跨局档案：Boss 关卡进度 + 扩展包的安装/装载/升级/恢复闭环。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc05_campaign_profile_lifecycle() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open content\");\n+\n+    // ① 独立安装 + 装载（安装副本为权威）\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    assert!(\n+        installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == PACKAGE_ID),\n+        \"boss-play 包应安装: {:?}\",\n+        installed.iter().map(|p| &p.package_id).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+    );\n+    // NC02：boss-play 在两个命名空间下都存在 → 显式指定命名空间（这正是\n+    // NC02「同 id 不同命名空间需显式选择」的行为）\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-liuli\"), PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"装载 boss-play（upstream-liuli）\");\n+    let pack = loaded.pack;\n+\n+    // ② Boss 关卡建局（产品构造入口）+ 进度写入\n+    let mut e =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_boss_stage_with_extensions(20261071, 5, 0, 3, 4, 4, 0, &[&pack])\n+            .expect(\"Boss 关卡建局\");\n+    e.debug_set_boss_progress(3, true, false);\n+    let cards_before = e.catalog().cards.len();\n+    let generals_before = e.catalog().general_count();\n+\n+    // ③ 归档往返（跨局档案）：带扩展恢复后进度与目录一致\n+    let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&e.save());\n+    assert!(!bytes.is_empty(), \"档案字节非空\");\n+    let snapshot = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).expect(\"解码档案\");\n+    let restored =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&pack]).expect(\"带扩展恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.catalog().cards.len(),\n+        cards_before,\n+        \"恢复后卡牌目录规模一致\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.catalog().general_count(),\n+        generals_before,\n+        \"恢复后武将目录规模一致\"\n+    );\n+    let progress = restored\n+        .boss_stage_progress()\n+        .expect(\"Boss 关卡进度在档案内\");\n+    assert_eq!(progress.0, 3, \"关卡等级保留\");\n+    assert!(progress.1, \"孟婆已出现旗标保留\");\n+    assert!(!progress.2, \"孟婆未死亡旗标保留\");\n+\n+    // ④ 固定内容锁：升级后旧锁仍装载旧版本（战役档案不被改写）\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&store_root).expect(\"store\");\n+    let pinned = store.current_lock().expect(\"内容锁\");\n+    let entry = pinned\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"锁含 boss-play\")\n+        .clone();\n+    let raw = store\n+        .load_active_package_bytes(\"upstream-liuli\", PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"读活动包\");\n+    let mut upgraded = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&raw).expect(\"解析活动包\");\n+    upgraded.manifest.version = \"9.9.9\".into();\n+    upgraded.manifest.logic_hash = upgraded.compute_logic_hash();\n+    upgraded.manifest.asset_hash = upgraded.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let version_dir = store\n+        .root()\n+        .join(\"packages\")\n+        .join(format!(\"upstream-liuli__{PACKAGE_ID}\"))\n+        .join(entry.version.clone());\n+    store\n+        .install_with_assets(\n+            &upgraded.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+            None,\n+            &options(),\n+            &version_dir,\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"升级安装\");\n+    let locked = store.load_locked_packages(&pinned).expect(\"按旧锁装载\");\n+    let locked_version = locked\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.manifest.package_id == PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"旧版本在锁内\")\n+        .manifest\n+        .version\n+        .clone();\n+    assert_eq!(locked_version, entry.version, \"固定内容锁版本不变\");\n+\n+    // ⑤ 回退 + 重新激活原版本后，档案仍可恢复且进度不变\n+    store.rollback().expect(\"回退\");\n+    store\n+        .activate_version(\"upstream-liuli\", PACKAGE_ID, &entry.version)\n+        .expect(\"激活原版本\");\n+    let restored_again =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &[&pack]).expect(\"回退后恢复\");\n+    let progress_again = restored_again.boss_stage_progress().expect(\"进度仍在\");\n+    assert_eq!(progress_again, progress, \"回退后进度一致\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 对照：跨局档案拒绝错误版本（内容锁/规则版本不符时明确失败）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc05_campaign_profile_rejects_wrong_content() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-liuli\"), PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"装载（显式命名空间）\");\n+\n+    let mut e = engine_native::Engine::new_boss_stage_with_extensions(\n+        20261072,\n+        5,\n+        0,\n+        3,\n+        4,\n+        4,\n+        0,\n+        &[&loaded.pack],\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"建局\");\n+    e.debug_set_boss_progress(1, false, false);\n+    let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&e.save());\n+    let snapshot = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).expect(\"解码\");\n+\n+    // 无扩展恢复（内容不符）应被拒绝\n+    let err = engine_native::Engine::restore(&snapshot);\n+    assert!(err.is_err(), \"缺少扩展时恢复应明确失败\");\n+}"},{"sha":"670bebcf801518873086585545154daa7296774d","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc05_lifecycle_heavy.rs","status":"added","additions":182,"deletions":0,"changes":182,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_lifecycle_heavy.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_lifecycle_heavy.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_lifecycle_heavy.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,182 @@\n+//! NC05 第一类纵向案例：**重规则/嵌套选择**扩展的全生命周期闭环。\n+//!\n+//! 案例来源：`shahai-swd-upstream-noname`（505 个宿主行为、含嵌套选择与多步机器\n+//! 的 swd 规则面）——按 NC05 要求走**产品入口**：\n+//!\n+//! 作者包产物（仓库转换包）→ `import_extensions` 独立安装 → `NativeContent::load`\n+//! 装载（NC02：以安装副本为权威）→ **正式选将**（`NativeGameRequest.generals` →\n+//! `Engine::assign_general_named`，非 `debug_grant`）→ 建局驱动 → 真实交互\n+//! （`legal_actions` 取候选、提交命令、应答选择）→ 存读档（`save_fresh_match`/\n+//! `restore_match`，内容锁固定）→ 升级/回退 → 卸载后旧锁仍可恢复。\n+//!\n+//! 未覆盖（登记待办，见证据 README）：客户端 UI/Worker 入口、多选/取消/过期选择\n+//! 的全部形态、真实网络会话。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::{\n+    create_native_game, restore_match, save_fresh_match, NativeContent, NativeGameRequest,\n+};\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+const PACK: &str = \"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\";\n+const PACKAGE_ID: &str = \"shahai-swd\";\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn options() -> content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+    content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+        activate: true,\n+        allow_unsigned: true,\n+        verify_key: None,\n+        host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 从目录里挑一个**扩展包自带**且带技能的武将（按包名前缀过滤）。\n+fn pack_general(content: &NativeContent) -> String {\n+    let loaded = content.load(PACKAGE_ID).expect(\"装载 swd 包\");\n+    let mut probe =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20261061, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    let names: Vec<String> = probe\n+        .general_candidates()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter_map(|d| probe.catalog().general_meta(d).map(|m| (m.0, m.2)))\n+        .filter(|(name, skills)| name.contains(\"swd\") && !skills.is_empty())\n+        .map(|(name, _)| name.to_string())\n+        .collect();\n+    assert!(!names.is_empty(), \"swd 包应含带技能的武将\");\n+    let pick = names[0].clone();\n+    // 产品入口可装配（顺带证明候选可装配）\n+    probe.assign_general_named(0, &pick).expect(\"选将应成功\");\n+    pick\n+}\n+\n+/// 全生命周期：安装 → 装载 → 正式选将 → 建局 → 交互 → 存读档 → 升级/回退 → 卸载恢复。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc05_heavy_rules_lifecycle() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open content\");\n+\n+    // ① 独立安装（作者包产物 → store）\n+    let installed = content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    assert!(\n+        installed.iter().any(|p| p.package_id == PACKAGE_ID),\n+        \"swd 包应安装: {:?}\",\n+        installed.iter().map(|p| &p.package_id).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+    );\n+\n+    // ② 正式选将 + 建局 + 驱动（产品入口，非 debug_grant）\n+    let general = pack_general(&content);\n+    let req = NativeGameRequest {\n+        packages: vec![PACKAGE_ID.to_string()],\n+        generals: vec![general.clone()],\n+        seed: 20261062,\n+        seats: 4,\n+        max_steps: 120,\n+        planner_nodes: 32,\n+        planner_lookahead: 1,\n+        planner_variant: 1,\n+    };\n+    let summary = create_native_game(&content, &req).expect(\"建局并驱动\");\n+    assert_eq!(summary.packages, vec![PACKAGE_ID.to_string()]);\n+    assert!(\n+        summary.catalog_cards > summary.base_catalog_cards,\n+        \"扩展卡牌并入目录\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        summary.catalog_generals > summary.base_catalog_generals,\n+        \"扩展武将并入目录\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // ③ 真实交互：用权威动作查询取候选并提交（至少提交一次非应答命令）\n+    let loaded = content.load(PACKAGE_ID).expect(\"装载\");\n+    let mut e =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20261063, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    e.assign_general_named(0, &general).expect(\"选将\");\n+    let seat = e.turn().current;\n+    let actions = e.legal_actions(seat);\n+    assert!(!actions.is_empty(), \"权威查询应给出候选\");\n+    let action = actions\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|a| matches!(a, engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase))\n+        .cloned()\n+        .unwrap_or_else(|| actions[0].clone());\n+    let out = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+        actor: seat,\n+        expected_revision: e.revision(),\n+        dedup_id: 1,\n+        action,\n+    });\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(\n+            out,\n+            engine_native::CommandOutcome::Accepted { .. }\n+                | engine_native::CommandOutcome::Pending { .. }\n+        ),\n+        \"真实交互命令应被接受: {out:?}\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // ④ 存读档（产品入口；内容锁固定）\n+    let (bytes, cards) =\n+        save_fresh_match(&content, &[PACKAGE_ID.to_string()], 20261064, 4).expect(\"存盘\");\n+    assert!(cards > 0);\n+    let restored_cards = restore_match(&content, &[PACKAGE_ID.to_string()], &bytes).expect(\"读档\");\n+    assert_eq!(restored_cards, cards, \"读档目录规模一致\");\n+\n+    // ⑤ 升级 → 回退（不改写已固定内容锁的局）\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&store_root).expect(\"store\");\n+    let pinned = store.current_lock().expect(\"内容锁\");\n+    let entry = pinned\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"锁含 swd 包\")\n+        .clone();\n+    let raw = store\n+        .load_active_package_bytes(\"upstream-noname\", PACKAGE_ID)\n+        .expect(\"读活动包\");\n+    let mut upgraded = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&raw).expect(\"解析活动包\");\n+    upgraded.manifest.version = \"9.9.9\".into();\n+    upgraded.manifest.logic_hash = upgraded.compute_logic_hash();\n+    upgraded.manifest.asset_hash = upgraded.compute_asset_hash();\n+    let version_dir = store\n+        .root()\n+        .join(\"packages\")\n+        .join(format!(\"upstream-noname__{PACKAGE_ID}\"))\n+        .join(entry.version.clone());\n+    store\n+        .install_with_assets(\n+            &upgraded.to_json_bytes().unwrap(),\n+            None,\n+            &options(),\n+            &version_dir,\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"升级安装\");\n+    // 旧锁仍装载旧版本（局不受升级影响）\n+    let locked = store.load_locked_packages(&pinned).expect(\"按旧锁装载\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        locked\n+            .iter()\n+            .find(|p| p.manifest.package_id == PACKAGE_ID)\n+            .expect(\"旧版本在锁内\")\n+            .manifest\n+            .version,\n+        entry.version,\n+        \"固定内容锁版本不变\"\n+    );\n+    store.rollback().expect(\"回退\");\n+\n+    // ⑥ 卸载（禁用）后旧锁仍可恢复：以固定锁装载存档\n+    store\n+        .activate_version(\"upstream-noname\", PACKAGE_ID, &entry.version)\n+        .expect(\"激活原版本\");\n+    let restored_again =\n+        restore_match(&content, &[PACKAGE_ID.to_string()], &bytes).expect(\"卸载/回退后仍可恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(restored_again, cards, \"恢复结果一致\");\n+}"},{"sha":"25f6fc901ee98f37e99149974c9d7a39b5b60d88","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc05_skin_ui.rs","status":"added","additions":234,"deletions":0,"changes":234,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_skin_ui.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_skin_ui.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc05_skin_ui.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,234 @@\n+//! NC05 第三类纵向案例：**皮肤/UI 组合**（表现资源与规则内容分离）。\n+//!\n+//! 案例来源：`skin-switch-upstream-liuli`（L24 皮肤切换，纯配置/表现面：\n+//! `assets/config.json`，无规则模块）+ `select-beautify-upstream-liuli`（L27 选将美化）。\n+//!\n+//! 方案 §2 要求：「规则配置进入逻辑内容锁；纯表现资源保留独立资源指纹」。本文件\n+//! 验收：\n+//! 1. 皮肤/UI 包可独立安装、装载（安装副本为权威）、其**配置资源**经 store 解析\n+//!    到安装目录（不读 drop-in 源目录）；\n+//! 2. 资源索引可枚举（`load_active_asset_index`）且路径位于 store 内；\n+//! 3. **资产改动只改资源指纹、不改逻辑指纹**：仅替换 `assets/config.json` 后重装，\n+//!    `asset_hash` 变化而 `logic_hash` 不变；\n+//! 4. 固定内容锁：升级后旧锁仍装载旧版本；回退后恢复；\n+//! 5. 与规则包共存（皮肤 + 重规则包同时启用）时建局与交互正常。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+const SKIN: &str = \"skin-switch\";\n+const RULES_PACK: &str = \"shahai-swd\";\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn options() -> content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+    content_runtime::InstallOptions {\n+        activate: true,\n+        allow_unsigned: true,\n+        verify_key: None,\n+        host: content_runtime::tooling_host_versions(),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 皮肤/UI 包：配置资源从安装副本解析；资产改动只改资源指纹。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc05_skin_ui_asset_separation() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store_root = dir.path().join(\"store\");\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), store_root.clone()).expect(\"open content\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let store = content_runtime::PackageStore::open(&store_root).expect(\"store\");\n+\n+    // ① 装载皮肤包（无规则模块：vm/cards 为空，不影响目录）\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-liuli\"), SKIN)\n+        .expect(\"装载皮肤包\");\n+    assert!(loaded.pack.vm_skills.is_empty(), \"皮肤包无 VM 技能\");\n+    assert!(loaded.pack.cards.is_empty(), \"皮肤包无卡牌\");\n+\n+    // ② 资源经 store 解析到安装目录（NC02 口径：不读 drop-in 源目录）\n+    let info = store\n+        .resolve_active_asset_info(\"upstream-liuli\", SKIN, \"skin-switch:config\")\n+        .expect(\"解析配置资源\");\n+    // macOS 上 /var 与 /private/var 为符号链接：两侧统一规范化后比较\n+    let store_root_canon = store.root().canonicalize().expect(\"store 根规范化\");\n+    let asset_canon = info.path.canonicalize().expect(\"资源路径规范化\");\n+    assert!(\n+        asset_canon.starts_with(&store_root_canon),\n+        \"资源路径须位于 store 内: {asset_canon:?} vs {store_root_canon:?}\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        asset_canon\n+            .to_string_lossy()\n+            .contains(\"packages/upstream-liuli__skin-switch\"),\n+        \"资源须来自该包的安装目录: {asset_canon:?}\"\n+    );\n+    let config_raw = std::fs::read_to_string(&info.path).expect(\"读配置\");\n+    assert!(config_raw.contains('{'), \"配置为 JSON 文本\");\n+\n+    // ③ 资源索引可枚举\n+    let index = store.load_active_asset_index().expect(\"资源索引\");\n+    assert!(\n+        index\n+            .keys()\n+            .any(|(ns, id, _)| ns == \"upstream-liuli\" && id == SKIN),\n+        \"索引含皮肤包资源\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // ④ 资产改动只改资源指纹、不改逻辑指纹\n+    let before = store.current_lock().expect(\"锁\");\n+    let before_entry = before\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == SKIN)\n+        .expect(\"锁含皮肤包\")\n+        .clone();\n+    let raw = store\n+        .load_active_package_bytes(\"upstream-liuli\", SKIN)\n+        .expect(\"读活动包\");\n+    let mut changed = config_raw.clone();\n+    changed.push_str(\"\\n\");\n+    // 模拟作者替换皮肤资源：改写内容 + 同步资产条目 source_hash（安装器逐资产校验）\n+    let new_hash: Vec<u8> = blake3::hash(changed.as_bytes()).as_bytes().to_vec();\n+    let raw_str = String::from_utf8(raw.clone()).expect(\"npack UTF-8\");\n+    let mut value: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(&raw_str).expect(\"npack JSON\");\n+    if let Some(entries) = value[\"asset_manifest\"][\"entries\"].as_array_mut() {\n+        for e in entries.iter_mut() {\n+            if e[\"asset_id\"] == \"skin-switch:config\" {\n+                e[\"source_hash\"] = serde_json::json!(new_hash);\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let mut pkg = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(\n+        serde_json::to_string(&value).unwrap().as_bytes(),\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"重建 npack\");\n+    // 真实升级路径：**新版本号**携带新资源（store 拒绝同版本不同内容——这是\n+    // 「安装失败保留旧版本」的不变量，测试不绕过它）\n+    pkg.manifest.version = \"1.0.1\".into();\n+    pkg.manifest.asset_hash = pkg.compute_asset_hash();\n+    pkg.manifest.logic_hash = pkg.compute_logic_hash();\n+    let source_dir = dir.path().join(\"skin-src-1.0.1\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(source_dir.join(\"assets\")).expect(\"资源目录\");\n+    std::fs::write(source_dir.join(\"assets/config.json\"), &changed).expect(\"替换资源\");\n+    store\n+        .install_with_assets(&pkg.to_json_bytes().unwrap(), None, &options(), &source_dir)\n+        .expect(\"升级到 1.0.1（仅资产变化）\");\n+\n+    let after = store.current_lock().expect(\"新锁\");\n+    let after_entry = after\n+        .packages\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|p| p.package_id == SKIN)\n+        .expect(\"锁含皮肤包\");\n+    // 版本升级本身进入逻辑指纹（version 是内容身份的一部分），故此处只断言\n+    // 升级被接受且活动集指向新版本；「资源变化不改逻辑指纹」用同版本的内存\n+    // 计算直接验收（见下）。\n+    assert_eq!(after_entry.version, \"1.0.1\", \"升级版本生效\");\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        after_entry.content_hash, before_entry.content_hash,\n+        \"资源指纹随资源变化\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // 同版本内存对照：仅替换资产文件哈希 → asset_hash 变、logic_hash 不变\n+    let base = content_schema::ContentPackage::from_json_bytes(&raw).expect(\"基线包\");\n+    let mut variant = base.clone();\n+    if let Some(entries) = variant.asset_manifest.as_mut().map(|m| &mut m.entries) {\n+        for e in entries.iter_mut() {\n+            if e.asset_id == \"skin-switch:config\" {\n+                e.source_hash = *blake3::hash(changed.as_bytes()).as_bytes();\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        variant.compute_asset_hash(),\n+        base.compute_asset_hash(),\n+        \"资产哈希应随资源变化\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        variant.compute_logic_hash(),\n+        base.compute_logic_hash(),\n+        \"纯表现资源变化不得改动逻辑指纹\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // ⑤ 固定内容锁：旧锁仍可装载旧版本；回退后可恢复\n+    let locked = store.load_locked_packages(&before).expect(\"按旧锁装载\");\n+    assert!(\n+        locked.iter().any(|p| p.manifest.package_id == SKIN),\n+        \"旧锁仍含皮肤包\"\n+    );\n+    store.rollback().expect(\"回退\");\n+    let restored = store.load_locked_packages(&before).expect(\"回退后装载\");\n+    assert!(\n+        restored.iter().any(|p| p.manifest.package_id == SKIN),\n+        \"回退后皮肤包仍可装载\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 皮肤包与规则包共存：建局、选将、交互正常（组合能力）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc05_skin_with_rules_pack_coexists() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let skin = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-liuli\"), SKIN)\n+        .expect(\"装载皮肤包\");\n+    let rules = content.load(RULES_PACK).expect(\"装载规则包\");\n+    let beautify = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-liuli\"), \"select-beautify\")\n+        .expect(\"装载选将美化包\");\n+\n+    let packs: Vec<&engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack> =\n+        vec![&skin.pack, &rules.pack, &beautify.pack];\n+    let mut e = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20261081, 4, &packs).expect(\"建局\");\n+\n+    // 正式选将 + 权威动作查询 + 真实提交（组合面可用）\n+    let general = e\n+        .general_candidates()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter_map(|d| e.catalog().general_meta(d).map(|m| (m.0, m.2)))\n+        .find(|(name, skills)| name.contains(\"swd\") && !skills.is_empty())\n+        .map(|(name, _)| name.to_string())\n+        .expect(\"规则包提供带技能武将\");\n+    e.assign_general_named(0, &general).expect(\"选将\");\n+    let seat = e.turn().current;\n+    let actions = e.legal_actions(seat);\n+    assert!(!actions.is_empty(), \"组合目录下仍有合法动作\");\n+    let out = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+        actor: seat,\n+        expected_revision: e.revision(),\n+        dedup_id: 1,\n+        action: actions\n+            .iter()\n+            .find(|a| matches!(a, engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase))\n+            .cloned()\n+            .unwrap_or_else(|| actions[0].clone()),\n+    });\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(\n+            out,\n+            engine_native::CommandOutcome::Accepted { .. }\n+                | engine_native::CommandOutcome::Pending { .. }\n+        ),\n+        \"组合面交互应被接受: {out:?}\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // 存档往返（组合内容锁）\n+    let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&e.save());\n+    let snapshot = engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).expect(\"解码\");\n+    let restored =\n+        engine_native::Engine::restore_with_extensions(&snapshot, &packs).expect(\"带组合扩展恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.catalog().cards.len(),\n+        e.catalog().cards.len(),\n+        \"恢复后目录规模一致\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"35ebb99994588a7a31ed236a25365290003bfa79","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc08_cross_line.rs","status":"added","additions":203,"deletions":0,"changes":203,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_cross_line.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_cross_line.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_cross_line.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,203 @@\n+//! NC08 旧线↔原生线**逐命令语义对照**（公开面）。\n+//!\n+//! 口径（方案 §NC08）：「固定采用的上游版本、初始局面、随机输入与玩家选择，\n+//! 复用现有场景和对照工具，逐命令比较状态、事件、选择、随机流与续行。旧线与\n+//! 新线一致、golden 未变和测试全绿分别记录，不能单独推导上游等价。」\n+//!\n+//! 本文件只做**可对照的公开面**：回合/阶段/座位体力/存活/手牌数。\n+//! 两侧状态模型不同（摘要不可比），故不比较 hash；差异逐条记录为\n+//! 「对照差异」而不是自动判失败——但**纯阶段推进**（NextPhase）段必须一致，\n+//! 不一致即为缺陷。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use engine_api::{\n+    Command, CommandKind, CommandResult as OldResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId,\n+};\n+use engine_core::Engine as OldEngine;\n+use engine_native::{CommandOutcome, Engine as NewEngine, GameAction, GameCommand};\n+use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicU64, Ordering};\n+\n+static DEDUP: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(1);\n+\n+fn next_dedup() -> u64 {\n+    DEDUP.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed)\n+}\n+\n+/// 公开面快照（两侧同口径）：`(round, current, phase, [(seat, hp, max_hp, alive, hand_count)])`。\n+type PublicTrace = (u32, u8, String, Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool, usize)>);\n+\n+fn old_trace(e: &OldEngine) -> PublicTrace {\n+    let st = e.state();\n+    let mut seats: Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool, usize)> = st\n+        .players\n+        .iter_live()\n+        .map(|p| {\n+            (\n+                p.seat.0,\n+                p.hp,\n+                p.max_hp,\n+                p.alive,\n+                // 旧线手牌在区域存储里（`GameState::hand_count`）\n+                st.hand_count(p.id) as usize,\n+            )\n+        })\n+        .collect();\n+    seats.sort();\n+    (\n+        st.turn.round,\n+        st.turn.current.raw() as u8,\n+        format!(\"{:?}\", st.turn.phase),\n+        seats,\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+fn new_trace(e: &NewEngine) -> PublicTrace {\n+    let core = e.state_core();\n+    let mut seats: Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool, usize)> = core\n+        .players\n+        .iter()\n+        .enumerate()\n+        .map(|(i, p)| (i as u8, p.hp, p.max_hp, p.alive, p.hand.len()))\n+        .collect();\n+    seats.sort();\n+    (\n+        e.turn().round,\n+        e.turn().current,\n+        format!(\"{:?}\", e.turn().phase),\n+        seats,\n+    )\n+}\n+\n+/// 启动旧线（原生线建局即开局）。\n+fn start_old(seats: u8, seed: u64) -> OldEngine {\n+    let mut e = OldEngine::new();\n+    let cmd = Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: seats,\n+            rng_seed: seed,\n+            ruleset: String::new(),\n+        },\n+    };\n+    match e.submit(cmd) {\n+        OldResult::Accepted { .. } => {}\n+        other => panic!(\"旧线 StartGame 未接受: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+    e\n+}\n+\n+/// 身份局模式对齐：旧线 `StartGame` 与原生 `new_identity` 的**初始公开面一致**\n+/// （主公 +1 体力上限、四座体力/手牌数相同）。\n+///\n+/// 已确证的**开局推进差异**（本用例不断言相等，见 `nc08_cross_line_divergence_report`\n+/// 与证据 README）：同种子下一次 `EndPhase`/`NextPhase` 后，\n+/// - 旧线：`current=1, phase=Play`；\n+/// - 原生：`current=0, phase=Draw`；\n+/// 即**回合起点与开局推进序不同**（旧线首回合为主公且直接进入出牌，原生自 0 号判定/摸牌起）。\n+/// 该差异需在规则基准登记理由与影响，不能靠改断言消除。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc08_cross_line_identity_start_alignment() {\n+    const SEATS: u8 = 4;\n+    const SEED: u64 = 20261601;\n+    let old = start_old(SEATS, SEED);\n+    let new = NewEngine::new_identity(SEED, SEATS as usize);\n+\n+    let a = old_trace(&old);\n+    let b = new_trace(&new);\n+    assert_eq!(a.0, b.0, \"初始回合数一致\");\n+    // 阶段/当前座位**不同**（开局推进差异，见上方说明与证据）：这里只记录不比较\n+    eprintln!(\n+        \"DBG 初始阶段/当前：旧 ({:?}, {}) / 原生 ({:?}, {})\",\n+        a.2, a.1, b.2, b.1\n+    );\n+    // 体力/上限/存活一致；**手牌数不同**（开局长发牌差异，已登记）\n+    let strip = |rows: &Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool, usize)>| -> Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool)> {\n+        rows.iter()\n+            .map(|(s, hp, mhp, alive, _)| (*s, *hp, *mhp, *alive))\n+            .collect()\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        strip(&a.3),\n+        strip(&b.3),\n+        \"初始体力/上限/存活一致：旧 {:?} / 原生 {:?}\",\n+        a.3,\n+        b.3\n+    );\n+    let hands = |rows: &Vec<(u8, i32, u32, bool, usize)>| -> Vec<usize> {\n+        rows.iter().map(|(_, _, _, _, n)| *n).collect()\n+    };\n+    eprintln!(\n+        \"DBG 初始手牌数：旧 {:?} / 原生 {:?}（开局长发牌差异，已登记规则基准）\",\n+        hands(&a.3),\n+        hands(&b.3)\n+    );\n+    // 身份局特征：主公 +1 体力上限（旧线主公为 1 号玩家 → 座位 0）\n+    let lord = a.3.iter().find(|(seat, ..)| *seat == 0).expect(\"座位 0\");\n+    assert_eq!(lord.2, 5, \"旧线主公 +1 上限（5）\");\n+    let native_lord = b.3.iter().find(|(seat, ..)| *seat == 0).expect(\"座位 0\");\n+    assert_eq!(native_lord.2, 5, \"原生身份局主公 +1 上限（5）\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 对照记录：差异**逐条打印**（供证据归档），不自动判失败。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc08_cross_line_divergence_report() {\n+    const SEATS: u8 = 4;\n+    let mut rows: Vec<String> = Vec::new();\n+    for seed in [20261602u64, 20261603] {\n+        let mut old = start_old(SEATS, seed);\n+        let mut new = NewEngine::new_identity(seed, SEATS as usize);\n+        for step in 0..12u64 {\n+            let old_actor = old.state().turn.current;\n+            let old_out = old.submit(Command {\n+                actor: old_actor,\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(old.state().revision),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(step + 100),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase {},\n+            });\n+            let new_seat = new.turn().current;\n+            let new_out = new.submit(GameCommand {\n+                actor: new_seat,\n+                expected_revision: new.revision(),\n+                dedup_id: next_dedup(),\n+                action: GameAction::NextPhase,\n+            });\n+            let old_ok = matches!(old_out, OldResult::Accepted { .. });\n+            let new_ok = matches!(\n+                new_out,\n+                CommandOutcome::Accepted { .. } | CommandOutcome::Pending { .. }\n+            );\n+            if old_ok != new_ok {\n+                rows.push(format!(\n+                    \"seed={seed} step={step} 接受性差异：旧={old_ok} 原生={new_ok}（旧 {old_out:?} / 原生 {new_out:?}）\"\n+                ));\n+                break;\n+            }\n+            if old_ok {\n+                let a = old_trace(&old);\n+                let b = new_trace(&new);\n+                if a.0 != b.0 || a.1 != b.1 || a.2 != b.2 || a.3 != b.3 {\n+                    rows.push(format!(\n+                        \"seed={seed} step={step} 公开面差异：旧 {a:?} / 原生 {b:?}\"\n+                    ));\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            if new.outcome().is_some() {\n+                break;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    if rows.is_empty() {\n+        eprintln!(\"DBG 旧线↔原生线 12 步 × 2 种子：公开面与接受性一致\");\n+    } else {\n+        for r in &rows {\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 对照差异：{r}\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+    // 本用例是**记录**用例：只要求能跑完（差异已打印，供证据归档）\n+    assert!(rows.len() <= 2, \"差异条数超出预期（{rows:?}）\");\n+}"},{"sha":"90b512c8801e1a37399171e5da09dad8f11f3208","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc08_install_matrix.rs","status":"added","additions":150,"deletions":0,"changes":150,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_install_matrix.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_install_matrix.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc08_install_matrix.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,150 @@\n+//! NC08：**逐包「安装」矩阵**——把「安装」项从 5 个来源扩到**全部包目录**。\n+//!\n+//! 判据（每包，**独立临时 store**）：\n+//! 1. 把**单个包目录**（symlink）放进临时 root ⇒ `NativeContent::import()` **成功**；\n+//! 2. `installed()` 中**出现该包**（按 `package_id` 匹配）；\n+//! 3. **再次 import** ⇒ 安装记录数**不变**（**幂等**，不重复安装）。\n+//!\n+//! 边界：只覆盖**安装 + 幂等**；**不覆盖**「卸载/回滚」（`native.rs` 无 uninstall API，已登记）、\n+//! 也不覆盖「版本升级」（由 `nc08_upgrade_matrix` 覆盖）。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\n+\n+fn pkg_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+/// 递归复制（`import` **不跟随 symlink**，实测用 symlink 会安装 0 个包 ⇒ 必须真复制）。\n+fn copy_dir(src: &Path, dst: &Path) {\n+    let _ = std::fs::create_dir_all(dst);\n+    let Ok(rd) = std::fs::read_dir(src) else {\n+        return;\n+    };\n+    for e in rd.flatten() {\n+        let p = e.path();\n+        let target = dst.join(e.file_name());\n+        if p.is_dir() {\n+            copy_dir(&p, &target);\n+        } else if p.is_file() {\n+            let _ = std::fs::copy(&p, &target);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 造一个只含 `pkg` 的临时 root（**真复制**）。\n+fn single_root(base: &Path, pkg: &Path) -> PathBuf {\n+    let root = base.join(\"root\");\n+    let dst = root.join(pkg.file_name().expect(\"pkg name\"));\n+    if !dst.exists() {\n+        copy_dir(pkg, &dst);\n+    }\n+    root\n+}\n+\n+/// 单包安装（返回 `Some(包名)` 通过；`None` 跳过）。\n+fn check(base: &Path, pkg: &Path, idx: usize) -> Option<String> {\n+    let name = pkg.file_name()?.to_string_lossy().to_string();\n+    if !pkg.join(\"package.npack.json\").is_file() {\n+        eprintln!(\"NOTE 安装矩阵：{name} 无 package.npack.json —— 跳过\");\n+        return None;\n+    }\n+    let scratch = base.join(format!(\"p{idx}\"));\n+    let _ = std::fs::create_dir_all(&scratch);\n+    let root = single_root(&scratch, pkg);\n+    let store = scratch.join(\"store\");\n+\n+    let nc = NativeContent::open(root.clone(), store.clone()).expect(\"open native content\");\n+    let installed = match nc.import() {\n+        Ok(v) => v,\n+        Err(e) => {\n+            eprintln!(\"NOTE 安装矩阵：{name} import 失败（{e}）—— 跳过\");\n+            return None;\n+        }\n+    };\n+    if installed.is_empty() {\n+        eprintln!(\"NOTE 安装矩阵：{name} import 成功但**安装 0 个包**（登记，见证据）\");\n+        return None;\n+    }\n+    assert_eq!(installed.len(), 1, \"{name}: 单包 root 最多只应安装 1 个包\");\n+    let first = nc.installed().expect(\"installed\");\n+    assert_eq!(first.len(), 1, \"{name}: 安装记录应为 1\");\n+    let pid = first[0].package_id.clone();\n+\n+    // 幂等：再次 import 不得增加记录\n+    let again = nc.import().expect(\"re-import\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.len(), 1, \"{name}: 重复 import 不应新增包\");\n+    let after = nc.installed().expect(\"installed2\");\n+    assert_eq!(after.len(), 1, \"{name}: 重复 import 后安装记录仍为 1\");\n+    eprintln!(\n+        \"DBG 安装矩阵：{name} ✅ package_id={pid} version={} 幂等 ✅\",\n+        first[0].version\n+    );\n+    Some(name)\n+}\n+\n+/// **逐包安装矩阵**：全部包目录各跑一次（独立 store）。\n+#[test]\n+fn install_matrix_over_package_dirs() {\n+    let root = pkg_root();\n+    let base = std::env::temp_dir().join(format!(\"nc08-install-{}\", std::process::id()));\n+    let _ = std::fs::create_dir_all(&base);\n+    let mut dirs: Vec<PathBuf> = std::fs::read_dir(&root)\n+        .expect(\"read packages dir\")\n+        .flatten()\n+        .map(|e| e.path())\n+        .filter(|p| p.is_dir())\n+        .collect();\n+    dirs.sort();\n+    let mut passed = Vec::new();\n+    for (i, pkg) in dirs.iter().enumerate() {\n+        if let Some(n) = check(&base, pkg, i) {\n+            passed.push(n);\n+        }\n+    }\n+    eprintln!(\n+        \"DBG 安装矩阵：通过 {}/{} 个包目录\",\n+        passed.len(),\n+        dirs.len()\n+    );\n+    let _ = std::fs::remove_dir_all(&base);\n+    assert!(\n+        passed.len() >= 35,\n+        \"应至少 35 个包目录通过安装矩阵，实得 {}：{passed:?}\",\n+        passed.len()\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// **符号链接包目录 ⇒ 明确报错**（而不是「静默装 0 个」）。\n+///\n+/// 背景：`import` 扫描**不跟随 symlink**；此前对「非空 root 但装 0 个包」返回 `Ok(空)`，\n+/// 部署者会误以为安装成功。本用例锁住新的**报错**行为。\n+#[cfg(unix)]\n+#[test]\n+fn symlinked_package_dir_is_rejected_explicitly() {\n+    let root = pkg_root();\n+    let pkg = root.join(\"shahai-swd-upstream-noname\");\n+    assert!(pkg.is_dir(), \"样本包应存在\");\n+    let base = std::env::temp_dir().join(format!(\"nc08-symlink-{}\", std::process::id()));\n+    let _ = std::fs::remove_dir_all(&base);\n+    let dropin = base.join(\"root\");\n+    std::fs::create_dir_all(&dropin).expect(\"mkdir\");\n+    std::os::unix::fs::symlink(&pkg, dropin.join(\"swd-link\")).expect(\"symlink\");\n+\n+    let nc = NativeContent::open(dropin.clone(), base.join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    let err = nc.import();\n+    match err {\n+        Err(msg) => {\n+            eprintln!(\"DBG 软链安装：被明确拒绝 ✅ —— {msg}\");\n+            assert!(\n+                msg.contains(\"非空\") || msg.contains(\"符号链接\"),\n+                \"错误信息应说明原因，实得：{msg}\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+        Ok(v) => panic!(\"软链包目录应被拒绝，实得 Ok({} 个包)\", v.len()),\n+    }\n+    let _ = std::fs::remove_dir_all(&base);\n+}"},{"sha":"6df8b9e4c10960eb5b149d9b014930a7c7c01f0c","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc09_dual_backend.rs","status":"added","additions":541,"deletions":0,"changes":541,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_dual_backend.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_dual_backend.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_dual_backend.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,541 @@\n+//! NC09 双后端等价面：**同一批会话语义**在旧线房间与原生房间上都必须成立。\n+//!\n+//! 口径：旧线房间（`room::spawn_room*`）与原生房间（`room_native_actor::spawn_room_native`）\n+//! 共用 `RoomMsg`/`RoomHandle`/`JoinReply` 与协议消息类型；本文件对**可对照的会话语义**\n+//! 逐条在两后端上跑同一断言：入座座位/玩家 id、满座拒绝、重连保留座位、观战无权威动作、\n+//! 非法命令明确拒绝。差异（如旧线 `StartGame` 前置、原生建局即开局）在证据中登记。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_room_store.rs\"]\n+mod native_room_store;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native.rs\"]\n+mod room_native;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native_actor.rs\"]\n+mod room_native_actor;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::{ClientRole, MessageHeader, ServerMessage};\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use room::{RoomHandle, RoomMsg};\n+use room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn native_session(seed: u64, seats: u8) -> NativeRoomSession {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, seats as usize, &[&loaded.pack])\n+        .expect(\"建局\");\n+    // 保存包集合：Recover 重放需要同内容\n+    NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![loaded.pack], seats)\n+}\n+\n+async fn join(\n+    handle: &RoomHandle,\n+    conn: u64,\n+    seat: Option<u8>,\n+    token: Option<String>,\n+) -> Result<room::JoinReply, String> {\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(8);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            display_name: format!(\"c{conn}\"),\n+            preferred_seat: seat,\n+            reconnect_token: token,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send join\");\n+    rr.await.expect(\"reply\")\n+}\n+\n+async fn spectate(handle: &RoomHandle, conn: u64) -> Result<room::JoinReply, String> {\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(8);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Spectate {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            display_name: format!(\"s{conn}\"),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send spectate\");\n+    rr.await.expect(\"reply\")\n+}\n+\n+async fn submit(\n+    handle: &RoomHandle,\n+    conn: u64,\n+    seq: u64,\n+    kind: CommandKind,\n+    idem: u64,\n+) -> Result<ServerMessage, String> {\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(1, seq, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::NONE, // 反冒充：以入座座位为准\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(idem),\n+                kind,\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(idem),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send submit\");\n+    rr.await.expect(\"reply\")\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生后端：入座/满座/重连/观战/拒绝（与旧线共用断言）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_session_semantics() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(11, native_session(20261801, 2), 16, 4);\n+\n+    let a = join(&handle, 1, Some(0), None).await.expect(\"入座 0\");\n+    assert_eq!(a.seat, 0);\n+    assert_eq!(a.role, ClientRole::Player);\n+    let b = join(&handle, 2, Some(1), None).await.expect(\"入座 1\");\n+    assert_eq!(b.seat, 1);\n+    // 满座（2 座）\n+    assert!(join(&handle, 3, None, None).await.is_err(), \"满座必须拒绝\");\n+    // 重连：令牌换绑连接、保留座位\n+    let token = a.reconnect_token.clone();\n+    let again = join(&handle, 4, None, Some(token.clone()))\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"重连\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.seat, 0, \"重连保留座位\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.reconnect_token, token, \"令牌不变\");\n+    // 无效令牌\n+    assert!(\n+        join(&handle, 5, None, Some(\"bogus\".into())).await.is_err(),\n+        \"无效令牌必须失败\"\n+    );\n+    // 观战：公开投影、无权威动作\n+    let spec = spectate(&handle, 6).await.expect(\"观战\");\n+    assert_eq!(spec.role, ClientRole::Spectator);\n+    assert!(spec.legal_actions.is_empty(), \"观战者无权威动作\");\n+    // 观战者提交 → 明确拒绝\n+    let out = submit(&handle, 6, 1, CommandKind::EndPhase {}, 1).await;\n+    assert!(out.is_err(), \"观战者提交必须失败: {out:?}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 原生后端：非当前回合座位推进 → 明确拒绝（协议拒绝原因可见）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_rejects_illegal_command() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(12, native_session(20261802, 4), 16, 4);\n+    // 占满四个座位，确保「非当前回合」座位存在\n+    for seat in 0..4u8 {\n+        let _ = join(&handle, 100 + seat as u64, Some(seat), None)\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"入座\");\n+    }\n+    // 找一个非当前回合座位：用快照问当前座位\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+            connection_id: 100,\n+            header: MessageHeader::new(12, 1, 0),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+    let current = match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+        ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => view.current_player.raw(),\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+    };\n+    let other_seat = (0..4u8)\n+        .find(|s| *s as u32 + 1 != current)\n+        .expect(\"其他座位\");\n+    let conn = 100 + other_seat as u64;\n+    match submit(&handle, conn, 2, CommandKind::EndPhase {}, 7).await {\n+        Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. }) => match result {\n+            CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => {\n+                assert!(\n+                    matches!(reason, engine_api::RejectReason::InvalidActor),\n+                    \"非本人回合应 InvalidActor: {reason:?}\"\n+                );\n+            }\n+            other => panic!(\"应被拒绝: {other:?}\"),\n+        },\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 旧线协议兼容：`StartGame` 作为「开局确认」——参数匹配则接受（原生建局即开局），\n+/// 不匹配则**明确拒绝**（不静默吞掉）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_startgame_is_confirmation_only() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(13, native_session(20261803, 4), 16, 4);\n+    let _ = join(&handle, 1, Some(0), None).await.expect(\"入座\");\n+    // 匹配：接受\n+    let ok = submit(\n+        &handle,\n+        1,\n+        1,\n+        CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 4,\n+            rng_seed: 20261803,\n+            ruleset: String::new(),\n+        },\n+        11,\n+    )\n+    .await\n+    .expect(\"提交\");\n+    match ok {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. } => assert!(\n+            matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            \"匹配的开局确认应接受: {result:?}\"\n+        ),\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+    // 不匹配：明确拒绝（返回错误）\n+    let bad = submit(\n+        &handle,\n+        1,\n+        2,\n+        CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: 3,\n+            rng_seed: 1,\n+            ruleset: String::new(),\n+        },\n+        12,\n+    )\n+    .await;\n+    assert!(bad.is_err(), \"座位数不一致的开局确认必须报错: {bad:?}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 房间密码：非空密码下错误密码必须被拒（与旧线同口径 `unauthorized`）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_enforces_room_password() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native_with_password(\n+        14,\n+        native_session(20261804, 2),\n+        16,\n+        4,\n+        \"s3cret\".to_string(),\n+    );\n+    // 错误密码 → 拒绝\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(4);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"bad\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: \"wrong\".into(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let err = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect_err(\"错误密码必须被拒\");\n+    assert_eq!(err, \"unauthorized\");\n+\n+    // 正确密码 → 入座\n+    let ok = {\n+        let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(4);\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+                connection_id: 2,\n+                display_name: \"good\".into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+                reconnect_token: None,\n+                password: \"s3cret\".into(),\n+                outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send\");\n+        rr.await.expect(\"reply\")\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(ok.expect(\"正确密码应入座\").seat, 0);\n+}\n+\n+/// `Recover`：快照 + WAL 重放恢复后，修订与摘要与实时推进一致；内容不符时明确失败。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_recover_matches_live_state() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(15, native_session(20261805, 4), 16, 1);\n+    let _ = join(&handle, 1, Some(0), None).await.expect(\"入座\");\n+    // 记录若干条被接受的阶段推进（snapshot_every=1 → 每条都落快照）\n+    let mut accepted = 0;\n+    for i in 0..6u64 {\n+        let current = {\n+            let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+            handle\n+                .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                    connection_id: 1,\n+                    header: MessageHeader::new(15, 1, 0),\n+                    reply: rt,\n+                })\n+                .await\n+                .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+            match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+                ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => view.current_player.raw(),\n+                other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+            }\n+        };\n+        let conn = 1 + current as u64; // 连接 id 与座位约定：1 号连接=座位 0\n+        let conn = if current == 1 { 1 } else { conn };\n+        let seat = current as u8 - 1;\n+        if seat != 0 {\n+            // 该座位未入座 → 先入座（幂等：已入座会失败，忽略）\n+            let _ = join(&handle, 1 + current as u64, Some(seat), None).await;\n+        }\n+        match submit(&handle, conn, 10 + i, CommandKind::EndPhase {}, 100 + i).await {\n+            Ok(ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. }) => {\n+                if matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }) {\n+                    accepted += 1;\n+                }\n+            }\n+            Ok(other) => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+            Err(_) => {}\n+        }\n+    }\n+    assert!(accepted >= 2, \"至少 2 条被接受（实际 {accepted}）\");\n+\n+    // 实时状态（恢复前）\n+    let live_hash = {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(15, 99, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => view.state_hash,\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+\n+    // Recover：快照 + WAL 重放\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Recover { reply: rt })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send recover\");\n+    rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"recover 应成功\");\n+\n+    // 恢复后状态摘要必须与实时一致\n+    let after_hash = {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(15, 100, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => view.state_hash,\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(after_hash, live_hash, \"Recover 后摘要必须与实时一致\");\n+}\n+\n+/// actor 回包与命令后推送：`legal_actions`/`choice` 按观察者给出，且其余成员收到\n+/// **个性化**推送（不含他人选项内容）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_backend_replies_carry_actions_and_fanout() {\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(16, native_session(20261806, 4), 16, 4);\n+    // 两个连接：1 → 座位 0；2 → 座位 1（各自 outbound 收集推送）\n+    let (tx1, mut rx1) = mpsc::channel::<String>(16);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"a\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx1),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let _ = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"入座 0\");\n+    let (tx2, mut rx2) = mpsc::channel::<String>(16);\n+    let (rt2, rr2) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 2,\n+            display_name: \"b\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(1),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx2),\n+            reply: rt2,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let _ = rr2.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"入座 1\");\n+    while rx1.try_recv().is_ok() {}\n+    while rx2.try_recv().is_ok() {}\n+\n+    // 1 号（座位 0）推进阶段（若当前不是座位 0 则先查快照并改用该座位连接）\n+    let current = {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(16, 1, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+                view,\n+                legal_actions,\n+                ..\n+            } => {\n+                // 快照回包应带该观察者的权威动作（至少阶段推进候选或为空集但类型正确）\n+                assert!(legal_actions.len() <= 256);\n+                view.current_player.raw()\n+            }\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let conn = if current == 1 { 1 } else { 2 };\n+    let out = submit(&handle, conn, 2, CommandKind::EndPhase {}, 200).await;\n+    match out.expect(\"提交\") {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            legal_actions,\n+            choice,\n+            ..\n+        } => {\n+            // 提交者回包带自己的动作与选择（可能为空集，但字段已接线）\n+            assert!(legal_actions.len() <= 256);\n+            let _ = choice;\n+        }\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+    // 另一连接应收到**个性化推送**（CommandOutcome）\n+    let mut pushed = 0;\n+    let other_rx = if conn == 1 { &mut rx2 } else { &mut rx1 };\n+    while let Ok(line) = other_rx.try_recv() {\n+        if line.contains(\"command_outcome\") || line.contains(\"CommandOutcome\") {\n+            pushed += 1;\n+        }\n+    }\n+    assert!(\n+        pushed >= 1,\n+        \"命令后其余成员应收到个性化推送（实际 {pushed}）\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 多房间并发与隔离：不同原生房间互不影响；房间信箱有界（满时 `try_send` 失败）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_rooms_are_isolated_and_mailbox_bounded() {\n+    // 5 个原生房间（不同种子），各自入座并推进一次 → 摘要互不相同\n+    let mut handles = Vec::new();\n+    for i in 0..5u64 {\n+        let handle =\n+            room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(300 + i, native_session(20261900 + i, 2), 8, 4);\n+        let _ = join(&handle, 1, Some(0), None).await.expect(\"入座\");\n+        handles.push(handle);\n+    }\n+    let mut hashes = Vec::new();\n+    for handle in &handles {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(1, 1, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => hashes.push(view.state_hash),\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let unique: std::collections::BTreeSet<_> = hashes.iter().collect();\n+    assert_eq!(unique.len(), hashes.len(), \"不同种子的房间摘要应互不相同\");\n+\n+    // 一个房间的命令不影响另一个房间\n+    let before: Vec<[u8; 32]> = hashes.clone();\n+    let current = {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handles[0]\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(1, 2, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => view.current_player.raw(),\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    let conn = if current == 1 {\n+        1\n+    } else {\n+        let _ = join(&handles[0], 2, Some(current as u8 - 1), None).await;\n+        2\n+    };\n+    let _ = submit(&handles[0], conn, 3, CommandKind::EndPhase {}, 900).await;\n+    for (i, handle) in handles.iter().enumerate().skip(1) {\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: MessageHeader::new(1, 3, 0),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send\");\n+        match rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { view, .. } => {\n+                assert_eq!(view.state_hash, before[i], \"其它房间不应受影响（房间 {i}）\")\n+            }\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    // 信箱有界：容量 1 的房间，未消费时 `try_send` 必须失败（tokio mpsc 有界语义）\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(1);\n+    // 直接验证 tokio 有界通道语义（房间 actor 使用同一 mpsc 有界信箱）\n+    tx.try_send(\"a\".into()).expect(\"首个可入\");\n+    assert!(\n+        tx.try_send(\"b\".into()).is_err(),\n+        \"容量 1 的信箱在未消费时必须拒绝第二个\"\n+    );\n+    let _ = rx.recv().await;\n+}"},{"sha":"c99a949615c16276bcea337d9545c564e11e97cd","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc09_native_actor.rs","status":"added","additions":638,"deletions":0,"changes":638,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_actor.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_actor.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_actor.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,638 @@\n+//! NC09 原生权威房间 actor：真实 tokio 任务下的入座/命令/快照/名册广播。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_room_store.rs\"]\n+mod native_room_store;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native.rs\"]\n+mod room_native;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native_actor.rs\"]\n+mod room_native_actor;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::{decode_s2c, ClientRole, ServerMessage};\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use room::RoomMsg;\n+use room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn native_session(seed: u64, seats: u8) -> NativeRoomSession {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, seats as usize, &[&loaded.pack])\n+        .expect(\"建局\");\n+    NativeRoomSession::new(engine, seats)\n+}\n+\n+async fn attached(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    connection_id: u64,\n+    seat: u8,\n+    token: Option<String>,\n+    password: &str,\n+) -> Result<(room::JoinReply, mpsc::Receiver<String>), String> {\n+    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel(128);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id,\n+            display_name: format!(\"p{connection_id}\"),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(seat),\n+            reconnect_token: token,\n+            password: password.into(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await?;\n+    Ok((response.await.unwrap()?, rx))\n+}\n+\n+async fn end_phase(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    connection_id: u64,\n+    header_revision: u64,\n+    body_revision: u64,\n+    key: u64,\n+) -> Result<ServerMessage, String> {\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id,\n+            header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(handle.id, key, header_revision),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(999),\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(body_revision),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase {},\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(key),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await?;\n+    response.await.unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_configured_actor_keeps_password_packages_general_and_seat_ownership() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content = NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"packages\")).unwrap();\n+    content.import().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path().join(\"rooms\"));\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_native_room_if_configured(\n+        90,\n+        2,\n+        4242,\n+        \"secret\".into(),\n+        16,\n+        20,\n+        &content,\n+        true,\n+        \"upstream-noname\",\n+        &[\"shahai-swd\".into(), \"huanle-cards\".into()],\n+        Some(store.clone()),\n+        30,\n+    )\n+    .unwrap()\n+    .unwrap();\n+    assert!(attached(&handle, 9, 0, None, \"wrong\").await.is_err());\n+    let (a, _rx_a) = attached(&handle, 1, 0, None, \"secret\").await.unwrap();\n+    let (_b, _rx_b) = attached(&handle, 2, 1, None, \"secret\").await.unwrap();\n+    let initial = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(initial.state.pack_refs.len(), 2);\n+    for reference in &initial.state.pack_refs {\n+        content.load_reference(reference).unwrap();\n+    }\n+\n+    let baseline = engine_native::Engine::new(1, 2);\n+    let name = baseline\n+        .general_candidates()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter(|def| *def as u32 != a.view.seats[0].character_def)\n+        .filter_map(|def| baseline.catalog().general_meta(def).map(|meta| meta.0))\n+        .next()\n+        .unwrap();\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::ChooseGeneral {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            name: name.into(),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let selected = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        initial.state.snapshot_hex, selected.state.snapshot_hex,\n+        \"同修订选将仍须落盘\"\n+    );\n+    let restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(\n+        &selected.state,\n+        selected\n+            .state\n+            .pack_refs\n+            .iter()\n+            .map(|r| content.load_reference(r).unwrap())\n+            .collect(),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    let selected_hash = restored.engine().state_hash();\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle.send(RoomMsg::Recover { reply }).await.unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+    let (again, mut rx_again) = attached(&handle, 11, 0, Some(a.reconnect_token), \"secret\")\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(again.view.state_hash, selected_hash, \"内存恢复保留选将结果\");\n+    let rebound = store.load_all().unwrap().pop().unwrap();\n+    assert!(rebound.state.members.iter().any(|m| m.connection_id == 11));\n+    assert!(!rebound.state.members.iter().any(|m| m.connection_id == 1));\n+    assert!(\n+        end_phase(&handle, 1, 0, 0, 77).await.is_err(),\n+        \"旧连接已无提交权\"\n+    );\n+    while let Ok(text) = rx_again.try_recv() {\n+        if let ServerMessage::RoomRoster { seats, .. } = engine_protocol::decode_s2c(&text).unwrap()\n+        {\n+            assert_eq!(seats.len(), 2, \"重连不能复制座位\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+    let rev = match end_phase(&handle, 11, 0, 0, 77).await.unwrap() {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            result: CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. },\n+            ..\n+        } => new_revision,\n+        other => panic!(\"{other:?}\"),\n+    };\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(\n+            end_phase(&handle, 2, rev, rev, 77).await.unwrap(),\n+            ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                result: CommandResult::Rejected { .. },\n+                ..\n+            }\n+        ),\n+        \"另一玩家的幂等键不能重放已接受结果\"\n+    );\n+    let current = match end_phase(&handle, 11, rev, rev, 78).await.unwrap() {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+            result: CommandResult::Accepted { new_revision, .. },\n+            ..\n+        } => new_revision,\n+        other => panic!(\"{other:?}\"),\n+    };\n+    assert!(current > rev);\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(\n+            end_phase(&handle, 11, 0, rev, 79).await.unwrap(),\n+            ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+                result: CommandResult::Rejected {\n+                    reason: engine_api::RejectReason::StaleRevision { .. }\n+                },\n+                ..\n+            }\n+        ),\n+        \"header未指定修订时仍须校验body.expected_revision\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// actor 端到端：入座（含名册广播）→ 命令 → 快照。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_native_actor_join_command_snapshot() {\n+    let session = native_session(20261701, 4);\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(7, session, 16, 4);\n+\n+    // 两个连接（各自 outbound 接收名册广播）\n+    let (tx1, mut rx1) = mpsc::channel::<String>(8);\n+    let (reply_tx, reply_rx) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"p1\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx1),\n+            reply: reply_tx,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send join\");\n+    let joined = reply_rx.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"join ok\");\n+    assert_eq!(joined.seat, 0);\n+    assert_eq!(joined.player_id, 1);\n+    assert_eq!(joined.role, ClientRole::Player);\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        joined.view.observer,\n+        engine_api::ObserverKind::Player(PlayerId::new(1))\n+    );\n+    assert!(!joined.reconnect_token.is_empty());\n+    // Successful Join enqueues the connected member's roster before replying.\n+    let text = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(3), rx1.recv())\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"join must broadcast a roster within the response deadline\")\n+        .expect(\"joined member's outbound must remain open\");\n+    let ServerMessage::RoomRoster {\n+        room_id,\n+        seats,\n+        started,\n+        finished,\n+        choice_timeout_secs,\n+    } = decode_s2c(&text).expect(\"valid server protocol\")\n+    else {\n+        panic!(\"expected RoomRoster, got {text}\");\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(room_id, handle.id);\n+    assert!(started && !finished);\n+    assert_eq!(choice_timeout_secs, Some(30));\n+    assert_eq!(seats.len(), 1, \"only the joined player is a room member\");\n+    assert_eq!(seats[0].seat, joined.seat);\n+    assert_eq!(seats[0].player_id, joined.player_id);\n+    assert_eq!(seats[0].display_name, \"p1\");\n+    assert!(seats[0].connected && !seats[0].managed);\n+\n+    // 命令：当前回合座位推进阶段\n+    let current = {\n+        // 直接问快照获取当前座位：用另一连接请求快照\n+        let (reply_tx2, reply_rx2) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Snapshot {\n+                connection_id: 1,\n+                header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(7, 1, 0),\n+                reply: reply_tx2,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send snapshot\");\n+        match reply_rx2.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"snapshot ok\") {\n+            ServerMessage::Snapshot { header, view, .. } => {\n+                assert_eq!(header.room_id, handle.id);\n+                assert_eq!(\n+                    view, joined.view,\n+                    \"snapshot must preserve the joined player's projection\"\n+                );\n+                assert!(view\n+                    .seats\n+                    .iter()\n+                    .any(|seat| seat.player.raw() == joined.player_id));\n+                view.current_player\n+            }\n+            other => panic!(\"应返回快照: {other:?}\"),\n+        }\n+    };\n+    // 若当前座位不是 0 号，则用该座位再入座一个连接\n+    let conn = if current == PlayerId::new(1) {\n+        1\n+    } else {\n+        let (tx2, _rx2) = mpsc::channel::<String>(8);\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+                connection_id: 2,\n+                display_name: \"p2\".into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(current.raw() as u8 - 1),\n+                reconnect_token: None,\n+                password: String::new(),\n+                outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx2),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send join2\");\n+        let j = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"join2 ok\");\n+        assert_eq!(j.player_id, current.raw());\n+        2\n+    };\n+    let (reply_tx3, reply_rx3) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(7, 2, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::new(1), // 反冒充：actor 由服务端以入座座位覆盖\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase {},\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: reply_tx3,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send submit\");\n+    match reply_rx3.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"submit ok\") {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. } => {\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+                \"当前回合座位推进应被接受: {result:?}\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    // 幂等重放：同 idempotency_key 再提交 → 返回同一结果（不重复执行）\n+    let (reply_tx4, reply_rx4) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Submit {\n+            connection_id: conn,\n+            header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(7, 3, 0),\n+            command: Command {\n+                actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+                expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+                idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+                kind: CommandKind::EndPhase {},\n+            },\n+            idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(1),\n+            replay: false,\n+            reply: reply_tx4,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send submit2\");\n+    match reply_rx4.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"submit2 ok\") {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. } => assert!(\n+            matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+            \"幂等重放应返回原结果: {result:?}\"\n+        ),\n+        other => panic!(\"应返回命令结果: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 后端选择：`native=false` 不接管（调用方走旧线）；`native=true` 装载配置包并起原生房间；\n+/// 装载失败**明确报错**（不静默回退旧线）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_backend_selection_is_explicit() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+\n+    // 未启用 → 不接管（返回 None，由调用方走旧线）\n+    let none = room_native_actor::spawn_native_room_if_configured(\n+        1,\n+        4,\n+        1,\n+        String::new(),\n+        8,\n+        20,\n+        &content,\n+        false,\n+        \"upstream-noname\",\n+        &[\"shahai-swd\".to_string()],\n+        None,\n+        30,\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"未启用不应报错\");\n+    assert!(none.is_none(), \"未启用原生后端时不得接管\");\n+\n+    // 启用且包可装载 → 起原生房间（句柄可发送消息）\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_native_room_if_configured(\n+        2,\n+        4,\n+        20261702,\n+        String::new(),\n+        8,\n+        20,\n+        &content,\n+        true,\n+        \"upstream-noname\",\n+        &[\"shahai-swd\".to_string()],\n+        None,\n+        30,\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"启用后应成功\")\n+    .expect(\"应返回原生句柄\");\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(4);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 9,\n+            display_name: \"p\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let joined = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"原生房间入座\");\n+    assert_eq!(joined.seat, 0);\n+\n+    // 启用但包不可装载 → **明确报错**（不静默回退旧线）\n+    let err = match room_native_actor::spawn_native_room_if_configured(\n+        3,\n+        4,\n+        20261703,\n+        String::new(),\n+        8,\n+        20,\n+        &content,\n+        true,\n+        \"upstream-noname\",\n+        &[\"no-such-package\".to_string()],\n+        None,\n+        30,\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"包缺失必须报错\"),\n+        Err(e) => e,\n+    };\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"no-such-package\"), \"{err}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 入座助手（沿用既有报文形态）：返回座位号；失败返回 Err。\n+async fn join(\n+    handle: &room::RoomHandle,\n+    connection_id: u64,\n+    preferred_seat: Option<u8>,\n+    reconnect_token: Option<String>,\n+) -> Result<u8, String> {\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(8);\n+    let (reply_tx, reply_rx) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id,\n+            display_name: format!(\"p{connection_id}\"),\n+            preferred_seat,\n+            reconnect_token,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: reply_tx,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"send: {e}\"))?;\n+    reply_rx\n+        .await\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"reply: {e}\"))?\n+        .map(|r| r.seat)\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 惰性缺席座位回收：满员且某成员超过时限未活动时，新入座者顶替其座位；\n+/// 时限为 0 时关闭该行为（不得回收）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_actor_reclaims_idle_seat_lazily() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20263900, 2, &[&loaded.pack])\n+        .expect(\"建局（2 座）\");\n+    let session = room_native::NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![loaded.pack], 2);\n+\n+    // 时限设为 1 秒，便于观察\n+    room_native_actor::set_seat_timeout_secs(1);\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(70, session, 8, 4);\n+\n+    let (j1, _rx1) = attached(&handle, 1, 0, None, \"\").await.expect(\"入座 1\");\n+    assert_eq!(j1.seat, 0);\n+    let (j2, _rx2) = attached(&handle, 2, 1, None, \"\").await.expect(\"入座 2\");\n+    assert_eq!(j2.seat, 1);\n+\n+    // 满员：立即入座应失败（座位被占）\n+    let busy = join(&handle, 3, None, None).await;\n+    assert!(busy.is_err(), \"满员且未超时 → 入座应失败：{busy:?}\");\n+\n+    // 在线等待他人回合/选择超过时限，仍不得回收。\n+    tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(1200)).await;\n+    assert!(\n+        join(&handle, 3, None, None).await.is_err(),\n+        \"在线空闲席位不得被回收\"\n+    );\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Disconnect { connection_id: 1 })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(\n+        join(&handle, 3, None, None).await.is_err(),\n+        \"离线未超时不得回收\"\n+    );\n+    tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(1200)).await;\n+    let taken = join(&handle, 4, None, None).await.expect(\"超时后应可入座\");\n+    assert_eq!(taken, 0, \"只能回收已离线的座位\");\n+\n+    // 关闭回收（0）→ 满员时不得回收\n+    room_native_actor::set_seat_timeout_secs(0);\n+    let session2 = {\n+        let loaded = content\n+            .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+            .expect(\"重装\");\n+        let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20263901, 2, &[&loaded.pack])\n+            .expect(\"建局 2\");\n+        room_native::NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![loaded.pack], 2)\n+    };\n+    let handle2 = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(71, session2, 8, 4);\n+    let _ = join(&handle2, 1, Some(0), None).await.expect(\"入座 a\");\n+    let _ = join(&handle2, 2, Some(1), None).await.expect(\"入座 b\");\n+    handle2\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Disconnect { connection_id: 1 })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(1200)).await;\n+    let closed = join(&handle2, 3, None, None).await;\n+    assert!(closed.is_err(), \"时限 0 → 不回收，入座应失败：{closed:?}\");\n+    room_native_actor::set_seat_timeout_secs(600); // 复位默认\n+}\n+\n+/// P1 回归：一个停止读取的旁观者填满出站队列后，不得阻塞房间 actor；\n+/// 其他玩家的命令必须在期限内完成，慢连接被明确移出广播并等待重连。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn slow_observer_queue_full_does_not_block_room_actor() {\n+    let session = native_session(20261024, 2);\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(77, session, 8, 4);\n+    let _ = attached(&handle, 1, 0, None, \"\").await.expect(\"入座 a\");\n+    let _ = attached(&handle, 2, 1, None, \"\").await.expect(\"入座 b\");\n+\n+    // 容量 1 且故意不读：入房名册已占满队列。\n+    let (tx, mut slow_rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(1);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(RoomMsg::Spectate {\n+            connection_id: 3,\n+            display_name: \"slow\".into(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    response.await.unwrap().expect(\"旁观入房\");\n+    // 故意不读：入房名册仍占着唯一的队列槽位。\n+\n+    let outcome = tokio::time::timeout(\n+        std::time::Duration::from_secs(3),\n+        end_phase(&handle, 1, 0, 0, 1),\n+    )\n+    .await\n+    .expect(\"慢旁观者不得阻塞房间命令\")\n+    .expect(\"命令成功\");\n+    match outcome {\n+        ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { result, .. } => {\n+            assert!(\n+                matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+                \"命令应被接受：{result:?}\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+        other => panic!(\"期望 CommandOutcome，得到 {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    // 慢连接被移出广播后，其发送端应关闭（session 侧也会收到 slow 信号）。\n+    let closed = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1), async {\n+        loop {\n+            match slow_rx.try_recv() {\n+                Ok(_) => continue,\n+                Err(mpsc::error::TryRecvError::Disconnected) => break true,\n+                Err(mpsc::error::TryRecvError::Empty) => {\n+                    tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(10)).await;\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+    })\n+    .await\n+    .expect(\"慢连接应被明确断开\");\n+    assert!(closed);\n+}\n+\n+/// P2 切片：原生 CommandOutcome 必须带真实公开事件码（此前恒为空）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn native_command_outcome_carries_public_event_codes() {\n+    let session = native_session(20261025, 2);\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(78, session, 8, 4);\n+    let _ = attached(&handle, 1, 0, None, \"\").await.expect(\"入座\");\n+    let message = end_phase(&handle, 1, 0, 0, 5).await.expect(\"命令\");\n+    let ServerMessage::CommandOutcome {\n+        result,\n+        public_event_codes,\n+        ..\n+    } = message\n+    else {\n+        panic!(\"期望 CommandOutcome\");\n+    };\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+        \"命令应接受：{result:?}\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(!public_event_codes.is_empty(), \"原生命令应带真实公开事件码\");\n+    assert!(\n+        public_event_codes\n+            .iter()\n+            .all(|code| (1..=10).contains(code)),\n+        \"公开事件码越界：{public_event_codes:?}\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"83aab2d86311768e477923d91338a87555def297","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc09_native_room_session.rs","status":"added","additions":826,"deletions":0,"changes":826,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_room_session.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_room_session.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_room_session.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,826 @@\n+//! NC09 原生权威房间会话：入座 → 命令 → 快照 → 重连 → 观战（同一原生会话契约）。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_room_store.rs\"]\n+mod native_room_store;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+#[path = \"../src/persist.rs\"]\n+mod persist;\n+#[path = \"../src/room.rs\"]\n+mod room;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native.rs\"]\n+mod room_native;\n+#[path = \"../src/room_native_actor.rs\"]\n+mod room_native_actor;\n+#[path = \"../src/session.rs\"]\n+mod session;\n+\n+use engine_api::{CommandKind, CommandResult, PlayerId as ApiPlayerId};\n+use engine_protocol::ClientRole;\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use room_native::NativeRoomSession;\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+use tokio::sync::mpsc;\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn session(seed: u64, seats: u8) -> NativeRoomSession {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, seats as usize, &[&loaded.pack])\n+        .expect(\"建局\");\n+    NativeRoomSession::new(engine, seats)\n+}\n+\n+/// 入座：座位分配、玩家 id、权威动作、投影不含他人手牌 id。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_join_and_projections() {\n+    let mut room = session(20261401, 4);\n+    let a = room.join(1, Some(2), None).expect(\"入座 2 号\");\n+    assert_eq!(a.member.seat, 2);\n+    assert_eq!(a.member.player_id, ApiPlayerId::new(3));\n+    assert_eq!(a.member.role, ClientRole::Player);\n+    // 非当前回合座位的合法动作集合可以为空（内核按当前回合校验）——这里只断言\n+    // 投影与座位/角色正确，不把「非本人回合无动作」当缺陷。\n+    assert_eq!(a.view.seats.len(), 4, \"投影含全部座位\");\n+    let b = room.join(2, None, None).expect(\"自动分配\");\n+    assert_ne!(b.member.seat, a.member.seat, \"座位不重复\");\n+    // 满座拒绝\n+    let _ = room.join(3, None, None).expect(\"第三座\");\n+    let _ = room.join(4, None, None).expect(\"第四座\");\n+    assert!(room.join(5, None, None).is_err(), \"满座必须拒绝\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 命令：合法推进被接受、非法命令明确拒绝（含协议拒绝原因）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_commands_and_rejections() {\n+    let mut room = session(20261402, 4);\n+    // 先占当前回合座位（首选座位为空，必命中）\n+    let current = room.engine().turn().current;\n+    let cur = room.join(1, Some(current), None).expect(\"入座当前回合座位\");\n+    assert_eq!(cur.member.seat, current, \"首选座位可用时应命中\");\n+\n+    // 另占一个非当前回合座位 → 其推进必须被拒绝\n+    let other = (0..4u8).find(|s| *s != current).expect(\"其他座位\");\n+    let oth = room.join(2, Some(other), None).expect(\"入座其他座位\");\n+    assert_eq!(oth.member.seat, other);\n+    let out = room\n+        .submit(\n+            oth.member.connection_id,\n+            &CommandKind::EndPhase {},\n+            room.engine().revision(),\n+        )\n+        .expect(\"提交\");\n+    match out {\n+        CommandResult::Rejected { reason } => assert!(\n+            matches!(reason, engine_api::RejectReason::InvalidActor),\n+            \"非本人回合应拒绝: {reason:?}\"\n+        ),\n+        other => panic!(\"应被拒绝: {other:?}\"),\n+    }\n+\n+    // 当前回合座位推进阶段 → 接受\n+    let rev = room.engine().revision();\n+    let out2 = room\n+        .submit(cur.member.connection_id, &CommandKind::EndPhase {}, rev)\n+        .expect(\"提交\");\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(out2, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+        \"本人回合推进应被接受: {out2:?}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 重连：令牌换绑连接、座位与令牌不变；无效令牌明确失败。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_reconnect_keeps_seat() {\n+    let mut room = session(20261403, 4);\n+    let a = room.join(1, Some(1), None).expect(\"入座\");\n+    let token = a.member.reconnect_token.clone();\n+    room.disconnect(1);\n+    let again = room.join(99, None, Some(token.clone())).expect(\"重连\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.member.seat, a.member.seat, \"重连保留座位\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.member.reconnect_token, token, \"令牌不变\");\n+    assert_eq!(again.member.connection_id, 99, \"连接已换绑\");\n+    assert!(uuid::Uuid::parse_str(&token).is_ok(), \"重连令牌须不可预测\");\n+    assert!(room.snapshot(1).is_err(), \"换绑后旧连接不再拥有座位\");\n+    assert!(\n+        room.join(100, None, Some(\"bogus\".into())).is_err(),\n+        \"无效令牌必须失败\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+fn session_with_choice() -> NativeRoomSession {\n+    let mut room = NativeRoomSession::new(engine_native::Engine::new(4242, 4), 4);\n+    for seat in 0..4 {\n+        room.join(10 + seat as u64, Some(seat), None).unwrap();\n+    }\n+    for _ in 0..1000 {\n+        if room.engine().open_choice().is_some() {\n+            for connection in 10..14 {\n+                room.reclaim_seat(connection).unwrap();\n+            }\n+            return room;\n+        }\n+        let actor = room.engine().turn().current;\n+        let player = ApiPlayerId::new(actor as u32 + 1);\n+        let action = native_view::legal_actions_for(room.engine(), player)\n+            .into_iter()\n+            .next()\n+            .expect(\"有可推进动作\");\n+        let command = action.to_command(player, room.engine().revision());\n+        let out = room\n+            .submit(10 + actor as u64, &command.kind, room.engine().revision())\n+            .unwrap();\n+        assert!(matches!(out, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }), \"{out:?}\");\n+    }\n+    panic!(\"固定场景须产生选择\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_choice_tokens_roundtrip_through_session_and_authoritative_actions() {\n+    let mut room = session_with_choice();\n+    let open = room.engine().open_choice().unwrap().clone();\n+    let joined = room.join(1, Some(open.observer), None).unwrap();\n+    let choice = native_view::choice_for(\n+        room.engine(),\n+        joined.member.role.into(),\n+        Some(joined.member.player_id),\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        choice.options.iter().map(|o| o.token).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n+        (0..open.spec.options.len() as u32).collect::<Vec<_>>()\n+    );\n+    let action = joined.legal_actions.iter().find(|a| matches!(a,\n+        engine_api::LegalAction::ResolveChoice { selections, cancelled: false, .. } if !selections.is_empty()\n+    )).expect(\"有权威选择动作\");\n+    let command = action.to_command(joined.member.player_id, room.engine().revision());\n+    let hash = room.engine().state_hash();\n+    room.join(2, Some((open.observer + 1) % 4), None).unwrap();\n+    for token in [0, u32::MAX] {\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            room.submit(\n+                2,\n+                &CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+                    choice_id: choice.choice_id,\n+                    selections: vec![token],\n+                    cancelled: false,\n+                },\n+                room.engine().revision()\n+            )\n+            .unwrap(),\n+            CommandResult::Rejected {\n+                reason: engine_api::RejectReason::InvalidActor,\n+            },\n+            \"非选择者的拒绝不能泄露私有候选边界\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(room.engine().state_hash(), hash);\n+    }\n+    assert!(\n+        room.submit(\n+            1,\n+            &CommandKind::ResolveChoice {\n+                choice_id: choice.choice_id,\n+                selections: vec![u32::MAX],\n+                cancelled: false,\n+            },\n+            room.engine().revision()\n+        )\n+        .is_err(),\n+        \"越界 token 不得截断成 Tag\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(room.engine().state_hash(), hash);\n+    let result = room\n+        .submit(1, &command.kind, room.engine().revision())\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(result, CommandResult::Accepted { .. }),\n+        \"权威 token 可原样回传，实际结果: {result:?}\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_join_reply_restores_pending_choice_for_its_observer_only() {\n+    let room = session_with_choice();\n+    let observer = room.engine().open_choice().unwrap().observer;\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(89, room, 8, 4);\n+    for (connection_id, seat) in [(1, observer), (2, (observer + 1) % 4)] {\n+        let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel(8);\n+        let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+                connection_id,\n+                display_name: \"pending\".into(),\n+                preferred_seat: Some(seat),\n+                reconnect_token: None,\n+                password: String::new(),\n+                outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+                reply,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .unwrap();\n+        let joined = response.await.unwrap().unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(joined.choice.is_some(), seat == observer);\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 观战：公开投影、无权威动作、不能提交命令。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_spectator_is_public_only() {\n+    let mut room = session(20261404, 4);\n+    let _ = room.join(1, Some(0), None).expect(\"入座\");\n+    let spec = room.spectate(500);\n+    assert_eq!(spec.member.role, ClientRole::Spectator);\n+    assert!(spec.legal_actions.is_empty(), \"观战者无权威动作\");\n+    assert_eq!(spec.view.seats.len(), 4, \"观战可见全部座位（公开面）\");\n+    let err = room\n+        .submit(500, &CommandKind::EndPhase {}, room.engine().revision())\n+        .expect_err(\"观战者提交必须失败\");\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"spectator\"), \"{err}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 快照：与引擎摘要/修订一致（客户端据此比对）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_snapshot_matches_engine() {\n+    let mut room = session(20261405, 4);\n+    let a = room.join(1, Some(0), None).expect(\"入座\");\n+    let snap = room.snapshot(a.member.connection_id).expect(\"快照\");\n+    assert_eq!(snap.revision, room.engine().revision(), \"修订一致\");\n+    assert_eq!(snap.state_hash, room.engine().state_hash(), \"摘要一致\");\n+}\n+\n+/// 存档/录像/恢复：快照 + WAL 重放后修订与摘要必须与记录一致。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_wal_replay_recovers_identically() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+\n+    let mut room = session(20261410, 4);\n+\n+    // 逐命令推进并记录 WAL（只记录被接受的动作）\n+    let mut accepted = 0usize;\n+    for _ in 0..12 {\n+        if room.engine().outcome().is_some() {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        let seat = room.engine().turn().current;\n+        let conn = 1000 + seat as u64;\n+        let _ = room.join(conn, Some(seat), None);\n+        let before = room.engine().revision();\n+        let out = room\n+            .submit(conn, &CommandKind::EndPhase {}, room.engine().revision())\n+            .expect(\"提交\");\n+        if let CommandResult::Accepted {\n+            new_revision,\n+            state_hash,\n+        } = out\n+        {\n+            if new_revision > before {\n+                accepted += 1;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+    assert!(\n+        accepted >= 3,\n+        \"至少记录 3 条被接受的提交（实际 {accepted}）\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let final_rev = room.engine().revision();\n+    let final_hash = room.engine().state_hash();\n+\n+    // The actor and disk now share the exact recorded commands and dedup values.\n+    let state = room.export_state(&room.snapshot_hex());\n+    assert_eq!(state.wal.as_ref().unwrap().entries.len(), accepted);\n+    let restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&state, vec![loaded.pack]).expect(\"WAL 重放恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(restored.engine().revision(), final_rev, \"重放后修订一致\");\n+    assert_eq!(restored.engine().state_hash(), final_hash, \"重放后摘要一致\");\n+    let mut actual = restored.engine().save();\n+    actual.auth_generation = room.engine().save().auth_generation;\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&actual),\n+        engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&room.engine().save())\n+    );\n+\n+    // 篡改一条 WAL 期望摘要仍须明确失败，不能只信最终完整快照。\n+    let mut tampered = state;\n+    tampered.wal.as_mut().unwrap().entries[0].state_hash[0] ^= 0xff;\n+    let error = match NativeRoomSession::from_saved(\n+        &tampered,\n+        vec![\n+            content\n+                .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+                .unwrap()\n+                .pack,\n+        ],\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(_) => panic!(\"摘要不符必须失败\"),\n+        Err(error) => error,\n+    };\n+    assert!(error.contains(\"摘要不一致\"), \"{error}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// NC05/NC09 房间级选将：原生后端支持（按入座座位、观战者拒绝、未知武将报错、\n+/// 成功后向全体推送新视图），旧线后端明确「不支持」。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_room_choose_general_is_room_level() {\n+    // 旧线后端：明确不支持（不静默）\n+    let legacy = room::spawn_room(21, 4, 1, String::new(), 8, 20);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    legacy\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::ChooseGeneral {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            name: \"whatever\".into(),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let err = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect_err(\"旧线必须明确不支持\");\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"不支持\"), \"{err}\");\n+\n+    // 原生后端：支持\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let engine =\n+        engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20261820, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    let session = room_native::NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![loaded.pack], 4);\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(22, session, 16, 4);\n+\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(16);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"p\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(0),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send join\");\n+    let _ = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"入座\");\n+    while rx.try_recv().is_ok() {}\n+\n+    // 选一个目录内的扩展武将（swd 前缀）\n+    let pick = {\n+        let candidates = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20261821, 4, &[]);\n+        let _ = candidates;\n+        // 用会话内引擎的候选（通过选将接口的候选导出不可得，这里直接挑已知 swd 武将）\n+        \"swd_lingwu\".to_string()\n+    };\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::ChooseGeneral {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            name: pick.clone(),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send choose\");\n+    match rr.await.expect(\"reply\") {\n+        Ok(json) => assert!(json.contains(\"state_hash\"), \"成功应返回 state_hash: {json}\"),\n+        Err(e) => {\n+            // 该武将名不在本包目录时，必须**明确报错**（不得静默）\n+            assert!(e.contains(\"选将被拒绝\"), \"{e}\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    // 观战者选将 → 拒绝\n+    let spec = {\n+        let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(4);\n+        let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+        handle\n+            .send(room::RoomMsg::Spectate {\n+                connection_id: 9,\n+                display_name: \"s\".into(),\n+                outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+                reply: rt,\n+            })\n+            .await\n+            .expect(\"send spectate\");\n+        rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"观战\")\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(spec.role, ClientRole::Spectator);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::ChooseGeneral {\n+            connection_id: 9,\n+            name: \"swd_lingwu\".into(),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send choose2\");\n+    let err = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect_err(\"观战者必须被拒\");\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"spectator\"), \"{err}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 跨重启持久化（会话级）：导出 → 落盘 → 重建 → 状态/成员/令牌一致，\n+/// 且重连令牌仍命中**原座位**；计数器延续（不重置）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_session_export_and_restore_roundtrip() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let pack = loaded.pack;\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20262001, 4, &[&pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    let mut session = NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![pack], 4);\n+\n+    // 两人入座 + 一条命令\n+    let a = session.join(1, Some(0), None).expect(\"入座 1\");\n+    let b = session.join(2, Some(1), None).expect(\"入座 2\");\n+    let rev_before = session.engine().revision();\n+    let _ = session.submit(1, &CommandKind::EndPhase {}, rev_before);\n+\n+    // 导出 → JSON 落盘 → 读回重建\n+    let state = session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex());\n+    let json = serde_json::to_string(&state).expect(\"序列化\");\n+    std::fs::write(dir.path().join(\"room.json\"), &json).expect(\"落盘\");\n+    let back: room_native::NativeRoomState =\n+        serde_json::from_str(&std::fs::read_to_string(dir.path().join(\"room.json\")).unwrap())\n+            .expect(\"读回\");\n+    assert_eq!(back.members.len(), 2, \"成员应随状态落盘\");\n+    assert!(\n+        back.pack_refs.iter().any(|r| r.contains(\"shahai-swd\")),\n+        \"包引用应落盘：{:?}\",\n+        back.pack_refs\n+    );\n+\n+    // 恢复路径与产品启动一致：按 `pack_refs` **重新装载**同内容包（而非复用句柄）\n+    let reloaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"重新装载\");\n+    let mut restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&back, vec![reloaded.pack]).expect(\"恢复\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.engine().revision(),\n+        session.engine().revision(),\n+        \"修订号应延续\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.engine().state_hash(),\n+        session.engine().state_hash(),\n+        \"状态摘要应与导出时一致\"\n+    );\n+    // 令牌延续：用导出前的令牌重连 → 命中**原座位**\n+    let rejoin = restored\n+        .join(9, None, Some(a.member.reconnect_token.clone()))\n+        .expect(\"令牌重连\");\n+    assert_eq!(rejoin.member.seat, 0, \"重连令牌必须命中原座位\");\n+    assert_eq!(rejoin.member.player_id, a.member.player_id, \"玩家 id 不变\");\n+    let _ = b;\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 落盘存储 + 启动恢复：写盘（原子）→ `load_all` → `restore_room_from_disk`\n+/// → 房间可用且令牌命中原座位；损坏文件**明确报错**（不跳过）。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_room_store_roundtrip_and_restore() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    let pack = loaded.pack;\n+    let engine = engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(20262002, 4, &[&pack]).expect(\"建局\");\n+    let session = NativeRoomSession::new_with_packs(engine, vec![pack], 4);\n+\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path().join(\"rooms\"));\n+    // 直接构造记录并落盘（actor 路径在 E2E 中覆盖）\n+    let mut session = session;\n+    let a = session.join(1, Some(0), None).expect(\"入座\");\n+    let record = native_room_store::StoredRoom {\n+        room_id: 42,\n+        password_hash: native_room_store::password_hash(42, \"pw\"),\n+        checksum: String::new(),\n+        state: session.export_state(&session.snapshot_hex()),\n+    };\n+    store.save(&record).expect(\"落盘\");\n+    assert!(store.dir().join(\"42.json\").exists(), \"应生成 42.json\");\n+    assert!(\n+        !store.dir().join(\"42.json.tmp\").exists(),\n+        \"临时文件应已 rename\"\n+    );\n+\n+    // 读回并按启动路径恢复（重新装载包）\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), \"shahai-swd\")\n+        .expect(\"重新装载\");\n+    let mut packs = vec![loaded.pack];\n+    let mut load_pack =\n+        |_ref: &str| -> Result<engine_native::content::extension::ExtensionPack, String> {\n+            packs.pop().ok_or_else(|| \"包只可装载一次\".to_string())\n+        };\n+    let handle =\n+        room_native_actor::restore_room_from_disk(&record, &mut load_pack, 8, 4, store.clone())\n+            .expect(\"恢复房间\");\n+    assert_eq!(handle.id, 42);\n+\n+    // 恢复后的房间可用：用导出前的令牌重连 → 原座位\n+    let (tx, _rx) = mpsc::channel::<String>(4);\n+    let (rt, rr) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 7,\n+            display_name: \"back\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: None,\n+            reconnect_token: Some(a.member.reconnect_token.clone()),\n+            password: \"pw\".into(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply: rt,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .expect(\"send\");\n+    let joined = rr.await.expect(\"reply\").expect(\"恢复后凭令牌入座\");\n+    assert_eq!(joined.seat, 0, \"恢复后令牌必须命中原座位\");\n+\n+    // 损坏文件：明确报错（不跳过）\n+    std::fs::write(store.dir().join(\"99.json\"), b\"{ not json\").unwrap();\n+    let err = store.load_all().expect_err(\"损坏文件必须报错\");\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"解析\"), \"{err}\");\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 终局清理：比赛结束后落盘记录被删除（不随重启恢复），且再次落盘不会重建。\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_room_store_is_removed_on_match_end() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path().join(\"rooms\"));\n+    // 未终局：写盘\n+    let record = native_room_store::StoredRoom {\n+        room_id: 7,\n+        password_hash: String::new(),\n+        checksum: String::new(),\n+        state: room_native::NativeRoomState {\n+            command_receipts: Vec::new(),\n+            timeout: None,\n+            wal: None,\n+            snapshot_hex: String::new(),\n+            max_seats: 4,\n+            started: true,\n+            next_token: 3,\n+            next_dedup: 9,\n+            pack_refs: Vec::new(),\n+            frozen_packages: None,\n+            members: Vec::new(),\n+        },\n+    };\n+    store.save(&record).expect(\"写盘\");\n+    assert!(store.dir().join(\"7.json\").exists());\n+    // 终局清理路径：remove 后不再存在；load_all 为空\n+    store.remove(7).expect(\"删除\");\n+    assert!(!store.dir().join(\"7.json\").exists(), \"终局后记录应删除\");\n+    assert!(store.load_all().expect(\"读回\").is_empty(), \"无残留记录\");\n+    // 幂等：重复删除不报错\n+    store.remove(7).expect(\"重复删除应幂等\");\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 落盘硬化：密码不落明文（只存加盐哈希）；校验和不匹配**明确报错**。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_room_store_hashes_password_and_verifies_checksum() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path().join(\"rooms\"));\n+    let hash = native_room_store::password_hash(5, \"secret\");\n+    assert_ne!(hash, \"secret\", \"不得落明文\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        hash,\n+        native_room_store::password_hash(5, \"secret\"),\n+        \"哈希稳定\"\n+    );\n+    assert_ne!(\n+        hash,\n+        native_room_store::password_hash(6, \"secret\"),\n+        \"盐=房间号\"\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(native_room_store::password_hash(5, \"\"), \"\", \"空密码 → 空串\");\n+\n+    let record = native_room_store::StoredRoom {\n+        room_id: 5,\n+        password_hash: hash.clone(),\n+        checksum: String::new(),\n+        state: room_native::NativeRoomState {\n+            command_receipts: Vec::new(),\n+            timeout: None,\n+            wal: None,\n+            snapshot_hex: String::new(),\n+            max_seats: 4,\n+            started: false,\n+            next_token: 1,\n+            next_dedup: 1,\n+            pack_refs: Vec::new(),\n+            frozen_packages: None,\n+            members: Vec::new(),\n+        },\n+    };\n+    store.save(&record).expect(\"落盘\");\n+    let text = std::fs::read_to_string(store.dir().join(\"5.json\")).unwrap();\n+    assert!(!text.contains(\"secret\"), \"磁盘不得出现明文密码：{text}\");\n+    assert!(text.contains(\"checksum\"), \"应写入校验和\");\n+    let back = store.load_all().expect(\"校验和匹配应可读\");\n+    assert_eq!(back.len(), 1);\n+    assert_eq!(back[0].password_hash, hash);\n+\n+    // 篡改状态但保留旧校验和 → 明确报错\n+    let tampered = text.replace(\"\\\"max_seats\\\": 4\", \"\\\"max_seats\\\": 8\");\n+    std::fs::write(store.dir().join(\"5.json\"), tampered).unwrap();\n+    let err = store.load_all().expect_err(\"校验和不匹配必须报错\");\n+    assert!(err.contains(\"校验和\"), \"{err}\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_legacy_state_checksum_survives_optional_frozen_package_field() {\n+    let old_state = r#\"{\"snapshot_hex\":\"\",\"max_seats\":4,\"started\":true,\"next_token\":1,\"next_dedup\":1,\"pack_refs\":[],\"members\":[]}\"#;\n+    let checksum = blake3::hash(old_state.as_bytes()).to_hex().to_string();\n+    let state: room_native::NativeRoomState = serde_json::from_str(old_state).unwrap();\n+    assert!(state.frozen_packages.is_none());\n+    assert_eq!(serde_json::to_string(&state).unwrap(), old_state);\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(dir.path());\n+    let record = format!(\n+        r#\"{{\"room_id\":88,\"password_hash\":\"\",\"state\":{old_state},\"checksum\":\"{checksum}\"}}\"#\n+    );\n+    std::fs::write(dir.path().join(\"88.json\"), record).unwrap();\n+    let loaded = store.load_all().unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(loaded[0].checksum, checksum);\n+}\n+\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_restore_does_not_publish_actor_when_migrated_save_cannot_be_written() {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let blocked = dir.path().join(\"not-a-directory\");\n+    std::fs::write(&blocked, b\"retain this file\").unwrap();\n+    let store = native_room_store::NativeRoomStore::new(&blocked);\n+    let mut room = NativeRoomSession::new(engine_native::Engine::new(4242, 2), 2);\n+    room.set_frozen_packages(Vec::new());\n+    let record = native_room_store::StoredRoom {\n+        room_id: 89,\n+        password_hash: String::new(),\n+        state: room.export_state(&room.snapshot_hex()),\n+        checksum: String::new(),\n+    };\n+    let result = room_native_actor::restore_room_from_disk(\n+        &record,\n+        &mut |_| Err(\"标准局不应装载包\".into()),\n+        8,\n+        4,\n+        store,\n+    );\n+    assert!(result.is_err());\n+    assert_eq!(std::fs::read(blocked).unwrap(), b\"retain this file\");\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_referee_general_authority_survives_trusted_restore_and_reconnect() {\n+    let mut engine = engine_native::Engine::new(1515, 4);\n+    engine.assign_general_named(1, \"刘备\").unwrap();\n+    let general = engine.state_core().player(1).general_slots[0].unwrap() as u32;\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.mode = engine_native::state::GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    let mut room = NativeRoomSession::new(engine_native::Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap(), 4);\n+    let ordinary = room.join(1, Some(0), None).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(ordinary.member.role, ClientRole::Player);\n+    assert_eq!(ordinary.view.seats[1].character_def, 0);\n+    room.spectate(90);\n+    let mut saved = room.export_state(&room.snapshot_hex());\n+    // Only a trusted host/store can provision a Referee; no client grant message exists.\n+    let referee = saved\n+        .members\n+        .iter_mut()\n+        .find(|m| m.connection_id == 90)\n+        .unwrap();\n+    referee.role = ClientRole::Referee;\n+    referee.reconnect_token = uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string();\n+    let token = referee.reconnect_token.clone();\n+    let mut restored = NativeRoomSession::from_saved(&saved, Vec::new()).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        restored.snapshot(90).unwrap().seats[1].character_def,\n+        general\n+    );\n+    assert_eq!(restored.snapshot(1).unwrap().seats[1].character_def, 0);\n+    let rejoined = restored.join(99, None, Some(token)).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(rejoined.member.role, ClientRole::Referee);\n+    assert_eq!(rejoined.view.observer, engine_api::ObserverKind::Referee);\n+    assert_eq!(rejoined.view.seats[1].character_def, general);\n+    assert!(restored.snapshot(90).is_err());\n+    assert!(restored.join(100, None, Some(\"Referee\".into())).is_err());\n+    let spec = restored.spectate(101);\n+    assert_eq!(spec.member.role, ClientRole::Spectator);\n+    assert_eq!(spec.view.seats[1].character_def, 0);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_choice_rejects_invalid_player_ids_without_wrapping() {\n+    let mut engine = engine_native::Engine::new(1515, 4);\n+    for _ in 0..3 {\n+        let result = engine.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+            actor: 0,\n+            expected_revision: engine.revision(),\n+            dedup_id: engine.revision() + 1,\n+            action: engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase,\n+        });\n+        assert!(!matches!(\n+            result,\n+            engine_native::CommandOutcome::Rejected(_)\n+        ));\n+    }\n+    let room = NativeRoomSession::new(engine, 4);\n+    assert_eq!(room.engine().open_choice().unwrap().observer, 0);\n+    for raw in [0, 257, u32::MAX] {\n+        assert!(\n+            native_view::choice_for(\n+                room.engine(),\n+                native_view::RoomRole::Player,\n+                Some(ApiPlayerId::new(raw))\n+            )\n+            .is_none(),\n+            \"invalid player id {raw} exposed seat-zero private options\"\n+        );\n+        assert!(native_view::legal_actions_for(room.engine(), ApiPlayerId::new(raw)).is_empty());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_choice_visibility_requires_trusted_role_even_with_a_valid_seat() {\n+    let room = session_with_choice();\n+    let open = room.engine().open_choice().unwrap();\n+    let owner = ApiPlayerId::new(open.observer as u32 + 1);\n+    for seat in [\n+        None,\n+        Some(ApiPlayerId::NONE),\n+        Some(owner),\n+        Some(ApiPlayerId::new(257)),\n+    ] {\n+        assert!(\n+            native_view::choice_for(room.engine(), native_view::RoomRole::Spectator, seat)\n+                .is_none()\n+        );\n+        let choice =\n+            native_view::choice_for(room.engine(), native_view::RoomRole::Referee, seat).unwrap();\n+        assert_eq!(choice.observer, owner);\n+        assert_eq!(choice.options.len(), open.spec.options.len());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+// Temporarily appended to nc09_native_room_session.rs, removed after capturing red.\n+#[tokio::test]\n+async fn nc09_timeout_default_deadline_answers_pending_choice() {\n+    let room = session_with_choice();\n+    let choice = room.engine().open_choice().unwrap().clone();\n+    let revision = room.engine().revision();\n+    let handle = room_native_actor::spawn_room_native(98, room, 8, 4);\n+    let (tx, mut rx) = mpsc::channel(32);\n+    let (reply, response) = tokio::sync::oneshot::channel();\n+    handle\n+        .send(room::RoomMsg::Join {\n+            connection_id: 1,\n+            display_name: \"timeout-observer\".into(),\n+            preferred_seat: Some(choice.observer),\n+            reconnect_token: None,\n+            password: String::new(),\n+            outbound: session::Outbound::new(tx),\n+            reply,\n+        })\n+        .await\n+        .unwrap();\n+    assert!(response.await.unwrap().unwrap().choice.is_some());\n+    let answer = tokio::time::timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(31), async {\n+        while let Some(message) = rx.recv().await {\n+            if let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::CommandOutcome { view, .. } =\n+                serde_json::from_str(&message).unwrap()\n+            {\n+                if view.revision > revision {\n+                    return;\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+        panic!(\"actor closed before the choice was answered\");\n+    })\n+    .await;\n+    assert!(\n+        answer.is_ok(),\n+        \"default 30-second room timeout must submit AI answer through ordinary actor command flow\"\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"b79a8df92c1e7890ac0a88c5db1bf6b6ca5829fb","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc09_native_view_bridge.rs","status":"added","additions":245,"deletions":0,"changes":245,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_view_bridge.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_view_bridge.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_native_view_bridge.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,245 @@\n+//! NC09/NC03 桥接回归：原生视图 → 产品协议视图（唯一映射点）。\n+//!\n+//! 验收：\n+//! 1. 座位投影：`SeatView.hand_count` 只给数量（协议视图不含手牌 id）；\n+//! 2. 观战/裁判投影：所有座位手牌均为数量；\n+//! 3. 摘要与修订：`state_hash`/`revision` 与内核一致；\n+//! 4. 权威动作：`legal_actions_for` 的候选都能被内核接受（反向重建 + 真实提交）；\n+//! 5. 非法座位：越界座位返回空候选（不 panic、不伪造）。\n+\n+#[path = \"../src/native.rs\"]\n+mod native;\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+\n+use engine_api::{ObserverKind, PlayerId as ApiPlayerId};\n+use native::NativeContent;\n+use native_view::{legal_actions_for, observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use std::path::PathBuf;\n+\n+fn repo_packages_root() -> PathBuf {\n+    PathBuf::from(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../../packages/extensions\")\n+}\n+\n+fn native_engine(seed: u64, pack_id: &str) -> engine_native::Engine {\n+    let dir = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+    let content =\n+        NativeContent::open(repo_packages_root(), dir.path().join(\"store\")).expect(\"open\");\n+    content.import().expect(\"安装\");\n+    let loaded = content\n+        .load_scoped(Some(\"upstream-noname\"), pack_id)\n+        .expect(\"装载\");\n+    engine_native::Engine::new_with_extensions(seed, 4, &[&loaded.pack]).expect(\"建局\")\n+}\n+\n+/// 座位投影：手牌只给数量；观战投影同样。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_bridge_hides_hand_contents() {\n+    let e = native_engine(20261301, \"shahai-swd\");\n+    let seat = ApiPlayerId::new(1);\n+    let snap = observer_snapshot_for(&e, RoomRole::Player, Some(seat));\n+    assert_eq!(snap.revision, e.revision(), \"修订号与内核一致\");\n+    assert_eq!(snap.state_hash, e.state_hash(), \"摘要与内核一致\");\n+    assert!(matches!(snap.observer, ObserverKind::Player(_)));\n+    for s in &snap.seats {\n+        let native_seat = s.seat.0;\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            s.hand_count as usize,\n+            e.debug_hand(native_seat).len(),\n+            \"手牌数量与内核一致（座位 {native_seat}）\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+    // 观战：同样只有数量\n+    let spec = observer_snapshot_for(&e, RoomRole::Spectator, None);\n+    assert!(matches!(spec.observer, ObserverKind::Spectator));\n+    assert_eq!(spec.seats.len(), snap.seats.len(), \"座位数一致\");\n+    for s in &spec.seats {\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            s.hand_count as usize,\n+            e.debug_hand(s.seat.0).len(),\n+            \"观战投影手牌数量一致\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// 权威动作：候选逐个反向重建并**在内核真实提交**（Accepted/Pending）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_bridge_legal_actions_are_authoritative() {\n+    let mut e = native_engine(20261302, \"shahai-swd\");\n+    // 推进到 0 号出牌阶段\n+    for _ in 0..30 {\n+        if e.turn().current == 0 && e.turn().phase == engine_native::Phase::Play {\n+            break;\n+        }\n+        if let Some(c) = e.open_choice().cloned() {\n+            let sel: Vec<engine_native::ChoiceOption> =\n+                if c.spec.options.contains(&engine_native::ChoiceOption::Pass) {\n+                    vec![engine_native::ChoiceOption::Pass]\n+                } else if c.spec.allow_cancel {\n+                    Vec::new()\n+                } else {\n+                    c.spec\n+                        .options\n+                        .iter()\n+                        .take(c.spec.min.max(1))\n+                        .copied()\n+                        .collect()\n+                };\n+            let _ = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+                actor: c.observer,\n+                expected_revision: e.revision(),\n+                dedup_id: 9000 + c.id,\n+                action: engine_native::GameAction::Answer {\n+                    choice_id: c.id,\n+                    selection: sel,\n+                },\n+            });\n+            continue;\n+        }\n+        let actor = e.turn().current;\n+        let _ = e.submit(engine_native::GameCommand {\n+            actor,\n+            expected_revision: e.revision(),\n+            dedup_id: 9100 + e.revision(),\n+            action: engine_native::GameAction::NextPhase,\n+        });\n+    }\n+    let actions = legal_actions_for(&e, ApiPlayerId::new(1));\n+    assert!(!actions.is_empty(), \"出牌阶段应有权威候选\");\n+    // 与内核候选数量一致（映射不丢项、不造项）\n+    let native_count = e.legal_actions(0).len();\n+    assert_eq!(actions.len(), native_count, \"映射后候选数一致\");\n+    // 至少一个 EndPhase 候选\n+    assert!(\n+        actions\n+            .iter()\n+            .any(|a| matches!(a, engine_api::LegalAction::EndPhase)),\n+        \"应含阶段推进候选\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+/// 越界座位：空候选、不 panic。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_bridge_out_of_range_seat_is_empty() {\n+    let e = native_engine(20261303, \"shahai-swd\");\n+    let actions = legal_actions_for(&e, ApiPlayerId::new(99));\n+    assert!(actions.is_empty(), \"越界座位不得给出候选\");\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09 投影字段：`character_def`/`identity`/`known_cards`/`outcome` 的真实映射。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_bridge_maps_character_identity_cards_and_outcome() {\n+    // 身份局（投影含身份面）；标准目录即可（选将用标准武将）\n+    let mut e = engine_native::Engine::new_identity(20261910, 4);\n+    let general = e\n+        .general_candidates()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter_map(|d| e.catalog().general_meta(d).map(|m| (d, m.0)))\n+        .find(|(_, name)| !name.is_empty())\n+        .expect(\"标准武将\");\n+    e.assign_general_named(0, general.1).expect(\"选将\");\n+\n+    let snap = observer_snapshot_for(&e, RoomRole::Player, Some(ApiPlayerId::new(1)));\n+    let seat0 = snap.seats.iter().find(|s| s.seat.0 == 0).expect(\"座位 0\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        seat0.character_def, general.0 as u32,\n+        \"character_def 应为主将槽 def（选将后非 0）\"\n+    );\n+    // identity：本人可见\n+    assert!(\n+        seat0.identity.is_some(),\n+        \"本人身份应可见（身份局）；当前为 {:?}\",\n+        seat0.identity\n+    );\n+    // known_cards：本人手牌可见、他人手牌不进入\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        snap.known_cards.len(),\n+        e.debug_hand(0).len(),\n+        \"known_cards 应等于本人手牌数\"\n+    );\n+    assert!(\n+        snap.known_cards\n+            .iter()\n+            .all(|c| c.zone == engine_api::CardZoneTag::Hand),\n+        \"known_cards 仅含手牌区\"\n+    );\n+    // GT-013 跨入口 def 口径：服务端 CardView.def = 目录牌种序号\n+    // （kind_code_u32），与本地 WASM view_json 的 cards.def 同式——同局\n+    // 面两入口对同一张牌给出同一 def（NC03/NC09 裁决⑦对照锚点）。\n+    for card in &snap.known_cards {\n+        let kind = e.catalog().card_kind(card.id.0 as u32);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            card.def,\n+            Some(kind as u16 as u32),\n+            \"def=牌种序号: id={}\",\n+            card.id.0\n+        );\n+    }\n+    // 观战者：无身份（非本人/非主公/未死亡者）、无 known_cards\n+    let spec = observer_snapshot_for(&e, RoomRole::Spectator, None);\n+    assert!(spec.known_cards.is_empty(), \"观战者无 known_cards\");\n+    let spec_seat1 = spec.seats.iter().find(|s| s.seat.0 == 1).expect(\"座位 1\");\n+    assert!(\n+        spec_seat1.identity.is_none(),\n+        \"观战者对存活非主公他人不可见身份\"\n+    );\n+    // 主公（座位 0）身份公开\n+    let spec_seat0 = spec.seats.iter().find(|s| s.seat.0 == 0).expect(\"座位 0\");\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(spec_seat0.identity, Some(engine_api::IdentityTag::Lord)),\n+        \"主公身份公开：{:?}\",\n+        spec_seat0.identity\n+    );\n+    // outcome：未终局 → InProgress\n+    assert!(matches!(snap.outcome, engine_api::MatchOutcome::InProgress));\n+}\n+\n+/// NC09：`SkillView` 字段取自**内核技能实例**（enabled/use_count/active/locked），\n+/// 未建模的 `view_as` 恒 false（不猜测）。\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_bridge_maps_skill_view_from_instances() {\n+    let mut e = engine_native::Engine::new_identity(20261920, 4);\n+    // 装配一个带技能的武将到座位 0\n+    let general = e\n+        .general_candidates()\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .filter_map(|d| e.catalog().general_meta(d).map(|m| (d, m.0, m.2)))\n+        .find(|(_, _, skills)| !skills.is_empty())\n+        .expect(\"带技能武将\");\n+    e.assign_general_named(0, general.1).expect(\"选将\");\n+    let snap = observer_snapshot_for(&e, RoomRole::Player, Some(ApiPlayerId::new(1)));\n+    let seat0 = snap.seats.iter().find(|s| s.seat.0 == 0).expect(\"座位 0\");\n+    assert!(!seat0.skills.is_empty(), \"选将后应投影技能实例\");\n+    for sv in &seat0.skills {\n+        // def 与内核实例一致\n+        let def = sv.def as u16;\n+        let inst = e.state_core().skills.get(&(0, def));\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            sv.enabled,\n+            inst.map(|i| i.enabled).unwrap_or(false),\n+            \"enabled 应取实例启用位（技能 {}）\",\n+            sv.def\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            sv.use_count,\n+            inst.map(|i| u32::from(i.once_used)).unwrap_or(0),\n+            \"use_count 应取实例 once_used\"\n+        );\n+        assert!(!sv.view_as, \"view_as 未建模 → 恒 false（不猜测）\");\n+        // active/locked 互斥且与内核权威校验一致\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            sv.active,\n+            sv.enabled\n+                && e.is_legal_action(0, &engine_native::GameAction::ActivateSkill { skill: def }),\n+            \"active 应与内核权威校验一致\"\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(sv.locked, !sv.active, \"locked = 当前不可主动（保守口径）\");\n+    }\n+    // 未持技座位：技能列表为空（不是「目录里有就算」）\n+    let seat1 = snap.seats.iter().find(|s| s.seat.0 == 1).expect(\"座位 1\");\n+    assert!(\n+        seat1.skills.is_empty(),\n+        \"未装配武将的座位不得投影技能：{:?}\",\n+        seat1.skills\n+    );\n+}"},{"sha":"c7136496e16f3d5a16b5ca2ec471d615875bf5b2","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/nc09_projection_parity.rs","status":"added","additions":293,"deletions":0,"changes":293,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_projection_parity.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_projection_parity.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fnc09_projection_parity.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,293 @@\n+//! NC09 decision15: compare server snapshots with the actual local WASM projection.\n+#[path = \"../src/native_view.rs\"]\n+mod native_view;\n+\n+use engine_api::{CardZoneTag, PlayerId};\n+use engine_native::{state::GameMode, Engine};\n+use native_view::{observer_snapshot_for, RoomRole};\n+use serde_json::Value;\n+use std::collections::BTreeSet;\n+\n+#[path = \"support/nc09_projection_fixtures.rs\"]\n+mod fixtures;\n+use fixtures::{all_cards_fixture, fixture};\n+\n+fn local(engine: &Engine, seat: u8) -> Value {\n+    let hex: String = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&engine.save())\n+        .iter()\n+        .map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\"))\n+        .collect();\n+    let mut wasm = engine_native_wasm::NativeEngine::new_identity(4, 1515).unwrap();\n+    wasm.restore_hex(&hex).unwrap();\n+    serde_json::from_str(&wasm.view_json(seat).unwrap()).unwrap()\n+}\n+\n+fn assert_parity(engine: &Engine) {\n+    for seat in 0..4 {\n+        let local = local(engine, seat);\n+        let server = observer_snapshot_for(\n+            engine,\n+            RoomRole::Player,\n+            Some(PlayerId::new(seat as u32 + 1)),\n+        );\n+        let local_ids: BTreeSet<u32> = local[\"cards\"]\n+            .as_object()\n+            .unwrap()\n+            .keys()\n+            .map(|id| id.parse().unwrap())\n+            .collect();\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            server\n+                .known_cards\n+                .iter()\n+                .map(|c| c.id.raw())\n+                .collect::<BTreeSet<_>>(),\n+            local_ids,\n+            \"server must preserve every locally visible card, including public zones\"\n+        );\n+        for card in &server.known_cards {\n+            let face = &local[\"cards\"][card.id.raw().to_string()];\n+            assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(card.def).unwrap(), face[\"def\"]);\n+            assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(card.suit).unwrap(), face[\"suit\"]);\n+            assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(card.rank).unwrap(), face[\"rank\"]);\n+            assert_eq!(serde_json::to_value(card.kind).unwrap(), face[\"kind\"]);\n+            match card.zone {\n+                CardZoneTag::Hand => {\n+                    assert_eq!(card.owner, Some(PlayerId::new(seat as u32 + 1)));\n+                    assert!(local[\"players\"][seat as usize][\"hand\"][\"own\"]\n+                        .as_array()\n+                        .unwrap()\n+                        .contains(&Value::from(card.id.raw())));\n+                }\n+                CardZoneTag::Equip | CardZoneTag::Judge => {\n+                    let owner = card.owner.unwrap().raw() as usize - 1;\n+                    let zone = if card.zone == CardZoneTag::Equip {\n+                        \"equips\"\n+                    } else {\n+                        \"judge\"\n+                    };\n+                    assert!(local[\"players\"][owner][zone]\n+                        .as_array()\n+                        .unwrap()\n+                        .contains(&Value::from(card.id.raw())));\n+                }\n+                CardZoneTag::DiscardPile | CardZoneTag::Processing => {\n+                    assert!(card.owner.is_none());\n+                    let zone = if card.zone == CardZoneTag::DiscardPile {\n+                        \"discard\"\n+                    } else {\n+                        \"table\"\n+                    };\n+                    assert!(local[zone]\n+                        .as_array()\n+                        .unwrap()\n+                        .contains(&Value::from(card.id.raw())));\n+                }\n+                other => panic!(\"unexpected visible zone {other:?}\"),\n+            }\n+        }\n+        for (server, local) in server\n+            .seats\n+            .iter()\n+            .zip(local[\"players\"].as_array().unwrap())\n+        {\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                serde_json::to_value(server.identity).unwrap(),\n+                local[\"identity\"]\n+            );\n+            assert_eq!(Value::from(server.character_def), local[\"characterDef\"]);\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                serde_json::to_value(&server.generals).unwrap(),\n+                local[\"generals\"]\n+            );\n+        }\n+        let hidden: BTreeSet<_> = engine\n+            .state_core()\n+            .deck\n+            .iter()\n+            .copied()\n+            .chain(\n+                engine\n+                    .state_core()\n+                    .players\n+                    .iter()\n+                    .enumerate()\n+                    .filter(|(i, _)| *i != seat as usize)\n+                    .flat_map(|(_, p)| p.hand.iter().copied()),\n+            )\n+            .collect();\n+        assert!(server\n+            .known_cards\n+            .iter()\n+            .all(|c| !hidden.contains(&c.id.raw())));\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_server_cards_and_identity_match_local_before_and_after_restart() {\n+    for (_, engine) in fixtures::scenarios() {\n+        assert_parity(&engine);\n+        let bytes = engine_native::archive::encode_archive(&engine.save());\n+        let restored =\n+            Engine::restore(&engine_native::archive::decode_archive(&bytes).unwrap()).unwrap();\n+        assert_parity(&restored);\n+    }\n+    let restored = fixture();\n+    for seat in [None, Some(PlayerId::new(2))] {\n+        {\n+            let view = observer_snapshot_for(&restored, RoomRole::Spectator, seat);\n+            assert_eq!(\n+                view.known_cards.len(),\n+                4,\n+                \"observer sees four public cards and no hands\"\n+            );\n+            assert!(view.known_cards.iter().all(|c| c.zone != CardZoneTag::Hand));\n+            assert!(\n+                view.seats[1].identity.is_none(),\n+                \"role must control identity visibility\"\n+            );\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_server_faces_have_real_suit_and_rank() {\n+    let engine = fixture();\n+    let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, Some(PlayerId::new(1)));\n+    assert!(view\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .all(|c| c.suit.is_some() && c.rank.is_some()));\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_server_general_visibility_uses_native_projection() {\n+    let engine = fixture();\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.mode = GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    let engine = Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap();\n+    let general = engine.state_core().player(1).general_slots[0].unwrap() as u32;\n+    assert_ne!(general, 0);\n+    let own = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, Some(PlayerId::new(2)));\n+    assert_eq!(own.seats[1].character_def, general);\n+    for role in [RoomRole::Spectator, RoomRole::Player] {\n+        let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, role, Some(PlayerId::new(1)));\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            view.seats[1].character_def, 0,\n+            \"unrevealed opponent general must stay hidden\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+    assert_parity(&engine);\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals[0] = true;\n+    let revealed = Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        observer_snapshot_for(&revealed, RoomRole::Spectator, None).seats[1].character_def,\n+        general\n+    );\n+    assert_parity(&revealed);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_dead_identity_is_public_after_restart() {\n+    let engine = fixture();\n+    let mut snapshot = engine.save();\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(2).alive = false;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(2).hp = 0;\n+    let engine = Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap();\n+    assert_parity(&engine);\n+    let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Spectator, None);\n+    assert!(view.seats[0].identity.is_some(), \"lord remains public\");\n+    assert!(view.seats[2].identity.is_some(), \"dead identity is public\");\n+    assert!(\n+        view.seats[1].identity.is_none(),\n+        \"living opponent stays hidden\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_invalid_seat_cannot_wrap_to_a_private_projection() {\n+    let engine = fixture();\n+    for seat in [PlayerId::NONE, PlayerId::new(257), PlayerId::new(u32::MAX)] {\n+        let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, Some(seat));\n+        assert_eq!(view.known_cards.len(), 4);\n+        assert!(view.known_cards.iter().all(|c| c.zone != CardZoneTag::Hand));\n+        assert!(view.seats[1].identity.is_none());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_projection_uses_ws6_snapshot_and_existing_card_fields() {\n+    let engine = fixture();\n+    let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, Some(PlayerId::new(1)));\n+    let message = engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+        header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader::new(15, 1, engine.revision()),\n+        view: view.clone(),\n+        choice: native_view::choice_for(&engine, RoomRole::Player, Some(PlayerId::new(1))),\n+        legal_actions: native_view::legal_actions_for(&engine, PlayerId::new(1)),\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(engine_protocol::NETWORK_PROTOCOL_VERSION, 6);\n+    let wire = engine_protocol::encode_s2c(&message).unwrap();\n+    let engine_protocol::ServerMessage::Snapshot {\n+        header,\n+        view: decoded,\n+        ..\n+    } = engine_protocol::decode_s2c(&wire).unwrap()\n+    else {\n+        panic!(\"snapshot\");\n+    };\n+    assert_eq!(header.protocol_version, 6);\n+    assert_eq!(decoded, view);\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_every_standard_card_kind_preserves_local_granularity() {\n+    let engine = all_cards_fixture();\n+    assert_parity(&engine);\n+    let public = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Spectator, None);\n+    assert_eq!(public.known_cards.len(), engine.catalog().cards.len());\n+    let kinds: BTreeSet<_> = public\n+        .known_cards\n+        .iter()\n+        .map(|c| format!(\"{:?}\", c.kind))\n+        .collect();\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        kinds,\n+        [\n+            \"Sha\",\n+            \"Shan\",\n+            \"Tao\",\n+            \"Jiu\",\n+            \"ShaFire\",\n+            \"ShaThunder\",\n+            \"Other\"\n+        ]\n+        .into_iter()\n+        .map(String::from)\n+        .collect()\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn nc09_referee_retains_authorized_unrevealed_general_definition() {\n+    let mut snapshot = fixture().save();\n+    snapshot.core.mode = GameMode::Kingdoms;\n+    snapshot.core.player_mut(1).revealed_generals = [false, false];\n+    let engine = Engine::restore(&snapshot).unwrap();\n+    let general = engine.state_core().player(1).general_slots[0].unwrap() as u32;\n+    assert_ne!(general, 0);\n+    for seat in [\n+        None,\n+        Some(PlayerId::new(1)),\n+        Some(PlayerId::NONE),\n+        Some(PlayerId::new(257)),\n+    ] {\n+        let view = observer_snapshot_for(&engine, RoomRole::Referee, seat);\n+        assert_eq!(view.observer, engine_api::ObserverKind::Referee);\n+        assert_eq!(\n+            view.seats[1].character_def, general,\n+            \"Referee is full-info authority, not a seated Player or Spectator\"\n+        );\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"b879024862f0964f480d5c7cb89e31b0616d6d42","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/support/ws5_metadata_readers.rs","status":"added","additions":82,"deletions":0,"changes":82,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws5_metadata_readers.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws5_metadata_readers.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws5_metadata_readers.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,82 @@\n+//! Frozen WS5 reader fields from HEAD 100489f5, before approved B.\n+use engine_api::*;\n+use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n+#[derive(Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct OldSeatView {\n+    /// Player id.\n+    pub player: PlayerId,\n+    /// Stable character definition id.\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub character_def: u32,\n+    /// Seat index.\n+    pub seat: SeatIndex,\n+    /// Current HP (public in standard rules).\n+    pub hp: i32,\n+    /// Max HP.\n+    pub max_hp: u32,\n+    /// Alive flag.\n+    pub alive: bool,\n+    /// Whether the character card is currently face-down.\n+    #[serde(default)]\n+    pub turned_over: bool,\n+    /// Hand count (not hand contents unless authorized).\n+    pub hand_count: u32,\n+    /// Known identity if revealed / authorized; otherwise unknown.\n+    pub identity: Option<IdentityTag>,\n+    /// Public skill instances owned by this player.\n+    pub skills: Vec<SkillView>,\n+}\n+#[derive(Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct OldChoiceRequest {\n+    /// Unique choice id for this match.\n+    pub choice_id: ChoiceId,\n+    /// Observer who must answer (usually a player).\n+    pub observer: PlayerId,\n+    /// Options the player may select (or empty if constraint-only).\n+    pub options: Vec<ChoiceOption>,\n+    /// Minimum number of selections.\n+    pub min_count: u8,\n+    /// Maximum number of selections.\n+    pub max_count: u8,\n+    /// Whether cancel is allowed.\n+    pub allow_cancel: bool,\n+    /// Timeout policy identifier (ruleset-defined).\n+    pub timeout_policy: TimeoutPolicy,\n+    /// Associated state revision when the choice was published.\n+    pub revision: u64,\n+    /// VM / effect continuation handle (opaque to clients).\n+    pub continuation_id: u64,\n+    /// Human-oriented choice kind for UI (not hashed into rules).\n+    pub kind: ChoiceKind,\n+}\n+#[derive(Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct OldObserverSnapshot {\n+    /// Revision of the authority state this view is derived from.\n+    pub revision: u64,\n+    /// Canonical hash of authority state (not of the view).\n+    pub state_hash: [u8; 32],\n+    /// Observer role.\n+    pub observer: ObserverKind,\n+    /// Current round number (public turn state).\n+    pub round: u32,\n+    /// Current turn player, or `PlayerId::NONE` between turns.\n+    pub current_player: PlayerId,\n+    /// Current public phase.\n+    pub phase: engine_api::TurnPhaseTag,\n+    /// Seat order (public).\n+    pub seats: Vec<OldSeatView>,\n+    /// Public / authorized cards known to this observer.\n+    pub known_cards: Vec<CardView>,\n+    /// Match outcome if finished.\n+    pub outcome: MatchOutcome,\n+}\n+#[derive(Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+#[serde(tag = \"type\", content = \"payload\")]\n+pub enum OldServerMessage {\n+    Snapshot {\n+        header: engine_protocol::MessageHeader,\n+        view: OldObserverSnapshot,\n+        legal_actions: Vec<LegalAction>,\n+        choice: Option<OldChoiceRequest>,\n+    },\n+}"},{"sha":"61f15154655d0fe53c3d90fae47589d6596e22b3","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/apps/game-server/tests/support/ws6_choice_before_source.rs","status":"added","additions":107,"deletions":0,"changes":107,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws6_choice_before_source.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws6_choice_before_source.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fapps%2Fgame-server%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fws6_choice_before_source.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,107 @@\n+// Frozen choice DTO from 4dd0b286, only the ids import redirected.\n+//! ChoiceRequest: rule-state input barrier (not a UI Promise).\n+\n+use engine_api::{ChoiceId, PlayerId};\n+use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n+\n+/// A pending choice the engine cannot continue past until resolved.\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct ChoiceRequest {\n+    /// Unique choice id for this match.\n+    pub choice_id: ChoiceId,\n+    /// Observer who must answer (usually a player).\n+    pub observer: PlayerId,\n+    /// Options the player may select (or empty if constraint-only).\n+    pub options: Vec<ChoiceOption>,\n+    /// Minimum number of selections.\n+    pub min_count: u8,\n+    /// Maximum number of selections.\n+    pub max_count: u8,\n+    /// Whether cancel is allowed.\n+    pub allow_cancel: bool,\n+    /// Timeout policy identifier (ruleset-defined).\n+    pub timeout_policy: TimeoutPolicy,\n+    /// Server Unix deadline; absent for offline and legacy rules.\n+    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n+    pub deadline_unix_ms: Option<u64>,\n+    /// Associated state revision when the choice was published.\n+    pub revision: u64,\n+    /// VM / effect continuation handle (opaque to clients).\n+    pub continuation_id: u64,\n+    /// Human-oriented choice kind for UI (not hashed into rules).\n+    pub kind: ChoiceKind,\n+    /// Static prompt key for presentation; absent in older payloads.\n+    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n+    pub prompt: Option<String>,\n+    /// Precise native choice kind, restricted to the five canonical names.\n+    #[serde(\n+        default,\n+        skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\",\n+        deserialize_with = \"deserialize_native_kind\"\n+    )]\n+    pub native_kind: Option<String>,\n+}\n+\n+/// Preserve the existing wire enum while retaining precise native choice metadata.\n+pub fn choice_kind_from_native(kind: &str) -> Option<ChoiceKind> {\n+    Some(match kind {\n+        \"confirm\" => ChoiceKind::Confirm,\n+        \"select_cards\" => ChoiceKind::SelectCards,\n+        \"select_players\" => ChoiceKind::SelectTargets,\n+        \"respond_card\" | \"pick_tag\" => ChoiceKind::Custom,\n+        _ => return None,\n+    })\n+}\n+\n+fn deserialize_native_kind<'de, D: serde::Deserializer<'de>>(\n+    deserializer: D,\n+) -> Result<Option<String>, D::Error> {\n+    let value = Option::<String>::deserialize(deserializer)?;\n+    if value\n+        .as_deref()\n+        .is_some_and(|kind| choice_kind_from_native(kind).is_none())\n+    {\n+        return Err(serde::de::Error::custom(\"invalid native_kind\"));\n+    }\n+    Ok(value)\n+}\n+\n+/// Single selectable option.\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct ChoiceOption {\n+    /// Option index / token returned in ResolveChoice.\n+    pub token: u32,\n+    /// Optional display key (localization id); empty if pure entity target.\n+    pub label_key: String,\n+}\n+\n+/// Timeout policy tag (concrete durations live outside the core rules clock).\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize, Default)]\n+pub enum TimeoutPolicy {\n+    /// No automatic timeout (offline / debug).\n+    #[default]\n+    None,\n+    /// Standard multiplayer response window.\n+    Standard,\n+    /// Short response (confirm / yes-no).\n+    Short,\n+    /// Tournament policy.\n+    Tournament,\n+}\n+\n+/// Semantic kind of choice (for projection / UI routing).\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub enum ChoiceKind {\n+    /// Select targets for a card or skill.\n+    SelectTargets,\n+    /// Select cards from a known set.\n+    SelectCards,\n+    /// Yes / no confirm.\n+    Confirm,\n+    /// Order simultaneous triggers.\n+    OrderTriggers,\n+    /// Discard down to hand limit.\n+    DiscardToLimit,\n+    /// Generic / content-defined.\n+    Custom,\n+}"},{"sha":"6c116059001ec027e936e4025df419b077f99f4d","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/crates/conformance/src/lib.rs","status":"added","additions":607,"deletions":0,"changes":607,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fconformance%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fconformance%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fconformance%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,607 @@\n+//! Conformance suite: pinned golden vectors for engine + content.\n+//!\n+//! Architecture Phase 11 — same golden cases across Native / WASM / desktop shell.\n+//! Bumping a vector requires an intentional domain version change + doc note.\n+//!\n+//! The bootstrap state hashes were re-pinned on 2026-08-08 after the roster-closure\n+//! round restored cross-package character skill references (391 characters across\n+//! 20 packages; gongsunzan/old_re_lidian entered standard with refresh refs):\n+//! bootstrapped characters now carry their full skill sets, changing every vector.\n+//! Earlier pins: ABI 346 (start_*) and ABI 616 (identity_*).\n+//! they had drifted from their ABI 187/231 pins as the bootstrap ruleset advanced.\n+//! The two content-repro vectors (`package_jianxiong_repro`, `dual_vm_standard_m1`)\n+//! were unaffected. ABI 347 added an opt-in per-player damage-taken counter that\n+//! low-ABI bootstrap packages do not record, so these hashes remain stable.\n+//! See `content/original/ported-character-log.md` for the re-pin record.\n+\n+#![deny(missing_docs)]\n+\n+use engine_api::{\n+    Command, CommandKind, CommandResult, ExpectedRevision, IdempotencyKey, PlayerId,\n+    ENGINE_BUILD_ID,\n+};\n+use engine_core::{run_guozhan_match, run_identity_match, Engine, MatchConfig};\n+use rule_vm::{CollectingHost, ExecResult, HostContext, ReferenceVm, RuleVm, VerifiedModule};\n+use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n+\n+/// One start-game golden vector (bootstrap ruleset, hash command parity).\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct StartVector {\n+    /// Label.\n+    pub id: &'static str,\n+    /// Players.\n+    pub players: u8,\n+    /// Seed.\n+    pub seed: u64,\n+    /// Expected state hash hex (lowercase).\n+    pub hash_hex: &'static str,\n+}\n+\n+/// Identity auto-match golden vector.\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct MatchVector {\n+    /// Label.\n+    pub id: &'static str,\n+    /// Players.\n+    pub players: u8,\n+    /// Seed.\n+    pub seed: u64,\n+    /// Max steps (must be high enough to finish for non-capped vectors).\n+    pub max_steps: u32,\n+    /// Expected final state hash hex.\n+    pub hash_hex: &'static str,\n+    /// Whether the run is allowed to hit max_steps.\n+    pub allow_capped: bool,\n+}\n+\n+/// Content package logic-hash golden (DSL compile reproducibility).\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct PackageVector {\n+    /// Label.\n+    pub id: &'static str,\n+    /// Package id passed to compiler.\n+    pub package_id: &'static str,\n+    /// DSL source.\n+    pub source: &'static str,\n+    /// Expected manifest.logic_hash hex (filled after first pin; tests recompute if empty? no — pin).\n+    pub logic_hash_hex: &'static str,\n+}\n+\n+/// Bootstrap start vectors (engine-cli `hash` parity).\n+pub const START_VECTORS: &[StartVector] = &[\n+    StartVector {\n+        id: \"start_4_42\",\n+        players: 4,\n+        seed: 42,\n+        // Re-pinned for ABI 346 (owner_is_target_trick_used_zero / hp_le_one / hp_le_two filters);\n+        // these state hashes drifted from the ABI 187 pin as the bootstrap ruleset advanced.\n+        hash_hex: \"86daeaffe7f71fb6facda6e6ebe358a87076f5d9e2e7be196deb111b698c31a7\",\n+    },\n+    StartVector {\n+        id: \"start_2_1\",\n+        players: 2,\n+        seed: 1,\n+        // Re-pinned for ABI 346; see start_4_42 note.\n+        hash_hex: \"5834b20ea9fbb7d2d3664af54bc49edad763e3089641d88fc181eb9ca19292ee\",\n+    },\n+    StartVector {\n+        id: \"start_8_99\",\n+        players: 8,\n+        seed: 99,\n+        // Re-pinned for ABI 346; see start_4_42 note.\n+        hash_hex: \"8835f8955fcc4af79589c2c30718e3054ca20b78c31dcddeddbe6726685caa7e\",\n+    },\n+];\n+\n+/// Finished identity match vectors.\n+pub const MATCH_VECTORS: &[MatchVector] = &[\n+    MatchVector {\n+        id: \"identity_4_42\",\n+        players: 4,\n+        seed: 42,\n+        max_steps: 5_000,\n+        // Re-pinned at ABI 616 after 五谷丰登 gained its exact shared-pool resolution.\n+        hash_hex: \"b351f4876316e27bb5e5aea05dbe3fc29c127e910eacd7b28b4f24a07681abd1\",\n+        allow_capped: false,\n+    },\n+    MatchVector {\n+        id: \"identity_2_7\",\n+        players: 2,\n+        seed: 7,\n+        max_steps: 5_000,\n+        // Re-pinned at ABI 616; see identity_4_42 note.\n+        hash_hex: \"8273d6cbf62d9045576f92a8cea42a4dc9431e5fee83a3461b18a584635ca217\",\n+        allow_capped: false,\n+    },\n+    MatchVector {\n+        id: \"identity_8_99\",\n+        players: 8,\n+        seed: 99,\n+        max_steps: 5_000,\n+        // Re-pinned at ABI 616; see identity_4_42 note.\n+        hash_hex: \"9ba17d5af5ffef0f8dd46314acd35b41af6c24ee9f80aa8c4b50319b13b5d406\",\n+        allow_capped: false,\n+    },\n+];\n+\n+/// Guozhan (国战) auto-match golden vectors (ADR 0598 phase B).\n+///\n+/// Pinned fresh at phase B landing — these are new vectors, not a re-pin. The auto-player is\n+/// a naive faction-aware heuristic; `allow_capped` tolerates runs that reach the step limit\n+/// without a terminal outcome (the skeleton AI may stall on complex boards).\n+pub const GUOZHAN_MATCH_VECTORS: &[MatchVector] = &[\n+    MatchVector {\n+        id: \"guozhan_4_42\",\n+        players: 4,\n+        seed: 42,\n+        max_steps: 2_000,\n+        // Re-pinned after each guozhan deck CardKind upgrade: tricks as Other (0604), then\n+        // yiyi (0614), shuiyanqijunx (0615), lulitongxin (0616), kefuzhongyuan (0617),\n+        // guguoanbang (0618), huoshaolianying (0619), lianjunshengyan (0620), yuanjiao (0621),\n+        // wenheluanwu (0622), haolingtianxia (0623), chiling (0624, A 段 Claude re-pin).\n+        hash_hex: \"5e97c1b2007edfbf8a656bc05ef7bb4a660dc9aea26233b90a874dd6a2dfd347\",\n+        allow_capped: true,\n+    },\n+    MatchVector {\n+        id: \"guozhan_2_7\",\n+        players: 2,\n+        seed: 7,\n+        max_steps: 2_000,\n+        // Re-pinned after guozhan tricks; see guozhan_4_42 note. 0622/0623 re-pin (C 段 omp),\n+        // 0624 chiling re-pin (A 段 Claude).\n+        hash_hex: \"c5ed1c4b4d77069032024dcaf76edfe24c82d3aef2190fdbf5e5d6a5510743fb\",\n+        allow_capped: true,\n+    },\n+];\n+\n+/// Official sample skills package (standard/jianxiong + peers compiled as one unit).\n+pub const JIANXIONG_SOURCE: &str = include_str!(\"../../../content/standard/jianxiong.skill\");\n+\n+/// Canonical standard bootstrap package used for VM backend differential checks.\n+pub const STANDARD_M1_SOURCE: &str = include_str!(\"../../../content/standard/standard_m1.skill\");\n+\n+/// Run a start vector; returns Ok(hex) or Err description.\n+pub fn run_start_vector(v: &StartVector) -> Result<String, String> {\n+    let mut eng = Engine::new();\n+    let r = eng.submit(Command {\n+        actor: PlayerId::NONE,\n+        expected_revision: ExpectedRevision(0),\n+        idempotency_key: IdempotencyKey(0),\n+        kind: CommandKind::StartGame {\n+            player_count: v.players,\n+            rng_seed: v.seed,\n+            ruleset: \"bootstrap\".into(),\n+        },\n+    });\n+    match r {\n+        CommandResult::Accepted { state_hash, .. } => Ok(hex32(&state_hash)),\n+        other => Err(format!(\"{}: {:?}\", v.id, other)),\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Run a match vector.\n+pub fn run_match_vector(v: &MatchVector) -> Result<String, String> {\n+    let report = run_identity_match(MatchConfig {\n+        player_count: v.players,\n+        rng_seed: v.seed,\n+        max_steps: v.max_steps,\n+        ruleset: \"identity-standard\".into(),\n+    })?;\n+    if report.capped && !v.allow_capped {\n+        return Err(format!(\"{}: capped at {} steps\", v.id, report.steps));\n+    }\n+    Ok(hex32(&report.state_hash))\n+}\n+\n+/// Run a guozhan match vector (ADR 0598 phase B).\n+pub fn run_guozhan_match_vector(v: &MatchVector) -> Result<String, String> {\n+    let report = run_guozhan_match(MatchConfig {\n+        player_count: v.players,\n+        rng_seed: v.seed,\n+        max_steps: v.max_steps,\n+        ruleset: \"guozhan-standard\".into(),\n+    })?;\n+    if report.capped && !v.allow_capped {\n+        return Err(format!(\"{}: capped at {} steps\", v.id, report.steps));\n+    }\n+    Ok(hex32(&report.state_hash))\n+}\n+\n+/// Compile package vector and return logic hash hex.\n+pub fn run_package_vector(v: &PackageVector) -> Result<String, String> {\n+    let pkg = content_compiler::compile_source_named(v.package_id, v.source)\n+        .map_err(|e| format!(\"{}: compile {e}\", v.id))?;\n+    Ok(hex32(&pkg.manifest.logic_hash))\n+}\n+\n+fn run_dual_vm_standard() -> Result<(), String> {\n+    let package = content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"standard\", STANDARD_M1_SOURCE)\n+        .map_err(|error| format!(\"compile standard_m1: {error}\"))?;\n+\n+    for module in &package.modules {\n+        // PA06/B1：优化后端只收装载期已校验模块；参照实现保留自有校验。\n+        let verified = VerifiedModule::verify(module.clone())\n+            .map_err(|error| format!(\"{} verify: {error}\", module.name))?;\n+        let context = HostContext {\n+            skill_id: 1,\n+            self_id: 1,\n+            event_player: 1,\n+            event_source: 2,\n+            event_card: 1,\n+            event_amount: 0,\n+        };\n+        let mut optimized_host = CollectingHost {\n+            ctx: context,\n+            ..Default::default()\n+        };\n+        let mut reference_host = optimized_host.clone();\n+        let mut optimized = RuleVm::new();\n+        let mut reference = ReferenceVm::new();\n+        let mut optimized_result = optimized\n+            .execute(&verified, &mut optimized_host, 10_000)\n+            .map_err(|error| format!(\"{} optimized: {error}\", module.name))?;\n+        let mut reference_result = reference\n+            .execute(module, &mut reference_host, 10_000)\n+            .map_err(|error| format!(\"{} reference: {error}\", module.name))?;\n+\n+        let mut completed = false;\n+        for _ in 0..16 {\n+            if optimized_result != reference_result {\n+                return Err(format!(\n+                    \"{} result mismatch: optimized={optimized_result:?} reference={reference_result:?}\",\n+                    module.name\n+                ));\n+            }\n+            if optimized_host.effects != reference_host.effects {\n+                return Err(format!(\"{} emitted effects diverged\", module.name));\n+            }\n+\n+            match (optimized_result, reference_result) {\n+                (ExecResult::Halted { .. }, ExecResult::Halted { .. }) => {\n+                    completed = true;\n+                    break;\n+                }\n+                (\n+                    ExecResult::Paused {\n+                        continuation: optimized_continuation,\n+                        options,\n+                    },\n+                    ExecResult::Paused {\n+                        continuation: reference_continuation,\n+                        ..\n+                    },\n+                ) => {\n+                    let chosen = options.first().copied().unwrap_or_default();\n+                    optimized_result = optimized\n+                        .resume(\n+                            &verified,\n+                            &mut optimized_host,\n+                            optimized_continuation,\n+                            chosen,\n+                        )\n+                        .map_err(|error| format!(\"{} optimized resume: {error}\", module.name))?;\n+                    reference_result = reference\n+                        .resume(module, &mut reference_host, reference_continuation, chosen)\n+                        .map_err(|error| format!(\"{} reference resume: {error}\", module.name))?;\n+                }\n+                _ => return Err(format!(\"{} backend state diverged\", module.name)),\n+            }\n+        }\n+        if !completed {\n+            return Err(format!(\"{} exceeded 16 choice resumptions\", module.name));\n+        }\n+    }\n+    Ok(())\n+}\n+\n+/// Aggregate report for CLI / CI.\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n+pub struct ConformanceReport {\n+    /// Engine build id.\n+    pub engine_build_id: String,\n+    /// Passed case ids.\n+    pub passed: Vec<String>,\n+    /// Failed (id, detail).\n+    pub failed: Vec<(String, String)>,\n+}\n+\n+impl ConformanceReport {\n+    /// True if no failures.\n+    pub fn ok(&self) -> bool {\n+        self.failed.is_empty()\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Run all built-in vectors.\n+pub fn run_all() -> ConformanceReport {\n+    let mut passed = Vec::new();\n+    let mut failed = Vec::new();\n+\n+    for v in START_VECTORS {\n+        match run_start_vector(v) {\n+            Ok(h) if h == v.hash_hex => passed.push(v.id.to_string()),\n+            Ok(h) => failed.push((\n+                v.id.to_string(),\n+                format!(\"hash mismatch got={h} want={}\", v.hash_hex),\n+            )),\n+            Err(e) => failed.push((v.id.to_string(), e)),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    for v in MATCH_VECTORS {\n+        match run_match_vector(v) {\n+            Ok(h) if h == v.hash_hex => passed.push(v.id.to_string()),\n+            Ok(h) => failed.push((\n+                v.id.to_string(),\n+                format!(\"hash mismatch got={h} want={}\", v.hash_hex),\n+            )),\n+            Err(e) => failed.push((v.id.to_string(), e)),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    // ADR 0598 phase B: guozhan golden vectors (freshly pinned, not a re-pin).\n+    for v in GUOZHAN_MATCH_VECTORS {\n+        match run_guozhan_match_vector(v) {\n+            Ok(h) if h == v.hash_hex => passed.push(v.id.to_string()),\n+            Ok(h) => failed.push((\n+                v.id.to_string(),\n+                format!(\"hash mismatch got={h} want={}\", v.hash_hex),\n+            )),\n+            Err(e) => failed.push((v.id.to_string(), e)),\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    // Pin package logic hash dynamically first run via compute; we assert reproducibility\n+    // and non-empty, and pin against dual compile.\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"standard\", JIANXIONG_SOURCE) {\n+        Ok(a) => match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\"standard\", JIANXIONG_SOURCE) {\n+            Ok(b) if a.manifest.logic_hash == b.manifest.logic_hash => {\n+                passed.push(\"package_jianxiong_repro\".into());\n+            }\n+            Ok(_) => failed.push((\n+                \"package_jianxiong_repro\".into(),\n+                \"logic_hash not reproducible\".into(),\n+            )),\n+            Err(e) => failed.push((\"package_jianxiong_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+        },\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"package_jianxiong_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+\n+    match run_dual_vm_standard() {\n+        Ok(()) => passed.push(\"dual_vm_standard_m1\".into()),\n+        Err(error) => {\n+            failed.push((\"dual_vm_standard_m1\".into(), error));\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    // ADR 0604: guozhan DSL must compile. Verify gz_jianxiong (the first migrated guozhan\n+    // skill) compiles reproducibly, and that the ABI-641 guozhan_use_zhulian_bihe builtin\n+    // lowers correctly (its package requires ABI 641).\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"guozhan\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/guozhan/gz_jianxiong.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"guozhan_gz_jianxiong_repro\".into());\n+            // Confirm the skill def id matches the claimed constant.\n+            if !pkg.skill_index.iter().any(|s| s.skill_def_id == 2398363843) {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"guozhan_gz_jianxiong_repro\".into(),\n+                    \"skill def id 2398363843 not in skill_index\".into(),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"guozhan_gz_jianxiong_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"guozhan_wei_batch\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/guozhan/gz_wei_skills.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"guozhan_wei_batch_repro\".into());\n+            if pkg.skill_index.len() < 6 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"guozhan_wei_batch_repro\".into(),\n+                    format!(\"expected >=6 skills, got {}\", pkg.skill_index.len()),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"guozhan_wei_batch_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"guozhan_other_batch\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/guozhan/gz_other_skills.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"guozhan_other_batch_repro\".into());\n+            if pkg.skill_index.len() < 9 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"guozhan_other_batch_repro\".into(),\n+                    format!(\"expected >=9 skills, got {}\", pkg.skill_index.len()),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"guozhan_other_batch_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"guozhan_batch_all\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/guozhan/gz_batch_all.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"guozhan_batch_all_repro\".into());\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"guozhan_batch_all_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"guozhan_zhulian_bihe\",\n+        \"skill gz_zhulian_bihe_spend(1) {\\n  active play_phase {\\n    effect guozhan_use_zhulian_bihe(self);\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"guozhan_zhulian_bihe_abi641\".into());\n+            // The guozhan_use_zhulian_bihe builtin requires ABI 641.\n+            if pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version < 641 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"guozhan_zhulian_bihe_abi641\".into(),\n+                    format!(\n+                        \"expected rule_vm_abi_version >= 641, got {}\",\n+                        pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version\n+                    ),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"guozhan_zhulian_bihe_abi641\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    // ADR 0607: the huanle shoulijian (手里剑) custom-basic-card DSL must compile and require\n+    // ABI 642 (the ResolveShoulijian builtin).\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"huanle_shoulijian\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/original/ported/huanle/huanle_meta.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"huanle_shoulijian_abi642\".into());\n+            if pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version < 642 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"huanle_shoulijian_abi642\".into(),\n+                    format!(\n+                        \"expected rule_vm_abi_version >= 642, got {}\",\n+                        pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version\n+                    ),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"huanle_shoulijian_abi642\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    // ADR 0607: the shahai (杀海拾遗) skill DSL must compile — including the newly added\n+    // gwent view_as skills (gw_wuyao_skill → 杀, gw_lang_skill → 酒).\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"shahai_impl\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/original/ported/shahai/shahai_impl.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"shahai_impl_repro\".into());\n+            let gwent_ok = pkg\n+                .skill_index\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|s| s.skill_def_id == 784509644 || s.skill_def_id == 2836710318);\n+            if !gwent_ok {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"shahai_impl_repro\".into(),\n+                    \"gwent view_as skills missing from skill_index\".into(),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"shahai_impl_repro\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    // ADR 0608: the gwent 杜达元帅1/2 special-card skills must compile and require ABI 643\n+    // (the CancelIncomingCardUse builtin).\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"shahai_impl\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/original/ported/shahai/shahai_impl.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"gwent_dudayuanshuai_abi643\".into());\n+            let dudayuanshuai_ok = pkg\n+                .skill_index\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|s| s.skill_def_id == 3583584906 || s.skill_def_id == 3832623127);\n+            if !dudayuanshuai_ok {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"gwent_dudayuanshuai_abi643\".into(),\n+                    \"gw_dudayuanshuai1/2 skills missing from skill_index\".into(),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+            if pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version < 643 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"gwent_dudayuanshuai_abi643\".into(),\n+                    format!(\n+                        \"expected rule_vm_abi_version >= 643, got {}\",\n+                        pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version\n+                    ),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"gwent_dudayuanshuai_abi643\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+    // ADR 0612: the gwent 呼朋 (hupeng) skill must compile with the ABI 644\n+    // choose_other_gain_one_of_two_skills builtin and stay linked from gw_zhuoertan.\n+    match content_compiler::compile_source_named(\n+        \"shahai_impl\",\n+        include_str!(\"../../../content/original/ported/shahai/shahai_impl.skill\"),\n+    ) {\n+        Ok(pkg) => {\n+            passed.push(\"shahai_hupeng_abi644\".into());\n+            let hupeng_ok = pkg.skill_index.iter().any(|s| s.skill_def_id == 3607688462);\n+            if !hupeng_ok {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"shahai_hupeng_abi644\".into(),\n+                    \"hupeng skill missing from skill_index\".into(),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+            if pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version < 644 {\n+                failed.push((\n+                    \"shahai_hupeng_abi644\".into(),\n+                    format!(\n+                        \"expected rule_vm_abi_version >= 644, got {}\",\n+                        pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version\n+                    ),\n+                ));\n+            }\n+        }\n+        Err(e) => failed.push((\"shahai_hupeng_abi644\".into(), e.to_string())),\n+    }\n+\n+    ConformanceReport {\n+        engine_build_id: ENGINE_BUILD_ID.to_string(),\n+        passed,\n+        failed,\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// Hex encode 32 bytes.\n+pub fn hex32(bytes: &[u8]) -> String {\n+    bytes.iter().map(|b| format!(\"{b:02x}\")).collect()\n+}\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn all_golden_vectors() {\n+        let report = run_all();\n+        if !report.ok() {\n+            for (id, detail) in &report.failed {\n+                eprintln!(\"FAIL {id}: {detail}\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+        assert!(report.ok(), \"conformance failures: {:?}\", report.failed);\n+        assert!(\n+            report.passed.len()\n+                >= START_VECTORS.len() + MATCH_VECTORS.len() + GUOZHAN_MATCH_VECTORS.len()\n+        );\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn start_vectors_individually() {\n+        for v in START_VECTORS {\n+            let h = run_start_vector(v).unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(h, v.hash_hex, \"{}\", v.id);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn match_vectors_individually() {\n+        for v in MATCH_VECTORS {\n+            let h = run_match_vector(v).unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(h, v.hash_hex, \"{}\", v.id);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn guozhan_match_vectors_individually() {\n+        for v in GUOZHAN_MATCH_VECTORS {\n+            let h = run_guozhan_match_vector(v).unwrap();\n+            assert_eq!(h, v.hash_hex, \"{}\", v.id);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4183b88480edc2db06afab06bce7f260a4ab388c","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/crates/content-compiler/examples/t8_backend_prototype.rs","status":"added","additions":301,"deletions":0,"changes":301,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fexamples%2Ft8_backend_prototype.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fexamples%2Ft8_backend_prototype.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fexamples%2Ft8_backend_prototype.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,301 @@\n+//! T8 后端对照原型（架构演进提案 C1）：以真实扩展 huanle-upstream-noname\n+//! 的技能「酒尾」（`huanle_jiuwei`，包数据 `mapping: host:phase_end_recover_or_draw`）\n+//! 为同一样本，实测规则 VM 字节码后端（候选 B）满足 C1 验收的能力项：\n+//! 数据驱动安装（不重编译）、选择挂起/恢复、内容锁（continuation 绑定\n+//! module hash）、超限（fuel）、故障回滚（半次效果不落账）、调用成本。\n+//!\n+//! 候选 A（现状：编译期 HostBehavior 枚举臂，kernel.rs）与候选 C（WASM 组件）\n+//! 不在本原型内实测：A 的执行路径在 engine-native 内（本例不依赖它，其\n+//! 「新技能必须改引擎重编译」以 host.rs/kernel.rs 源码位置为证）；C 的\n+//! wasmtime 不在离线依赖图内，仅做桌面评估（见 ADR 草稿）。\n+//!\n+//! **本例为 ADR 草稿输入（docs/adr/notes/draft-t8-backend-comparison.md），\n+//! 非定案；后端选择待 D2 决策。**\n+//!\n+//! 运行：`cargo run --offline -p content-compiler --example t8_backend_prototype`\n+\n+use content_compiler::compile_source_named;\n+use rule_api::{CapabilitySet, EffectRequest, HostTrap, PlayerId, QueryRequest, QueryResponse};\n+use rule_vm::{Continuation, ExecResult, HostContext, RuleVm, VmError, VmHost, DEFAULT_FUEL};\n+\n+/// 酒尾 T8 对照样本：语义逐句对齐 kernel.rs 的 PhaseEndRecoverOrDraw 臂\n+/// （hp < max_hp → 回 1 体力，否则摸 1）。\n+const JIUWEI_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill hnl_jiuwei_t8(990001) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {\n+    if hp(self) < max_hp(self) {\n+      effect recover_hp(self, 1);\n+    } else {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+\n+/// 选择挂起/恢复样本：同语义改为二选一（1=回血，2=摸牌）。\n+const JIUWEI_CHOICE_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill hnl_jiuwei_choice_t8(990002) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target optional {\n+    let option = choose(1, 2);\n+    if option == 1 {\n+      effect recover_hp(self, 1);\n+    }\n+    if option == 2 {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+\n+/// 超限样本：先发一张效果再无限循环——证明故障回滚协议（已发效果不落账）。\n+const OVERRUN_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill hnl_overrun_t8(990003) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target {\n+    effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    loop 1000000 {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+\n+/// 改动版（回血量 2）：仅用于内容锁负例（logic_hash 必然不同）。\n+const JIUWEI_CHOICE_TAMPERED_DSL: &str = \"\\\n+skill hnl_jiuwei_choice_t8(990002) {\n+  trigger phase_end owner_is_target optional {\n+    let option = choose(1, 2);\n+    if option == 1 {\n+      effect recover_hp(self, 2);\n+    }\n+    if option == 2 {\n+      effect draw_cards(self, 1);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\";\n+\n+/// 原型宿主：可配置 hp/max_hp，按 C1 协议分「已排队」与「已落账」两层——\n+/// 只有 `Halted` 才把排队效果落账（引擎提交点）；trap 时排队层整批丢弃\n+/// （不留下半次效果）；Paused 时排队层保留给续跑路径。\n+struct HarnessHost {\n+    caps: CapabilitySet,\n+    ctx: HostContext,\n+    queued: Vec<EffectRequest>,\n+    committed: Vec<EffectRequest>,\n+    hp: i32,\n+    max_hp: i32,\n+}\n+\n+impl HarnessHost {\n+    fn new(hp: i32, max_hp: i32) -> Self {\n+        Self {\n+            caps: CapabilitySet::standard_skill(),\n+            ctx: HostContext {\n+                skill_id: 42,\n+                self_id: 1,\n+                event_player: 1,\n+                event_source: 1,\n+                event_card: 0,\n+                event_amount: 0,\n+            },\n+            queued: Vec::new(),\n+            committed: Vec::new(),\n+            hp,\n+            max_hp,\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    /// 引擎提交点：仅 Halted 落账；Err 回滚排队层。\n+    fn commit(&mut self, result: &Result<ExecResult, VmError>) {\n+        match result {\n+            Ok(ExecResult::Halted { .. }) => self.committed.append(&mut self.queued),\n+            Ok(ExecResult::Paused { .. }) => {} // 排队层保留至续跑后落账\n+            Err(_) => self.queued.clear(),      // 故障回滚：半次效果不落账\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+impl VmHost for HarnessHost {\n+    fn capabilities(&self) -> &CapabilitySet {\n+        &self.caps\n+    }\n+    fn context(&self) -> HostContext {\n+        self.ctx.clone()\n+    }\n+    fn emit_effect(&mut self, req: EffectRequest) -> Result<(), HostTrap> {\n+        self.queued.push(req);\n+        Ok(())\n+    }\n+    fn run_query(&mut self, req: QueryRequest) -> Result<QueryResponse, HostTrap> {\n+        match req {\n+            QueryRequest::Hp { .. } => Ok(QueryResponse::Int(self.hp)),\n+            QueryRequest::MaxHp { .. } => Ok(QueryResponse::Int(self.max_hp)),\n+            _ => Ok(QueryResponse::Int(0)),\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+/// PA06/B1：装载期校验一次（`VerifiedModule`），执行期不再重复 verify。\n+fn module_of(pkg: &content_schema::ContentPackage, skill: &str) -> rule_vm::VerifiedModule {\n+    let trig = pkg\n+        .trigger_index\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|t| t.module.contains(skill))\n+        .unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\"trigger for {skill} not found\"));\n+    let module = pkg\n+        .modules\n+        .iter()\n+        .find(|m| m.name == trig.module)\n+        .unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\"module {} not found\", trig.module))\n+        .clone();\n+    rule_vm::VerifiedModule::verify(module).expect(\"装载期校验\")\n+}\n+\n+fn owner() -> PlayerId {\n+    PlayerId::new(1)\n+}\n+\n+fn main() {\n+    println!(\"== T8 后端对照原型（C1，ADR 草稿输入，非定案）==\");\n+    println!(\"样本：huanle-upstream-noname「酒尾」huanle_jiuwei\");\n+    println!(\n+        \"候选 A（现状）= 编译期 HostBehavior 枚举（host:phase_end_recover_or_draw，kernel.rs 直派臂；新技能须改引擎重编译）\"\n+    );\n+    println!(\"候选 B（本例实测）= rule-vm 字节码（DSL→typecheck→codegen→verify→VM）\");\n+    println!(\"候选 C（WASM 组件）= 未实测（离线依赖图无 wasmtime），桌面评估见 ADR 草稿\\n\");\n+\n+    // ── 1. 数据驱动安装：DSL 即包数据，编译进 npack 形态的 ContentPackage ──\n+    let src = format!(\"{JIUWEI_DSL}{JIUWEI_CHOICE_DSL}{OVERRUN_DSL}\");\n+    let pkg = compile_source_named(\"huanle-t8-prototype\", &src).expect(\"酒尾对照样本编译\");\n+    assert_eq!(pkg.trigger_index.len(), 3, \"三个触发技能全部入索引\");\n+    let pkg_again = compile_source_named(\"huanle-t8-prototype\", &src).expect(\"复编译\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        pkg.manifest.logic_hash, pkg_again.manifest.logic_hash,\n+        \"logic_hash 可复现（内容锁输入稳定）\"\n+    );\n+    println!(\n+        \"① 安装即数据：3 技能 DSL 编译为 npack 形态包（logic_hash 复现一致，rule_vm_abi={}）\",\n+        pkg.manifest.rule_vm_abi_version\n+    );\n+\n+    // 模块经 to_bytes/from_bytes 往返（npack 载体形态）后可执行\n+    let jiuwei = module_of(&pkg, \"hnl_jiuwei_t8\");\n+    let shipped = rule_vm::VerifiedModule::verify(\n+        rule_vm::BytecodeModule::from_bytes(&jiuwei.to_bytes()).expect(\"字节码往返\"),\n+    )\n+    .expect(\"恢复载体装载期校验\");\n+    assert_eq!(shipped.logic_hash, jiuwei.logic_hash, \"往返后 hash 不变\");\n+    println!(\"② 模块 to_bytes/from_bytes 往返一致（npack 载体可执行）\");\n+\n+    // ── 2. 语义一致：两分支分别对齐 kernel 臂 ──\n+    let mut vm = RuleVm::new();\n+    let mut host = HarnessHost::new(2, 4); // hp < max_hp\n+    let out = vm.execute(&shipped, &mut host, DEFAULT_FUEL);\n+    host.commit(&out);\n+    assert!(matches!(out, Ok(ExecResult::Halted { .. })), \"{out:?}\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        host.committed,\n+        vec![EffectRequest::RecoverHp {\n+            source: owner(), // DSL recover_hp(self, 1)：来源=拥有者\n+            player: owner(),\n+            amount: 1,\n+        }],\n+        \"hp<max_hp 分支=回 1 体力（同 kernel 臂）\"\n+    );\n+\n+    let mut host = HarnessHost::new(4, 4); // hp == max_hp\n+    let out = vm.execute(&shipped, &mut host, DEFAULT_FUEL);\n+    host.commit(&out);\n+    assert!(matches!(out, Ok(ExecResult::Halted { .. })), \"{out:?}\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        host.committed,\n+        vec![EffectRequest::DrawCards {\n+            player: owner(),\n+            count: 1,\n+        }],\n+        \"hp==max_hp 分支=摸 1（同 kernel 臂）\"\n+    );\n+    println!(\"③ 语义一致：受伤时回 1 / 满血摸 1，两分支均与 kernel 臂等价\");\n+\n+    // ── 3. 选择挂起/恢复 + 内容锁 ──\n+    let choice = module_of(&pkg, \"hnl_jiuwei_choice_t8\");\n+    let mut host = HarnessHost::new(4, 4);\n+    let out = vm.execute(&choice, &mut host, DEFAULT_FUEL);\n+    let cont = match out.expect(\"choice 执行\") {\n+        ExecResult::Paused {\n+            continuation,\n+            options,\n+        } => {\n+            assert_eq!(options, vec![1, 2], \"选项按声明序\");\n+            continuation\n+        }\n+        other => panic!(\"期望 Paused，得 {other:?}\"),\n+    };\n+    // 存档形态：continuation 可序列化（进入内容锁与存档）\n+    let saved = serde_json::to_string(&cont).expect(\"continuation 序列化\");\n+    let restored: Continuation = serde_json::from_str(&saved).expect(\"continuation 反序列化\");\n+    // 内容锁：continuation 绑定 module logic_hash，换模块即拒绝续跑\n+    let tampered = module_of(\n+        &compile_source_named(\"huanle-t8-tampered\", JIUWEI_CHOICE_TAMPERED_DSL)\n+            .expect(\"改动版编译\"),\n+        \"hnl_jiuwei_choice_t8\",\n+    );\n+    let locked = vm.resume(&tampered, &mut host, restored.clone(), 2);\n+    assert!(\n+        matches!(&locked, Err(VmError::InvalidBytecode(m)) if m.contains(\"mismatch\")),\n+        \"内容锁应拒绝跨模块续跑：{locked:?}\"\n+    );\n+    let out = vm.resume(&choice, &mut host, restored, 2); // 选 2=摸牌\n+    host.commit(&out);\n+    assert!(matches!(out, Ok(ExecResult::Halted { .. })), \"{out:?}\");\n+    assert_eq!(\n+        host.committed,\n+        vec![EffectRequest::DrawCards {\n+            player: owner(),\n+            count: 1,\n+        }],\n+        \"续跑后落账=所选分支效果\"\n+    );\n+    println!(\"④ 挂起/恢复：Paused→continuation JSON 往返→resume 落账所选分支\");\n+    println!(\"⑤ 内容锁：continuation 换模块（logic_hash 漂移）续跑被拒\");\n+\n+    // ── 4. 超限与故障回滚 ──\n+    let mut host = HarnessHost::new(4, 4);\n+    let out = vm.execute(&shipped, &mut host, 2); // fuel=2 必然超限\n+    assert_eq!(out, Err(VmError::OutOfFuel), \"fuel 超限确定性 trap\");\n+    host.commit(&out);\n+    assert!(host.committed.is_empty(), \"trap 后无落账\");\n+\n+    let overrun = module_of(&pkg, \"hnl_overrun_t8\");\n+    let mut host = HarnessHost::new(4, 4);\n+    let out = vm.execute(&overrun, &mut host, DEFAULT_FUEL);\n+    assert_eq!(out, Err(VmError::OutOfFuel), \"死循环被 fuel 截断\");\n+    assert!(\n+        !host.queued.is_empty(),\n+        \"trap 前已有排队效果（半次效果的原料）\"\n+    );\n+    host.commit(&out);\n+    assert!(\n+        host.committed.is_empty(),\n+        \"提交点协议：trap 整批丢弃，不落半次账\"\n+    );\n+    println!(\"⑥ 超限/回滚：fuel 截断死循环；trap 时排队效果整批丢弃（不留下半次效果）\");\n+\n+    // ── 5. 调用成本（同机初步测量，非验收口径）──\n+    const N: u32 = 20_000;\n+    let total = std::time::Instant::now();\n+    for _ in 0..N {\n+        let mut host = HarnessHost::new(4, 4);\n+        let r = vm.execute(&shipped, &mut host, DEFAULT_FUEL);\n+        assert!(matches!(r, Ok(ExecResult::Halted { .. })));\n+    }\n+    let total_ns = total.elapsed().as_nanos();\n+    println!(\n+        \"⑦ 成本（本机初步测量，{} 构建）：酒尾触发一次（装载期已校验，不含 verify）≈ {} ns 均值（N={N}；解释器量级参考值，非验收口径）\",\n+        if cfg!(debug_assertions) { \"debug\" } else { \"release\" },\n+        total_ns / N as u128,\n+    );\n+\n+    println!(\"\\n结论（草稿）：候选 B 在 C1 必须项上全部可实测满足；成本为解释器量级、\");\n+    println!(\"候选 A 为编译直派（未单独测量）；候选 C 隔离最强但离线不可测。定案待 D2。\");\n+}"},{"sha":"a065f033c08a8fd5d7a3ef9676c38932b14fb0a9","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/crates/content-compiler/src/abi.rs","status":"added","additions":24,"deletions":0,"changes":24,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@\n+use super::*;\n+\n+mod since_abi_154;\n+mod since_abi_241;\n+mod since_abi_353;\n+mod since_abi_513;\n+mod since_abi_677;\n+\n+pub(super) fn required_rule_vm_abi(ir: &RuleModuleIr, module_required_abi: u32) -> u32 {\n+    since_abi_677::required_abi(ir, module_required_abi).max(module_required_abi)\n+}\n+\n+fn statements_require_abi4(statements: &[StmtIr]) -> bool {\n+    statements.iter().any(|statement| match statement {\n+        StmtIr::EffectChooseUseVirtualSha { .. } => true,\n+        StmtIr::If {\n+            then_body,\n+            else_body,\n+            ..\n+        } => statements_require_abi4(then_body) || statements_require_abi4(else_body),\n+        StmtIr::Loop { body, .. } => statements_require_abi4(body),\n+        _ => false,\n+    })\n+}"},{"sha":"40d66691bba46a5c75015dcb246fad6605f5c595","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority/original/accidental-format-original/crates/content-compiler/src/abi/since_abi_241.rs","status":"added","additions":601,"deletions":0,"changes":601,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi%2Fsince_abi_241.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi%2Fsince_abi_241.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9d-priority%2Foriginal%2Faccidental-format-original%2Fcrates%2Fcontent-compiler%2Fsrc%2Fabi%2Fsince_abi_241.rs?ref=9f4b74236f97b0b9dc72388b6e08d310d2f26f64","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,601 @@\n+use super::*;\n+\n+pub(super) fn required_abi(ir: &RuleModuleIr, module_required_abi: u32) -> u32 {\n+    if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_241\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_gained_or_lost_at_least_two\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_241\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_240 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_240\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_239 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_239\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_238 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_238\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_237 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_237\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_751\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_sanshou_type_tracked\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_751\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_750\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_source_hp_gt_owner_or_source_damaged_owner\"\n+                    || trigger.filter\n+                        == \"owner_is_target_owner_hp_gt_source_or_source_damaged_owner\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_750\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_749\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_source_in_turn_target_unharmed_card_actions_ge_target_hp\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_749\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_741\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .view_as\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|view_as| view_as.owner_basic_uses_plus_one_cards)\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_741\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_742\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .view_as\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|view_as| view_as.max_cards == u8::MAX)\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_742\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_744\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .view_as\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|view_as| view_as.once_per_turn_per_branch)\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_744\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_745\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .actives\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|active| active.hand_missing_gaintag.is_some())\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_745\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_236\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .view_as\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|view_as| view_as.owner_hp_min_one_cards)\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_236\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_235 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_235\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_234\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .actives\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|active| active.owner_missing_skill.is_some())\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_234\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_233 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_233\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_232 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_232\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_231\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_longdan_view_as_first_counterpart_hand_nonempty\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_231\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_230\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_source_sha_damage_before_endpoint_discardable_hand_equip\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_230\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_229\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter\n+                    == \"owner_source_sha_or_juedou_single_target_first_same_name_this_turn\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_229\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_228\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                matches!(\n+                    trigger.filter.as_str(),\n+                    \"owner_alive_hand_below_alive_count_capped_eight\"\n+                        | \"owner_alive_delayed_trick_target_without_pending_judge_skip\"\n+                )\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_228\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_227\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_alive_sha_target_distance_le_one\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_227\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_226 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_226\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_225\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_draw_not_replaced\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_225\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_224\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_judge_nonempty\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_224\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_223 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_223\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_222 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_222\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_221\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .view_as\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|view| view.min_cards > 1 || view.as_kind == \"wanjian\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_221\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_220\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_source_card_has_other_target_current_play_phase_first_two\"\n+            }) || skill.modifiers.iter().any(|modifier| {\n+                modifier.value_source.as_deref().is_some_and(|source| {\n+                    source.starts_with(\"owner_skill_play_phase_fire_count_below_\")\n+                })\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_220\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_219\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter\n+                    == \"owner_alive_sha_damage_source_target_alive_owner_hand_equip_nonempty\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_219\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_218 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_218\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_217 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_217\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_216 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_216\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_215 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_215\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_214 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_214\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_213 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_213\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_212 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_212\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_211\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.view_as.iter().any(|view| {\n+                view.max_cards > 1\n+                    || view.same_suit\n+                    || view.nature.is_some()\n+                    || view.multi_card_bonus.is_some()\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_211\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_210\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_discarded_at_least_two_in_discard_phase\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_210\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_209 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_209\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_208 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_208\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_207 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_207\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_206\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill.triggers.iter().any(|trigger| {\n+                trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_per_damage_point_other_hand_equip_judge_nonempty\"\n+            })\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_206\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_205 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_205\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_204 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_204\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_203 {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_203\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_202\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_source_movable_field_card\")\n+        })\n+    {\n+        ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_202\n+    } else if module_required_abi >= ADDITIVE_RULE_VM_ABI_VERSION_201\n+        || ir.skills.iter().any(|skill| {\n+            skill\n+                .triggers\n+                .iter()\n+                .any(|trigger| trigger.filter == \"owner_is_target_lost_cards_at_most_hp_gainable\